('0062a20f-f164-4409-9cc7-3bfd9caada61','2026-07-09 11:03:07.028790','2026-07-09 11:03:07.028790',NULL,'Logitech G325 LIGHTSPEED Wireless Gaming Headset - White','logitech-g325-lightspeed-wireless-gaming-headset-white','5099206129849-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'3155269b-8d2e-4303-ba21-b03ba2ef8437',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Logitech G325 LIGHTSPEED Wireless Gaming Headset — White Stand out with clean aesthetics and powerful audio with the Logitech G325 LIGHTSPEED Wireless Gaming Headset (White) — engineered for gamers seeking performance, comfort, and seamless connectivity in a modern, minimalist design. Using LIGHTSPEED wireless technology, this headset delivers responsive, low-latency audio that enhances every game, from competitive shooters to immersive RPGs. Bluetooth 5.2 lets you switch effortlessly to mobile gaming, music, or calls. Enjoy rich, detailed 24-bit sound that brings game worlds to life while the built-in beamforming microphone captures your voice clearly for team chat and streaming. The ergonomic 212 g design and soft fabric earcups ensure maximum comfort, even during long sessions.Logitech G325 LIGHTSPEED Wireless Gaming Headset – Key FeaturesGame-Ready Audio for Immersive Gaming Experience rich, game-tuned audio designed to deliver clear detail and balanced sound, helping you stay fully immersed in every match and in-game moment.Built-In Beamforming Microphone The integrated beamforming mic captures your voice clearly while reducing background noise, ensuring smooth and reliable communication during online gaming and voice chat.All-Day Comfort Design Built with a lightweight structure and soft ear cushions, the Logitech G325 gaming headset is made for extended play sessions without discomfort.LIGHTSPEED Wireless Technology Enjoy fast, stable, low-latency wireless performance with LIGHTSPEED technology, delivering responsive audio for competitive and casual gaming alike.Bluetooth Wireless Connectivity Connect easily to smartphones, tablets, and other Bluetooth-enabled devices, making it simple to switch between gaming, calls, and entertainment.Up to 24-Hour Battery Life Game longer with up to 24 hours of wireless battery life on a single charge, perfect for long gaming sessions and daily use.Powered by Logitech G HUB Customize your audio and microphone settings using Logitech G HUB software to fine-tune your gaming experience exactly the way you like it.Clean, Stylish Gaming Headset Design A modern, minimal design that looks great in any setup, available in Black and White color options to match your gaming style.',NULL,343.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('006b5e1e-4d56-47f2-89b3-e5376c297798','2026-07-09 11:07:09.999037','2026-07-09 11:07:09.999037',NULL,'Contra: Rogue Corps - SW','switch-contra-rogue-corps-pegi-ara','4012927085448-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','CONTRA: ROGUE CORPS is a twin stick, third-person action game drawing upon its roots in fast and focused combat developed for the Xbox One, PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch, and PC (STEAM). From the director of CONTRA III: THE ALIEN WARS and CONTRA: HARD CORPS, Nobuya Nakazato instills more than 25 years of franchise pedigree into CONTRA: ROGUE CORPS with enormous crazed enemies, over-the-top violence, and a cast of diverse playable characters that add to the irreverent tone of the game. Several years after the events of the Alien Wars, CONTRA: ROGUE CORPS follows a former military group living on the fringes as bounty hunters and treasure finders in the Damned City. Survival requires fast reactions, powerful weapons and the occasional organ and cybernetic augmentation. Players will complete missions in PVE campaigns, gathering resources to upgrade their guns to stay alive in the Damned City. If all else fails bring in a friend and mow-down enemies together in online and local multiplayer modes!',NULL,69.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
