('02ecb347-b3af-46d4-b1c0-0e960a39f376','2026-07-09 10:40:42.003435','2026-07-09 10:40:42.003435',NULL,'Arcade1Up Mortal Kombat Arcade Machine','arcade1up-mortal-kombat-with-riser-light-up-marquee-stool','8152210276514-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'4bd124d5-f1b1-4cea-9490-f31a776d35b3',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Challenge your friends in this all-time classic fighting game. The two-player joystick/button configuration brings the Mortal Kombat arcade experience you remember into your home or office. Mortal Kombat is a mix of Kombat, skill and strategy. It\'s important to know when to block, jump, punch or kick your opponent. Fight against the computer or your friends, and perfect your own fighting style by mixing in creative combinations.',NULL,2697.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('02f13dec-aa4c-40b7-b157-dee744de2cc3','2026-07-09 10:54:27.840762','2026-07-09 10:54:27.840762',NULL,'Pop! Movies: Ghost Face - Tongue in Cheek','pop-movies-ghost-face-tongue-in-cheek','889698903851-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'f98bbd67-0b4f-473a-9b36-8d4e6c4d60c2',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Step into the world of slasher horror with the Funko Pop! Movies: Ghost Face – Tongue in Cheek Vinyl Figure. Inspired by the iconic Scream franchise, this officially licensed collectible reimagines Ghost Face in a playful yet unsettling “Tongue in Cheek” expression, crafted in Funko’s signature Pop! Movies style. Ghost Face remains one of horror’s most recognizable villains, known for the chilling mask, suspense-driven storytelling, and shocking twists across the Scream films. This variant adds a distinctive facial expression that enhances its display impact while keeping the character’s eerie presence intact. A standout piece for horror collectors, this figure blends classic slasher appeal with a stylized Funko twist.',NULL,75.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
