('032e9cd9-fb56-4e4d-9b32-5ef42bc92ec1','2026-07-09 11:12:45.043313','2026-07-09 11:12:45.043313',NULL,'Dragon Ball: Sparking! ZERO','dragon-ball-sparking-zero','p-3391892031782-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescriptionResolution: 4K Ultra HD with HDR support for vivid visualsFrame Rate: 60fps for smooth and fluid gameplayGraphics Engine: Optimized for dynamic cell-shaded art style, realistic lighting, and detailed character modelsAudio: 3D audio support for immersive sound; original Japanese and English voice optionsDualSense Features (PS5): Adaptive triggers, haptic feedback, and speaker integration for enhanced gameplay immersionStorage: Approximately 60GB, plus 5GB for exclusive Collector\'s Edition contentLoading Times: Optimized for fast load times on next-gen SSDMultiplayer: Cross-platform play, ranked matches, and online tournamentsPlatform Compatibility: Available on PS5, Xbox Series X|S, and PC Dragon Ball Sparking Zero Dragon Ball Sparking Zero is an upcoming entry in the iconic Dragon Ball fighting game series, bringing explosive, high-energy combat, and vibrant visuals to the gaming world. A spiritual successor to the Sparking! (also known as Budokai Tenkaichi) series, this game aims to deliver an action-packed experience with a focus on fast-paced, dynamic battles, a massive roster of characters, and deep combat mechanics. With its rich portrayal of the Dragon Ball universe, Sparking Zero allows players to relive classic moments from the series while introducing new ways to fight, transform, and experience the saga. Key FeaturesMassive Character Roster: Sparking Zero includes a wide selection of fan-favorite characters from the Dragon Ball universe, from Saiyans like Goku and Vegeta to iconic villains like Frieza and Cell, as well as new characters and transformations.Signature Combos and Special Moves: Players can execute devastating combo attacks, signature moves, and ultimate attacks (like Goku’s Kamehameha and Vegeta’s Final Flash), each with cinematic cutscenes that replicate the intense moments from the anime.Transformations & Power Ups: Transformations are a core aspect of the game, allowing characters to ascend into their more powerful forms like Super Saiyan, Super Saiyan Blue, and beyond, with new powers, faster speeds, and enhanced abilities.Immersive Story Mode: Experience the Dragon Ball saga with new stories, side missions, and expanded lore, with special story arcs that explore \"what if\" scenarios and alternate timelines.Dynamic Combat: Fast-paced 3D combat with fluid movement, aerial battles, and destructible environments that keep the action feeling fresh and intense.Tag-Team & Multiplayer Modes: Fight alongside a teammate in tag-team battles, or challenge friends in local and online multiplayer modes. Competitive modes include ranked battles and tournaments.Stunning Visuals: The game features crisp graphics with high-quality cell-shading to replicate the anime\'s signature style. Real-time effects, such as energy blasts and environmental destruction, create an exciting and visually explosive experience.',NULL,259.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
