ct and take your place among the MotoGP greats.FEEL EVERY DETAILImmerse yourself in the race thanks to the new Unreal Engine 5 and a groundbreaking bike sounds live-recorded on track. CREATE YOUR VISIONDesign unique custom gear and express your style with a full suite of in-game graphic editors, allowing you to personalize every detail.Dominate The Global ArenaChallenge friends from around the world—no matter what platform* they’re racing on—and compete in ranked races against opponents of similar skill levels. You can also go head-to-head with friends in split-screen mode to see who truly is the best rider. Are you ready to take on the challenge? *Cross-play available between PlayStation, Xbox and PC, not available on Nintendo Switch version.',NULL,229.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('048290a5-03c9-4906-b0eb-0c5c57e65245','2026-07-09 10:41:27.845051','2026-07-09 10:41:27.845051',NULL,'Paladone Icons Super Mario Boo Light','paladone-icons-super-mario-boo-light','5055964717841-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'8f5c8927-be48-41c7-9c7a-c40f59f564c2',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Give yourself a fright, and brighten up your room with this fun Boo 3D Light. This light features Boo, one of the scarier villains from the Super Mario franchise and makes a great gift for fans of the game. Lovers of the Super Mario games will remember taking on Boo many times, and now with this great piece of memorabilia, you can remember all of your adventures each time you switch on your light. The Boo 3D Light is perfect for use as a bedside lamp, or on your desk. It has three LED lights inside, is battery powered (3 x AAA batteries) and has an on/off button on the base. One of the most popular and instantly recognizable video game characters of all time, Mario first appeared in the iconic 1981 arcade game Donkey Kong under the name \'Jumpman\'. Since then, Mario has become a legend within popular culture and has been a defining figure not just for Nintendo, but for the whole gaming industry. Since hitting the big time with Super Mario Bros. Mario has had huge success with other installments such as Super Mario Galaxy, Super Mario 3D World, and the hugely popular racing spin-off Super Mario Kart. This Boo 3D Light is an officially licensed Super Mario product.',NULL,59.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
