('0486d234-7ac0-4067-b029-460b25484365','2026-07-09 11:07:13.069552','2026-07-09 11:07:13.069552',NULL,'The LEGO Movie 2 Video Game - Nintendo Switch','sw-the-lego-movie-2-videogam-16667848336750','5051892220095-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescription Platform: Nintendo SwitchGenre: Action, Adventure, PuzzleGame Modes: Single-player, Multiplayer (Local Co-op)Resolution: 720p (Handheld Mode), 1080p (Docked Mode)Frame Rate: 30fpsAudio: Stereo, Dolby DigitalThe LEGO Movie 2 Video Game - Nintendo SwitchThe LEGO Movie 2 Video Game for Nintendo Switch brings the action and humor of the LEGO Movie 2: The Second Part to the palm of your hands. Join Emmet, Lucy, Batman, and other LEGO heroes as they embark on an epic adventure to save the world from the invading Duplo forces. With fun, family-friendly gameplay, the game lets you build, explore, and solve puzzles in a colorful world made entirely of LEGO bricks. Key Features: Iconic LEGO Characters: Play as a variety of characters from The LEGO Movie 2, including Emmet, Lucy, Batman, and more, each with unique abilities to help solve puzzles and complete missions.Creative Building: Use your building skills to create LEGO structures, vehicles, and devices that help overcome obstacles and solve puzzles.Explore Diverse Worlds: Travel through various exciting and vibrant worlds, from the chaotic Apocalypseburg to the colorful Systar System, all while uncovering secrets and battling Duplo invaders.Co-op Gameplay: Team up with friends for local multiplayer fun. Work together to solve puzzles, defeat enemies, and complete missions.Fun Combat and Action: Engage in action-packed battles using LEGO-powered abilities and creative weapons to fight off enemies and solve environmental challenges.Humor and Storyline: Enjoy the fun and quirky storyline of The LEGO Movie 2, complete with hilarious dialogue and memorable moments from the movie’s characters.Building and Destruction: Build, destroy, and recreate using the familiar LEGO brick system to interact with the environment in creative ways.',NULL,79.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
