('079618ed-ce3c-462a-8fe6-86679c251168','2026-07-09 11:18:25.859041','2026-07-09 11:18:25.859041',NULL,'FIFA 17 - XBOX One','xbx-one-fifa-17-r2-eng','5035223116417-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','For the first time ever in FIFA, live your story on and off the pitch as the Premier League\'s next rising star, Alex Hunter. Play on any club in the Premier league, for authentic managers and alongside some of the best players on the planet. Experience brand new worlds in FIFA 17, all while navigating your way through the emotional highs and lows of The Journey.',NULL,29.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('0797593c-810b-49fc-ba35-b947e15c6490','2026-07-09 10:55:25.224762','2026-07-09 10:55:25.224762',NULL,'BLOKEES Transformers Classic 5 Inch Model Kit Class 01 - Optimus Prime','blokees-transformers-classic-5-inch-model-kit-class-01-optimus-prime','6972984885772-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'f98bbd67-0b4f-473a-9b36-8d4e6c4d60c2',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','The Blokees Transformers Classic 5 Inch Model Kit Class 01 – Optimus Prime is a buildable collectible figure inspired by the legendary leader of the Autobots. This model kit features a snap-fit assembly system, allowing fans to construct Optimus Prime without glue or paint. Once assembled, the figure stands approximately 5 inches tall, delivering a detailed and articulated display model suitable for collectors and Transformers enthusiasts. Designed with precision molding and durable materials, this kit combines hands-on building enjoyment with a high-quality finished collectible.',NULL,99.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
