('07c1291b-77f1-4788-bbfb-a23adcd47882','2026-07-09 11:18:40.840242','2026-07-09 11:18:40.840242',NULL,'Paw Patrol: Grand Prix - Xbox XS','xbsx-paw-patrol-grand-prix-16667848344185','3391892024463-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescription Platform: Xbox Series X|SGenre: Kart Racing / FamilyGame Modes: Single-player, Local Multiplayer (up to 4 players)Resolution: Up to 4K UHDFrame Rate: Targeted 60fpsAudio: Dolby Atmos support for immersive sound Paw Patrol: Grand Prix - Xbox Series X|SGet ready to race with Ryder and the Paw Patrol pups in Paw Patrol: Grand Prix! Zoom through thrilling tracks inspired by Adventure Bay and beyond in this high-energy kart racing adventure. Perfect for fans of all ages, this game offers family-friendly fun, exciting power-ups, and the chance to compete for the coveted Pup Cup. Whether playing solo or in multiplayer, experience the ultimate Paw Patrol racing challenge on Xbox Series X|S with enhanced visuals and performance. Key Features: Race as Your Favorite Characters: Choose from iconic Paw Patrol pups like Chase, Skye, and Marshall, each with unique karts.Vibrant Tracks: Race across exciting courses based on locations from the Paw Patrol series.Pup Power-Ups: Use special abilities and dodge hazards to outpace your rivals.Multiplayer Fun: Enjoy split-screen racing with friends and family for up to 4 players.Optimized for Xbox Series X|S: Enhanced 4K visuals, faster load times, and smooth gameplay for an immersive experience.Family-Friendly Gameplay: Easy-to-learn controls and customizable difficulty levels make it accessible to players of all ages.',NULL,149.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('07cae52f-0242-453e-a6e5-27451b299284','2026-07-09 11:16:35.484150','2026-07-09 11:16:35.484150',NULL,'Destiny 2 - PS4','ps4-destiny-2-r2-eng','5030917213953-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','In Destiny 2, the last safe city on Earth has fallen and lays in ruins, occupied by a powerful new enemy and his elite army, the Red Legion. Every player creates their own character called a “Guardian,” humanity\'s chosen protectors. As a Guardian in Destiny 2, players must master new abilities and weapons to reunite the city\'s forces, stand together and fight back to reclaim their home. In Destiny 2 players will answer this call, embarking on a fresh story filled with new destinations around our solar system to explore, and an expansive amount of activities to discover. There is something for almost every type of gamer in Destiny 2, including gameplay for solo, cooperative and competitive players set within a vast, evolving and exciting universe. Humanity\'s last safe city has fallen to an overwhelming invasion force, led by Ghaul, the imposing commander of the brutal Red Legion. He has stripped the city\'s Guardians of their power and forced the survivors to flee.',NULL,39.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('07d855e4-f411-43d2-857e-cb2b39682724','2026-07-09 11:01:40.959249','2026-07-09 11:01:40.959249',NULL,'Onimusha: Way of the Sword','onimusha-way-of-the-sword','p-5055060906781-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','A New Era of Onimusha Begins Onimusha: Way of the Sword delivers intense, blood-soaked swordplay action set in a dark fantasy version of Edo-era Kyoto, where history has been twisted by a corruptive force known as Malice. Every stage is filled with danger, mystery, and cinematic intensity as players fight through a world overrun by horrific underworld creatures known as the Genma. At the center of the story is a lone samurai who carries the legendary Oni Gauntlet, a mystical artifact granting the power to stand against the darkness and transcend human limits.STORY The journey follows Miyamoto Musashi, who arrives in Kyoto with a single purpose: to refine his mastery of the sword and prove himself as a warrior without equal. But his path quickly becomes something far greater than personal ambition. As the city is consumed by Malice and overrun by Genma, Musashi is forced into a brutal struggle that will define his fate—and the meaning of his blade.COMBAT SYSTEM – PURE SWORDPLAY ACTION Onimusha: Way of the Sword delivers a deeply immersive melee combat experience built around precision and impact: • Authentic Sword Techniques Experience a wide range of real sword-based combat moves where every strike carries weight and consequence. • Dynamic Blade Clashes Combat evolves through intense weapon clashes that add depth and tension to every encounter. • Genma Battles Face monstrous beings from the underworld in fast, brutal, and cinematic combat scenarios. • Oni Abilities Harness supernatural powers for both offensive and defensive combat advantages. • Issen Technique Execute high-risk, high-reward precision strikes that define the Onimusha combat legacy.POWER OF THE ONI The Oni Gauntlet is essential for survival against the Genma. By consuming the souls of defeated enemies, players gain strength beyond human limitations, unlocking devastating power that transforms combat potential. This system embodies the core identity of becoming an Onimusha—a warrior who stands between humanity and the abyss.DARK FANTASY SETTING Explore a haunting reimagining of Kyoto during the Edo era, transformed into a corrupted battlefield. • Atmospheric environments filled with Malice• Mystery-driven stage progression• Constant tension between beauty and horror• A world where every step hides danger and discovery',NULL,269.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
