y adjust the flow, color, and direction of your light panels. With DIY Mode on Govee Home App, we offer various options that allow you to create your lighting. Select a variety of colors and effects that are unique to you.',NULL,849.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
