('0887b761-a6c4-4c66-8212-6c3c4235416d','2026-07-09 10:58:03.700381','2026-07-09 10:58:03.700381',NULL,'Pop! Movies: Harry Potter - Harry with Hedwig (Exclusive)','pop-movies-harry-potter-harry-with-hedwig-exclusive','889698917636-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'f98bbd67-0b4f-473a-9b36-8d4e6c4d60c2',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Bring home a magical moment from the Wizarding World with the Funko Pop! Movies: Harry Potter S20 – Harry with Hedwig (Exclusive) vinyl figure. This officially licensed collectible captures Harry Potter™ holding his loyal owl Hedwig™, reflecting the bond that fans cherish throughout the film series. The exclusive design adds a unique touch for collectors seeking rare pieces from the Harry Potter S20 lineup. Crafted from high-quality vinyl, this figure stands at approximately 4 inches (10.2 cm) tall, featuring detailed sculpting and vibrant paint that showcases Harry in his classic Hogwarts attire, holding Hedwig perched gracefully on his arm. It’s a perfect collectible for display on shelves, desks, or among other Wizarding World Pop! figures. Whether completing your Harry Potter Pop! collection or adding a standout exclusive figure to your lineup, this Harry with Hedwig (Exclusive) Pop! is ideal for fans of all ages in the UAE. It also makes a thoughtful gift for Potterheads and Funko collectors. Key Highlights: • Official Funko Pop! Movies collectible — Harry Potter: Harry with Hedwig (Exclusive) • Exclusive design for unique collector appeal • Approximate size: ~4 inches (10.2 cm) tall • High-quality vinyl figure with detailed sculpt and vibrant paint • Perfect for Wizarding World fans, collectors, and gifting in the UAE Celebrate Harry Potter’s magical journey with this exclusive Funko Pop! figure — a must-have piece for any collection.',NULL,89.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
