('08d9ce34-601b-4cf0-aae9-745a74857510','2026-07-09 11:02:46.211841','2026-07-09 11:02:46.211841',NULL,'Magic: The Gathering - Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles - Collector Booster Pack','magic-the-gathering-teenage-mutant-ninja-turtles-collector-booster-pack','195166308173-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'3155269b-8d2e-4303-ba21-b03ba2ef8437',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Power up your collection with the Magic: The Gathering – Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles Collector Booster Pack, a premium crossover release combining the strategic gameplay of Magic: The Gathering with the iconic heroes from Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles. Collector Booster Packs are designed for fans who want the most exciting cards straight out of the pack. Each pack is packed with premium cards, including special foils, alternate artwork, and rare collectibles inspired by the Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles universe. Perfect for collectors and dedicated Magic players, this booster pack offers a chance to discover unique TMNT-themed cards that stand out in both gameplay and display. Key Features: • Official Magic: The Gathering Collector Booster Pack • Special Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles crossover edition • Contains premium and collectible cards • Chance to find foil and special artwork cards • Ideal for collectors and MTG players Enhance your Magic collection with this exciting TMNT-themed collector booster pack.',NULL,164.25,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
