('095e3731-7900-4d29-bc4b-858f50dea4e5','2026-07-09 10:42:18.842020','2026-07-09 10:42:18.842020',NULL,'MARS GAMING MMIKIT 7 in 1 Professional Microphone','mars-gaming-mmikit-7in1-professional-microphone-kit','4718009154261-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'2f4818b1-ebde-4ac3-adb1-5c4f62d01e42',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Looking for a professional recording studio in your own room? MMICKIT offers everything you need to increase the quality of your streams, podcasts, interviews or music recordings: 7 gadgets in an exclusive kit with a cardioid condenser microphone powered by an included Phantom 48v power supply. PROFESSIONAL DESIGN The MMICKIT has a black finish design for all the gadgets in the kit and gives you a professional look. It provides a totally improved design with the best versatility to build your own recording setup and allows any user to get the best audio equipment. 7 IN 1 KIT Anti-vibration stand, articulated arm with fastening system, anti-pop screen, wind filter... If you want to create your own recording set on your desktop, you need the highest level of quality with MMICKIT. Get a complete 7-in-1 kit and enjoy your own sound studio! MAXIMUM SOUND QUALITY The MMICKIT microphone features a cardioid polar pattern design, perfect for voice recording, streaming, podcasts, music recordings, etc. It also offers up to 130dB SPL (Sound Pressure Level), provides a high quality microphone and a wide range of features. 6 FITTING DEVICES MMICKIT has 6 improved gadgets plus the microphone for a great experience during audio recording or streaming sessions. Its various accessories have been designed to facilitate its use and offer you the greatest freedom when creating your sound studio. COMFORT AND PERFORMANCE MMICKIT is prepared to offer different positions when it comes to locating your microphone, so that you have complete comfort when recording or browsing your online sessions. It offers an anti-vibration mount that can be attached to either the tripod or the optimized arm, providing a versatile microphone and a wide range of possibilities. PROFESSIONAL CAPTURE To avoid unnecessary noise and get a clean sound at any time, MMICKIT includes an adjustable anti-pop screen that drowns out harsh sound beats and achieves an ideal capture for streaming and recording. It also includes a wind filter for the microphone to achieve the sound quality you are looking for. PHANTOM POWER SUPPLY INCLUDED The MMICKIT includes a 48V phantom power supply that supplies power to your microphone to pre-amplify the signal and deliver perfect sound quality. Connect the Phantom PSU XLR to XLR cable to the microphone and the Phantom PSU XLR to 3.5mm connector to the PC. Enjoy incredible performance! THE ULTIMATE SOUND PACKAGE With 6 professional gadgets in one kit, MMICKIT offers a comfortable, functional and versatile recording studio setup that you can adapt to your needs at any time. Put your mic on the table, adjust the boom, use or remove noise filters... Whatever you need! SPECIFICATIONS MIC Directionality: Unidirectional Polar pattern: cardioid Equivalent noise: 16dbA SPL: 130dB (1KHz≤1% THD) Load impedance: ≥1000 Ω Output impedance: 150 Ω ± 30% (1kHz) Sensitivity: -38dB ± 2dB (0dB = 1V / Pa at 1KHz) Frequency range: 20Hz - 20kHz SNR: 78dB Connector: 3.5mm jack / XLR Current: 3mA GHOST POWER SUPPLY Output Voltage: 48V DC Input Voltage: 220V AC / 50-60Hz Connectors: 1x XLR IN, 1x XLR OUT Material: Metal Extras: ON/OFF switch Extras: LED ON/OFF indicator',NULL,559.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
