('0b21cbd8-48e0-40b6-8f53-73dd8ff1b2c1','2026-07-09 11:12:09.394050','2026-07-09 11:12:09.394050',NULL,'Sand Land Collector\'s Edition','sand-land-clt-edt','p-3391892030587-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','“Only a demon can save the world.” Dive into a desert world where both humans and demons suffer from an extreme water shortage – SAND LAND. Meet the Fiend Prince Beelzebub, his chaperone Thief, and the fearless Sheriff Rao, and follow the team in an extraordinary adventure in search of the Legendary Spring hidden in the desert. In this Action-RPG, you will become the main character Beelzebub, and learn how to control his demonic powers as you lead your company of heroic misfits while exploring the legendary world of SAND LAND. Use your tact and imagination to develop tanks and other vehicles that will help you navigate this ruthless land, and build up your base of operations into a thriving city, bringing back water to the land! EMBARK ON AN EPIC JOURNEY Take off on a bumpy adventure written and designed by the creator of Dragon Ball, Akira Toriyama. Discover the unique art style that flows through the game, follow the character\'s crazy saga, and let yourself be carried away by this original story of friendship and justice. ADVENTURE BEYOND THE DUNES Travel through SAND LAND and its canyons, unveil its secrets, overcome fierce foes, and pave the way to the Legendary Spring. Explore the world and search every nook and cranny to loot essential materials that will help the team take on harder and harder challenges. VEHICLES FROM BEYOND YOUR IMAGINATION Unlock vehicles that can be levelled-up with various mechanic parts, including weapons, engines and suspensions. Design and operate a large variety of vehicles, including Battle Tanks with powerful cannons, Motorbikes that speed through deserts, and Jump-Bots that bounce over craters to explore every corner of the continent. YOUR LAND, YOUR STYLE Become Beelzebub, master his demonic powers and develop his fighting abilities to match your playstyle. Build and customize all your vehicles to your taste and style including the paint job! Save Sand Land your way and in style while doing it! BECOME THE SAVIOR THE WORLD NEEDS Develop the basecamp in the city of Spino, as you build relationships with its inhabitants. Watch the town and its capabilities grow, as you bring back the exiled people of the desert so Spino. Listen to their requests and wishes, and unlock useful materials and city features, that will help you make the SAND LAND thrive again!',NULL,299.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
