('0db2e5f2-5e58-4cf5-9a43-f4ed275880a1','2026-07-09 11:16:52.961372','2026-07-09 11:16:52.961372',NULL,'Apex Legends: Bloodhound Edition - PS4','ps4-apex-legends-bloodhound-edition-pegi-arb','5030941124003-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Squad up. Drop in. Prove you\'re the team to beat. The Bloodhound Edition includes: • Legendary Intimidator Bloodhound Skin • Legendary PDW Weapon Skin • Exclusive Bloodhound Banner and Badge • 1,000 Apex Coins This does not include Apex Legends. Please download the full game separately.',NULL,39.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
