('0e5be4a0-1673-452e-b0a3-967f306932c8','2026-07-09 10:44:05.934757','2026-07-09 10:44:05.934757',NULL,'Goliath Clickeez: 5-Pack Multipack – Includes 5 Clickable Keyboard Collectibles, Keychain & Guide','goliath-clickeez-5-pack-multipack-includes-5-clickable-keyboard-collectibles-keychain-guide','8720077341104-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'f98bbd67-0b4f-473a-9b36-8d4e6c4d60c2',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Go Pro with the Clickeez 5-Pack Multipack! Level up your clicking game with the Goliath Clickeez 5-Pack Multipack. Perfect for seasoned collectors or those looking to jumpstart their collection, this pack provides an instant \"key-munity\" of tactile, mechanical-style keyboard fidgets. Each Clickee delivers that iconic \"click and clack\" sound and feel, providing the ultimate sensory satisfaction for your fingers. With over 70 characters to find, which ones will you unbox? Key Features: 5 Complete Characters: This multipack features five Clickeez, including three visible characters to start your set and two hidden mystery surprises for an exciting unboxing experience. Authentic Mechanical Feel: Each character is mounted on a high-quality keyboard switch, offering genuine tactile feedback and the satisfying sound of a premium mechanical keyboard. Portable Fidgeting: Use the included heavy-duty keychain to link your favorite characters together. Mix and match your Clickeez to create a personalized, clicking accessory for your backpack or keys. Four Whimsical Themes: Explore characters from the Cozy Garden, Strawberry Treats, Kawaii Dreams, and Celestial Sky sets. Hunt for the Ultra-Rare: Every pack gives you a chance to find the legendary limited edition @The_Lucky_Bunny—one of only 5,000 produced worldwide!',NULL,39.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('0e5e5bc4-c3e3-4c0b-99b9-48bb57ec76f1','2026-07-09 11:12:10.914456','2026-07-09 11:12:10.914456',NULL,'Valkyrie Elysium','valkyrie-elysium','pr-5021290094857-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','The latest title in the VALKYRIE series is finally here! This action RPG incorporates the series\' signature Einherjar and combo systems, allowing players to enjoy speedy, three-dimensional combat. The game\'s unique art style beautifully depicts a collapsing world as Ragnarok looms, with series veteran Motoi Sakuraba returning to enrich the title with an unforgettable soundtrack. Story Long ago, Ragnarok—the End Times—loomed upon the realms. The All-Father Odin, with the last of his strength, created an emissary of redemption, Valkyrie; her sole task being the salvation of a doomed world. High-Speed Action RPG Effortlessly soar through the battlefield and perform high-speed actions with the new Soul Chain system. Utilize a wide array of abilities and skills at the Valkyrie’s disposal to unleash devastating combos. Einherjar Summon Einherjar – strong warrior spirits selected by the Valkyrie – to aid you in battle! Summoning Einherjar imbues the Valkyrie with elemental bonuses, giving players a tactical advantage in battle. Combo & Divine Arts System The “Arts Gauge” fills as players perform a J19continuous stream of attacks and maintain combos.?? Consuming the Arts Gauge enables the Valkyrie to perform powerful, special techniques known as Divine Arts. Upgrade and Customization Features Upgrade your weapons, skills, and Einherjar/Divine Arts combos to customize your playstyle.',NULL,249.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('0e6d1581-8902-4e70-882c-e1d896e38144','2026-07-09 10:40:34.089800','2026-07-09 10:40:34.089800',NULL,'Arcade1Up Pac-Man Deluxe Arcade Machine','pac-man-deluxe-arcade-game','195570019573-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'4bd124d5-f1b1-4cea-9490-f31a776d35b3',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Join the legacy: Library of 14 iconic games, including Dig Dug, Galaga, Galaxian, Rompers, PAC-Mania, Mappy, and more! Authentic gaming at its finest: Relive the golden era of arcade gaming with original licensed artwork, real-feel joysticks and buttons, light up marquee, and a molded faux coin door. Enjoy Wi-Fi enabled gaming and unlimited free play: Compete with friends, post scores to leaderboards and download the Companion App to join a community of gamers across the country. 21st century technology brings retro games to life: Powerful processors deliver crisp graphics on a 17 inch full color high-resolution LCD screen; enjoy arcade-quality sound with integrated dual speakers. Built to be part of your collection: Enjoy the nostalgia of classic arcade games in your home, complete with authentic artwork and real-feel features; Compact design is easy to assemble and fits seamlessly into any décor; Assembled Dimensions: 22.44” D x 18.82” W x 61”H; Weight: 68 lbs.',NULL,2399.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('0e6e289e-1f8b-4280-8c07-cfdd16b5bbaa','2026-07-09 10:40:52.295197','2026-07-09 10:40:52.295197',NULL,'Loungefly! Leather: Disney Little Mermaid Stain Glass Mini Backpack','loungefly-leather-disney-little-mermaid-stain-glass-mini-backpack','671803409637-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'cfac33db-f672-41dc-8d02-baaac0891814',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','There’s nothing quite like the magical feeling of watching a Disney happy ending. With Loungefly’s Stain Glass line, you can carry the happily ever after of a Disney Princess wherever you go! Next in this line is The Little Mermaid–the story of a mermaid princess who longs to live on the land. She finds her happily ever after with Prince Eric of the kingdom ashore, and their marriage reunites their worlds. This enchanting backpack shows Ariel in Eric’s arms as they gaze lovingly at one another, surrounded by a collage of beautiful motifs inspired by their palaces. Watching below are Ariel’s underwater friends, including Flounder and Sebastian. A bright seahorse is featured as the bag’s enamel zipper charm, perfectly complimenting the vibrance and sheer beauty of the stained glass art style.',NULL,299.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('0e7741ef-2be4-4d34-aee0-dd98db5dd7d1','2026-07-09 11:01:41.273578','2026-07-09 11:01:41.273578',NULL,'ACE COMBAT 8: WINGS OF THEVE Deluxe Edition','ace-combat-8-wings-of-theve-deluxe-edition','p-3391892042801-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Rise Above the Battlefield ACE COMBAT 8: Wings of Theve returns with a brand-new chapter in the acclaimed flight combat franchise, delivering thrilling aerial warfare, cinematic storytelling, and high-speed arcade-style action. Developed by PROJECT ACES, the team behind the legendary series, the game places players in the cockpit of an elite pilot fighting against overwhelming odds in a war-torn world. From breathtaking skies to emotionally driven character moments, every mission pushes you closer to becoming a true ace.DescriptionScreenshotsSTORY It is July 2029. The Federation of Central Usea (FCU) has fallen following a devastating surprise invasion by the Republic of Sotoa. Much of the nation has been occupied, its military shattered, and hope is fading. Rescued from the sea and brought aboard the aging aircraft carrier Endurance, you find yourself among the last remnants of your homeland\'s resistance. Onboard, you are given a name that carries the hopes of an entire nation: \"Wings of Theve.\" A legendary ace pilot and symbol of resistance connected to the FCU capital, Theve. But the legend was never real. Created to inspire a nation in crisis, the myth must now become reality as you take up the name and return to the skies alongside three trusted comrades to fight for your homeland’s future.HIGH-OCTANE AERIAL COMBAT Experience the signature gameplay that has defined the ACE COMBAT franchise. Become an Elite Fighter Pilot Take control of advanced military aircraft and engage in fast-paced aerial battles across massive combat zones. Intense Dogfights Outmaneuver enemy pilots, evade incoming threats, and unleash devastating weaponry in action-packed engagements. Powerful Arsenal Deploy a variety of weapons and combat systems to gain the advantage in challenging missions. Earn Your Wings Complete high-risk operations and rise through the ranks as a legendary ace pilotAERIAL WARFARE IN LIVING SKIES Campaign Mode features visually stunning environments designed to capture the beauty and danger of modern aerial combat. Dynamic Multi-Layered Cloudscapes Fight across vast skies filled with evolving weather systems and immersive atmospheric effects. Stunning Visual Presentation Experience dramatic battlefields and cinematic environments that bring every mission to life. Arcade-Style Flight Action Accessible yet exhilarating flight combat delivers fast-paced gameplay while maintaining the strategic depth fans expect.A CINEMATIC JOURNEY ACE COMBAT 8 expands the series’ storytelling with immersive first-person sequences and emotional character-driven moments. Experience the Human Side of War Witness the pressures of leadership, the consequences of battle, and the sacrifices made during conflict. Build Bonds With Your Squadron Between missions, strengthen relationships with squad members, overcome adversity together, and prepare for the battles ahead. Become a Symbol of Hope Carry the legacy of Wings of Theve and inspire those fighting for freedom.',NULL,429.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
