ive interface.Timer & Scheduling: Automate your lights to match your daily routines or events.Easy Installation: Includes strong adhesive backing, clips, and connectors for quick setup on any clean surface.',NULL,159.50,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
