('10eefe19-801a-4ddd-a5e7-e7fd4c698706','2026-07-09 11:16:41.852069','2026-07-09 11:16:41.852069',NULL,'Call of Cthulhu - PS4','ps4-call-of-cthulhu-pegi-eng','3512899117839-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Developed by seasoned studio Cyanide, Call of Cthulhu is an RPG-Investigation game with psychological horror and stealth mechanics, set in a deeply immersive world. On a mission to find the truth behind the death of an acclaimed artist and her family on a backwater island, the player will soon uncover a more disturbing truth as the Great Dreamer, Cthulhu, prepares its awakening...',NULL,39.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
