('114222a1-06ca-4bdd-be98-d096de4e6cb4','2026-07-09 11:17:12.991740','2026-07-09 11:17:12.991740',NULL,'Marvel\'s Guardians of the Galaxy Digital Edition - XBOX XS','xbx-xs-marvels-guardians-of-the-galaxy-digital-deluxe-edition-pegi-eng','5021290092327-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescription Developer: Eidos-MontrealPublisher: Square EnixGenre: Action-AdventurePlatform: Xbox Series X|SMode: Single-playerRating: PEGI 16Release Date: October 26, 2021 Marvel\'s Guardians of the Galaxy: Digital Deluxe Edition - Xbox Series X|S Marvel\'s Guardians of the Galaxy: Digital Deluxe Edition for Xbox Series X|S offers an exhilarating single-player action-adventure experience where you play as Star-Lord, leading the Guardians through a richly detailed Marvel universe. This edition includes extra digital content to enhance the gameplay and unlock exclusive outfits and bonuses. Key Features: Play as Star-Lord: Take control of Star-Lord (Peter Quill) and navigate through an original story filled with action and humor. Utilize Star-Lord’s gadgets and combat skills to overcome challenges and engage in intense battles.Team-Based Combat: Command the Guardians and unleash powerful, team-based combos during combat. Each Guardian has unique abilities that work together to take down enemies in dynamic battles.Story-Driven Adventure: Embark on an original storyline where your choices as Star-Lord will impact the fate of the Guardians and the universe. Encounter iconic characters and villains from the Marvel universe.Character Customization: Unlock and equip new costumes and abilities for Star-Lord and the Guardians, personalizing their looks and powers.Vibrant and Dynamic Environments: Explore visually stunning, vast environments rendered in high-definition, optimized for Xbox Series X|S.Soundtrack: Enjoy a retro-inspired, licensed soundtrack with classic 80s hits, enhancing the overall experience.Digital Deluxe Edition Bonuses: Exclusive Outfits: Get exclusive \"Throwback Guardians Outfit\" and the \"Knights of the Galaxy\" outfits for the Guardians.Bonus Digital Content: Includes extra digital goodies, such as additional in-game music tracks to enrich your experience.Early Access: Digital Deluxe players receive early access to the game before the official release.',NULL,299.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('1143630e-8ea4-49d8-91e1-17310c942767','2026-07-09 10:42:39.098628','2026-07-09 10:42:39.098628',NULL,'HYPERX QUADCAST USB Microphone','hyperx-quadcast-usb-microphone-pc-ps4','740617284300-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'2f4818b1-ebde-4ac3-adb1-5c4f62d01e42',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','The HyperX QuadCast™ is the ideal all-inclusive standalone microphone for the aspiring streamer or podcaster looking for a condenser mic with quality sound. QuadCast comes with its own anti-vibration shock mount to help reduce the rumbles of daily life and a built-in pop filter to muffle pesky plosive sounds. Instantly know your mic status with the LED indicator, and simply tap-to-mute to avoid awkward broadcasting accidents. With four selectable polar patterns, this mic’s prepared for nearly any recording situation and also features a conveniently-located gain control dial to quickly adjust your mic input sensitivity.',NULL,549.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('114ff61a-4bc8-42f1-9ef9-d9168c2650f4','2026-07-09 10:54:29.508996','2026-07-09 10:54:29.508996',NULL,'Pop! Movies: Ghost Face - Devil Mask (Metallic)','pop-movies-ghost-face-devil-mask-metallic','889698916837-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'f98bbd67-0b4f-473a-9b36-8d4e6c4d60c2',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Embrace the terror of one of horror\'s most recognizable icons with the Funko Pop! Movies: Ghost Face – Devil Mask Metallic Exclusive Vinyl Figure. This officially licensed collectible reimagines Ghost Face with a striking metallic Devil Mask finish, giving the legendary slasher an even more menacing appearance in Funko\'s signature Pop! style. Known for haunting the Scream franchise, Ghost Face has become a symbol of modern horror with the iconic mask, chilling phone calls, and unpredictable attacks that have captivated fans for decades. This Exclusive Metallic edition adds a premium touch to the classic design, making it a standout centerpiece for horror collectors and Funko enthusiasts alike.',NULL,89.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('116486dc-1947-4feb-805a-f9c67e5b5365','2026-07-09 11:16:28.001813','2026-07-09 11:16:28.001813',NULL,'EA Sports UFC 4 - PS4','ps4-ea-sports-ufc-4-pegi-ara','5030943124025-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescriptionPlatform: PlayStation 4Genre: Sports, FightingDeveloper: EA VancouverPublisher: Electronic ArtsModes: Single-player, MultiplayerRelease Date: August 14, 2020 EA Sports UFC 4 - PS4 EA Sports UFC 4 transforms players into the ultimate MMA fighters, delivering the most realistic and dynamic fighting experience. Featuring enhanced gameplay mechanics, stunning visuals, and a deep career mode, the game captures the intensity and strategy of mixed martial arts. Whether battling friends or climbing the ranks, every fight shapes your legacy. Key Features Career Mode:Create and develop your fighter’s journey from local matches to becoming a global UFC icon.Train, strategize, and build rivalries to enhance your narrative.Enhanced Combat System:New clinch and takedown mechanics for smoother transitions.Redesigned ground-and-pound controls for greater control and impact.Customizable Fighters:Extensive customization options, including appearances, gear, and fighting styles.Immersive Locations:Fight in iconic UFC arenas or unique settings like backyard arenas and underground rings.Multiplayer Modes:Compete in fast-paced online blitz battles, ranked matches, or casual bouts with friends.Fighter Evolution:Progress your skills based on your fighting style and the decisions you make during matches.',NULL,109.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('11663b43-1e5a-4c4e-b49f-58fcb1621eec','2026-07-09 11:11:55.491015','2026-07-09 11:11:55.491015',NULL,'PS5 Avatar Frontiers of Pandora Collector\'s Edition','ps5-avatar-frontiers-of-pandora-collectors-edition','3307216235477-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescription Resolution: Supports 4K UHD with HDR for immersive visualsFrame Rate: 60fps optimized for smooth, responsive gameplayAudio: Dolby Atmos-enabled for 3D spatial audio, capturing the soundscapes of Pandora in all their richnessEngine: Built with Ubisoft’s Snowdrop Engine, featuring detailed environmental realism, weather effects, and advanced AI for dynamic NPC interactionsPlatforms: Available on PlayStation 5, Xbox Series X|S, and PCPS5 Avatar: Frontiers of Pandora Collector\'s Edition Avatar: Frontiers of Pandora Collector’s Edition offers an immersive experience into the lush and visually stunning world of Pandora, brought to life by Ubisoft in collaboration with James Cameron’s iconic film franchise. In this open-world action-adventure game, players step into the role of a Na’vi warrior and explore the Western Frontier, a previously unseen region of Pandora, as they defend their world from the encroaching forces of the RDA (Resources Development Administration). The Collector’s Edition is packed with exclusive content and physical collectibles, perfect for fans eager to deepen their connection to the world of Avatar. Collector’s Edition ContentsFull Game: Avatar: Frontiers of Pandora for PS5, offering a complete open-world experience with rich exploration, environmental storytelling, and fast-paced combat.14.5” Na\'vi Warrior Figurine: A beautifully detailed statue depicting the Na’vi protagonist in a battle-ready stance, capturing the essence of Pandora’s warriors and adding a stunning collectible piece to your shelf.Exclusive SteelBook Case: A premium, collectible SteelBook case featuring artwork inspired by Pandora’s flora and fauna.Replica Field Notebook: An RDA (Resources Development Administration) notebook with field notes, lore entries, and sketches of Pandora’s ecosystem and wildlife, offering fans insight into the world from the perspective of an RDA scientist.Na\'vi Bracelet: A wearable, intricately designed Na\'vi-inspired bracelet symbolizing the deep connection to Pandora’s natural world.Digital Art Book: A digital companion art book with concept art, character designs, and visual assets that showcase the creative process behind the game’s design.Bonus In-Game Content: Includes exclusive items such as a weapon and character cosmetics, unique Na’vi outfits, and skins inspired by the flora and fauna of Pandora.Game FeaturesOpen-World Exploration: Discover the expansive Western Frontier, a visually rich region of Pandora with dynamic ecosystems, lush landscapes, and diverse wildlife.First-Person Combat: Engage in immersive first-person action as a Na’vi warrior, using a variety of weapons, including traditional Na’vi bows and RDA technology-based arms.Environmental Interaction: Experience a living world where you can bond with and ride native animals, gather resources, and use Pandora’s environment to your advantage in combat.Story-Driven Missions: Undertake a series of missions that reveal the story of Pandora’s ongoing struggle against the RDA, exploring themes of nature, survival, and resilience.Dynamic World Events: Encounter unique world events that add spontaneity to the exploration of Pandora, with the world responding dynamically to player choices and actions.',NULL,599.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
