('14e0f71f-6211-462a-80a5-37debeb3fb61','2026-07-09 10:43:24.938780','2026-07-09 10:43:24.938780',NULL,'Corsair Hd60 S+ Elgato Game Capture 1080P60 Hdr10 Ultra-Low Latency Technology','corsair-hd60-s-elgato-game-16696332257092','840006609292-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'c5791033-3955-4fde-8c05-21a002d28c03',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Elgato Game Capture HD60 S+ High Definition HDR Game Capture Capture your games with the Elgato Systems Game Capture HD60 S+ High Definition HDR Game Recorder. This plug-and-play capture device is designed to quickly get you into the game using the streaming platform and software of your choice, including OBS Studio, Streamlabs OBS, XSplit, and others. Using the included cables, simply connect your game console and Windows or Mac computer to the HDMI and USB 3.1 Gen 1 Type-C ports of the HD60 S+, install the software, and you’re ready to go. The HD60 S+ captures gameplay at stunning 1080p quality with high-dynamic range, allowing you to include wide color range with deep blacks and bright whites in your videos and live streams. With true 4K passthrough and Instant Gameview technology, you can fully enjoy playing 3840 x 2160 resolution games at up to 60 frames per second with HDR10 support while the device simultaneously captures footage without adding control latency. Other features include Flashback Recording and adding a separate Live Commentary voice track to your game captures. The Elgato Game Capture HD60 S+ uses ultra-low latency technology to simultaneously record footage while delivering a full 4K, 60 frames per second gaming experience. Record 1080p gameplay footage with high-dynamic range to deliver vivid colors that include bright highlights and deep shadows. Please note that HDR10 capture is only available on Windows PCs. Rewind through your gaming session to retroactively save footage. Add your voice on a separate audio track as you play. The Elgato 4KCU software helps you organize your archived captured footage and allows you to quickly find clips. KEY FEATURES Capture 1080p, 60 fps HDR Gameplay True 4K 60 fps HDR10 Passthrough Works with Most Streaming Platforms Plug-and-Play Design Instant Gameview Technology Flashback Recording Live Commentary USB 3.1 Gen 1 Type-C Host Connection 5Gb/s throughput HDMI In | HDMI Out Record to Windows or Mac',NULL,809.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
