('14feeb7f-74e0-4dcc-ba0c-36f1b22eadc7','2026-07-09 10:41:13.238005','2026-07-09 10:41:13.238005',NULL,'Govee Envisual TV Backlight T2 (55-65 inch)','govee-envisual-tv-backlight-t2','6974316992738-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'2f4818b1-ebde-4ac3-adb1-5c4f62d01e42',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescription Compatibility: Designed for 55-65 inch TVsLight Type: RGBIC LEDControl Options: Govee Home app, Voice control (Amazon Alexa, Google Assistant), Physical touch panelConnectivity: BluetoothPower Source: USB-powered (via TV USB port or power adapter)Sync Modes: Dynamic screen sync, Music syncLength of LED Strips: Tailored for 55-65 inch TV sizesColor Options: 16 million colors with dynamic RGBIC effectsSpecial Features: Smart control, easy installation with adhesive, dynamic light sync with TV screen, customizable lighting effectsGovee Envisual TV Backlight T2The Govee Envisual TV Backlight T2 is an advanced TV backlighting system designed to enhance your viewing experience with dynamic, ambient lighting. Equipped with Govee’s proprietary RGBIC technology, this backlight creates vibrant, immersive lighting that syncs with the content on your screen, making your TV time more engaging and exciting. Perfect for movie nights, gaming, or simply relaxing, the Envisual T2 transforms any TV setup into an audiovisual masterpiece. Key Features: RGBIC Technology: Govee’s RGBIC (RGB with Independent Control) technology allows for multiple colors to be displayed simultaneously, creating a more dynamic and lively experience. The backlight adjusts to different zones based on the content displayed on the screen, ensuring a perfect match with what’s on your TV.Dynamic Scene Modes: The Envisual T2 comes with a variety of preset scene modes, including music, movie, and gaming modes, each fine-tuned to offer the best visual experience for your content.Smart Control: Easily control your lighting setup via the Govee Home app, voice commands (Amazon Alexa or Google Assistant), or through the touch panel on the device. Customize brightness, color effects, and more with the app.Sync with Screen Content: The Envisual T2’s dynamic lighting reacts in real-time to what\'s displayed on your screen, matching the on-screen colors and content for an immersive, theater-like experience.Music Sync Feature: Use the built-in microphone to sync the lights with the music in your environment, making it perfect for parties or gaming.Easy Setup: The Envisual T2 is designed for easy installation, with flexible and adhesive-backed LED strips that attach neatly to the back of your TV, creating a clean and tidy setup.Wide Compatibility: Compatible with most TVs, including 55-65 inch models, ensuring a great fit for your home entertainment setup.',NULL,449.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('150dfd73-db94-4887-bf43-7befde83fe2f','2026-07-09 10:40:55.390115','2026-07-09 10:40:55.390115',NULL,'Star Wars Fennec Shand Outfit Cosplay Mini Backpack','star-wars-fennec-shand-outfit-cosplay-mini-backpack','671803443143-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'cfac33db-f672-41dc-8d02-baaac0891814',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','\"Take some advice, kid. You wanna be a bounty hunter? Make the best deal for yourself and survive.\" Make a killer statement with the Fennec Shand Cosplay Mini Backpack! Fennec Shand—bounty hunter, elite mercenary and master assassin—worked for the top crime syndicates during the age of the Galactic Empire. Skilled and ruthless, Shand worked her way up the criminal underworld during the beginning of the Empire\'s reign, becoming renowned and gaining a reputation as a cunning and elite mercenary. After the fall of the Empire and the imprisonment of many of her employers, Shand went on the run. Though hunted down and left for dead, fate would intervene and she was rescued by Boba Fett. This backpack recreates Shand’s outfit designed by Joseph Porro with applique, debossed and printed details. A burlap-like texture as well as shiny faux leather come together to recreate her unique look, while pops of orange lend it the instant recognition of the deadly mercenary. A zipper charm of Shand’s helmet completes the armor. Product Features: Enamel zipper charm, Faux leather, Adjustable shoulder straps, Applique, and Printed details',NULL,299.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
