('158b9e9f-c33e-4701-8330-6627905eb92f','2026-07-09 10:51:42.045746','2026-07-09 10:51:42.045746',NULL,'Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: Mutant Mayhem 5.5” Raphael Deluxe Ninja Shouts','teenage-mutant-ninja-turtles-mutant-mayhem-5-5-raphael-deluxe-ninja-shouts','43377833543-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'ff242680-eaae-4c64-9b7f-22aef1f926df',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','AUTHENTIC: Raphael stands 5.5” tall and comes authentically decorated and detailed just as he appears in the hit movie SHOUT OUT: Pull back on his spring-loaded right arm or left leg to make him shout—spoken by the same talent who voices Raph in the movie HOLD ON: When you pull back Raph’s arm or leg and hold it, the word he’s saying is stretched and a syllable is repeated until you let go—then the word and phrase is completed and followed by a battle sound effect LOTS TO SAY: Raphael figure includes eight phrases and five sound effects COLLECT THEM ALL: Collect all the TMNT Mutant Mayhem action figures and accessories from Playmates Toys, your Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles Toy Headquarters',NULL,99.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
