('17920855-2592-48ea-a9fc-d33188daf964','2026-07-09 11:01:49.270310','2026-07-09 11:01:49.270310',NULL,'Xbox FIFA World Cup 2026 Football Games Bundle (7 Games)','xbox-fifa-world-cup-2026-football-games-bundle-7-games','WRLDCPOFFER4-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Experience the evolution of football gaming with the Xbox FIFA World Cup 2026 Football Games Bundle (7 Games). This special collection brings together iconic football titles spanning multiple generations of EA football games. From classic FIFA releases to the latest EA SPORTS FC titles, this bundle offers an exciting journey through the history of virtual football. Featuring EA SPORTS FC 26, EA SPORTS FC 25, EA SPORTS FC 24, FIFA 23, FIFA 17, and FIFA 15, along with a bonus FIFA 21 special edition, players can enjoy years of football action, authentic teams, licensed leagues, and popular game modes. Whether you\'re revisiting classic football titles or experiencing the latest EA SPORTS FC releases, this bundle delivers exceptional value for football fans and collectors. As part of the FIFA World Cup 2026 promotion, it\'s the perfect addition to any Xbox game collection. What\'s Included • Xbox Series X|S EA SPORTS FC 26 • Xbox Series X|S EA SPORTS FC 25 • Xbox Series X|S EA SPORTS FC 24 • Xbox Series X|S FIFA 23 • Xbox One FIFA 17 English Edition• Xbox One FIFA 15 Arabic Edition Bonus Game (Any One) • Xbox One FIFA 21 Champions Edition • Xbox One FIFA 21 Ultimate Edition ∗One FIFA 21 Special Edition will be included based on stock availability. Key Features • Includes 7 football games for Xbox• Features FIFA and EA SPORTS FC titles• Includes EA SPORTS FC 24, FC 25, and FC 26• Includes FIFA 23, FIFA 17, and FIFA 15• Includes one bonus FIFA 21 Special Edition• Experience the transition from FIFA to EA SPORTS FC• Authentic clubs, players, leagues, and stadiums• Great value football gaming bundle• Physical game editions• Compatible with Xbox Series X|S and Xbox One (based on included title) Why You\'ll Love It The Xbox FIFA World Cup 2026 Football Games Bundle (7 Games) is ideal for football fans looking to build a complete EA football collection. Featuring both classic and modern football titles, this bundle delivers years of football gaming entertainment in a single package.',NULL,549.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
