('1e115880-4241-4829-936f-0edd2473e52f','2026-07-09 11:01:37.516512','2026-07-09 11:01:37.516512',NULL,'Magic: The Gathering Marvel Super Heroes - Beginner Box','magic-the-gathering-marvel-super-heroes-beginner-box','195166316505-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'3155269b-8d2e-4303-ba21-b03ba2ef8437',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Magic: The Gathering – Marvel Super Heroes Beginner Box Start your journey into the world of Magic: The Gathering with the Marvel Super Heroes Beginner Box, a perfect introduction to the legendary trading card game and its epic Marvel crossover. Featuring iconic Marvel characters and designed with new players in mind, the Beginner Box provides an accessible way to learn the fundamentals of Magic while experiencing the excitement of the Marvel Universe. Whether you\'re discovering Magic for the first time, looking for a fun way to play with friends, or adding to your Marvel collection, the Marvel Super Heroes Beginner Box is the perfect starting point for your adventure. Product Features • Official Magic: The Gathering trading card product• Features the Marvel Super Heroes set• Designed for new and returning players• An ideal introduction to the world of Magic: The Gathering• Experience the epic crossover between Magic: The Gathering and Marvel• Great for learning, collecting, and casual play',NULL,199.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('1e2640f0-2de0-4a33-97c6-157560453671','2026-07-09 11:07:26.273666','2026-07-09 11:07:26.273666',NULL,'NBA 2K23 - Nintendo Switch','sw-nba-2k23-16669714267906','5026555070225-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescriptionPlatform: Nintendo SwitchGenre: Sports, SimulationGame Modes: Single-player, Multiplayer, Online MultiplayerResolution: 720p (Handheld), 1080p (Docked)Frame Rate: 30fpsAudio: StereoNBA 2K23 - Nintendo SwitchBring the excitement of basketball wherever you go with NBA 2K23 for Nintendo Switch. Featuring engaging game modes, authentic gameplay, and the legendary Jordan Challenge, this installment delivers the ultimate basketball simulation experience. Build your dream team, rise through the ranks, and compete in thrilling online and local matchups. Key Features: Jordan Challenge: Relive 15 iconic moments from Michael Jordan’s career with era-specific gameplay and visuals.MyCareer: Create your custom player and guide them from rookie to NBA superstar.MyTeam: Build your ultimate roster with player cards featuring current stars and basketball legends.Portable Gameplay: Enjoy basketball action on the go, thanks to the Nintendo Switch’s handheld mode.Dynamic Multiplayer: Compete with friends locally or online in exciting matches.MyNBA: Manage your favorite NBA franchise, handling rosters, trades, and team strategies.',NULL,229.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('1e41d47d-23f3-4045-8582-b07fb8bb2cf5','2026-07-09 10:40:46.234377','2026-07-09 10:40:46.234377',NULL,'POKEMON PLUSH BACKPACK (MC-111-PK)','pikachu-plush-backpack-37','8426842051185-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'cfac33db-f672-41dc-8d02-baaac0891814',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','The Pokemon Pikachu Plush Backpack is an adorable and practical choice for all fans of the franchise. With its size of 35 cm, this polyester backpack is perfect for daily outings and adventures. The Pikachu plush is nicely attached to the front of the bag, adding a playful touch to this officially licensed backpack. The plush is soft and cuddly, perfect for kids and adults looking to add a touch of cuteness to their style. The main compartment is large enough to store all your daily essentials, such as school supplies, snacks, books, or even a small laptop. There is also a handy front pocket to store smaller items and keep your things organised. With its quality polyester construction, this Pikachu backpack is durable and tough, able to withstand daily wear and tear. It\'s perfect for Pokemon fans of all ages looking to add a touch of their favorite character to their everyday life. This Pikachu backpack is a functional and cute fashion choice for all Pokemon fans. Size: about 35cm Material: Polyester Age: + 18 months',NULL,139.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
