('1fef2dca-2121-4b71-9c61-1f72e7ca0758','2026-07-09 11:18:08.043806','2026-07-09 11:18:08.043806',NULL,'LEGO Harry Potter Collection - XBOX One','xbx-one-lego-harry-potter-collection-pegi','5051892217224-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','The LEGO Harry Potter Collection brings LEGO Harry Potter: Years 1-4 and LEGO Harry Potter: Years 5-7 to the PlayStation4 computer entertainment system for the first time with both top-selling videogames remastered on one disc. This compilation unites the creative prowess of LEGO and the expansive world of Harry Potter, with an exciting journey full of spell-casting, potion-making, puzzle-solving, lessons, dueling and much more for players of all ages to enjoy. Gamers can experience the entire LEGO Harry Potter adventure featuring content from seven books and eight films, with enhanced graphics, environments, lighting and visual effects, along with two downloadable content (DLC) packs. Sure to delight fans of J.K. Rowling’s ever-expanding Wizarding World, the LEGO Harry Potter Collection serves as a perfect gift for those eagerly anticipating the upcoming film, Fantastic Beasts and Where to Find Them, a prequel to the Harry Potter film series.',NULL,89.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('1ff559b2-5ced-458b-8e2b-be2977ecf57e','2026-07-09 11:02:38.851094','2026-07-09 11:02:38.851094',NULL,'WWE 2K26 - PS5','wwe-2k26-ps5','5026555439640-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Step into the ring with WWE 2K26 on PlayStation 5, the latest installment in the long-running WWE 2K series, delivering the most expansive wrestling experience yet. Featuring over 400 playable Superstars and Legends, the game brings together modern icons and classic WWE heroes for the ultimate showdown. Experience enhanced gameplay mechanics, new match types, and deeper customization systems that allow you to control every aspect of your WWE universe. Relive and rewrite history in the 2K Showcase mode, centered around CM Punk’s legendary career, with both real and alternate storyline scenarios. With upgraded physics, improved stamina and reversal systems, and interactive environments, WWE 2K26 delivers a more dynamic and strategic in-ring experience. Whether you\'re competing solo or online, this is the most feature-rich WWE game to date. Key Features • Massive Roster – 400+ WWE Superstars and Legends• New Match Types – Includes I Quit, Inferno, Dumpster & more• 2K Showcase Mode – Focused on CM Punk’s career and “what-if” scenarios• Expanded Universe Mode – Control shows, rivalries, and outcomes• Advanced Creation Suite – More customization slots and deeper editing tools• Gameplay Enhancements – Improved stamina, reversals, and physics system• Multiplayer Support – Up to 8 players online (PS Plus required)',NULL,269.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
