('20e4222a-2d19-4d8d-be9c-7daf312496a8','2026-07-09 10:40:34.577871','2026-07-09 10:40:34.577871',NULL,'My Arcade Street Fighter 2 Champion Edition Micro Player','my-arcade-street-fighter-2-c-16693882223584','845620032839-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'4bd124d5-f1b1-4cea-9490-f31a776d35b3',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Twelve characters can now directly battle each other in 78 different possible match combinations and the ultimate feature, where characters must face their true equal...themselves. The legendary arcade classic STREET FIGHTER II: Champion Edition was released in 1992 and featured revolutionary gameplay, including multi-button combinations and addictive head-to-head gameplay. Returning for the first time as a fully playable mini-sized replica, it is a must have for casual fans and collectors of the legendary fighting game franchise.',NULL,309.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('20fca2ea-ddfe-4ee8-9652-90d7e429ac7d','2026-07-09 11:07:02.935139','2026-07-09 11:07:02.935139',NULL,'Mario + Rabbids Kingdom Battle - Nintendo Switch','switch-mario-plus-rabbids-kingdom-battle-pegi','3307216024330-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','This is the story of an unexpected encounter between Mario and the irreverent Rabbids. The Mushroom Kingdom has been torn apart by a mysterious vortex, transporting the Rabbids into the once-peaceful area, splintering this beloved land. To bring order back to the Kingdom, Mario, Luigi, Princess Peach, and Yoshi team up with Rabbids heroes in a journey through four different worlds. The Mushroom Kingdom has been torn apart by a mysterious vortex, transporting the chaotic Rabbids into this once peaceful land. To restore order, Mario, Luigi, Princess Peach and Yoshi must team up with a whole new crew: four Rabbids heroes! Together, they will battle with weapons through four worlds filled with combat, puzzles, and unpredictable enemies.',NULL,99.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('2115991c-c3a0-4e4d-a85e-b3caf3c2e4f8','2026-07-09 10:57:21.517334','2026-07-09 10:57:21.517334',NULL,'Pop! Games: Sonic The Hedgehog - Super Sonic & Super Shadow 2 Pack (Flocked) (Exclusive)','pop-games-sonic-the-hedgehog-super-sonic-super-shadow-2-pack-flocked-exclusive','889698918237-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'f98bbd67-0b4f-473a-9b36-8d4e6c4d60c2',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Power up your collection with the Super Sonic & Super Shadow 2-Pack from Sonic the Hedgehog. This officially licensed Funko Pop! Games set features both characters in flocked finish, giving them a soft, textured feel that stands out in any display. As an Exclusive edition, this 2-pack is a must-have for Sonic fans and Funko collectors, combining two iconic characters in a single, highly collectible set. Perfect for display or completing your Sonic collection. Product Features: • Official Funko Pop! Games collectible • Characters: Super Sonic & Super Shadow • Flocked finish for soft, textured design • Exclusive edition • Window display packaging • Ideal for Sonic fans and Funko collectors',NULL,139.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
