('21313dfb-c82b-4d9f-9d25-a3ab0dfa23ff','2026-07-09 11:01:40.772714','2026-07-09 11:01:40.772714',NULL,'Onimusha: Way of the Sword Premium Deluxe Edition','onimusha-way-of-the-sword-premium-deluxe-edition','p-5055060907047-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','A New Era of Onimusha Begins Onimusha: Way of the Sword delivers intense, blood-soaked swordplay action set in a dark fantasy version of Edo-era Kyoto, where history has been twisted by a corruptive force known as Malice. Every stage is filled with danger, mystery, and cinematic intensity as players fight through a world overrun by horrific underworld creatures known as the Genma. At the center of the story is a lone samurai who carries the legendary Oni Gauntlet, a mystical artifact granting the power to stand against the darkness and transcend human limits.STORY The journey follows Miyamoto Musashi, who arrives in Kyoto with a single purpose: to refine his mastery of the sword and prove himself as a warrior without equal. But his path quickly becomes something far greater than personal ambition. As the city is consumed by Malice and overrun by Genma, Musashi is forced into a brutal struggle that will define his fate—and the meaning of his blade.COMBAT SYSTEM – PURE SWORDPLAY ACTION Onimusha: Way of the Sword delivers a deeply immersive melee combat experience built around precision and impact: • Authentic Sword Techniques Experience a wide range of real sword-based combat moves where every strike carries weight and consequence. • Dynamic Blade Clashes Combat evolves through intense weapon clashes that add depth and tension to every encounter. • Genma Battles Face monstrous beings from the underworld in fast, brutal, and cinematic combat scenarios. • Oni Abilities Harness supernatural powers for both offensive and defensive combat advantages. • Issen Technique Execute high-risk, high-reward precision strikes that define the Onimusha combat legacy.POWER OF THE ONI The Oni Gauntlet is essential for survival against the Genma. By consuming the souls of defeated enemies, players gain strength beyond human limitations, unlocking devastating power that transforms combat potential. This system embodies the core identity of becoming an Onimusha—a warrior who stands between humanity and the abyss.DARK FANTASY SETTING Explore a haunting reimagining of Kyoto during the Edo era, transformed into a corrupted battlefield. • Atmospheric environments filled with Malice• Mystery-driven stage progression• Constant tension between beauty and horror• A world where every step hides danger and discovery',NULL,429.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('2140a62b-d8e0-46f4-b101-25ac267bd22d','2026-07-09 11:14:54.933203','2026-07-09 11:14:54.933203',NULL,'Nier Replicant - PS4','ps4-nier-replicant-pegi-eng','5021290090200-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','NieR Replicant is a japanese PS3 version of NieR Gestalt with a younger main character. Both games are based in the same world, but differ only in the lead character\'s design, relationship with the character of Yonah, and the time in which the game takes place.The story of Nier Replicant begins in the summer of 2053 in the ruins of an unidentified city. A prolonged snowstorm envelops the region, trapping the few survivors in a gripping cold with little shelter and minimal food. Two who have made it through the onslaught of climate change lie hunkered down in the remains of a grocery store - a boy and his sister. The girl suffers from an uncontrollable cough, while her weary brother weighs a fateful decision. The mysterious book lying on the ground between them taunts the brother with its power to help. He only needs to hand over his soul to receive the tome\'s power. A number of monsters known as Shades appear and the brother fights them off to protect his sister with the help of the book. After defeating the Shades the child grows sicker. The story continues some 1,412 years in the future where a boy named Nier endures a similar struggle. His only sister has succumbed to a violent cough and must remain in bed while he searches for a cure. Though much time has passed, the world in which this brother and sister resides is, in many ways, one of a simpler time. Villagers live in modest homes and work together to ensure a better life for their community. The entire village knows of young Yonah\'s illness, and lends their support by hiring Nier for numerous odd jobs and errands. Some would say the work is beneath a man of his caliber, but he holds his head high and does whatever he can to provide for his sister, all the while hoping that the village\'s wisest member, Popola, and her twin sister Devola can discover a cure.',NULL,129.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
