('23730852-be10-45cd-a5e9-dd7f8e7c4d5b','2026-07-09 11:13:21.469133','2026-07-09 11:13:21.469133',NULL,'Metal Gear Solid Delta: Snake Eater Deluxe Edition - PS5','ps5-metal-gear-solid-delta-snake-eater-deluxe-edition','4012927151051-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescriptionPlatform: PlayStation 5Graphics: 4K resolution with ray tracing and HDR supportPerformance: Smooth 60fps for seamless gameplayAudio: 3D spatial audio for immersive soundscapesController Support: DualSense integration for tactile feedback and adaptive triggersPS5 Metal Gear Solid Δ: Snake Eater Deluxe Edition The Metal Gear Solid Δ: Snake Eater Deluxe Edition brings the beloved classic to the PlayStation 5 with a complete reimagining of the game’s visuals, mechanics, and sound. Relive the origins of the legendary Big Boss in this highly detailed remake of Metal Gear Solid 3: Snake Eater, featuring modern enhancements and exclusive deluxe content for fans of the series. Deluxe Edition ContentsFull Game: Experience the reimagined Metal Gear Solid Δ: Snake Eater, featuring stunning Unreal Engine-powered graphics and refined gameplay.Digital Soundtrack: An exclusive collection of remastered and original tracks from the game.Digital Art Book: Explore the game’s creative process with a beautifully crafted digital art book featuring concept art, character designs, and behind-the-scenes content.In-Game Deluxe Content:Exclusive camouflage patterns to enhance your stealth options.Additional face paints for deeper customization.Special weapon skins inspired by iconic moments from the Metal Gear series. Key FeaturesComplete Remake: A ground-up reimagining of the classic game with ultra-realistic environments, dynamic lighting, and cinematic visuals.Tactical Espionage Action: Classic stealth gameplay redefined with modern controls, enhanced AI, and immersive mechanics.Iconic Story: Follow the origins of the legendary Big Boss and immerse yourself in a deep narrative that explores loyalty, betrayal, and survival.Revamped Audio: Remastered sound effects and voice acting with a modern soundscape for an enriched audio experience.Survival Mechanics: Utilize camouflage, manage injuries, and hunt for food in a hostile jungle environment.Expanded Accessibility: Options for customizable controls, difficulty levels, and accessibility features ensure the game is enjoyable for all players.',NULL,399.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
