('25226570-e3e3-42af-9c3f-ca352ab89187','2026-07-09 10:41:25.588690','2026-07-09 10:41:25.588690',NULL,'Paladone Pennywise Light','paladone-pennywise-light','5055964726430-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'2f4818b1-ebde-4ac3-adb1-5c4f62d01e42',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Brighten up your room with everyones favourite terrifying clown, Stephen Kings iconic Pennywise. Ideal for lovers of the Stephen King novel IT and its film adaptations, this free sanding light features a cartoon figure of Pennywise the Clown on a black plinth with the IT logo on its front. Not for the feint hearted, the Pennywise figure is pulling a scary face, exposing his razor sharp teeth, and his mouth is stained with blood. The light, which stands at 10cm (4\") tall, is powered by 2 AA batteries that are not included. This light makes a fantastic gift for IT fans, and lovers of horror movies in general! The Horror range from Paladone features a variety of spooky gifts and accessories that are designed to pay homage to some of the horror genres biggest and best movies. Including items taken from such classic films as Gremlins and IT, the Horror range is ideal for lovers of everything that makes you go jump in the night. With a range of products that includes lamps, mugs, and more, theres plenty of fantastic items that you can add to your home.',NULL,59.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
