('256bb6c0-978f-4e83-8447-396b218478a9','2026-07-09 11:13:48.318231','2026-07-09 11:13:48.318231',NULL,'NIOH 2 - PS4','nioh-2-16672147343169','711719347606-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescription Platform: PlayStation 4Genre: Action RPG, Hack-and-SlashGame Modes: Single-player, Online Co-op (up to 3 players)Resolution: 1080pFrame Rate: 30fpsAudio: StereoController Features: Standard DualShock 4 controls, with vibration and adaptive triggers (PS5 compatibility)NIOH 2 - PS4NIOH 2 is an action-packed, samurai-themed RPG set in a mythical version of Japan during the Sengoku period. In this prequel to the original NIOH, players take control of a new protagonist, a half-human, half-yokai warrior known as Hide, who can harness the powers of demons to fight his enemies. Featuring challenging combat, intricate skill trees, and a rich, immersive storyline, NIOH 2 offers deep gameplay with strategic combat and a dark fantasy setting. The game combines fast-paced action with RPG elements, allowing players to customize their abilities and equipment as they explore the dangerous, war-torn world of Japan. Key Features: Challenging Combat: Master a variety of weapons, stances, and abilities to defeat enemies, including deadly yokai and powerful bosses.Yokai Abilities: Harness the powers of demons (yokai) to gain unique abilities, such as elemental powers and enhanced attacks.Stance-Based Combat System: Switch between multiple combat stances—high, mid, and low—for fluid and strategic combat against a wide range of enemies.Deep Customization: Tailor your character with a vast array of weapons, armor, and skill upgrades, allowing for a playstyle suited to your preferences.Multiplayer Co-op: Team up with friends in online co-op mode to tackle the game\'s toughest challenges, including difficult bosses and levels.Rich, Immersive Story: Engage in a captivating storyline filled with legendary figures from Japanese history and lore, as well as supernatural enemies and allies.New Abilities and Features: Unique to NIOH 2, the game introduces new mechanics like the Soul Core system, which lets you equip and use abilities from defeated yokai.',NULL,39.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('2573bc87-41b3-4ef7-8f05-7a6e1546c9b8','2026-07-09 10:53:25.453085','2026-07-09 10:53:25.453085',NULL,'Switch Oled Crystal Case','switch-oled-crystal-case','6972520254130-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'a98d2277-6776-45b2-b725-b5c4dfb53a56',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','High quality protective crystal case specially designed for Nintendo Switch OLED (2021 model). Protect your console from drops, shocks, bumps, scratches, dust and fingerprints. Made of durable PC materials. All ports and buttons are properly accessible. Features 6 game card slots. You can carry extra games with you. Easy to get game cards in and out. Ergonomic grip makes it easy and comfortable to use. Slim and lightweight. Easy to install. Compatible with Nintendo Switch OLED console only.',NULL,19.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('2576ccfa-0f60-46af-a4e5-31c58903a95b','2026-07-09 11:07:02.360113','2026-07-09 11:07:02.360113',NULL,'Monster Hunter Stories 2: Wings of Ruin - SW','switch-monster-hunter-stories-2-wings-of-ruin-pegi-eng','5055060968383-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Monster Hunter Stories 2: Wings of Ruin offers both RPG and Monster Hunter fans a unique new experience with a rich storyline featuring charming characters, challenging quests and friendly encounters with familiar monsters from the Monster Hunter series. Assuming the role of a young Monster Rider who can use a Kinship Stone to form strong bonds with monsters, players can gain experience and improve their skills to form deeper connections with these wonderful creatures. When ready, players can embark on memorable adventures filled with dramatic events and heartwarming friendships as the epic tale unfolds. A new adventure awaits you in this second installment of the turn-based RPG series set in the world of Monster Hunter! Become a Rider and form bonds with friendly monsters known as Monsties to fight alongside them as you take part in an epic story. You play as the grandson of Red, a legendary Rider. The story begins with a fateful encounter with Ena, a Wyverian girl who has been entrusted with an egg with the potential to hatch into a legendary Rathalos which could wreak havoc if awakened to its destructive power. Embark on a journey which will test the bonds of friendship in a changing world, and discover the truth behind the legends of old.',NULL,229.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
