('260f7355-ef16-4cd6-a46b-32c6026aff8e','2026-07-09 11:12:40.226381','2026-07-09 11:12:40.226381',NULL,'DRAGON BALL: Sparking! ZERO Collector\'s Edition','dragon-ball-sparking-zero-collectors','p-3391892032390-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescriptionResolution: 4K Ultra HD with HDR support for vivid visualsFrame Rate: 60fps for smooth and fluid gameplayGraphics Engine: Optimized for dynamic cell-shaded art style, realistic lighting, and detailed character modelsAudio: 3D audio support for immersive sound; original Japanese and English voice optionsDualSense Features (PS5): Adaptive triggers, haptic feedback, and speaker integration for enhanced gameplay immersionStorage: Approximately 60GB, plus 5GB for exclusive Collector\'s Edition contentLoading Times: Optimized for fast load times on next-gen SSDMultiplayer: Cross-platform play, ranked matches, and online tournamentsPlatform Compatibility: Available on PS5, Xbox Series X|S, and PCDragon Ball Sparking Zero Collector’s Edition The Dragon Ball Sparking Zero Collector’s Edition is a must-have for die-hard Dragon Ball fans, delivering a premium experience packed with exclusive collectibles, enhanced game features, and nostalgia for the legendary Dragon Ball Z series. This Collector’s Edition celebrates the return of the Sparking! (known as Budokai Tenkaichi in the West) series, known for its fast-paced combat, enormous character roster, and intense battles that capture the essence of Dragon Ball. From custom figures to exclusive in-game content, this edition brings players closer to the world of Dragon Ball like never before. Collector\'s Edition ContentsFull Game: Dragon Ball Sparking Zero on PS5, Xbox Series X|S, or PC.Exclusive Goku vs. Frieza Figurine: A high-quality, hand-painted figurine of Goku and Frieza in their iconic face-off on Planet Namek. The figurine showcases dynamic poses and intricate details, capturing the intensity of their legendary battle.SteelBook Case: A collector’s SteelBook case featuring exclusive artwork of Goku, Vegeta, and iconic Dragon Ball Z scenes.Art Book: A full-color art book with concept art, character designs, and a behind-the-scenes look at the game’s development, featuring classic and new characters alike.Soundtrack CD: The game’s soundtrack, including remastered versions of iconic Dragon Ball tracks and new compositions that bring the battles to life.Collector\'s Box: A specially designed box with artwork from Akira Toriyama, perfect for displaying and storing the collection.In-Game Features for Collector\'s Edition OwnersEarly Access: Get a 48-hour head start to experience Dragon Ball Sparking Zero before standard edition players.Exclusive Character Skins: Access unique skins for fan-favorite characters like Goku, Vegeta, and Piccolo, inspired by rare and nostalgic designs from the manga and anime.Sparking Boost Pack: An in-game boost pack that includes Zeni, additional character slots, and an XP multiplier to help players level up characters faster.Bonus Arenas: Two exclusive battle arenas inspired by iconic locations in Dragon Ball Z, available only in the Collector’s Edition.|Key Game FeaturesHuge Character Roster: Play as over 100 characters from the Dragon Ball universe, including classic fighters and new additions from recent series.Fast-Paced Combat System: Experience the high-speed, aerial battles and devastating special moves with fully interactive 3D environments.Enhanced Graphics and Animations: Built for next-gen consoles, Sparking Zero uses advanced lighting and physics to bring explosive energy effects, character models, and environments to life.Online Multiplayer: Join ranked battles, team fights, and tournaments to compete with players worldwide in dynamic, high-energy matchups.Dynamic Story Mode: Relive iconic Dragon Ball Z battles in story mode, complete with recreated cutscenes and voice acting from the original cast.The Dragon Ball Sparking Zero Collector’s Edition offers an immersive experience that brings the Dragon Ball universe directly to fans, making it an essential addition for collectors and players eager to relive the thrill of Dragon Ball battles with premium content and timeless memorabilia.',NULL,699.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
