('266e1b76-6ab7-4a22-b3eb-3f7ef8e74abb','2026-07-09 11:01:41.233164','2026-07-09 13:18:03.773259',NULL,'ACE COMBAT 8: WINGS OF THEVE','ace-combat-8-wings-of-theve','p-3391892043006-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Rise Above the Battlefield ACE COMBAT 8: Wings of Theve returns with a brand-new chapter in the acclaimed flight combat franchise, delivering thrilling aerial warfare, cinematic storytelling, and high-speed arcade-style action. Developed by PROJECT ACES, the team behind the legendary series, the game places players in the cockpit of an elite pilot fighting against overwhelming odds in a war-torn world. From breathtaking skies to emotionally driven character moments, every mission pushes you closer to becoming a true ace.DescriptionScreenshotsSTORY It is July 2029. The Federation of Central Usea (FCU) has fallen following a devastating surprise invasion by the Republic of Sotoa. Much of the nation has been occupied, its military shattered, and hope is fading. Rescued from the sea and brought aboard the aging aircraft carrier Endurance, you find yourself among the last remnants of your homeland\'s resistance. Onboard, you are given a name that carries the hopes of an entire nation: \"Wings of Theve.\" A legendary ace pilot and symbol of resistance connected to the FCU capital, Theve. But the legend was never real. Created to inspire a nation in crisis, the myth must now become reality as you take up the name and return to the skies alongside three trusted comrades to fight for your homeland’s future.HIGH-OCTANE AERIAL COMBAT Experience the signature gameplay that has defined the ACE COMBAT franchise. Become an Elite Fighter Pilot Take control of advanced military aircraft and engage in fast-paced aerial battles across massive combat zones. Intense Dogfights Outmaneuver enemy pilots, evade incoming threats, and unleash devastating weaponry in action-packed engagements. Powerful Arsenal Deploy a variety of weapons and combat systems to gain the advantage in challenging missions. Earn Your Wings Complete high-risk operations and rise through the ranks as a legendary ace pilotAERIAL WARFARE IN LIVING SKIES Campaign Mode features visually stunning environments designed to capture the beauty and danger of modern aerial combat. Dynamic Multi-Layered Cloudscapes Fight across vast skies filled with evolving weather systems and immersive atmospheric effects. Stunning Visual Presentation Experience dramatic battlefields and cinematic environments that bring every mission to life. Arcade-Style Flight Action Accessible yet exhilarating flight combat delivers fast-paced gameplay while maintaining the strategic depth fans expect.A CINEMATIC JOURNEY ACE COMBAT 8 expands the series’ storytelling with immersive first-person sequences and emotional character-driven moments. Experience the Human Side of War Witness the pressures of leadership, the consequences of battle, and the sacrifices made during conflict. Build Bonds With Your Squadron Between missions, strengthen relationships with squad members, overcome adversity together, and prepare for the battles ahead. Become a Symbol of Hope Carry the legacy of Wings of Theve and inspire those fighting for freedom.',NULL,279.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
