('26ddd738-21ff-4335-b197-df9e24a84760','2026-07-09 11:08:18.487177','2026-07-09 11:08:18.487177',NULL,'PlayStation 5 DualSense Wireless Controller - Chroma Pearl','playstation-5-dualsense-wireless-controller-chroma-pearl','711719590552-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'8f5c8927-be48-41c7-9c7a-c40f59f564c2',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescriptionFinish: Chroma Pearl, premium and reflective.Wireless: Bluetooth connectivity.Haptics: Dynamic haptic feedback for immersive feel.Triggers: Adaptive triggers with variable resistance.Battery: Rechargeable, 8-12 hours per charge, USB-C port.Touchpad: Large touch-sensitive control pad.Audio: Built-in microphone, 3.5mm headphone jack, and speaker.Sensors: Gyroscope and accelerometer for motion detection.Compatibility: PS5 and limited PC compatibility.The PlayStation 5 DualSense Wireless Controller - Chroma Pearl is designed for immersive gameplay and visual appeal. Its Chroma Pearl finish adds a premium, reflective touch, making it as striking as it is functional. With Bluetooth connectivity, the controller enables smooth wireless gaming, and adaptive triggers add an extra layer of realism by adjusting resistance for actions like drawing a bow or accelerating. Dynamic haptic feedback reacts to in-game events with subtle or intense vibrations, enhancing player connection to the environment. A large, responsive touchpad offers additional control options, and the built-in microphone, speaker, and 3.5mm headphone jack provide flexible audio setups for communication and sound immersion. The controller’s rechargeable battery provides 8-12 hours of gameplay on a single charge via USB-C, making it ideal for extended sessions. Motion sensors, including a gyroscope and accelerometer, allow for intuitive tilt and movement-based controls, further drawing players into the game world. Compatible with PlayStation 5 and select PC games, the DualSense Chroma Pearl is built to enhance both functionality and aesthetics, delivering a next-generation gaming experience that feels as good as it looks.',NULL,359.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
