('27d78bfa-b232-4652-83d5-1ade08549ff4','2026-07-09 11:13:14.782831','2026-07-09 11:13:14.782831',NULL,'Dying Light 2: Stay Human - PS5','dying-light-2-stay-human-16667842795553','5902385108164-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescriptionPlatform: PlayStation 5Genre: Action RPG, Survival HorrorGame Modes: Single-player, Online Co-opResolution: 4K UHD with HDR supportFrame Rate: Up to 60fps performance modeAudio: 3D Audio support for an immersive soundscapeDying Light 2: Stay Human - PS5Dying Light 2: Stay Human is a gripping open-world action RPG set in a post-apocalyptic world overrun by the infected. As Aiden Caldwell, a skilled survivor with unique abilities, you\'ll explore a vast, dynamic world filled with danger, choices, and consequences. Traverse the city with parkour-inspired movement, engage in visceral combat, and shape the fate of The City with your decisions. With enhanced visuals and performance on PS5, the game delivers a deeply immersive experience, including ray tracing, faster load times, and haptic feedback support on the DualSense controller. Whether you\'re battling the infected at night or forming alliances by day, Dying Light 2 promises a thrilling adventure where your choices matter. Key Features: Expansive Open World: Explore a massive, vertical city teeming with secrets, factions, and diverse locations.Dynamic Day-Night Cycle: Face greater dangers at night as the infected become more aggressive and the streets turn deadly.Player Choices: Make impactful decisions that shape the world, influence factions, and determine the outcome of your story.Parkour Movement: Navigate the environment with advanced parkour skills, seamlessly scaling buildings and performing daring leaps.Visceral Combat: Use an arsenal of melee and ranged weapons, traps, and your wits to battle humans and infected alike.Co-op Gameplay: Team up with up to three friends in online co-op to explore, fight, and survive together.Enhanced for PS5: Enjoy 4K resolution, ray tracing, and smooth gameplay at 60fps, with immersive haptic feedback and adaptive triggers.',NULL,249.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
