('2842608e-d3ed-4db1-aa11-a76a6249b07d','2026-07-09 11:01:37.220467','2026-07-09 11:01:37.220467',NULL,'The Grinch 2: Saving Christmas','the-grinch-2-saving-christmas','p-5061005357921-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','THE GRINCH 2: SAVING CHRISTMASDescriptionScreenshotsSave Christmas with the Grinch! Every Who down in Who-ville is jingling, singing, and celebrating—and this time, the Grinch can\'t wait to join them! With a heart three sizes bigger and a desire to show the Whos that he\'s changed, the Grinch is determined to create the most spectacular Christmas tree ever. Play as the Grinch and leap through snowy 3D worlds, collecting ornaments to make your tree sparkle brighter with every adventure. Explore Festive 3D Worlds Embark on a magical journey across vibrant locations filled with festive surprises and platforming challenges. • Explore the Grinch\'s Cave, avoiding falling stalactites and rushing water chutes.• Conquer the icy slopes and giant rolling snowballs of Mt. Crumpit.• Journey through Who-wood, filled with towering trees and springy mushrooms.• Discover the cheerful streets and cozy homes of Who-ville.• Search every corner for hidden paths and sparkling decorations to bring Christmas cheer to Who-ville. Unleash Grinchy Gadgets Use a variety of clever gadgets to overcome obstacles and explore each world. • Rocket Skates to race through levels.• Jetpack to reach new heights.• Snowball Maker to freeze mischievous adversaries.• Use your candy canes to smash objects and reveal hidden ornaments. Decorate the Ultimate Christmas Tree Collect ornaments throughout your adventure and use them to decorate the Grinch\'s Christmas tree and Who-ville Square. The more decorations you discover, the more spectacular your Christmas celebration becomes. Play Solo or Together Enjoy the adventure alone as the Grinch or team up with a friend in local co-op mode as Max. Together, outsmart pesky mice, wild forest bats, and other curious creatures while uncovering every hidden secret and collectible.Key FeaturesBRING CHEER TO THE WHOS Embark on a festive journey to create the most spectacular Christmas tree and decorate Who-ville Square. EXPLORE VIBRANT WORLDS Swing, smash, and Jumbo-Jump through the Grinch\'s Cave, Mt. Crumpit, Who-wood, and Who-ville. UNLEASH GRINCHY GADGETS Take on every challenge with the Rocket Skates, Jetpack, Snowball Maker, and more. CO-OP TO SAVE CHRISTMAS Play solo as the Grinch or team up with a friend as Max in local co-op mode. AN ADVENTURE FOR EVERYONE Enjoy a whimsical journey inspired by the original books, featuring intuitive gameplay and challenges accessible to players of all ages.',NULL,169.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
