('29ff8511-8bfe-4bcf-add2-f87a7190b3d2','2026-07-09 10:42:19.206489','2026-07-09 10:42:19.206489',NULL,'MARS GAMING MMICX Pro Studio Microphone','mars-gaming-mmicx-pro-studio-microphone-dual-condenser-usb-black','4710562759808-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'2f4818b1-ebde-4ac3-adb1-5c4f62d01e42',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Take the ultimate professional leap with MMICX. A high definition studio microphone (96Khz ADC) and dual capsule (cardioid and omnidirectional), with anti-vibration support and a special latency-free headphone jack. Simplified plug & play USB connection and all-metal construction for extreme durability. double capsule ADC 96Khz high definition anti-vibration support Latency-free audio connector DUAL CAPSULE WITH SMART-LED BUTTON Thanks to its dual capsule and smart LED button, you can select between three modes: Cardiode Condenser: For clear, targeted sound, perfect for streaming, instrument recording, and voice recording. Omnidirectional Condenser: For multi-level sound capture, perfect for ambient recordings with a natural 3D surround effect. Mute Mode: Mute the microphone quickly and visually thanks to the smart led button. CHOOSE YOUR VERSION: BLACK OR WHITE Available in two colors, black and white, choose the one that best suits your configuration! HIGH DEFINITION 96KHZ ADC Take the leap to professional studio recording quality thanks to its advanced 96Khz ADC chipset. Every detail and nuance of your voice or music is captured in your recordings and streams like never before. ANTI-VIBRATION MOUNT Isolates the microphone and suppresses unwanted noise and sounds thanks to its professional suspension system. LATENT- FREE OUTLET Hear your voice or music through the microphone in real-time with your headphones connected to the 3.5mm jack port for maximum control. PROFESSIONAL MATERIALS All-metal microphone and stand constructed of the finest materials for maximum durability and stability. SPECIFICATIONS Polar Pattern: Cardioid and Omnidirectional SPL: 120dB Frequency range: 20Hz-20kHz SNR: USB Current: 150mA Input Voltage: 5V Connectors: USB (microphone) / Jack 3.5 mm (headphones) Weight: 730g (total) / 200g (microphone) Cable length: 200cm Lighting: Smart LED Button Impedance: <16Ω Compatibility: Windows, Mac Dimensions: 150x52x48mm (microphone) / 163x104x104mm (bracket)',NULL,369.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
