('2b37d092-151a-4864-b17a-9a3ab782104e','2026-07-09 11:11:18.564158','2026-07-09 11:11:18.564158',NULL,'Outriders Worldslayer - PS5','ps5-outriders-worldslayer','5021290093775-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescription Platform: PlayStation 5Genre: Action RPG, ShooterGame Modes: Single-player, Online Co-op (up to 3 players)Resolution: Up to 4KFrame Rate: Targeted 60fpsAudio: 3D Audio support for immersive soundController Features: Haptic feedback and adaptive triggers for more immersive combat and abilities Outriders Worldslayer - PS5Outriders Worldslayer is an expansive expansion for the hit cooperative RPG Outriders, bringing new content, missions, and challenges to the brutal world of Enoch. This action-packed shooter offers a combination of intense gunplay, dynamic character customization, and a rich narrative. Players can explore new regions, take on powerful enemies, and dive deeper into the game’s lore. With the addition of the Worldslayer expansion, the stakes are higher, and the action is more intense than ever before. Key Features: New Storyline and Missions: Uncover the secrets of the planet Enoch as you face a new threat in an expanded narrative.New Enemy Types: Encounter challenging new enemies, including powerful bosses, that push your combat skills to the limit.Expanded Class System: New abilities and skills allow for even greater character customization.Multiplayer Co-op: Team up with friends to face off against enemies and explore Enoch\'s dangerous environments in online co-op mode.Dynamic Combat: Use a mix of powerful firearms, unique abilities, and tactical strategies to survive brutal encounters.Optimized for PS5: Enjoy improved graphics, faster loading times, and enhanced performance for a more immersive experience.Endgame Content: New endgame activities, including expeditions and world tiers, to keep the action going beyond the story.',NULL,219.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
