('2bb9fc51-c98e-4b4a-82eb-16f1089aa6ae','2026-07-09 11:08:33.178175','2026-07-09 11:08:33.178175',NULL,'PlayStation 5 DualSense Wireless Controller - Fortnite Limited Edition','playstation-5-dualsense-wireless-controller-fortnite-limited-edition','711719594154-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'8f5c8927-be48-41c7-9c7a-c40f59f564c2',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescriptionDesign: Custom Fortnite-themed with vibrant purple and green colors.Wireless: Bluetooth connectivity for seamless gaming.Haptics: Dynamic feedback through immersive vibrations.Adaptive Triggers: Adjustable resistance for in-game actions.Battery: Rechargeable, 8-12 hours of playtime, USB-C charging.Audio: Built-in microphone, 3.5mm headphone jack.Touchpad: Interactive touchpad for extra controls.Sensors: Gyroscope and accelerometer for motion controls.Compatibility: PS5 and select PC games.Bonus: Includes exclusive Fortnite cosmetics and V-Bucks. The PlayStation 5 DualSense Wireless Controller - Fortnite Limited Edition showcases a unique Fortnite-themed design with vibrant purple and green colors, capturing the essence of the game. It offers Bluetooth connectivity for seamless, wireless gaming, along with dynamic haptic feedback and adaptive triggers that provide immersive, real-time responses to in-game actions. The controller also includes a large interactive touchpad, built-in microphone, 3.5mm headphone jack, and motion sensors for added control and communication. With a rechargeable battery that provides 8-12 hours of playtime and USB-C charging for quick power-ups, this controller is designed for extended sessions. Compatible with both PS5 and select PC games, it also includes exclusive Fortnite cosmetics and V-Bucks, enhancing your in-game experience. This limited edition controller brings both style and functionality to Fortnite fans and gamers alike.',NULL,379.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
