ytelling that brings high-stakes drama and intense fights to the forefront.Multiplayer Modes: Ranked matches, online tournaments, and casual lobbies with rollback netcode for smooth online play.',NULL,249.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
