('2ef4255b-be2d-4910-9e2f-bd507d2e4ed0','2026-07-09 11:13:00.014242','2026-07-09 11:13:00.014242',NULL,'Assassin\'s Creed Shadows Collector\'s Edition (ZGames Exclusive)','assassins-creed-shadows-collectors-edition','p-3307216294559-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescription Platform: PlayStation 5, Xbox Series X|S, PCResolution: 4K with HDR supportPerformance: 60fps with ray-tracing enabledAudio: 3D spatial audio for immersive environmentsController Features: Haptic feedback and adaptive triggers on PS5 Assassin\'s Creed: Shadows Collector\'s Edition The Assassin\'s Creed: Shadows Collector\'s Edition delivers an immersive experience for fans of the franchise, combining the game\'s thrilling stealth-action gameplay with a host of exclusive collector’s items. Set in a mysterious and shadowy era of history, this entry explores the secretive and dangerous world of the Brotherhood in a way never seen before. Collector\'s Edition ContentsFull Game: Includes the full version of Assassin\'s Creed: Shadows, optimized for next-gen performance.Exclusive Figurine: A meticulously crafted 12-inch statue of the game’s protagonist in an iconic pose, showcasing intricate details and a dynamic design.Steelbook Case: A collectible steelbook featuring exclusive artwork inspired by the game’s dark and enigmatic theme.Map of the World: A detailed map of the game’s open-world setting, highlighting key locations and secrets to uncover.Art Book: A premium-quality art book showcasing concept art, character designs, and behind-the-scenes insights into the game’s development.Digital Soundtrack: A collection of the game’s haunting and atmospheric music, downloadable in high quality.In-Game Content:Unique armor set and weapons inspired by the shadows.An exclusive mount or ship skin, depending on the setting.Special mission \"Secrets of the Brotherhood,\" available only in the Collector\'s Edition. Key Features of the GameDynamic Open World: Explore a vast, beautifully crafted world filled with historical intrigue, shadowy environments, and secret societies.Enhanced Stealth Mechanics: Master new stealth techniques and gadgets to take down enemies unseen.Deep Customization: Personalize your assassin’s gear, abilities, and style to suit your playstyle.Compelling Narrative: Unravel a gripping story that ties into the larger Assassin\'s Creed universe, focusing on themes of loyalty, betrayal, and redemption.Next-Gen Performance: Experience stunning 4K visuals, realistic lighting, and smooth 60fps gameplay on supported platforms.',NULL,699.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('2ef69a6d-ae2e-459f-8549-b953db0e67a8','2026-07-09 11:11:26.405029','2026-07-09 11:11:26.405029',NULL,'Marvel\'s Midnight Suns Enhanced Edition - PS5','ps5-marvels-midnight-suns-enhanced-edition','5026555431361-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','DARKNESS FALLS. RISE UP! YOU ARE THE HUNTER, A LEGENDARY DEMON SLAYER WITH A MYSTERIOUS PAST...AND SECRETS YOU HAVE YET TO UNCOVER. When the demonic Lilith and her fearsome horde unite with the evil armies of Hydra, it’s time to unleash Marvel’s dark side. As The Hunter, your mission is to lead an unlikely team of seasoned Super Heroes and dangerous supernatural warriors to victory. Can legends such as Doctor Strange, Iron Man, and Blade put aside their differences in the face of a growing apocalyptic threat? If you’re going to save the world, you\'ll have to forge alliances and lead the team into battle as the legendary Midnight Suns. With an array of upgradeable characters and skills allowing you to build your own unique version of The Hunter, you will choose how to send Lilith’s army back to the underworld. The Enhanced Edition includes 5 premium skins: Captain America (Future Soldier) Captain Marvel (Mar-vell) Magik (Phoenix 5) Nico Minoru (Sister Grimm) Wolverine (X-Force) MARVEL’S MIDNIGHT SUNS IS A TACTICAL RPG SET IN THE DARKER SIDE OF MARVEL. As a new and customisable original Marvel character, lead a powerful team of supernatural Super Heroes facing growing unholy threats. Experience a Tactical Marvel game unlike any other. You must fight vigorously, strategise smartly, and lead an unexpected combination of Marvel Super Heroes to save the world from the rising darkness.',NULL,279.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
