('2fae380d-01d9-433f-87e0-3d54a960a225','2026-07-09 11:17:43.881541','2026-07-09 11:17:43.881541',NULL,'PJ Masks: Heroes of the Night - Xbox One','xbx-one-pj-masks-heroes-of-16667848345812','5060528035491-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Who goes into the night to save the day? You do! Get your PJs on and become heroes Catboy, Owlette, and Gekko in the most exciting PJ Masks video game yet.Starting out at Mission Control HQ, you’ll set off on a platforming adventure for little heroes. Use your superpowers – like Catboy’s speed, Owlette’s super flying moves, and mighty Gekko’s muscles – to stop the most popular night-time baddies. And explore eight PJ Masks locations, from the city roofs and Mystery Mountain all the way to the Moon! With help from PJ Robot, you’ll discover a world of friendship, teamwork, and amazing hidden collectibles.Bedtime is the right time to fight crime – but can you save the world from Romeo, Luna Girl, Night Ninja and more villains?',NULL,79.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
