('30f78177-4249-4dad-ad09-4aab345be5ff','2026-07-09 11:01:45.323142','2026-07-09 11:01:45.323142',NULL,'ELDEN RING Tarnished Edition - Nintendo Switch 2','elden-ring-tarnished-edition-nintendo-switch-2','3391892041705-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Product DescriptionScreenshotsRise, Tarnished, and embark on the definitive ELDEN RING adventure with ELDEN RING Tarnished Edition for Nintendo Switch 2. Developed by FromSoftware and published by Bandai Namco Entertainment, this complete edition brings together the critically acclaimed base game and the massive SHADOW OF THE ERDTREE expansion, delivering the most comprehensive ELDEN RING experience to date. Journey through the vast Lands Between, uncover ancient mysteries, challenge fearsome enemies, and forge your own path in a dark fantasy world crafted by Hidetaka Miyazaki and George R. R. Martin. Explore breathtaking landscapes, discover hidden dungeons, master powerful weapons and magic, and face legendary bosses in epic battles that reward skill, exploration, and perseverance.KEY FEATURESA NEW FANTASY WORLD Journey through the Lands Between, a new fantasy world created by Hidetaka Miyazaki, creator of the influential DARK SOULS video game series, and George R. R. Martin, author of The New York Times best-selling fantasy series, A Song of Ice and Fire. Unravel the mysteries of the Elden Ring’s power. Encounter adversaries with profound backgrounds, characters with their own unique motivations for helping or hindering your progress, and fearsome creatures. WORLD EXPLORATION IN THE LANDS BETWEEN Explore breathtaking open environments and interconnected dungeons filled with secrets, challenges, and rewards. Travel on foot or horseback across sprawling landscapes, towering mountains, ancient castles, and dangerous swamps.GENRE-DEFINING GAMEPLAY Create your own Tarnished hero and shape your playstyle using a diverse arsenal of weapons, magic, and skills. Engage enemies through direct combat, stealth tactics, or strategic use of allies in FromSoftware\'s acclaimed action RPG experience.',NULL,279.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
