('345ea70b-976c-497d-a0bf-043679c87392','2026-07-09 10:51:27.157891','2026-07-09 10:51:27.157891',NULL,'Gabby\'s DH Basic Doll Gabby Girl','gabbys-dh-basic-doll-gabby-girl','778988364383-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'ff242680-eaae-4c64-9b7f-22aef1f926df',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','8-INCH GABBY’S DOLLHOUSE DOLL: Dressed in her classic outfit from the show, Gabby is ready for endless adventures! Realistic details like her fabric top, cat ears and kitty jeans bring Gabby to life. DOLL WITH SOFT HAIR: Gabby Girl looks just like the character from the show! She features super soft and curly hair that’s so much fun to style! REMOVABLE CAT EARS: A pinch on the left, pinch, pinch on the right! Gabby Girl comes with her signature cat ears headband. Slide them onto Gabby to begin your pretend play adventures! PERFECT GIFT FOR KIDS: The Gabby’s Dollhouse Gabby Girl doll is the perfect kids gift for ages 3 and up. Bring home Gabby and relive your favorite moments from the show! TOYS FOR GIRLS AND BOYS AGES 3 AND UP: Gabby’s dollhouse dolls, doll house furniture, stuffed animals and kids toys are great birthday and christmas gifts for kids ages 3 and up..Includes: 1 Doll, 1 Removable Cat Ears Headband.Covered by the Spin Master Care Commitment. See below for full details',NULL,109.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL);
