('348038db-50ab-436b-8701-82f37c6c0d2f','2026-07-09 11:06:51.074246','2026-07-09 11:06:51.074246',NULL,'Lego Jurassic World - Nintendo Switch','lego-jurassic-world-16667842791180','5051893239713-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescription Platform: Nintendo SwitchGenre: Action, AdventureGame Modes: Single-player, Local Multiplayer (Co-op)Resolution: 720p (Handheld), 1080p (Docked)Frame Rate: 30fpsAudio: StereoESRB Rating: E10+ (Mild Cartoon Violence)LEGO Jurassic World - Nintendo SwitchDive into the thrilling adventure of dinosaurs with LEGO Jurassic World on Nintendo Switch! This exciting game captures iconic moments from the first four Jurassic movies (Jurassic Park, The Lost World: Jurassic Park, Jurassic Park III, and Jurassic World) in LEGO’s trademark humor and charm. Build, explore, and relive cinematic moments while playing as beloved characters—or even as dinosaurs—in this fun, family-friendly adventure. Key Features: Revisit Jurassic History: Play through key moments from the first four Jurassic films, all brought to life with LEGO\'s creativity and wit.Dinosaur Gameplay: Control over 20 dinosaurs, from the fearsome T. rex to smaller species like compsognathus.Open World Exploration: Explore Isla Nublar and Isla Sorna, collect items, and unlock secrets in free-play mode.Custom Dinosaurs: Create your own hybrid dinosaurs by mixing DNA to design the ultimate dino.Two-Player Co-op: Enjoy local multiplayer mode and solve puzzles together with a friend.LEGO Fun: Experience the Jurassic saga with LEGO’s lighthearted humor and engaging gameplay.Switch Optimization: Play on-the-go in handheld mode or docked for big-screen action.',NULL,79.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
