('35936398-a4ca-4b33-b515-4f9cedaa9bd4','2026-07-09 11:12:49.564011','2026-07-09 11:12:49.564011',NULL,'Final Vendetta - PS5','final-vendetta-16667842799372','5056280444893-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescription Platform: PS5Genre: Action, Beat \'Em UpDeveloper: Bitmap BureauPublisher: Numskull GamesModes: Single-player, Local Co-opRelease Date: June 17, 2022Final Vendetta - PS5 Final Vendetta is a hard-hitting arcade-style beat \'em up inspired by classic brawlers. Set against a vibrant urban backdrop, the game features pixel-perfect retro visuals, challenging combat, and an adrenaline-pumping soundtrack. With a gritty story and fast-paced action, Final Vendetta pays homage to iconic games like Streets of Rage and Final Fight while adding its unique flair. Key Features Classic Beat \'Em Up Gameplay: Engage in challenging, skill-based combat against waves of street thugs and bosses.Three Unique Characters: Play as Claire Sparks, Duke Sancho, or Miller T. Williams, each with distinct fighting styles and abilities.Local Co-op: Team up with a friend in two-player co-op mode for ultimate brawling fun.Pixel Art Excellence: Beautifully crafted retro-inspired visuals, bringing vibrant cityscapes and gritty environments to life.Dynamic Soundtrack: Enjoy an electrifying soundtrack featuring contributions from renowned artists in electronic music and chiptune.Diverse Stages and Enemies: Battle through a variety of environments, including alleyways, nightclubs, and subway stations, facing a wide array of foes.Multiple Modes: Try different game modes, including arcade, survival, and boss rush, for extended replayability.',NULL,149.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('359bb997-0ffb-43be-b8ef-efa4ace7b567','2026-07-09 10:47:17.213779','2026-07-09 10:47:17.213779',NULL,'IRON MAN SHAPED MUG V2','iron-man-shaped-mug-v2','5056577710649-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'6c37856e-f0e1-41cc-baf4-c86092a4757a',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Fuel your day with the power of Iron Man using our Iron Man Shaped Mug V2! Featuring the iconic helmet design, this mug adds a heroic touch to your morning routine. Sip your favorite beverage and embrace the spirit of Tony Stark.',NULL,85.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('35a6039e-43b8-4ad3-a3d9-4f1face1044d','2026-07-09 11:14:18.027137','2026-07-09 11:14:18.027137',NULL,'PS4 The Last of Us Remastered','ps4-the-last-of-us-remastered','711719810919-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Winner of over 200 Game of the Year awards, The Last of Us™ has been rebuilt for the PlayStation®4 system. Now featuring full 1080p, higher-resolution character models, improved shadows and lighting, in addition to several other gameplay improvements. 20 years after a pandemic has radically changed known civilization, infected humans run wild and survivors are killing each other for food, weapons; whatever they can get their hands on. Joel, a violent survivor, is hired to smuggle a 14 year-old girl, Ellie, out of an oppressive military quarantine zone, but what starts as a small job soon transforms into a brutal journey across the U.S. The Last of Us Remastered includes the Abandoned Territories Map Pack, Reclaimed Territories Map Pack, and the critically acclaimed The Last of Us: Left Behind Single Player campaign that combines themes of survival, loyalty, and love with tense, survival-action gameplay.',NULL,79.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('35abcd6d-39d1-4f07-bc94-31b9528b198e','2026-07-09 11:10:57.094043','2026-07-09 11:10:57.094043',NULL,'Alan Wake 2 Deluxe Edition','alan-wake-2-deluxe-edition-p-17269104451495','p-5056635609427-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescriptionEngine: Northlight Engine, optimized for next-gen platforms, offering photorealistic graphics, dynamic lighting, and detailed environments.Resolution: 4K support with HDR for deep contrasts and lifelike visuals.Frame Rate: 60fps for smooth, responsive gameplay.Audio: Dolby Atmos surround sound support for an immersive, spine-chilling auditory experience.Platforms: PlayStation 5, Xbox Series X|S, and PC (Steam, Epic Games Store)Alan Wake 2 Deluxe Edition - Uncover the Dark Mystery Alan Wake 2 Deluxe Edition is the definitive version of Remedy Entertainment’s thrilling survival horror sequel. Building on the narrative-driven gameplay and atmospheric tension of the first game, Alan Wake 2 dives deeper into the psychological terror of its protagonist while introducing new gameplay mechanics, a dual narrative, and an eerie new setting. The Deluxe Edition offers additional content and exclusive in-game items to enhance the experience, making it the perfect choice for fans of the series looking to immerse themselves fully in the dark, mysterious world of Alan Wake. Deluxe Edition ContentsFull Game: Alan Wake 2 featuring the complete dark journey of Alan Wake and new protagonist, Saga Anderson, in a tense battle against supernatural forces.Bonus In-Game Content: Exclusive costumes, weapons, and skins that give players more customization options for their characters, including unique outfits that reflect the game\'s atmosphere and lore.Digital Art Book: Explore the hauntingly beautiful world of Alan Wake 2 with a full-color digital art book that takes you behind the scenes of the game’s design, characters, and environments.Soundtrack: A digital soundtrack featuring chilling music and atmospheric scores that set the tone for Alan Wake 2, including compositions that elevate the sense of dread and mystery.Survival Pack: A special in-game item pack that includes additional resources, such as extra ammunition and health kits, to help players survive the game’s terrifying challenges.Early Access: Get 48-hour early access to the game, diving into the mystery and darkness before the general release.Game FeaturesDual Protagonist Storyline: Play as both Alan Wake, the writer trapped in the dark world, and Saga Anderson, a new FBI agent, each with unique perspectives and abilities. Their intertwined fates drive a suspenseful narrative filled with twists and turns.Psychological Horror & Survival Mechanics: Combat the forces of darkness using light-based weapons and tactics, with limited resources that heighten the game\'s survival horror elements. Solve intricate puzzles and uncover dark secrets as you progress through the twisted storyline.Improved Combat and Gameplay: Building on the first game\'s mechanics, Alan Wake 2 introduces new ways to manipulate light and darkness, creating strategic depth in combat. Players will face terrifying enemies that are vulnerable to light, demanding quick thinking and tactical use of available resources.Stunning Visuals: Powered by Remedy’s proprietary Northlight Engine, Alan Wake 2 offers breathtaking visuals with realistic lighting effects, detailed environments, and a gripping atmosphere that intensifies the horror experience.Intricate Storytelling: True to its legacy, Alan Wake 2 features an immersive narrative with deep psychological elements, exploring themes of madness, creativity, and the supernatural. Rich dialogue, complex character development, and haunting cutscenes unfold as you uncover the mystery.',NULL,299.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
