('35e203cf-92b6-466d-93e3-30bdbbef3e67','2026-07-09 11:13:47.473669','2026-07-09 11:13:47.473669',NULL,'Evil Dead: The Game - PS4','ps4-evil-dead-the-game','5060760886097-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescription Platform: PlayStation 4Genre: Action, Horror, MultiplayerGame Modes: Single-player, Online Co-op, PvP MultiplayerResolution: Up to 1080p on PS4 (4K available via PS5 backward compatibility)Frame Rate: Up to 60fps (dependent on hardware)Audio: Surround sound for immersive audio effectsEvil Dead: The Game - PS4Immerse yourself in the chaotic, blood-soaked world of Evil Dead: The Game, where the legendary franchise comes alive in a thrilling co-op and PvP action-horror experience. Play as iconic characters like Ash Williams and his crew as you work to banish the Kandarian Demon, close rifts, and survive relentless Deadite attacks. Join forces with friends to complete missions or take control of the demon to terrorize the survivors. Packed with visceral combat, humor, and authentic Evil Dead charm, this game is perfect for fans and newcomers alike. Key Features: Play as Iconic Characters: Step into the shoes of Ash Williams, Kelly Maxwell, Pablo Simon Bolivar, and more, each with unique abilities.Multiplayer Action: Choose to be a survivor in a co-op team or play as the Kandarian Demon in asymmetric PvP battles.Authentic Locations: Explore detailed environments, including the infamous Knowby Cabin, straight from the Evil Dead universe.Dynamic Combat: Use chainsaws, boomsticks, and a variety of melee and ranged weapons to obliterate Deadites in gruesome, over-the-top battles.Solo or Team Play: Tackle story-driven missions solo or team up online for co-op survival.',NULL,169.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
