cro recording• Gaming Mode Key Features • Analog Optical Switches Gen-2 for precise and customizable input• Rapid Trigger & Snap Tap for ultra-fast responsiveness• Dual-step Actuation for multi-function key control• Compact TKL Design for esports setups• Razer Chroma RGB with full customization• Premium Build Quality with aluminum top case• Magnetic Wrist Rest for added comfort',NULL,899.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
