rd, providing a reliable platform for Intel LGA 1700 processors. Featuring integrated Wi-Fi connectivity, DDR5 memory support, and modern expansion options, it delivers the essential features needed for gaming, productivity, and future system upgrades.Memory – T-FORCE DELTA RGB 16GB (2×8GB) DDR5 5600MHz Equipped with 16GB of T-FORCE DELTA RGB DDR5 memory, configured as 2×8GB modules running at 5600MHz, this system offers fast responsiveness and smooth multitasking performance. The DDR5 platform provides increased bandwidth for modern applications, while the RGB lighting adds a premium gaming aesthetic to the build.Storage – Crucial E100 1TB PCIe 4.0 NVMe SSD Store your games, software, and files on the Crucial E100 1TB M.2 NVMe SSD. Utilizing a PCIe 4.0 interface, the drive delivers fast system startup, quick game loading, and responsive application performance while providing ample storage capacity for modern gaming and everyday computing needs.CPU Cooling – XANDER Whirlwind Pro Black The processor is cooled by the XANDER Whirlwind Pro Black CPU Cooler, designed to maintain stable operating temperatures during gaming and daily workloads. Its cooling design helps ensure reliable system performance while complementing the overall black-themed appearance of the build.Power Supply – SilverStone Strider 650W Power Supply The SilverStone Strider 650W Power Supply provides dependable power delivery for the entire system. Designed to support modern gaming hardware, it offers the stability and reliability required for long gaming sessions and everyday use.',NULL,4199.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
