('38a47baa-367c-4943-bac5-b1fe1d7b070d','2026-07-09 10:51:27.506294','2026-07-09 10:51:27.506294',NULL,'GAME FRIENDS:TRIVIATHEONEW/THEAPRTMNTBET','friends-the-one-with-the-apartment-game','778988324806-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'ff242680-eaae-4c64-9b7f-22aef1f926df',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Includes 1 Dry Erase Gameboard, 1 Cardboard Stand, 2 Jumbo Dry Erase Cards, 2 Dry Erase Markers, 2 Plastic Stands, 250 Question Cards, 1 Sand Timer, Instructions FOR THE ULTIMATE FRIENDS FANS Turn game night into a party for Friends fans. Trivia from the entire run of the show makes its way into over 200 questions QUICK START, FUN AND ENGAGING Just take the game out of the box, choose your teams and get ready for allout Friendsstyle hilarity. For 26 players, ages 14 and up. PLAY THE GAME BASED ON THE ONE IN THE SHOW Play the game featured in the episode The One with the Embryos. PERFECT PARTY GAME With four different categories and a superfast lightening round, gameplay never gets boring.',NULL,119.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('38a57348-f190-43a2-b72a-fffdf16c02fc','2026-07-09 10:47:07.037996','2026-07-09 10:47:07.037996',NULL,'NIGHTMARE BEFORE CHRISTMAS GLOW IN THE DARK GLASS','nightmare-before-christmas-glow-in-the-dark-glass','5056577708998-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'6c37856e-f0e1-41cc-baf4-c86092a4757a',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Add a magical touch to your drinkware collection with our Nightmare Before Christmas Glow in the Dark Glass! Featuring hauntingly beautiful designs that glow in the dark, this glass adds a spooky vibe to your beverages. Let Jack Skellington and his friends brighten up your drinks with their ghostly charm.',NULL,75.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('38a60aa9-ace0-4b40-9a01-e3e3ba88d8d7','2026-07-09 10:57:45.375217','2026-07-09 10:57:45.375217',NULL,'Pop! Games: Funko Fusion - He-Man w/Chase','pop-games-funko-fusion-he-man-w-chase','889698830652-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'f98bbd67-0b4f-473a-9b36-8d4e6c4d60c2',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Power up your collection with this Funko Fusion He-Man w/ Chase figure. Featuring the legendary hero in a dynamic pose, this stylized vinyl figure combines Funko Pop! charm with collectible Chase variant rarity, making it a standout piece for fans of He-Man and Funko Fusion enthusiasts alike. Perfect for Masters of the Universe collectors and anyone looking to add a rare chase figure to their display. Key Features • Official Funko Pop! Games collectible • Features He-Man in action-ready pose • Includes chance for a rare Chase variant • High-quality vinyl figure with detailed sculpting • Ideal for He-Man, Masters of the Universe, and Funko Fusion collectors',NULL,75.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('38b85c6f-55a0-4a13-aa25-1b373b63008e','2026-07-09 11:10:58.622395','2026-07-09 11:10:58.622395',NULL,'Clair Obscur: Expedition 33','clair-obsucr-expedition-33','p-3391892035544-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','« Year by year, she erases us. »Lead the members of Expedition 33 on their quest to destroy the Paintress so that she can never paint death again. Explore a world of wonders inspired by Belle Époque France and battle unique enemies in this turn-based RPG with real-time mechanics. \"Once a year, the Paintress wakes and paints upon her monolith. Paints her cursed number and everyone of that age turns to smoke and fades away. Year by year, that number ticks down and more of us are erased. Tomorrow she’ll wake and paint “33.” Tomorrow we depart on our final mission - Destroy the Paintress, so she can never paint death again. - We are Expedition 33.\"« Tomorrow Comes »With only one year left to live, join Gustave, Maelle, and their fellow Expeditioners as they embark upon a deperate quest to break the Paintress\' cycle of death. Follow the trail of previous expeditions and discover their fate. Get to know the members of Expedition 33 as they learn to work together against impossible odds.Reactive Turned-Based CombatIn this evolution of JRPGs, real-time actions enhance the heart of turn-based combat. Build your party and level up six characters. Craft unique builds for your expeditioners that fit your playstyle via gear, stats, skills, and characters synergies. Open an active dimension in combat - dodge, parry and counter in real time, chain combos of mastering attack rythms, and target enemy weak points using free-aim system.A Hauntingly Beautiful WorldExplore an enchanting realm populated by surreal adversaries. Wander through breathtaking landscapes, from the Island of Visages to the Forgotten Battlefield, discovering secrets and hidden quests along the way. Find allies of fortune in creatures of legend and recruit a special companion who can access new travel methods and secret areas in the World Map. Experience the debut game from Sandfall Interactive, fully realized in Unreal Engine 5 with stunning graphics and a heartbreaking soundtrack.',NULL,199.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('38bb3245-8c01-405a-93ce-acb022056aae','2026-07-09 11:08:45.220109','2026-07-09 11:08:45.220109',NULL,'4Gamers Stereo HS Wired PRO410 (PS4)','ps4-4gamers-stereo-hs-wired-pro410-ps4','pr-5055269704096-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'c5791033-3955-4fde-8c05-21a002d28c03',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','The 4Gamers Stereo Gaming Headset is the perfect solution for the serious gamer, it allows you to continue gaming even after you leave home, simply disconnect the headset from your DualShock ®,4 Controller and connect it to your PS Vita system for gaming on the go ! Lightweight, compact styling with folding headband, fully compatible with the PlayStation®,4 and PlayStation®,Vita systems. The single jack connection simply plugs into the DualShock®,4 controller or your PS Vita system for instant online gaming. 40mm speaker drivers, producing a quality all-round audio performance Inline dual volume control unit to separately adjust the volume for online chat and gameplay audio Inline microphone Soft leatherette style ear cushions provide comfort and help reduce ambient noise Fully adjustable padded headband with rotating ear cups 1.2 metre 3.5mm jack connection cable Can be used as a standard audio headset to listen to music and movies Adjusts outgoing chat only on PlayStation®,4 system',NULL,59.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
