('3938fd3e-8fca-4336-9a97-265a90b23b50','2026-07-09 11:02:07.242123','2026-07-09 11:02:07.242123',NULL,'Palit GeForce RTX 4070 Dual 12GB GDDR6X Semi-Fanless Gaming Graphics Card','palit-geforce-rtx-4070-dual-12gb-gddr6x-semi-fanless-gaming-graphics-card','4710562243888-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'3155269b-8d2e-4303-ba21-b03ba2ef8437',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','The Palit GeForce RTX 4070 Dual 12GB GDDR6X Semi-Fanless Graphics Card is a high-performance GPU built on NVIDIA’s Ada Lovelace architecture. It delivers advanced ray tracing, AI-enhanced rendering, and strong power efficiency for modern gaming and creative workloads. Featuring 12GB GDDR6X memory, this graphics card is optimized for smooth 1440p gaming and capable 4K performance. The dual-fan cooling system includes a semi-fanless (0-dB) mode, allowing silent operation during low-load tasks. Key Features • NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 GPU• 12GB GDDR6X high-speed memory• Semi-fanless (0-dB) cooling technology• Dual-fan thermal design• Ray tracing and DLSS AI support• Optimized for 1440p and 4K gaming• Efficient and quiet operation',NULL,2489.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
