('39be460b-2434-4d8c-812f-bf6f9a979ca0','2026-07-09 11:12:59.990386','2026-07-09 11:12:59.990386',NULL,'Warhammer 40,000: Space Marine 2','warhammer-40000-space-marine-2','p-3512899967984-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescriptionGraphics: 4K resolution at 60fps, with HDR support for rich colors and contrast in high-definition gameplay.DualSense Features: Full PS5 DualSense support with adaptive triggers, haptic feedback to intensify each shot, explosion, and melee encounter.Audio: 3D Audio for immersive soundscapes, letting players hear the roar of battle from every angle, and experience the scale of warfare.Multiplayer: Online co-op mode for the main campaign; multiplayer details TBA.Platform Availability: Available on PlayStation 5, Xbox Series X|S, and PC.Warhammer 40,000: Space Marine 2Warhammer 40,000: Space Marine 2 marks the triumphant return of the epic, visceral gameplay that defined the original, plunging players into the grimdark future of the 41st millennium. Developed by Saber Interactive and published by Focus Entertainment, this long-awaited sequel follows the fearless Ultramarine Lieutenant Titus as he faces insurmountable odds in brutal battles against the terrifying forces of the Tyranids, a hive mind of monstrous aliens threatening humanity. Powered by modern gaming technology, Space Marine 2 offers adrenaline-pumping action with vastly improved visuals, deeper combat mechanics, and massive battles that capture the scale and intensity of the Warhammer 40K universe like never before. From iconic power armor and weapons to the terrifying foes that lurk on alien planets, this third-person shooter delivers relentless, brutal action for fans of Warhammer and newcomers alike.',NULL,269.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
