('3a99282f-837d-43eb-9915-bda9ad1eec3b','2026-07-09 11:18:50.451715','2026-07-09 11:18:50.451715',NULL,'Sony PlayStation 5 Console Digital Edition: Fortnite Bundle','sony-playstation-5-console-digital-edition-fortnite-bundle','711719021445-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'8f5c8927-be48-41c7-9c7a-c40f59f564c2',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','PlayStation 5 (PS5) Digital Edition – Fortnite Bundle Model Group: PS5 Digital Edition (No Disc Drive) - Includes a Fortnite Voucher with exclusive in-game content. The All-Digital Next-Gen Experience The PS5 Digital Edition is a sleek, all-digital version of the PlayStation 5 console, focused on maximizing performance and immersive gameplay. With no Blu-ray disc drive, you can only play games purchased and downloaded from the PlayStation Store. Key PS5 Console Features: ⚡ Ultra-High Speed SSD: Say goodbye to long loading screens. Experience near-instant load times for all installed PS5 games, fundamentally changing how you play.DualSense Wireless Controller: Feel the action with Haptic Feedback and Adaptive Triggers. The controller provides dynamic physical sensations that mimic everything from the recoil of a weapon to the friction of driving over mud. 4K & Ray Tracing: Enjoy stunning visuals with support for 4K gaming and realistic light and shadow effects powered by Ray Tracing in compatible titles. 3D Audio Technology: Immerse yourself in the soundscape as 3D Audio brings game worlds to life, making it feel like sound is coming from every direction. Exclusive Fortnite In-Game Content The Fortnite Voucher Card included in this bundle (often named the \"Cobalt Star\" or \"Flowering Chaos\" set) provides a great head start in the game. The Fortnite Voucher Bundle typically includes: 1,000 V-Bucks (in-game currency to spend in the Item Shop).A Collection of Exclusive Cosmetics: A set of unique PlayStation-themed in-game items, such as an Outfit (Skin), Back Bling, Pickaxe, and other accessories (e.g., Car Body, Wheels, and Trail for Rocket Racing). (The exact items vary by the bundle version, but are a high-value cosmetic pack.) What\'s In The Box: PlayStation 5 Digital Console (with 1TB SSD) DualSense Wireless Controller Base (for horizontal orientation) HDMI Cable AC Power Cord USB Cable Printed Materials Fortnite Voucher Card (for redeeming the exclusive in-game content and V-Bucks) ASTRO’s PLAYROOM (Pre-installed game)',NULL,2300.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('3a9bf524-4bf3-45f3-b2b8-a6fedf8421a8','2026-07-09 11:01:44.498633','2026-07-09 11:01:44.498633',NULL,'Marvel\'s Wolverine - PS5','marvel-s-wolverine-ps5','711719073345-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','A new and exciting adventure inspired by the legendary comic book character The studio behind Marvel\'s Spider-Man series . Developed in collaboration with Marvel Games, it presents a brand-new original story based on the legendary comic book character. Logan thought he was done with Wolverine, but the past isn\'t over. Three years after leaving Team X, Wolverine returns to the Mighty Special Forces in the darkest of times. Bolivar Trask, driven by his fanatical belief in human supremacy, has kidnapped the Mighty. Only Wolverine has what it takes to save them. In his fight for the future, Wolverine must team up with other Mightys around the world, across locations like Canada, Japan, and Madrebor Island in the Marvel Universe. With the fate of both humans and Mightys hanging in the balance, Logan knows the world needs a hero, but he has to make do with Wolverine.KEY FEATURESGameplay – Become Wolverine Step into the role of Wolverine and unleash his legendary adamantium claws in fast-paced, action-packed combat. Execute swift attacks, overpower enemies with brutal efficiency, and adapt to intense encounters using a variety of tactical abilities and combat enhancements. Face dangerous adversaries ranging from elite mercenaries to iconic Marvel villains, building unstoppable momentum as Wolverine\'s rage grows throughout battle.An Original Story Filled with Emotion Beneath Wolverine\'s fierce reputation lies a hero fighting for something greater than himself. As mutants face an uncertain future, Wolverine is drawn into a deeply personal journey shaped by sacrifice, loyalty, and survival. Uncover hidden truths from his past and experience a powerful narrative that explores identity, inner conflict, and the challenges that define one of Marvel\'s most iconic characters.A Global Adventure Travel across diverse and beautifully crafted locations as Wolverine battles to protect mutantkind. Explore the frozen wilderness of Canada, navigate the vibrant streets of Tokyo, and venture through the contrasting districts of Madripoor Island. Each destination presents unique challenges, enemies, and opportunities as Wolverine embarks on a worldwide mission filled with action and danger.',NULL,279.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
