('3b153467-5cfa-4246-80c9-deed72fa997c','2026-07-09 11:18:56.378198','2026-07-09 11:18:56.378198',NULL,'Predator: Hunting Grounds - PS5','predator-hunting-grounds','0811949038395-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescriptionPlatform: PlayStation 5 Modes: Online multiplayer (4v1 format)Audio: 3D spatial audio for immersive soundscapes and Predator\'s iconic growls and roarsGraphics: High-definition visuals with atmospheric lighting and realistic jungle environmentsååPerformance: 60fps on PS5 and PC for smoother gameplayController Support: Full support for PS5 DualSense with adaptive trigger and haptic feedback integration Predator: Hunting Grounds Predator: Hunting Grounds is an intense multiplayer action game that immerses players in the deadly world of the Predator franchise. Set in the dense jungles of remote locations, players take on the role of either a member of an elite Fireteam tasked with completing missions or as the Predator, hunting down their prey with brutal precision. The asymmetrical gameplay ensures a thrilling and unpredictable experience in every match. Key FeaturesAsymmetrical Multiplayer: Choose to play as the Predator, with advanced alien weaponry and stealth, or as a Fireteam member armed with powerful human weapons.Authentic Predator Experience: Utilize iconic Predator abilities like thermal vision, cloaking, and the deadly plasma caster.Dynamic Environments: Explore dense jungle settings filled with threats, including AI enemies and environmental hazards.Fireteam Missions: Engage in high-stakes objectives such as rescuing hostages, retrieving data, and neutralizing enemy forces while evading the Predator.Customization Options: Unlock and personalize Predator classes, Fireteam weapons, and gear to suit your playstyle.Intense Combat: Engage in heart-pounding encounters as the Predator hunts its prey, while the Fireteam fights to survive.',NULL,169.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NUL