('3b887866-8170-4773-90e6-a73e6a731789','2026-07-09 11:08:33.080374','2026-07-09 11:08:33.080374',NULL,'PDP Riffmaster Wireless Guitar','riffmaster-wireless-guitar','p-708056072599-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'8f5c8927-be48-41c7-9c7a-c40f59f564c2',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescriptionConnectivity: 2.4GHz wireless with USB receiverPower Source: 2 AA batteries (up to 30 hours of playtime)Compatibility: PlayStation 4/5, Xbox One, Xbox Series X|S, PC (check game compatibility)Dimensions: Full-sized guitar controller (approx. 30” length)Weight: Lightweight design for enhanced comfortAdditional Features: Whammy bar and tilt-to-activate overdrive functionality PDP Riffmaster Wireless Guitar The PDP Riffmaster Wireless Guitar is the ultimate instrument for rocking out in rhythm games, designed for seamless gameplay and an authentic guitar-playing experience. With a sleek, ergonomic design and wireless connectivity, it ensures you can shred your favorite tracks without being tethered to your console. Perfect for casual players and serious rhythm game enthusiasts alike, the Riffmaster delivers precision, style, and performance. Key FeaturesWireless Freedom: Enjoy untethered gameplay with reliable wireless connectivity for smooth and responsive performance.Ergonomic Design: A lightweight, comfortable design for extended play sessions without fatigue.Responsive Fret Buttons: High-precision fret buttons and a durable strum bar for accurate note hits.Authentic Feel: Realistic guitar shape and size make it feel like a true instrument in your hands.Compatibility: Works seamlessly with popular rhythm games across multiple platforms, including PS4, PS5, Xbox One, Xbox Series X|S, and PC.Customizable Options: Interchangeable faceplates (sold separately) let you personalize your guitar’s look.Rock-Solid Build: Designed with durable materials to withstand intense shredding sessions.',NULL,0.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('3b8d478b-573c-442e-ad23-9bfaa9114d45','2026-07-09 11:16:16.770019','2026-07-09 11:16:16.770019',NULL,'FIFA 18 - PS4','ps4-fifa-18-r2-eng','5030946121526-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Powered by Frostbite™, EA SPORTS™ FIFA 18 blurs the line between the virtual and real worlds, bringing to life the players, teams, and atmospheres that immerse you in the emotion of The World\'s Game. The biggest step in gameplay innovation in franchise history, FIFA 18 introduces Real Player Motion Technology, an all-new animation system which unlocks a new level of responsiveness, and player personality - now Cristiano Ronaldo and other top players feel and move exactly like they do on the real pitch. Player Control combined with new Team Styles and Positioning give you the tools to deliver Dramatic Moments that ignite Immersive Atmospheres around the world. The World\'s Game also takes you on a global journey as Alex Hunter Returns along with a star-studded cast of characters, including Cristiano Ronaldo and other European football stars. And in FIFA Ultimate Team™, FUT ICONS, featuring Ronaldo Nazário and other football legends, are coming to FIFA 18 on PlayStation 4, Xbox One, and PC when the game launches on September 29, 2017.',NULL,39.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('3b8ff56e-740b-435d-99bd-47c5346118ad','2026-07-09 11:12:53.922276','2026-07-09 11:12:53.922276',NULL,'Scarlet Nexus - PS5','ps5-scarlet-nexus-pegi-eng','3391892012064-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescription Platform: PS5Genre: Action RPGDeveloper: Bandai Namco StudiosPublisher: Bandai Namco EntertainmentModes: Single-playerRated: T for Teen (Violence, Mild Language) Game Highlights Stunning next-gen visuals enhanced for the PS5.High-speed loading times and 4K resolution with smooth performance.A compelling story exploring themes of connection, power, and sacrifice. Scarlet Nexus - PS5 Enter the world of Scarlet Nexus, a brain-punk action RPG set in a futuristic city where technology and psychic abilities merge. You’ll assume the role of Yuito Sumeragi or Kasane Randall, two new recruits in the Other Suppression Force (OSF), tasked with defending humanity from grotesque, brain-eating mutants known as the Others. Experience a deep, narrative-driven journey filled with intense combat, exploration, and a mysterious world teeming with intrigue. Key Features Brain-Powered Combat: Harness psychokinetic abilities to hurl objects and devastate enemies in dynamic, fast-paced combat.Dual Protagonist Storyline: Play as Yuito or Kasane, each with unique skills and perspectives that intertwine into a gripping narrative.Richly Detailed World: Explore a visually stunning futuristic cityscape blending anime aesthetics with a cyberpunk edge.Squad Mechanics: Form bonds with OSF team members to unlock unique abilities and deepen the story.Challenging Enemies: Face the grotesque Others, bizarre and horrifying creatures immune to traditional weaponry.',NULL,189.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
