('41410ee8-4675-4965-9493-fdbc9b7edebe','2026-07-09 10:41:11.662238','2026-07-09 10:41:11.662238',NULL,'Govee RGBIC Basic Wi-Fi + Bluetooth LED Strip Lights - 5m','govee-rgbic-basic-wi-fi-bluetooth-led-strip-lights-5m','6974316992943-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'2f4818b1-ebde-4ac3-adb1-5c4f62d01e42',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescription Length: 5 metersTechnology: RGBIC (Individual color control)Connectivity: Wi-Fi + BluetoothControl Options: Govee Home app, Voice control (Amazon Alexa, Google Assistant), Physical controllerColor Options: 16 million colors with customizable effectsPower Source: 12V DC adapter (included)Timer & Scheduling: Yes, via appMusic Sync: Yes, via microphoneSpecial Features: Voice control, smart scheduling, music synchronization, easy installation with adhesive backingGovee RGBIC Basic Wi-Fi + Bluetooth LED Strip Lights 5mThe Govee RGBIC Basic Wi-Fi + Bluetooth LED Strip Lights (5m) are designed to bring vibrant, customizable lighting to any space. Equipped with both Wi-Fi and Bluetooth connectivity, these LED strips can be controlled easily through the Govee Home app, voice assistants like Amazon Alexa or Google Assistant, or directly via the physical controller. Whether you\'re setting the mood for a movie night, creating an immersive gaming setup, or adding some flair to your bedroom or living room, the Govee RGBIC strip lights provide a flexible and colorful solution. Key Features: RGBIC Technology: This advanced technology allows the LED strip to display multiple colors simultaneously along different segments of the strip. Each section can be controlled independently, creating stunning, dynamic lighting effects.Wi-Fi and Bluetooth Connectivity: Control the lights from anywhere using the Govee Home app via Wi-Fi, or directly connect via Bluetooth for quick adjustments.Voice Control: Use Amazon Alexa or Google Assistant to control the lights hands-free. Adjust brightness, change colors, or turn the lights on and off with simple voice commands.Customizable Lighting: With 16 million colors to choose from, you can create the perfect atmosphere for any occasion. From vibrant colors to softer tones, the possibilities are endless.Multiple Scene Modes: Choose from preset lighting effects designed for different activities such as gaming, parties, reading, or movie-watching.Sync to Music: Built-in music mode syncs the LED strip lights to the rhythm of your favorite music, making it ideal for parties or gaming.Easy Installation: The flexible, adhesive-backed LED strip is simple to install on clean, dry surfaces, and the 5m length makes it ideal for covering large areas or wrapping around furniture.Timer & Scheduling: Set timers or schedules through the Govee Home app to have the lights automatically turn on/off or change color at specified times.',NULL,71.40,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
