('4483f75f-f21e-4806-a262-8f2a70e539c5','2026-07-09 11:11:46.429674','2026-07-09 11:11:46.429674',NULL,'Far Cry 6 Gold Edition - PS5','ps5-far-cry-6-gold-edition-pegi-ara','3307216223764-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescriptionPlatform: PS5Genre: Open-world action-adventureDeveloper: Ubisoft TorontoPublisher: UbisoftGraphics: 4K HDR support with enhanced textures and lightingModes: Single-player, Online Co-opAudio: 3D Audio support for immersive soundscapesFar Cry 6 Gold Edition - PS5 Immerse yourself in the chaos of a revolution in Far Cry 6, set in the heart of the tropical nation of Yara. This Gold Edition includes the base game and additional content to enhance your journey against the oppressive dictator, Anton Castillo.Features: Season Pass: Includes 3 DLC episodes featuring iconic Far Cry villains — Vaas Montenegro, Pagan Min, and Joseph Seed.Expansive Open World: Explore lush jungles, rugged mountains, and urban cityscapes with complete freedom.Dynamic Combat: Engage in guerrilla warfare using a wide variety of customizable weapons, vehicles, and companions.Stunning Visuals: Optimized for PS5 with 4K resolution and 60 FPS for smooth, immersive gameplay.Co-op Mode: Play solo or team up with a friend to liberate Yara together.',NULL,369.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('4489d4ca-7b7a-4002-83bb-4d7849ec9122','2026-07-09 11:03:13.400018','2026-07-09 11:03:13.400018',NULL,'Logitech G29 Driving Force Racing Bundle: G29 Wheel & Shifter + The Crew 2 (PS4)','logitech-g29-driving-force-racing-bundle-g29-wheel-shifter-the-crew-2','G29RACING2-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'3155269b-8d2e-4303-ba21-b03ba2ef8437',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Logitech G29 Driving Force Wheel Experience every gear shift and tire slip with dual-motor force feedback and stainless steel paddle shifters. Wrapped in hand-stitched leather for that authentic race car feel.Logitech Driving Force Shifter Take total control with a six-speed \"H\" pattern shifter, featuring a push-down reverse and a solid steel gear shaft for durable, realistic shifting.The Crew 2 (PS4) The Crew 2 is the high-octane sequel to the revolutionary open-world racing franchise. It captures the raw spirit of American motorsports in one of the most expansive and exhilarating playgrounds ever created. Welcome to Motornation, a massive, redesigned version of the entire USA built for non-stop action and unrestrained exploration on ground, sea, and sky. Ultimate Freedom of Movement: Seamlessly switch between cars, powerboats, and planes with the \"Fast Fav\" feature. You can be driving a hypercar through New York City one second and flying over the Grand Canyon the next. Four Motorsports Families: Join the Street Racers, Pro Racers, Off-Road Experts, and Freestylers. Each group provides unique vehicles, custom cultures, and specific disciplines to master as you rise to become a champion. Massive Open World: Explore a beautiful and varied landscape that includes everything from the snowcapped Rocky Mountains to the winding Mississippi River. Showcase Your Skills: Collect and customize your dream rides in your personal HQ. From legendary American bikes to the swiftest aerobatic planes, the opportunities for challenges are limitless. Connect and Compete: Every achievement is saved as a new challenge for the community. Use the integrated tools to capture and share your most glorious racing moments with the world at the press of a button.',NULL,1049.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
