('44d165c6-6487-441d-94fa-e7c8f232a46b','2026-07-09 11:13:32.595405','2026-07-09 11:13:32.595405',NULL,'Paw Patrol Grand Prix','paw-patrol-grand-prix','pr-5060528037983-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','No track is too big, no racer too small! Race around Adventure Bay, Jake’s Snowboarding Resort and the Jungle as the PAW Patrol pups and up-to 4 players at once – but look out for the obstacles left by mischievous Mayor Humdinger! This kart racer includes an easy control option for little ones with auto-acceleration to guide them around the track, as well as a hard mode for experienced track stars. So, buckle up for a PAWsome race around 11 tracks with your best pup pals! UP TO 4 PAW PATROL RACERS – You can play with friends in up to 4-player split screen as your favorite pups including Chase, Marshall and first disabled pup, Rex! BECOME THE CHAMPION – Use power ups and boosts including water balloons, snowballs, and confetti blasts to reach pole position. CUSTOMISE YOUR KARTS – Make your kart more PAWsome with 20 stylish stickers and 20 topper items inspired by the show. The more you race, the more you’ll unlock! MAYOR MADNESS – Avoid the tricks and obstacles Mayor Humdinger may throw on the tracks as you zoom around.',NULL,0.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('44d4d977-c405-44e1-87de-961849d01658','2026-07-09 11:07:11.968448','2026-07-09 11:07:11.968448',NULL,'Yoshi\'s Crafted World - SW','sw-yoshis-crafted-world-16667848348012','45496593919-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Lead Yoshi on a brand new adventure that will turn everything you\'ve come to expect from side-scrolling games upside down! Explore a great, big world decorated like a miniature diorama in a new art style for the franchise, where each side-scrolling stage has the traditional front side as well as a flip side with different views and surprises. Look for items throughout the stage as Yoshi makes his way to the goal. You can even join up with a friend!',NULL,249.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('44dd3c18-a0c8-4b0e-9ca8-02e4e0fb4e19','2026-07-09 11:14:52.777856','2026-07-09 11:14:52.777856',NULL,'Outriders Worldslayer - PS4','ps4-outriders-worldslayer','5021290093690-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescription Platform: PlayStation 4Genre: Action RPG, ShooterGame Modes: Single-player, Online Co-op (up to 3 players)Resolution: 1080pFrame Rate: 30fpsAudio: Stereo soundController Features: Standard DualShock 4 controlsOutriders Worldslayer - PS4Outriders Worldslayer expands on the original Outriders experience with new content, enhanced features, and a thrilling storyline. Set in a hostile world on Enoch, the game offers an intense mix of cooperative action, brutal gunplay, and dynamic character progression. The Worldslayer expansion introduces new missions, powerful bosses, and an upgraded class system, all while building upon the rich, post-apocalyptic world. Explore new areas, defeat terrifying enemies, and face epic challenges, all while optimizing your character with even more devastating abilities and gear. Key Features: New Campaign and Storyline: Unveil new chapters of the Enoch saga, with additional lore and epic missions in the Worldslayer expansion.Expanded Combat System: New skills, abilities, and modifications that allow for greater customization of your character’s playstyle.New Enemies and Bosses: Encounter more deadly foes, including brutal bosses and powerful monsters, pushing your combat abilities to the limit.Co-Op Multiplayer: Team up with up to two other players in online co-op mode to explore dangerous environments and tackle powerful enemies together.Enhanced Endgame Content: Take on new endgame missions, expeditions, and World Tier challenges designed for replayability and high-level loot.Optimized for PS4: While designed to run on PS4 hardware, enjoy smooth gameplay and optimized visuals with a fast-paced, action-packed experience.',NULL,219.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('44defeed-9993-495b-a099-995942ca9140','2026-07-09 11:08:14.355207','2026-07-09 11:08:14.355207',NULL,'PlayStation 5 DualSense Edge Wireless Controller - Midnight Black','playstation-5-dualsense-edge-wireless-controller-midnight-black','711719593096-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'8f5c8927-be48-41c7-9c7a-c40f59f564c2',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescription Customization Features:Remappable Buttons: Reassign inputs for personalized control setups.Adjustable Triggers and Stick Sensitivity: Fine-tune trigger lengths and stick sensitivities to suit different game genres.Swappable Stick Caps: Includes three sets of caps (standard, high dome, and low dome) for improved grip and comfort.Interchangeable Back Buttons: Two swappable back buttons (paddle and half-dome) for quicker inputs.Custom Profiles: Save multiple control profiles and switch between them instantly.Build and Aesthetics:Design: Midnight Black finish with sleek detailing to complement the PS5 aesthetic.Materials: Premium build for enhanced durability and tactile comfort.Enhanced Gameplay Features:Haptic Feedback: Immersive vibrations that mimic in-game actions.Adaptive Triggers: Resistance levels dynamically adjust for precise tactile feedback.Audio Integration: Built-in speaker, microphone, and a 3.5mm headphone jack for communication and audio devices.Battery and Connectivity:Wireless Connection: Bluetooth compatibility for seamless pairing with the PS5.USB-C Port: Fast charging and a reliable wired play option.Battery Life: Comparable to the standard DualSense controller.Carrying Case:Premium Case: Protects the controller during storage or travel.Integrated Charging: Charge the controller while stored using the included USB-C cable.PlayStation 5 DualSense Edge Wireless Controller - Midnight Black The DualSense Edge Wireless Controller in Midnight Black is designed to elevate your gaming experience. With unparalleled customization options, advanced haptic technology, and a striking black finish, it is built for both casual players and competitive gamers alike. Whether you\'re battling opponents, exploring expansive worlds, or racing to victory, this controller adapts to your unique playstyle, giving you the edge you need to dominate every game.',NULL,799.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
