('47b6bc32-4b26-4373-9975-7d4c9db32444','2026-07-09 10:58:15.614825','2026-07-09 10:58:15.614825',NULL,'Pop! Sanrio: Kuromi Present (SDCC\'25)','pop-sanrio-kuromi-present-sdcc-25','889698879521-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'f98bbd67-0b4f-473a-9b36-8d4e6c4d60c2',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Celebrate one of the most anticipated collectible drops of the year with the Funko Pop! Sanrio: Kuromi Present (SDCC’25) vinyl figure — an exclusive release from the 2025 Summer Convention (SDCC) that brings everyone’s favorite mischievous Sanrio character into a whole new light. This special edition Pop! features Kuromi in a striking metallic finish, making it a standout addition for passionate collectors in the UAE. In this unique variant, Kuromi pops out of a present box with a shimmering metallic coating that gives her signature punk‑style attitude even more impact. The figure’s vibrant chrome‑style look sets it apart from regular releases, making it ideal for display on shelves, desks, or within themed Sanrio and collectible Pop! displays. Approximate Size: This exclusive figure stands at about 4.1 inches (10.4 cm) tall — a standard size for Pop! collectibles that ensures it fits seamlessly alongside other Funko figures while offering a hint of elevated presence thanks to its SDCC metallic style. Whether you’re a devoted Sanrio fan, a Funko Pop! collector seeking the latest convention exclusives, or someone building a standout display, this Kuromi Present SDCC’25 piece is a must‑have collectible that blends playful design with highly collectible appeal. Key Highlights: • Official Funko Pop! Sanrio collectible — Kuromi Present (SDCC’25) exclusive. • Metallic finish for standout visual appeal and collector value. • Approximate size: ~4.1 inches (10.4 cm), perfect for display. • Part of the 2025 Summer Convention (SDCC) exclusive lineup. • Ideal for Sanrio fans, anime figure collectors, and Funko Pop enthusiasts in the UAE.',NULL,89.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,