('4855ab98-564a-4a4d-a550-455fe71b3229','2026-07-09 11:06:52.199057','2026-07-09 11:06:52.199057',NULL,'Hotel Transylvania: Scary-Tale Adventures - Nintendo Switch','hotel-transylvania-scary-ta-16667842795888','3391892021080-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescriptionPlatform: Nintendo SwitchGenre: Action, Adventure, PlatformerPublisher: Outright GamesModes: Single-playerRelease Date: March 11, 2022 Hotel Transylvania: Scary-Tale Adventures - Nintendo Switch Enter the magical and spooky world of Hotel Transylvania with Scary-Tale Adventures! This delightful action-adventure game reimagines classic fairy tales with the hilarious twist and charm of the Hotel Transylvania universe. Perfect for fans of the movies and adventure-seekers of all ages! Key Features Monstrous Fairy Tales: Relive beloved fairy tales like Little Red Riding Hood and The Emperor\'s New Clothes, retold with a humorous, monster-themed twist.Fan-Favorite Characters: Take on the role of Mavis, Drac, and other beloved characters as they explore enchanted, eerie worlds.Engaging Gameplay: Solve puzzles, uncover secrets, and conquer platforming challenges in this thrilling adventure.Vibrant Worlds: Immerse yourself in beautifully designed environments packed with collectibles and surprises.Family-Friendly Fun: Ideal for kids and families, combining humor and adventure in an accessible format.',NULL,169.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
