('48eac90f-8887-4b37-9535-e5da5ec0b3b1','2026-07-09 11:15:24.823942','2026-07-09 11:15:24.823942',NULL,'PS4 Little Nightmares II','ps4-little-nightmares-ii-16667840627879','3391892013832-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Little Nightmares II is a suspense-adventure game in which you play as Mono, a young boy trapped in a world that has been distorted by the humming transmission of a distant tower. With Six, the girl in a yellow raincoat, as his guide, Mono sets out to discover the dark secrets of The Signal Tower and save Six from her terrible fate; but their journey will not be straightforward as Mono and Six will face a gallery of new threats from the terrible residents of this world. Will you dare to face this collection of new, little nightmares?',NULL,129.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('48ebf4b3-12ab-4643-8637-28d6619eeb9c','2026-07-09 11:06:46.316647','2026-07-09 11:06:46.316647',NULL,'Snufkin: Melody of Moominvalley - Nintendo Switch','snufkin-melody-of-moominvalley','7350002935255-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescription Platform: Nintendo SwitchGenre: Adventure, PuzzleGameplay Modes: Single-playerResolution: 720p (Handheld), 1080p (Docked)Frame Rate: 30fpsAudio: Original music from the Moomin series, ambient sounds Snufkin: Melody of Moominvalley - Nintendo SwitchSnufkin: Melody of Moominvalley takes you on a heartwarming journey through the enchanting world of Moominvalley, filled with music, nature, and the beloved characters from Tove Jansson’s classic Moomin series. Play as Snufkin, the free-spirited traveler and musician, as he journeys to bring harmony back to the valley. Solve puzzles, explore lush environments, and interact with familiar Moomin characters in a peaceful yet captivating adventure. The game focuses on exploration, problem-solving, and the magic of music, set against a beautifully hand-drawn landscape that fans of the Moomin series will adore.Key Features: Explore Moominvalley: Travel through vibrant landscapes, forests, lakes, and the mysterious corners of Moominvalley, all rendered in beautiful hand-drawn 2D visuals.Solve Musical Puzzles: Use Snufkin’s musical abilities to solve puzzles and bring back harmony to the valley, integrating sound and melody into gameplay mechanics.Interact with Moomin Characters: Meet iconic characters such as Moomintroll, Little My, and Snorkmaiden as you uncover their stories and assist them in their daily adventures.Charming Story: Enjoy a serene narrative that celebrates the themes of nature, friendship, and the power of music.Relaxing Gameplay: Ideal for players seeking a calming, non-violent experience with an emphasis on exploration and discovery.Atmospheric Soundtrack: A soothing, whimsical soundtrack that complements the peaceful gameplay and captures the magic of Moominvalley.',NULL,149.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('48ecc3e1-cf35-4f4a-8797-12178b99f453','2026-07-09 11:01:31.560919','2026-07-09 11:01:31.560919',NULL,'Sonic Frontiers - Definitive Edition Nintendo Switch 2','nintendo-switch-2-sonic-frontiers-definitive-edition','5055277057702-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Experience Sonic Like Never Before! Embark on Sonic\'s biggest adventure yet in Sonic Frontiers – Definitive Edition for Nintendo Switch 2. After becoming stranded on the mysterious Starfall Islands while searching for the Chaos Emeralds, Sonic must uncover ancient secrets, rescue his friends, and confront powerful enemies across expansive open-zone environments. Explore diverse landscapes at incredible speed, solve environmental puzzles, and master an evolved combat system featuring fast-paced attacks and powerful abilities. Whether you\'re exploring, battling towering foes, or uncovering hidden mysteries, every island offers new challenges and discoveries. The Definitive Edition delivers the complete Sonic Frontiers experience by including the base game along with major content updates, bonus in-game items, a digital art book, and a mini soundtrack, making it the ultimate edition for both longtime Sonic fans and newcomers. The Sonic Frontiers – Definitive Edition includes: • Sonic Frontiers game • \"The Final Horizon\" story campaign • \"Sights, Sounds, and Speed\" and \"Sonic\'s Birthday Bash\" Content Updates • Bonus in-game items (Explorer\'s Treasure Box, \"Monster Hunter\" Collaboration Pack, \"Sonic Adventure 2\" Shoes, and Holiday Cheer Suit) • Digital Art Book and Mini Soundtrack',NULL,199.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
