('490d426f-2c43-4581-8310-21eb8d394ebe','2026-07-09 10:41:14.673144','2026-07-09 10:41:14.673144',NULL,'Govee Neon Rope Light 2 - 3m','govee-neon-rope-light-2','6974316998860-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'2f4818b1-ebde-4ac3-adb1-5c4f62d01e42',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescription Length: 3 meters (9.84 feet)Lighting Type: Neon-style LED stripPower Source: USB-powered (via wall adapter or power bank)Control Options: Govee Home app, voice control via Amazon Alexa/Google AssistantConnectivity: BluetoothColor Options: Customizable RGB colorsSpecial Features: Music sync, app-based control, flexible neon tubingGovee Neon Rope Light 2 (3M Neon Preinstalled Strip Light)Add a modern and vibrant touch to your home or workspace with the Govee Neon Rope Light 2. This 3-meter preinstalled neon strip light features flexible, bendable tubing that emits bright and smooth lighting, perfect for accentuating any room, gaming area, or outdoor space. With the ease of customization via the Govee Home app, you can create stunning lighting displays to suit any occasion or mood. Key Features: Preinstalled Neon Strip: Convenient 3-meter length with neon-style tubing, ready to use right out of the box.Flexible and Bendable: Ideal for creative installations, the neon rope light can be shaped and placed to suit any design need.Customizable Colors and Effects: Control brightness, colors, and lighting modes using the Govee Home app for a truly personalized lighting experience.Voice Control: Works with Amazon Alexa and Google Assistant for hands-free operation.Music Sync: The built-in microphone allows the light to pulse and change colors based on the music or ambient sound.Indoor/Outdoor Use: Perfect for creating mood lighting in your living room, gaming setup, or outdoor events.Energy-Efficient LED: Long-lasting and power-efficient, providing bright lighting without excessive energy consumption.',NULL,249.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('490fd06d-a101-4cb9-b162-54fdc490b1ad','2026-07-09 11:16:56.817463','2026-07-09 11:16:56.817463',NULL,'PS4 Assassin\'S Creed Valhalla: Dawn Of Ragnarok','assassins-creed-valhalla-d-16467540535591','3307216234524-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','In the most ambitious expansion in franchise history, Eivor must embrace their destiny as Odin, the Norse god of Battle and Wisdom. Unleash new divine powers as you embark on a desperate quest through a breathtaking world. Complete a legendary Viking saga and save your son in the face of the gods’ doom. Wield incredible, otherworldly powers. Absorb new abilities from those you’ve defeated and use them to slay all who stand in your way. Shape-shift into a raven for spectacular assassinations or resurrect your defeated foes to fight on your side. Transform your skin into magma to protect yourself, infuse your weapon with ice to unleash devastating strikes, and more. Faced with visions of a new threat, Eivor must embrace their destiny as Odin and enter the mythical dwarven realm of Svartalfheim, a beautiful but hostile world under invasion. From underground forges to soaring golden peaks, immerse yourself in a vast, perilous new world of Norse mythology as you embrace your fate as a Norse god. Face off against Jotnars, foes of ice from Jotunheim, and Muspels, new enemies of fire from Muspelheim. Battle a wide range of enemy archetypes, infiltrate their strongholds, and wield their own powers against them as you grow stronger. At the head of this army stands Surtr, an unkillable fire giant and the greatest enemy that Odin has ever faced. As Odin, embark on a desperate quest to rescue your son, Baldr, from imprisonment at the hands of an unspeakable foe. Use your wit and cunning to infiltrate hostile territory, gain dwarven allies, and take revenge on Baldr’s captors. Odin’s journey will force him to confront his own fate against the certain doom of Ragnarök.',NULL,169.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
