('4b97decd-61d1-4caa-8698-2b7e1720ebc2','2026-07-09 11:01:41.168913','2026-07-09 11:01:41.168913',NULL,'MY HERO ACADEMIA: All\'s Justice - Nintendo Switch 2','my-hero-academia-all-s-justice-nintendo-switch-2','3391892043532-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','PRE-ORDER BONUS Pre-order and receive the Pre-Order Pack, which includes: • Early Unlock Playable Character: Izuku Midoriya Rising• Early Unlock Playable Character: All For One Chaos• 30,000 Hero Coins The included playable characters can also be unlocked by fulfilling specific in-game conditions and using in-game currency.ONE LAST SMASH Battle your way through MY HERO ACADEMIA: All\'s Justice and take part in spectacular 3v3 battles as you experience life at U.A. High and relive the climactic Final War. Explore a variety of game modes, including Team Up Mission, where you can experience hero life as a U.A. High Class 1-A student in a Virtual Space; Story Mode, which lets you relive the Final War storyline; and Archives Battle Mode, where you can revisit iconic battles from across the series, along with much more. MY HERO ACADEMIA: All\'s Justice is a super-powered 3D arena fighter featuring your favourite characters from the My Hero Academia franchise in their latest and most powerful forms, all brought together within a refined battle system.A DAY IN THE LIFE OF A HERO Step into the role of Deku and the students of Class 1-A in Team Up Mission and take on training exercises in a Virtual Space. In this original game scenario, team up with Class 1-A students as your allies, complete a variety of missions, and overcome Villains across an exclusive map. Take on Archives Battle to experience iconic battles from throughout the story of My Hero Academia, and unlock Hero\'s Diary to discover never-before-seen character moments. Both modes become available by completing Team Up Missions.RELIVE THE FINAL WAR STORYLINE Experience the final battle of My Hero Academia from a new perspective in Story Mode. Relive Bakugo\'s fearless stand against All For One, follow Deku\'s heroic struggle to bring justice and redemption to his destined foe, and witness a unique cinematic take on the climactic conflict of My Hero Academia.THE LARGEST MY HERO ACADEMIA ROSTER Heroes and Villains come together in a massive roster of characters from across the world of My Hero Academia. Play as your favourite U.A. students, including all of Class 1-A, Pro Heroes such as Mirko and Best Jeanist, and Villains including All For One, Shigaraki, and Dabi, all appearing in their final and most powerful forms.UNLEASH YOUR QUIRKS IN FAST-PACED STRATEGIC BATTLES Take control of your favourite U.A. students, Pro Heroes, and Villains, and use their unique Quirks to overpower your opponents. Activate Rising to enhance attack power, movement speed, and Quirk actions, allowing each character\'s abilities to reach their full potential. Mix and match your team\'s Quirks to create powerful synergies, deepen your strategies, and chain together devastating combos by switching characters during battle.',NULL,279.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
