('4ef1b8d4-b10b-4e07-bc70-03bba1a580e5','2026-07-09 10:42:38.037890','2026-07-09 10:42:38.037890',NULL,'POGA LUX PlayStation 5 Premium Portable Travel Case - Camouflage','indigaming-poga-lux-camouflage-for-ps5','4063657001369-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'8f5c8927-be48-41c7-9c7a-c40f59f564c2',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Introducing the POGA LUX gaming case - a sleek and stylish solution for gamers on the go. This case comes in a black and white colorway, with a special POGA x POGA The Label edition available in Desert Taupe. Not only does it look great, but it\'s also built to protect your valuable gaming equipment. The POGA LUX features a high-quality foam inlay, specially designed to hold both the PS5 disc and digital editions securely in place. The trolley system makes it easy to transport, and it\'s completely removable if you prefer to carry the case by hand. In addition, the POGA LUX also includes a 23.8 inch AOC monitor, so you can game wherever you go without needing to look for any external equipment such as a monitor. The included POGA Connect USB Hub features 3x USB Type-A and 1x USB Type-C port, ensuring that you can connect all your necessary peripherals. Measuring in at a compact 58 cm in height, 39 cm in width, and 18 cm in depth, the POGA LUX is easy to store and transport. It is made from high quality materials such as aluminum and composite, providing the ultimate protection for your gaming gear. And with an IP52 certification, you can be sure that it\'s resistant to dust and water splashes. The state-of-the-art AOC - 24G2SPAE/BK monitor offers a screen size of 23.8 inches with an IPS panel type, ensuring stunning visuals with a resolution of 1920x1080 pixels (Full-HD). The 16:9 aspect ratio, 1ms response time and 165z refresh rate make for an immersive gaming experience. The FreeSync Premium feature, low blue light, and built-in speaker enhance your gaming experience even further. Finally, the POGA LUX is made in Germany, ensuring the highest quality production standards. If you\'re looking for a reliable and stylish gaming case that can protect your PS5 and all its accessories while on the go, the POGA LUX is the perfect solution.',NULL,3949.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
