('4ff7795c-82cf-4686-9ea0-d4600f00e28d','2026-07-09 10:58:21.543263','2026-07-09 10:58:21.543263',NULL,'Pop! Animation: Frieren Beyond Journey\'s End - Frieren','pop-animation-frieren-beyond-journey-s-end-frieren','889698864923-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'f98bbd67-0b4f-473a-9b36-8d4e6c4d60c2',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Bring the magic of Frieren into your anime collection with this Funko Pop! Animation Frieren Beyond Journey’s End figure. Officially licensed by Funko, this collectible perfectly captures the elegant and mystical character in highly detailed vinyl form, making it a standout piece for fans of the popular anime series. Standing at approximately 4 inches tall, this Pop! figure is ideal for display on shelves, desks, or alongside your other anime collectibles. Every detail, from Frieren’s flowing robes to her serene expression, reflects her personality and the enchanting atmosphere of the series. Whether you’re a dedicated anime collector or just beginning your Funko Pop! anime lineup, this figure adds charm, collectible value, and visual appeal to any display. It also makes a perfect gift for anime enthusiasts and Pop! collectors across the UAE. Key Highlights: • Official Funko Pop! Animation collectible – Frieren from Frieren Beyond Journey’s End • High-quality vinyl figure with detailed sculpting and vibrant paint • Approximate size: 4 inches tall, perfect for display • Ideal for anime fans, Funko Pop! collectors, and Frieren enthusiasts • Great for gifting or adding to your anime Funko Pop! collection Add this Frieren Pop! figure to your collection and bring the enchanting world of Frieren Beyond Journey’s End to life on your shelves.',NULL,75.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
