('53034e7d-3dd5-4bdb-ae46-e16078bbf6a4','2026-07-09 11:16:27.054018','2026-07-09 11:16:27.054018',NULL,'Dying Light 2: Stay Human - PS4','ps4-dying-light-2-stay-huma-16667840629','5902385108911-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescriptionPlatform: PlayStation 4Genre: Action RPG, Survival HorrorGame Modes: Single-player, Online Co-opResolution: Up to 1080pFrame Rate: 30fps (targeted performance)Audio: Full stereo and 3D audio support (on compatible systems)Dying Light 2: Stay Human - PS4Dying Light 2: Stay Human takes you to a dark and immersive post-apocalyptic world where survival hinges on your choices and abilities. Play as Aiden Caldwell, a survivor navigating a city torn apart by factions and overrun by infected horrors. Experience a dynamic open world where every decision shapes the story and the environment around you. Designed for action and exploration, the game combines fast-paced parkour mechanics, visceral combat, and a compelling narrative. Whether battling hordes of infected at night or negotiating fragile alliances by day, your survival depends on sharp instincts and bold choices. Key Features: Dynamic Open World: Explore a sprawling city teeming with secrets, dangerous factions, and hidden treasures.Day-Night Cycle: Daytime offers exploration and relative safety, while nighttime brings out deadly infected and increased risk.Branching Narrative: Your decisions shape the fate of The City and its inhabitants, with far-reaching consequences.Parkour Gameplay: Utilize advanced parkour skills to scale buildings, evade enemies, and traverse the environment.Visceral Combat: Engage in brutal melee and ranged combat with customizable weapons and tactical strategies.Co-op Multiplayer: Play solo or team up with friends in online co-op for shared exploration and survival.Optimized for PS4: Experience smooth gameplay with visuals optimized for the PlayStation 4 platform.',NULL,199.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
