ctional, Noise-cancelling Frequency response: 50Hz-6.8kHz Sensitivity: -20dBV (1V/Pa at 1kHz)',NULL,669.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
