('58326a70-0c26-4da9-ad05-a4d3d9db14dd','2026-07-09 11:14:58.044460','2026-07-09 11:14:58.044460',NULL,'Necromunda: Hired Gun - PS4','ps4-necromunda-hired-gun-pegi-eng','3512899123779-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescription Platform: PlayStation 4Genre: First-Person Shooter, ActionGame Modes: Single-playerResolution: Up to 1080pFrame Rate: 30fpsAudio: Dolby Digital, StereoController Features: Compatible with DualShock 4 Necromunda: Hired Gun - PS4Necromunda: Hired Gun is an adrenaline-pumping, first-person shooter set in the dark and lawless hive city of Necromunda, part of the Warhammer 40,000 universe. As a fearless bounty hunter, you navigate a treacherous underworld filled with rival gangs, mutated creatures, and nefarious plots. Armed with a vast arsenal of customizable weapons and enhanced with cybernetic upgrades, you’ll undertake dangerous contracts, battling your way through the grim, dystopian environments of the hive city. With visceral combat, RPG elements, and a loyal cyber-mastiff companion, Necromunda: Hired Gun delivers an exhilarating shooter experience. Key Features: Dystopian Hive City: Immerse yourself in the chaotic, industrialized world of Necromunda, filled with dark secrets and deadly enemies.Fast-Paced Gunplay: Engage in high-octane combat using a wide array of firearms, melee weapons, and powerful gadgets.Cybernetic Enhancements: Upgrade your abilities with cybernetic implants, improving your speed, agility, strength, and combat prowess.Loyal Cyber-Mastiff: Command your customizable cyber-mastiff companion to assist in combat and sniff out enemies.Customizable Weapons and Gear: Modify your weapons and equipment to suit your playstyle, from stealthy approaches to all-out assaults.Diverse Environments: Explore varied locations within the hive city, from grimy industrial zones to gang-infested hideouts.RPG Progression: Earn rewards, level up your character, and unlock new skills as you complete contracts and take down targets.Dynamic Story: Experience a narrative-driven campaign filled with intrigue, betrayal, and relentless action.',NULL,169.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
