('5acaf3d3-c743-4f73-9781-20e726cd55f6','2026-07-09 10:48:37.248101','2026-07-09 10:48:37.248101',NULL,'Funism Pokemon Vinyl Keychain - Fuecoco (Fire-Type Starter)','funism-pokemon-vinyl-keychain-fuecoco-fire-type-starter','6972407215117-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'3155269b-8d2e-4303-ba21-b03ba2ef8437',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Add a spark of personality to your everyday accessories with the Funism Pokémon Fuecoco Vinyl Keychain. This officially licensed Pokémon collectible features Fuecoco, the Fire-type starter from the Pokémon Scarlet & Violet series, designed in Funism’s signature stylized vinyl format. Compact and lightweight, it is ideal for decorating keys, backpacks, handbags, or zippers. Crafted from durable PVC soft vinyl material, the keychain captures Fuecoco’s playful and relaxed expression with vibrant colors and clean detailing. Despite its small size, it delivers strong visual appeal for collectors and Pokémon fans alike. This is both a functional accessory and a collectible item, making it a perfect gift for Pokémon enthusiasts or a fun addition to any anime merchandise collection.',NULL,19.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
