('5f450618-7bc3-4720-9ac5-e4060128fc07','2026-07-09 10:46:54.056195','2026-07-09 10:46:54.056195',NULL,'Nemesis Now Harry Potter Slytherin Collectible Goblet 19.5cm Holds 200ml','nn-harry-potter-slytherin-collectible-goblet-19-5cm-holds-200ml','801269143220-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'6c37856e-f0e1-41cc-baf4-c86092a4757a',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Show your passion for the finest School of Witchcraft and Wizardry in the world with this officially licensed Slytherin collectable Goblet. Slytherin is one of the four houses at Hogwarts School of Witchcraft and Wizardry, whose members are characterised by their cunning, resourcefulness, leadership, and ambition. The emblematic animal of the house is a snake, which can be seen within the crest on the sides of this beautifully crafted piece, along with the house colours of green and silver. Cast in the finest resin before being expertly hand-painted, this collectable Goblet is the perfect addition to any wizarding collection and can be enjoyed by witches, wizards and Muggles alike.',NULL,149.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('5f5fdfc1-5da7-473a-ac4f-51315af02a4f','2026-07-09 10:40:53.652477','2026-07-09 10:40:53.652477',NULL,'Loungefly! Leather: Disney - The Night Before Christmas Jack Skellington House Mini Backpack','loungefly-leather-disney-the-night-before-christmas-jack-skellington-house-mini-backpack','671803426610-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'cfac33db-f672-41dc-8d02-baaac0891814',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','In Tim Burton’s The Nightmare Before Christmas, Jack Skellington of Halloween Town finds himself bored with the same old thing of frightening people in the real world every year. When he accidentally stumbles into Christmas Town, he is instantly enchanted. His obsession with celebrating Christmas leads him to abduct Santa Claus to take over his role. Prepare for a scare! Funko Pop! by Loungefly Jack Skellington Mini Backpack brings some frightful fun to every day. On the front, Jack Skellington and Zero the ghost dog from The Nightmare Before Christmas appear in Funko Pop! form outside the gates of Jack’s house. Opening the gate will grant you access to a hidden pocket perfect for storing your tricks and treats. Turn the bag around to find Pop! Jack Skellington and Zero striking a terrifying pose. Embrace your spooky side with a festive accessory that is sure to bring thrills and chills throughout the year. The Funko Pop! by Loungefly Jack Skellington Mini Backpack is made of vegan leather (polyurethane). The bag has adjustable shoulder straps and sturdy metal hardware. Additional features include applique, debossed, and printed details. Take note of the coordinating inside fabric lining',NULL,299.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('5f686d4e-93b8-4714-a3e5-64bf73ee7ecd','2026-07-09 11:12:09.091795','2026-07-09 11:12:09.091795',NULL,'Skull and Bones Special Edition - PS5','ps5-skull-bones-special-edition','3307216250357-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','From nobody to the most fearsome pirate kingpin Under the pretense of learning from ruthless top dogs, shipwrecked ordinary men and women from all over the world, built their name across the lawless Indian Ocean. They had one aim in mind - to one day topple those in power and eventually compete with one another to rule as the most fearsome pirate kingpin. navigate a beautiful yet dangerous world hell in paradise From the Coast of Africa to the lush, tropical islands of the East Indies, the world of Skull and Bones is a treasure trove to explore. Through your journey, you will face many dangers - from unpredictable weather, dangerous rogue waves, to deadly wildlife and cutthroat pirate hunters. Everything and everyone wants you dead. Sail with your friends Sail the dark and dangerous seas, and experience the thrill of taking on threats with massive cannons and other weapons solo, or form alliances with friends or other players you encounter. your world, your rules Take on the lawless seas on your own or easily form groups with up to 2 friends or other players throughout the game to partake in shareable contracts and rewards. with or against others Keep an eye out for opportunities with vast rewards. But beware, this will put a target on your back for other players to hunt you down and steal your loot.',NULL,129.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
