('5fc77883-cc80-4cd5-9b13-397dc8cabd44','2026-07-09 11:13:47.474906','2026-07-09 11:13:47.474906',NULL,'Eagle Flight - PS4','eagle-flight-1666784278710','3307215991053-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescription Platform: PlayStation 4 (PlayStation VR required)Genre: VR, Adventure, Flight SimulatorGame Modes: Single-player, Online MultiplayerResolution: 1080p (PlayStation VR)Audio: 3D Audio for an immersive VR experienceEagle Flight - PS4Eagle Flight is an exhilarating virtual reality (VR) flight experience that allows players to soar high above a beautifully recreated Paris, experiencing the world from the perspective of a mighty eagle. Set in a post-apocalyptic world, this game brings you to a time where humans are long gone, and nature has taken over the city. Navigate the skies, dive between buildings, and explore every corner of the city as you take on thrilling missions and participate in competitive multiplayer aerial battles. With intuitive flight controls, stunning visuals, and a truly immersive VR experience, Eagle Flight offers an exciting and peaceful journey through one of the most iconic cities in the world. Whether you\'re simply enjoying the freedom of flight or challenging friends in high-speed races, Eagle Flight delivers an unforgettable adventure. Key Features: Virtual Reality Flight: Fly through the skies in first-person, experiencing the freedom of flight from the perspective of a powerful eagle.Explore Paris: Discover a beautiful, dynamic version of Paris, reimagined in the aftermath of human civilization, with lush vegetation and wildlife taking over the city.Single-Player and Multiplayer: Engage in thrilling solo missions or compete with friends in fast-paced, competitive aerial multiplayer modes.Intuitive Controls: Easy-to-learn flight mechanics that allow players to dive, swoop, and glide through the environment with precision.Immersive VR Experience: Compatible with PlayStation VR, offering an unforgettable sense of freedom and immersion in the skies.Adventure and Discovery: Uncover hidden secrets around Paris as you explore the city from the air, encountering other flying creatures along the way.',NULL,39.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
