('5ff0197c-09a2-4c7c-91fa-6e7e5d593b70','2026-07-09 11:06:46.424257','2026-07-09 11:06:46.424257',NULL,'SpongeBob SquarePants™: The Patrick Star Game','spongebob-squarepants-the-patrick-star-game','p-3391892033854-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescriptionPlatform: PlayStation 5, PlayStation 4, Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch, PCGenre: Action-Adventure, PlatformerGameplay Modes: Single-playerResolution: Up to 4K UHD (on supported platforms)Frame Rate: 60fpsSpongeBob SquarePants™: The Patrick Star GameDive into Bikini Bottom for a hilarious and whimsical adventure in SpongeBob SquarePants™: The Patrick Star Game! Step into the fins of Patrick Star as he embarks on a wild quest filled with absurd challenges, quirky humor, and undersea shenanigans. Navigate wacky levels inspired by Patrick\'s imagination, solve creative puzzles, and meet iconic characters from the SpongeBob SquarePants universe. Perfect for fans of all ages, this game is a celebration of Patrick’s unique charm and comedic misadventures. Key Features: Play as Patrick Star: Take control of SpongeBob’s lovable and goofy best friend in a game dedicated to his unique personality.Imaginative Worlds: Explore vibrant levels filled with surreal, dream-like environments reflecting Patrick\'s whimsical thoughts.Hilarious Abilities: Use Patrick’s iconic moves, from belly flops to throwing random objects, to overcome obstacles and defeat enemies.Meet the Cast: Interact with SpongeBob, Squidward, Sandy, and other beloved characters in humorous and heartwarming encounters.Puzzles & Challenges: Solve creative puzzles and engage in slapstick combat in this lighthearted platforming adventure.Family-Friendly Fun: Designed to entertain fans of all ages with its mix of action, comedy, and nostalgia.',NULL,169.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
