('66e8d8d4-417d-4e76-bbda-6014824addf4','2026-07-09 11:15:03.709039','2026-07-09 11:15:03.709039',NULL,'Narcos Rise Of The Cartels - PS4','ps4-narcos-rise-of-the-cartels','5060146468732-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Authenticity is at the core of the Narcos experience and highly recognisable and iconic characters from the TV show are available to control and play, such as El Mexicano, Murphy, Peña, Primo and more. Narcos: Rise of the Cartels takes turn-based tactical combat to a whole new level with units possessing the ability to move individually one after another or multiple times within one turn, meaning the pace is always ramped up. Featuring two unique campaigns, Narcos: Rise of the Cartels enables you to see the war from both sides. Innovative gameplay mechanics keep the turn-based tactical combat fresh by allowing you to take third-person control of your units in order to engage enemies directly, giving you the opportunity to deal critical damage at optimum moments.',NULL,99.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
