('6742d06e-3b19-4849-bf84-6567df7ed008','2026-07-09 11:13:26.455369','2026-07-09 11:13:26.455369',NULL,'Final Fantasy VII Rebirth Deluxe Edition - PS5','final-fantasy-vii-rebirth-deluxe-edition','5021290098541-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescriptionPlatform: PlayStation 5Genre: Action RPGResolution: Up to 4K UHDFrame Rate: Up to 60fpsAudio: Full 3D audio support for an immersive experienceGameplay Mode: Single-playerFinal Fantasy VII Rebirth – Deluxe Edition (PS5)Elevate your journey through Gaia with the Final Fantasy VII Rebirth Deluxe Edition. This premium package includes the next chapter of the epic saga, exclusive collectible content, and digital bonuses. With enhanced visuals, a deeper story, and thrilling gameplay, this edition is the perfect choice for fans who want to experience the Final Fantasy VII universe in all its glory. Deluxe Edition Includes: Full Game: Final Fantasy VII Rebirth on PlayStation 5.SteelBook Case: A stunning collector’s case featuring exclusive artwork.Art Book: A beautifully crafted book showcasing concept art and designs.Mini Soundtrack CD: Relive the epic music from the game with a selection of tracks.Digital DLC Bonuses: Includes in-game content to enhance your adventure. Key Features: Expanded Storytelling: Delve deeper into the mysteries of Sephiroth and the world of Gaia with new locations, characters, and lore.Dynamic Combat: Experience a blend of real-time action and strategic gameplay.Breathtaking Visuals: Stunning graphics powered by PS5 technology.New Exploration: Traverse an expansive world filled with secrets, quests, and breathtaking vistas.',NULL,449.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
