('677e2f28-0566-416c-8799-dcea012969cc','2026-07-09 11:01:50.246060','2026-07-09 11:01:50.246060',NULL,'PS4 FIFA World Cup 2026 Football Games Bundle (7 Games)','ps4-fifa-world-cup-2026-football-games-bundle-7-games','WRLDCPOFFER2-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Get ready for the biggest football celebration with the PS4 FIFA World Cup 2026 Football Games Bundle (7 Games). This exclusive bundle brings together some of the most popular football titles ever released by EA, allowing players to experience the complete journey from the FIFA era to the modern EA SPORTS FC generation. Featuring six main football releases and one bonus FIFA 21 special edition, this collection offers incredible value for football fans and collectors alike. Play through multiple generations of football gaming, enjoy authentic clubs, leagues, players, and stadiums, and experience the evolution of gameplay mechanics across the franchise. Whether you\'re building your Ultimate Team, managing your favorite club in Career Mode, or competing with friends, this bundle delivers countless hours of football action. Perfect for football enthusiasts looking to expand their PS4 game library, this collection celebrates the spirit of football during the FIFA World Cup 2026 season. What\'s Included • PS4 EA SPORTS FC 26 (R2) Standard Edition• PS4 EA SPORTS FC 25 (R2) Standard Edition• PS4 EA SPORTS FC 24 (R2) Standard Edition• PS4 FIFA 23 (R2) Standard Edition• PS4 FIFA 22 (R2) Standard Edition• PS4 FIFA 21 (R2) Standard Edition Bonus Game (Any One) • PS4 FIFA 21 Ultimate Edition (R2) NMC Arabic Edition OR• PS4 FIFA 21 Champions Edition (R2) PEGI Arabic Edition OR• PS4 FIFA 21 Ultimate Edition (R2) PEGI Arabic Edition ∗One FIFA 21 Special Edition will be included based on availability. Key Features • Includes 7 football games for PS4• Features FIFA 21, FIFA 22, FIFA 23, EA SPORTS FC 24, FC 25, and FC 26• Includes 1 bonus FIFA 21 Special Edition• Experience the evolution from FIFA to EA SPORTS FC• Authentic clubs, players, leagues, and stadiums• Multiple game modes including Career Mode, Ultimate Team, Kick-Off, and more• Great value bundle for football fans and collectors• Physical game editions• Compatible with PlayStation 4 Why You\'ll Love It Whether you\'re a long-time FIFA fan or discovering the series for the first time, the PS4 FIFA World Cup 2026 Football Games Bundle (7 Games) offers an incredible football gaming collection. From FIFA 21 to EA SPORTS FC 26, you\'ll enjoy years of football history and gameplay innovation in one bundle.',NULL,449.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
