('687cabeb-85cc-46d4-a78f-3c0836f27fc6','2026-07-09 10:57:04.960596','2026-07-09 10:57:04.960596',NULL,'Pop! Rocks: BTS - V (Love Me Again)','pop-rocks-bts-v-love-me-again','889698863476-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'f98bbd67-0b4f-473a-9b36-8d4e6c4d60c2',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Add the globally adored BTS member to your collection with the Funko Pop! Rocks BTS V (Love Me Again) Vinyl Figure. Inspired by V’s solo single “Love Me Again,” this figure captures his signature style in Funko’s stylized vinyl design. Perfect for BTS ARMY, K-Pop collectors, and Funko enthusiasts, this collectible brings V’s charm and charisma straight to your shelf. Inspired by V’s Solo Track “Love Me Again” V’s “Love Me Again” showcases his vocal talent and artistry. This Pop! Rocks collectible celebrates that era, making it a standout piece in any BTS Funko lineup. Combine it with other BTS Pop! Rocks figures to complete your BTS collection.',NULL,75.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
