('689234a9-eed8-4df0-be1c-a4e4f95c6ca9','2026-07-09 11:16:02.846771','2026-07-09 11:16:02.846771',NULL,'PS4 GRID Legends NMC','ps4-grid-legends-nmc','5030932124944-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','WHAT DOES IT TAKE TO BECOME A RACING LEGEND? Welcome to GRID Legends: a high-stakes driving experience that combines thrilling unpredictable motorsport, incredible race variety, and an immersive driving story that puts you at the heart of the action.Take the spotlight in an engrossing racing story, brought to life by a world-class cast in a ground-breaking extended reality production. Face fierce personalities, paddock politics, on-track drama, and the infamous Ravenwest Motorsport, as a fly-on-the-wall documentary captures every moment.',NULL,139.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('68966305-830f-4fdc-bb0f-a4b30897c7bb','2026-07-09 10:43:41.813376','2026-07-09 10:43:41.813376',NULL,'The Noble Collection Minecraft Diamond Sword Collector Replica','the-noble-collection-minecraft-diamond-sword-collector-replica','849421009441-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'f98bbd67-0b4f-473a-9b36-8d4e6c4d60c2',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Bring the iconic weapon from the blocky world of Minecraft to life with The Noble Collection Minecraft Diamond Sword Collector Replica. Faithfully crafted with intricate details and a premium finish, this collector replica captures the look and feel of the legendary diamond sword, making it a must-have for fans and gamers alike. Perfect for display, cosplay, or as a unique gift for Minecraft enthusiasts. Key Features • Official licensed The Noble Collection product • Replica of Minecraft’s Diamond Sword • High-quality materials with authentic design details • Ideal for display, cosplay, or collector showcases • Perfect gift for Minecraft fans',NULL,249.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('68a18c18-52e1-4c1d-b7ca-97188305460f','2026-07-09 11:08:40.086385','2026-07-09 11:08:40.086385',NULL,'Sony PlayStation 5 Console : Disc Edition (1TB)','sony-playstation-5-console-disc-edition-1tb','711719020189-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'8f5c8927-be48-41c7-9c7a-c40f59f564c2',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Sony PlayStation 5 Console: Disc Edition (1TB) Play Has No Limits. Experience lightning-fast loading, deeper immersion, and an all-new generation of incredible PlayStation games with the sleek, re-engineered PlayStation 5 Disc Edition (1TB) console. Next-Generation Performance & Spee The PS5 console harnesses custom-built technology to deliver a revolution in gaming: 1TB Ultra-High Speed SSD: Maximize your playtime with near-instant load times for installed PS5 games. The custom integration of the console\'s systems allows creators to pull data from the SSD so quickly that they can design games in ways never before possible. 4K Gaming & Ray Tracing: Immerse yourself in worlds with a new level of realism. Ray Tracing individually simulates rays of light, creating true-to-life shadows and reflections in supported PS5 titles. Play your favorite games on your stunning 4K TV with support for HDR for vibrant, lifelike colors. Up to 120fps with 120Hz Output: Enjoy smooth and fluid high frame rate gameplay at up to 120fps for compatible games, with support for 120Hz output on 4K displays. Deeper Immersion with DualSense The revolutionary DualSense Wireless Controller puts tactile sensations directly into your hands, redefining how you interact with games: Haptic Feedback: Experience responsive vibrations that react to your in-game choices, simulating everything from the impact of objects to the feel of terrain. Adaptive Triggers: Get to grips with dynamic resistance levels that simulate the physical tension of in-game actions, like pulling back an arrow or stepping on a brake pedal. Tempest 3D AudioTech: Dive into incredible soundscapes where it feels as if sound comes from every direction. Your surroundings truly come alive through compatible headphones or TV speakers. Key Features of the 1TB Disc Edition 1TB SSD Storage: Increased internal storage to keep your most anticipated games ready to play. Integrated Disc Drive: Play physical PS5 and PS4 game discs, as well as 4K Ultra HD Blu-ray movies, standard Blu-ray, and DVDs. Slim & Sleek Design: Powerful gaming technology is packed inside a refined, compact console design (CFI-2000 model group). Backward Compatibility: The PS5 console can play a massive back catalog of over 4,000 PS4 games, with many benefitting from the Game Boost feature for faster and smoother frame rates. Pre-Installed Game: Includes ASTRO\'s Playroom, a charming adventure designed to showcase the versatile features of the DualSense controller.',NULL,2500.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('68a25eec-3016-4b32-8178-d6df1c06af41','2026-07-09 10:43:41.151080','2026-07-09 10:43:41.151080',NULL,'CINEREPLICAS ADVENT CALENDAR HARRY POTTER MARAUDER\'S MAP CALENDAR','cinereplicas-harry-potter-marauder-s-map-advent-calendar','4895205615304-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'3155269b-8d2e-4303-ba21-b03ba2ef8437',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Discover the magic of the wizarding world with the Cinereplicas Harry Potter Marauder\'s Map Advent Calendar. Officially licensed, this advent calendar features 24 themed surprises inspired by the Marauder’s Map, including mini collectibles and wizarding memorabilia, making it a unique countdown experience for fans. Perfect for Harry Potter enthusiasts, collectors, and anyone looking to add a magical touch to the holiday season. Key Features • Officially licensed Cinereplicas product • 24 themed surprises inspired by the Marauder\'s Map • Includes mini collectibles and wizarding memorabilia • Ideal holiday gift for Harry Potter fans and collectors • Perfect for display or festive seasonal enjoyment',NULL,159.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('68a2b5af-3090-4405-8a07-a77641b17d9b','2026-07-09 10:40:48.684217','2026-07-09 10:40:48.684217',NULL,'Loungefly! Leather: Sanrio Monkichi Cosplay Mini Backpack','loungefly-leather-sanrio-monkichi-cosplay-mini-backpack','671803415676-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'cfac33db-f672-41dc-8d02-baaac0891814',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Go bananas for this a-peel-ing Monkichi Cosplay collection by Loungefly! In the Sanrio universe, along the countryside of Japan lives Monkichi, an adorable little monkey with no shortage of energy, optimism and puns. He dreams of one day becoming a poet and loves bananas. In fact, he can eat ten in one minute! Made to look just like Monkichi, this mini backpack honors his love of the fruit. It’s even banana scented! On the front, Monkichi’s eyes are wide at how many bananas he’s found. His soft, applique ears extend outside the backpack, and the bananas he’s holding rise above the front zipper compartment. There’s even a bunch of bananas as the enamel zipper charm! On the back, Monkichi happily poses with one of his bananas.',NULL,299.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
