('690b99d2-9d28-4746-9fd6-302373706724','2026-07-09 10:53:09.484890','2026-07-09 10:53:09.484890',NULL,'Multiformat Stereo HS Wired Stealth C6 300','multiformat-stereo-hs-wired-16673849791925','5055269709954-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'8f5c8927-be48-41c7-9c7a-c40f59f564c2',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','The STEALTH C6-300 Premium Stereo Gaming Headset is the ultimate Gaming headset for all platforms. The C6-300, part of the STEALTH C6-Series, is a multi-format Gaming headset, compatible with Xbox One, PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch and PC. Take your gaming experience to a whole new level with the powerful audio, through high quality speaker drivers encased in extra comfortable over ear design cushions, allowing for extended gaming sessions without any distractions. The cool design of the Black and Orange colour way, brings a stylish look and feel to your Gaming. The premium braided cable entwined with Black and Orange stitching gives an extra premium feel, providing protection to the inner wiring for quality assurance, whilst aiding a barrier towards anti-tangling of the cable. Activate STEALTH mode and remove the Flexible Mic. Boom, ideal for taking this stylish headset to the streets or offline sessions. Use the inline volume controller with Mic. Mute switch and maintain control. The STEALTH C6-300 connects to all compatible devices via 3.5mm Jack Connection. Features: 40mm Speaker Drivers. Adjustable Headband. Flexible/Removable Mic. Boom. Lightweight Design. Mic. Mute Switch. Over Ear Design Ear Cushions.',NULL,89.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
