 hub ensures that your smartphone or other devices remain fully charged. Efficient Cable Management Comes with a flexible cable holder with built-in cable organizer clips to keep your cables neat, tidy, and secure. Plug and Play No need to install any drivers or software. Simply plug in your HUB right out of the box and you’re ready to go. The USB 3.0 connector is designed with the standard UVC/UVA protocol so it can be used with nearly any device. Main Features USB Hub with 7 x USB ports and individual power buttons LED Indicators for connected devices 16 Swappable Icons Cycle through RGB lighting modes via RGB control button 12V/2A, 24W Power adapter provides high-power delivery 2.0A USB port allows for fast charging Plug and Play - No drivers required',NULL,189.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
