('6c6e32b1-3430-4c5e-888b-a6525ced6c8a','2026-07-09 11:14:54.614753','2026-07-09 11:14:54.614753',NULL,'NIOH - PS4','ps4-nioh','711719818762-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescription Platform: PlayStation 4Genre: Action RPG, Hack-and-SlashGame Modes: Single-playerResolution: 1080pFrame Rate: 30fpsAudio: StereoController Features: Standard DualShock 4 controls, vibration feedbackNIOH - PS4NIOH is an action-packed, dark fantasy RPG set in a reimagined version of feudal Japan, mixing historical events with supernatural elements. Players take on the role of William, a skilled swordsman with a mysterious past, as he battles through hordes of mythical creatures and powerful samurai. Featuring a deep and challenging combat system, NIOH draws inspiration from classic action RPGs while introducing its own unique mechanics, such as stance-based fighting and the use of \"Onmyo\" magic and \"Yokai\" powers. With punishing difficulty, intense boss battles, and a rewarding progression system, NIOH offers a thrilling challenge for fans of action games and samurai mythology. Key Features: Challenging Combat: Engage in tactical, fast-paced combat with a variety of weapons including swords, axes, and spears. Master the stance-based combat system (high, mid, and low) to suit different fighting styles.Yokai and Supernatural Powers: Battle yokai (evil spirits) and use special powers gained from defeating them, such as elemental magic and powerful attacks.Detailed Customization: Equip and upgrade an array of weapons, armor, and abilities to craft a playstyle that suits you.Strategic Boss Battles: Face off against massive, powerful bosses that test your combat skills, patience, and ability to learn enemy patterns.Skill Trees and Abilities: Improve your abilities in combat and magic through the skill tree, enhancing both your swordsmanship and supernatural powers.Side Missions and Exploration: Explore beautiful, but dangerous environments, from dense forests to haunted castles, all filled with secret items and challenging enemies.',NULL,39.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('6c77907b-168c-4981-a57b-3a97d277c48a','2026-07-09 11:06:43.968587','2026-07-09 11:06:43.968587',NULL,'Secret Neighbor + Hello Engineer: The Neighborhood Bundle - Nintendo Switch','secret-neighbor-hello-engineer-the-neighborhood-bundle','5056635612045-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Secret NeighborGather your friends and step into the mysterious Hello Neighbor house—but watch out! One of you is secretly the Neighbor in disguise. Secret Neighbor is a thrilling multiplayer social horror game set in the world of Hello Neighbor. Work together to explore the house and find hidden keys to unlock the basement door. But beware—the Neighbor is among you, blending in and waiting to sabotage your mission. Can you uncover the traitor before it’s too late?Hello EngineerPut your engineering skills to the test and build the ultimate mechanical masterpiece! Trapped in a mysterious amusement park by your sinister Neighbor? It’s time to get creative—construct powerful machines, hop on board, and face the park’s dark secrets to break free. Hello Engineer is a single and multiplayer machinery-building game set in a twisted amusement park full of puzzles and challenges. Use scrap parts to build incredible contraptions, outsmart the creepy Neighbor and his mechanical minions, and conquer every obstacle with your problem-solving skills. Team up with up to three friends and roll, fly, or bounce your way to victory! Get ready for epic machine-on-machine battles that prove these local inventors are a force to be reckoned with!',NULL,149.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('6c888cd4-5219-4dd7-b0b1-157ce1f8c1eb','2026-07-09 11:18:56.706726','2026-07-09 11:18:56.706726',NULL,'Black Myth: Wukong Deluxe Edition','black-myth-wukong','5056635611864-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescriptionPlatform: Available for PS5, Xbox Series X|S, and PCGenre: Action RPGDeveloper: Game SciencePublisher: Game ScienceModes: Single-playerRated: PendingBlack Myth: Wukong Deluxe Edition Immerse yourself in the epic journey of Black Myth: Wukong, a visually stunning action RPG inspired by the classic Chinese tale, Journey to the West. As the legendary Monkey King, wield incredible powers, uncover hidden truths, and confront monstrous foes in a richly detailed world of myth and magic. The Deluxe Edition offers an enhanced experience with exclusive content and collectibles. Key Features Dynamic Combat: Master the Monkey King’s staff and a range of transformative abilities to defeat diverse and challenging enemies.Epic Storytelling: Experience a reimagined tale of the Monkey King with deep lore and compelling characters.Breathtaking Visuals: Powered by Unreal Engine 5, the game showcases hyper-realistic environments, characters, and effects.Immersive World: Explore an expansive world filled with mythical creatures, hidden secrets, and dynamic weather systems. Deluxe Edition Content: The physical edition will come with a Digital Deluxe Edition Voucher that grants access to the following in-game content: Weapon: Bronzecloud StaffEquipment: Folk Opera Mask, Folk Opera Almsgiving Armor, Folk Opera Leather Bracers, Folk Opera BuskinsCurio: Wind Chimes These items can be redeemed through the Trailblazer’s Gift menu at the Keeper’s Shrine (Respawn Point) early in the game. Additionally, the voucher includes a Selected Digital Soundtrack, which enables players to listen to a collection of curated tracks from the game via the Music Library function on the title screen.',NULL,299.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
