tensive customization.Versatile Connectivity:Wi-Fi 6 and Bluetooth 5.2 for lag-free connections to peripherals and networks.USB-C port for charging and accessory connections.HDMI support for docking and big-screen gaming.',NULL,3299.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
