('70d1a29a-541b-43fb-bbe6-8872fa75cf83','2026-07-09 10:47:00.099562','2026-07-09 10:47:00.099562',NULL,'Nemesis Now Harry Potter Death Eater Collectible Tankard 600ml Capacity (B5604T1)','nn-harry-potter-death-eater-collectible-tankard-600ml-capacity','801269143176-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'6c37856e-f0e1-41cc-baf4-c86092a4757a',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Show your allegiance to He Who Must Not Be Named with this officially licensed Death Eater collectable Tankard from Nemesis Now. The Death Eaters were the name given to the most ardent followers of Lord Voldemort. They often wore black hoods and masks with snake-like eye slits to cover their faces, as shown by the ones on the sides of this beautifully sculpted tankard. The Dark Mark was usually burned into their left forearms, an effigy which can be seen forming the serpentine handle, adorned with Emerald jewels. Cast in the finest resin before being expertly hand-painted, this collectable Tankard is the perfect addition to any wizarding collection and can be enjoyed by witches, wizards and Muggles alike.',NULL,210.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
