('714a5466-e2a2-494b-8bad-09863aed3e11','2026-07-09 11:01:45.487834','2026-07-09 11:01:45.487834',NULL,'Rayman Legends Retold Standard Edition','rayman-legends-retold-standard-edition','p-3307216313052-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Product DescriptionScreenshotsGet ready to return to the Glade of Dreams in Rayman Legends Retold Standard Edition, a bold reimagining of Ubisoft\'s award-winning platforming classic. Developed by Ubisoft Montpellier and Ubisoft Milan, this all-new adventure modernizes the beloved experience while preserving the fast-paced gameplay, memorable characters, and cooperative fun that made the original a fan favorite. Launching on October 1, 2026, Rayman Legends Retold introduces stunning new visuals, fully voiced cinematics, an expanded story, and brand-new content designed for a new generation of players. Whether you\'re discovering Rayman for the first time or returning to one of platform gaming\'s most celebrated adventures, Retold delivers a fresh journey through the magical world of Rayman.PURE PLATFORMING JOY Leap, glide, and punch your way through vibrant worlds filled with imaginative challenges, hidden secrets, and unforgettable moments. From fast-paced action to rhythm-based musical stages, every level offers a unique adventure designed to keep players of all ages entertained.NEW AND IMPROVED GAMEPLAY Rediscover the magic of Rayman with enhanced visuals, refined gameplay, and exciting new content. Explore iconic levels alongside a mysterious sixth realm, master 4 brand-new musical stages, embark on thrilling dragon-riding sequences, and prove your skills in the challenging Cave of Trials.A FRESH TAKE ON AN EPIC TALE Join Rayman, Globox, and the Teensies on an all-new adventure as they face a powerful threat emerging from the underworld. Fully voiced cinematics and an expanded soundtrack from acclaimed composers Christophe Héral and Grant Kirkhope bring this reimagined journey to life.4 PLAYERS, LEGENDARY FUN Experience the entire adventure in up to 4-player local co-op. Team up with friends and family, compete for Lums, rescue every last Teensy, or jump into the returning Kung Foot mode featuring enhanced controls, power-ups, and customizable rules for endless multiplayer fun.',NULL,189.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
