('728a21db-cecf-406a-9c3b-5248b14e4832','2026-07-09 11:08:17.200372','2026-07-09 11:08:17.200372',NULL,'PlayStation 5 DualSense Wireless Controller - Chroma Indigo','playstation-5-dualsense-wireless-controller-chroma-indigo','711719590576-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'8f5c8927-be48-41c7-9c7a-c40f59f564c2',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescriptionDesign: Gradient Chroma Indigo finish with blue and purple tones.Wireless: Bluetooth connectivity for smooth gaming.Haptics: Dynamic feedback for immersive sensations.Adaptive Triggers: Adjustable resistance for in-game actions.Battery: Rechargeable, 8-12 hours of playtime, USB-C charging.Audio: Built-in microphone, 3.5mm headphone jack.Touchpad: Interactive touchpad for extra controls.Sensors: Gyroscope and accelerometer for motion controls.Compatibility: PS5 and select PC games.The PlayStation 5 DualSense Wireless Controller - Chroma Indigo features a striking gradient finish that transitions between blue and purple tones, offering a premium, visually appealing design. With Bluetooth connectivity, it ensures smooth and lag-free gaming, while dynamic haptic feedback delivers immersive sensations, reacting to in-game actions. The adaptive triggers offer adjustable resistance, adding a deeper level of realism during gameplay. Equipped with a rechargeable battery that provides 8-12 hours of playtime and USB-C charging for fast power-ups, this controller also includes a built-in microphone, a 3.5mm headphone jack, and an interactive touchpad for additional control options. Motion sensors, including a gyroscope and accelerometer, allow for intuitive motion-based gameplay. Fully compatible with PlayStation 5 and select PC games, the Chroma Indigo controller is designed to elevate your gaming experience with both style and advanced features.',NULL,359.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
