('72edc953-371b-4a67-9656-43ddec64d3d7','2026-07-09 11:02:16.225259','2026-07-09 11:02:16.225259',NULL,'Darksiders Warmastered Edition','darksiders-warmastered-edition','p-9120131604395-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','DescriptionScreenshotsDarksiders: Warmastered Edition Deceived by evil forces into bringing about the end of the world too soon, War — the first Horseman of the Apocalypse — stands accused of violating sacred law and igniting the conflict between Heaven and Hell. Now stripped of his powers and hunted by angels, War must return to Earth to uncover the truth and seek vengeance against those responsible. Experience the acclaimed action-adventure classic in Darksiders: Warmastered Edition, featuring enhanced visuals, improved performance, and intense hack-and-slash combat across a devastated post-apocalyptic world. Key Features • Apocalyptic Power – Unleash devastating supernatural abilities and brutal combat attacks• Extreme Arsenal – Wield angelic, demonic, and earthly weapons in battle• Epic Quest – Explore ruined cities, demon-infested dungeons, and wastelands• Character Progression – Upgrade weapons, unlock abilities, and customize combat style• Battle Heaven and Hell – Fight powerful enemies from both celestial and demonic realms Warmastered Edition Enhancements • Native 1080p resolution support• Improved rendering and visual effects• Doubled texture resolutions• Enhanced shadow quality• Post-processing visual upgrades• Smooth 60 FPS gameplay on supported platforms',NULL,139.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
