('730cc453-cc84-43f0-9846-54f2910ea2a5','2026-07-09 10:54:25.499425','2026-07-09 10:54:25.499425',NULL,'Pop! Animation: Tom & Jerry Gokko - Nibbles','pop-animation-tom-jerry-gokko-nibbles','889698928694-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'f98bbd67-0b4f-473a-9b36-8d4e6c4d60c2',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Celebrate classic cartoon chaos with a modern twist in the Funko Pop! Animation: Tom & Jerry Gokko – Nibbles Vinyl Figure. Inspired by Tom & Jerry Gokko, this officially licensed collectible reimagines Nibbles in Funko’s signature Pop! Animation style with a stylized, anime-inspired aesthetic. Nibbles, also known as Tuffy, is the small but clever mouse often seen alongside Jerry. Despite his size, he is quick-witted and resourceful, frequently joining in on the mischievous antics that define the Tom and Jerry universe. This Gokko version gives Nibbles a refreshed visual design while keeping his playful personality intact, making it a fun and unique addition for animation collectors.',NULL,75.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
