('73286512-974d-48f4-bea2-c8d2c3a586b0','2026-07-09 11:01:55.917817','2026-07-09 11:01:55.917817',NULL,'Yu-Gi-Oh! Trading Card: Rarity Collection 5 Booster Box (24 Packs) - English Edition','yu-gi-oh-trading-card-rarity-collection-5-booster-box-24-packs-english-edition','4012927194768-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'3155269b-8d2e-4303-ba21-b03ba2ef8437',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Expand your collection with the Yu-Gi-Oh! TCG Rarity Collection 5 Booster Box, a premium release packed with high-rarity reprints, exclusive artwork variants, and collector-focused foil cards. Rarity Collection 5 continues the popular Rarity Collection series with an approximately 80-card pool featuring tournament staples, fan-favorite cards, and multiple premium rarity treatments. Every pack includes a special variant art card, while selected cards are available in the first-ever extended-art format introduced to the Yu-Gi-Oh! Trading Card Game. Each booster box contains 24 booster packs, with 5 cards per pack. Cards can appear in multiple premium rarities, including Super Rare, Ultra Rare, Secret Rare, Starlight Rare, Platinum Secret Rare, Ultimate Rare, and Collector’s Rare variants. Whether you\'re a competitive duelist searching for valuable reprints or a collector looking for premium foil cards and alternate artwork, Rarity Collection 5 offers one of the most exciting Yu-Gi-Oh! releases in the series.',NULL,720.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
