('7804ba0f-384c-4041-8b18-05bf3e84b295','2026-07-09 10:40:47.619539','2026-07-09 10:40:47.619539',NULL,'Loungefly! Leather: Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtle Sewer Cap All-Over-Print Mini Backpack','loungefly-leather-teenage-mutant-ninja-turtle-sewer-cap-all-over-print-mini-backpack','671803422407-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'cfac33db-f672-41dc-8d02-baaac0891814',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Cowabunga, dudes! The Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles have emerged from the sewers for this awesome Loungefly collection! The turtles were once ordinary red-eared slider turtles born in 1997 in a New York City pet store. One day, they were adopted, and an accident involving a canister of Mutagen Ooze turned them into humanoids along with a brown rat by the name of Splinter, who became their father and trained them in the art of ninjitsu deep in the sewers under the city. They grew to be great heroes and gained great foes in the process. In delightful chibi form, the turtles have gathered with Splinter, April O’Neil, Casey Jones, Shredder, Bebop and Rocksteady for an adorable all-over print! Featured in various poses and activities, such as eating pizza, there’s no shortage of enthusiasm in this print. The front zipper compartment is cleverly disguised as a sewer cap adorned with the Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles logo, and is accessible with a slice of pizza-shaped enamel zipper charm.',NULL,299.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
