('78130f0b-3e9f-45dd-96b7-09dcb60fc0a6','2026-07-09 10:51:33.131321','2026-07-09 10:51:33.131321',NULL,'WW FASHION DOLL DLX - HERMIONE','ww-fashion-doll-8-dlx-hermione','778988398265-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'ff242680-eaae-4c64-9b7f-22aef1f926df',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','\"Recreate your favorite Harry Potter scenes with the Wizarding World Brilliant Hermione 8-inch doll! With two different outfits and five accessories included, the Brilliant Hermione doll is perfect for storytelling play and is a must-have for Harry Potter fans. Cute facial details, soft and extra-long curly hair and five points of articulation bring the beloved Harry Potter character to life. Brilliant Hermione is ready for endless spellbinding adventures, with two outfits to choose from! She comes wearing her pink hoodie and jeans complete with rainbow belt and removable sneakers, as seen in the Prisoner of Azkaban movie, or you can switch Hermione into her Hogwarts uniform with Gryffindor sweater and skirt! Place Hermione’s wand in her hand and pose your doll to brew up potions over the cauldron, then pretend to bottle them up with the potion bottle accessory – Hermione can really hold the bottle! Slide the Time-Turner necklace onto Hermione and recreate iconic movie scenes; plus, Hermione’s adorable pet cat Crookshanks can join in on the fun! This 8-inch Brilliant Hermione doll will inspire your imagination through fun and exciting pretend play. For more ways to build out your Wizarding World, add all of the other Harry Potter 8-inch dolls to your collection (each sold separately)! This 8-inch Brilliant Hermione doll and the 8-inch Harry Potter dolls are great gifts for girls. Experience the magic of Harry Potter with the Wizarding World Brilliant Hermione 8-inch doll!\"',NULL,165.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('781986fd-795e-48ec-a21e-31f2a97361b7','2026-07-09 10:41:42.962284','2026-07-09 10:41:42.962284',NULL,'Govee LED Smart Light Bulb','govee-led-light-bluetooth-bulbs','6974316991516-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'2f4818b1-ebde-4ac3-adb1-5c4f62d01e42',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Connect via Bluetooth App Control: Via Bluetooth connects the light bulb with the \"Govee Home\" App. Group control can control up to 6 bulbs at the same time (Note: Don\'t support Alexa/Google) Multi-Use RGBWW Bulb: Adjustable 2700 - 6500K colour temperature of colour changing light bulb brings you warm to cool white, meeting your needs for relaxing or working. Over 16 million vivid colours elevate your mood at a get-together. Bring Music to Life: Bulbs can change colours according to the rhythm of the music. Sync lights to the beat of any song whether you want to get a crazy party start or indulge in a candlelight dinner with the beloved. Versatile App Control: With the Govee Home app, you can create timers and routines to automate the LED bulbs. Select from 8 Scene Modes to easily match diverse occasions. Customize your lighting with vibrant colours and animated lighting effects. Energy Saving: The brightness of this 7W bulb is equivalent to a 60W incandescent, saving you 90% on lighting costs',NULL,129.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('78434ce7-e91e-4d72-a22f-d4e0704a8b40','2026-07-09 10:41:13.255650','2026-07-09 10:41:13.255650',NULL,'Govee RGBIC TV Light Bars for 45-70 inch TVs','govee-rgbic-tv-light-bars-for-45-70-inch-tvs','6974316993667-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'2f4818b1-ebde-4ac3-adb1-5c4f62d01e42',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescription Compatibility: Designed for 45-70 inch TVsLight Type: RGBIC LEDControl Options: Govee Home app, Voice control (Amazon Alexa, Google Assistant), Physical touch panelConnectivity: BluetoothPower Source: USB-powered (via TV USB port or power adapter)Sync Modes: Dynamic screen sync, Music syncColor Options: 16 million colors with dynamic RGBIC effectsLength of Light Bars: Custom length for 45-70 inch TV sizesSpecial Features: Smart control, easy installation with adhesive, dynamic light sync with TV screen, customizable lighting effectsGovee RGBIC TV Light Bars for 45-70 inch TVsThe Govee RGBIC TV Light Bars for 45-70 inch TVs are designed to enhance your entertainment space by adding dynamic, color-changing lighting that syncs with your on-screen content. Using Govee’s RGBIC technology, these light bars provide a vivid and immersive experience by displaying multiple colors simultaneously across different segments of the lights. Whether you\'re watching movies, playing games, or enjoying music, the light bars adjust in real-time to create the perfect ambiance, elevating your viewing experience to the next level. Key Features: RGBIC Technology: The RGBIC feature allows for independent color control across different segments of the light bar, creating a more fluid and dynamic lighting effect that responds to on-screen action.Screen Sync Technology: The lights adjust automatically to the colors and content on your screen, enhancing your viewing experience by producing lighting effects that match the action in real-time.Wide Compatibility: These light bars are specifically designed for TVs ranging from 45-70 inches, providing an ideal lighting solution for medium-sized TVs in your living room or home theater.Multiple Scene Modes: The light bars come with several preset scene modes such as movie, gaming, and music modes. Choose the right mode for your activity to get the most immersive lighting experience.Smart Control: Control your lights using the Govee Home app, your voice (via Amazon Alexa or Google Assistant), or directly via the touch panel. Customize colors, brightness, effects, and more.Music Sync: The built-in microphone allows the light bars to sync with the beat of your music, creating a visually engaging environment for parties or gaming sessions.Easy Installation: The light bars are simple to install, using a non-permanent adhesive that sticks securely to the back of your TV without leaving any residue.USB Powered: Powered through a USB connection, the light bars can easily connect to your TV’s USB port or a wall adapter for convenient power access.',NULL,249.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
