('7ae1d3c6-a263-4173-88e9-ca80e0b77094','2026-07-09 11:16:13.190089','2026-07-09 11:16:13.190089',NULL,'FIFA 21 - PS4','ps4-fifa-21-r2-nmc-arb-std','5030941124454-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescription Platform: PlayStation 4Genre: Sports, Football (Soccer)Developer: EA Vancouver, EA RomaniaPublisher: Electronic ArtsModes: Single-player, Multiplayer, Online multiplayerRelease Date: October 9, 2020EA Sports FIFA 21 - PS4 EA Sports FIFA 21 delivers the most authentic football experience yet, featuring groundbreaking gameplay mechanics, enhanced visuals, and improved AI. With new attacking systems and creative modes, FIFA 21 sets the stage for thrilling matches on the pitch. Whether you\'re building your dream team in FIFA Ultimate Team or dominating with your favorite club in Career Mode, every play feels more realistic and rewarding. Key Features Gameplay Enhancements:Agile dribbling for increased control and precision.Creative runs to allow more off-the-ball movement.Natural collision system for more fluid interactions.FIFA Ultimate Team (FUT):Build and customize your dream squad.Co-op mode lets you team up with friends to take on the FUT community.Career Mode:Manage every aspect of your team\'s success on and off the pitch.Simulated match options provide more tactical control.VOLTA Football:Experience street football in vibrant locales.New gameplay modes and customization options. Authenticity:Over 17,000 players and 700+ teams.Official leagues, stadiums, and competitions, including UEFA Champions League.',NULL,139.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
