('7b9d7dc6-347b-4403-bc0f-5c5413c3c4b5','2026-07-09 11:06:29.767284','2026-07-09 11:06:29.767284',NULL,'Lumo 2 Standard Edition (ZGames Exclusive)','lumo-2-standard-edition','p-5060997483557-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Rewind the cassette and fall head over heels into a love letter to the trailblazing days of early ‘80s & ‘90s British videogames. Adventure calls, grab your hat, light your staff, and leap into a world of shifting landscapes and interconnected rooms, each a meticulously designed puzzle box with dangers to dodge, precision platforming and secrets to uncover. Hunt for collectibles, and vault through portals to experience wild genre twists that’ll keep you on your toes.Features: Retro‑inspired puzzle platforming: A modern sequel built on the charm and artistry of early isometric British classics Classic Collectibles: Collect 25 vintage cassettes and 20 ducks hidden in inventive locations, rewarding exploration and persistence Evolving Gameplay: Traverse shifting dimensions and portals; mini-games and genre-bending levels surprise around every corner Retro Charm, Modern Design: Paying homage to 8‑bit era aesthetics while delivering polished modern platform mechanics',NULL,169.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
