('7ec3204f-989e-4d1c-87ae-9519d00ac18d','2026-07-09 10:57:58.558893','2026-07-09 10:57:58.558893',NULL,'Pop! Super Movies: Alien vs Predator Requiem - Predalien','pop-super-movies-alien-vs-predator-requiem-predalien','889698902410-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'f98bbd67-0b4f-473a-9b36-8d4e6c4d60c2',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Bring the terrifying hybrid of the universe to your collection with the Funko Pop! Super Movies: Alien vs Predator Requiem – Predalien vinyl figure. This officially licensed Pop! collectible showcases the Predalien, a deadly fusion of Predator and Xenomorph from the Alien vs Predator Requiem movie, in Funko’s signature stylized design. Crafted from high-quality vinyl, the figure stands at approximately 4.5 inches (11.4 cm) tall and features intricate sculpting and detailed paintwork that highlights the terrifying features of this iconic sci-fi hybrid. Ideal for display alongside other Alien, Predator, or Pop! Movies collectibles, it brings an intense, dramatic flair to any shelf or collection. Perfect for collectors and fans of the Alien vs Predator franchise, this Predalien Pop! figure captures the hybrid’s monstrous appearance with precision, making it a must-have centerpiece for any sci-fi collection in the UAE. It also makes a thrilling gift for enthusiasts of horror, sci-fi, and collectible vinyl figures. Key Highlights: • Official Funko Pop! Super Movies collectible – Alien vs Predator Requiem: Predalien • High-quality vinyl with detailed sculpting and paintwork • Approximate size: ~4.5 inches (11.4 cm) tall • Perfect for sci-fi collectors, Alien vs Predator fans, and Pop! enthusiasts in the UAE • Ideal for display or gifting for movie and horror franchise fans Add the Predalien Pop! Super Movies figure to your collection and showcase one of the most fearsome creatures from the Alien vs Predator universe.',NULL,119.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('7ec3848c-11db-4b2e-a044-84f1a46f361c','2026-07-09 11:18:49.963355','2026-07-09 11:18:49.963355',NULL,'HORI Tactical Assault Commander Mechanical Keypad + Battlefield 6 PS5','hori-tactical-assault-commander-mechanical-keypad-battlefield-6-ps5','MCKPBTLFLD6-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','HORI Tactical Assault Commander Mechanical Keypad Take your console gaming to a competitive elite level with the HORI Tactical Assault Commander (TAC). Specifically designed to bridge the gap between console and PC, this officially licensed Sony peripheral brings the surgical precision of keyboard movement to the PlayStation 5 and PlayStation 4. Whether you are navigating high-stakes firefights in an FPS or managing complex rotations in an MMORPG, the TAC Mechanical Keypad gives you the \"PC-style\" edge without leaving your console environment. Key Features & Performance Mechanical Precision: Equipped with high-quality, LED-backlit mechanical keys, providing tactile feedback and lightning-fast response times for every keystroke. Tactical Analog Stick: Features an integrated side-mounted analog stick that mimics controller movement, allowing your thumb to handle navigation while your fingers stay free for ability keys. Customizable Profiles: Using the TAC Companion App on your smartphone, you can remap every key, adjust sensitivity, and save up to 6 unique profiles per platform to swap playstyles on the fly. Ergonomic Design: The adjustable palm rest features three different positions, ensuring maximum comfort and reducing wrist strain during grueling marathon sessions. Seamless Integration: Fully compatible with PS5 and PS4 home screen menus and native keyboard-supported titles like Call of Duty, Fortnite, and Final Fantasy XIV.Battlefield 6 - PS5The ultimate all-out warfare experience. Fight in high-intensity infantry combat. Rip through the skies in aerial dogfights. Demolish your environment for a strategic advantage. Harness complete control over every action and movement using the Kinesthetic Combat System. In a war of tanks, fighter jets, and massive combat arsenals—the deadliest weapon is your squad. This is Battlefield™ 6.TACTICAL DESTRUCTIONTransform your surroundings for a strategic advantage. More reactive, consistent, and tactical than ever before. Let nothing stand in your way to victory. And we mean nothing.ALL-OUT WARFARE Engage in all-out war with Battlefield’s legendary mix of infantry and vehicle combat, class-based squad play, and cutting edge audiovisual immersion.GLOBAL SCALE CAMPAIGN Campaign is back. Drive tanks across the Sahara. Storm the beaches of Gibraltar. Defend New York from invasion. Join an elite squad of Marine Raiders fighting relentlessly to save a world on the edge of collapse.MODESFrom classic modes like Conquest and Breakthrough to new fast-paced, close-quarters experiences like Escalation, Battlefield 6 is bringing you more ways to battle than ever before.MAPSVictory, however you envision it. Fight in iconic locations all over the world like Cairo, Brooklyn, Gibraltar and more. More ways to play. More paths to victory. All on day 1.',NULL,799.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
