('825b10c4-288c-454b-a0e4-c5f777aa5e99','2026-07-09 10:56:55.880122','2026-07-09 10:56:55.880122',NULL,'Pop! Games: Pokemon - Goomy','pop-games-pokemon-goomy','889698916639-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'f98bbd67-0b4f-473a-9b36-8d4e6c4d60c2',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Add an adorable Pokémon to your collection with the Pop! Games Pokémon – Goomy Collectible Figure. Inspired by the beloved Pokémon series, this figure captures Goomy’s cute and recognizable appearance in the signature Pop! design style. Perfect for display on shelves, desks, or gaming setups, this collectible is made from durable vinyl and designed to maintain its vibrant look over time. Its compact size makes it an ideal addition to any Pokémon or Pop! figure collection. Whether you’re a long-time Pokémon fan or a dedicated Pop! collector, this Goomy figure is a charming piece that brings personality and fun to your display. Key Features • Official Pop! Games Pokémon – Goomy figure• Cute and detailed design inspired by the Pokémon series• Durable vinyl construction for long-lasting display• Compact size perfect for shelves, desks, or display cases• Ideal collectible for Pokémon fans and Pop! figure collectors• Great gift for gamers, collectors, and Pokémon enthusiasts',NULL,75.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('825d3b36-1eab-4909-a68e-a0ac7d7c1307','2026-07-09 11:08:11.123403','2026-07-09 11:08:11.123403',NULL,'SW Animal Crossing: New Horizons','animal-crossing-new-horizon-16667842799920','45496596439-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Escape to a deserted island and create your own paradise as you explore, create, and customize in Animal Crossing: New Horizons. Your island getaway has a wealth of natural resources that can be used to craft everything from tools to creature comforts. You can hunt down insects at the crack of dawn, decorate your paradise throughout the day, or enjoy sunset on the beach while fishing in the ocean. The time of day and season match real life, so each day on your island is a chance to check in and find new surprises all year round. If the hustle and bustle of modern life’s got you down, Tom Nook has a new business venture up his sleeve that he knows you’ll adore: the Nook Inc. Deserted Island Getaway Package! Sure, you’ve crossed paths with colorful characters near and far. Had a grand time as one of the city folk. May’ve even turned over a new leaf and dedicated yourself to public service! But deep down, isn’t there a part of you that longs for…freedom? Then perhaps a long walk on the beach of a deserted island, where a rich wealth of untouched nature awaits, is just what the doctor ordered! Peaceful creativity and charm await as you roll up your sleeves and make your new life whatever you want it to be. Collect resources and craft everything from creature comforts to handy tools. Embrace your green thumb as you interact with flowers and trees in new ways. Set up a homestead where the rules of what goes indoors and out no longer apply. Make friends with new arrivals, enjoy the seasons, pole-vault across rivers as you explore, and more!',NULL,189.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('82779c5b-ed25-45e5-a958-a434825d4d63','2026-07-09 11:02:03.911811','2026-07-09 11:02:03.911811',NULL,'CAPTAIN TSUBASA 2: WORLD FIGHTERS','captain-tsubasa-2-world-fighters','p-3391892041019-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','CAPTAIN TSUBASA 2: WORLD FIGHTERSScreenshotsCaptain Tsubasa 2: World Fighters is an upcoming football anime action game published by Bandai Namco Entertainment and inspired by the legendary Captain Tsubasa franchise. The game combines fast-paced arcade football gameplay with cinematic anime presentation, allowing players to perform signature special moves, powerful shots, and competitive football action inspired by the iconic series. Players can experience stylized matches, anime-inspired visuals, and dynamic gameplay designed for both casual and competitive football game fans.Battle for Soccer World Glory • The latest video game in the globally beloved anime series Captain Tsubasa! • Featuring 22 national teams and over 110 playable characters. • Experience super action soccer where a continuous stream of superhuman plays creates unpredictable match sequences! A Soccer World That is Larger Than Before! Featuring 22 national teams, over 110 playable characters, and more than 150 cutscenes highlighting moves on the pitch! Previously unseen teams from the manga and original teams and characters clash in glorious, meticulous animation. The excitement of these once-in-a-lifetime moments has never been higher! New and Improved Gameplay Action on the field has been significantly enhanced! New super moves increase the intensity of every part of the game. Now, even when you pass, dribble, tackle or block, you can dominate the field with your own special techniques. Even blocking goal shots gets more tactical! The new system pits goalkeeper against shooter, allowing both players to experience and counter jaw-dropping super shots and blocks from characters of the original series. Follow the Journey to Victory Pick up where the first game left off and follow Tsubasa as he takes on formidable new rivals in the thrilling story based on the World Youth arc. Discover expanded storylines overseen by the original creator, Yoichi Takahashi, and witness powerhouse nations clash as they chase international glory.',NULL,229.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
