('83099594-447a-49ac-bced-35d62b94a690','2026-07-09 11:01:42.842369','2026-07-09 11:01:42.842369',NULL,'Star Wars Zero Company','star-wars-zero-company','p-5030932125484-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','A Tactical Star Wars Story Set in the Clone Wars Era Star Wars Zero Company™ is a single-player, turn-based tactics game developed by Bit Reactor in collaboration with EA and Lucasfilm Games. Set during the final days of the Clone Wars, the game places you in command of an elite, unconventional squad known as Zero Company—a group of specialists, mercenaries, and operatives brought together from across the galaxy for a mission that could decide the fate of the Republic. You play as Hawks, a former Republic officer tasked with leading this volatile team against a growing galactic threat capable of consuming everything in its path.STORY As war engulfs the galaxy, Hawks must lead Zero Company, a squad of uneasy allies forced to set aside personal differences to survive impossible odds. Every mission carries weight. Every decision matters. And every choice you make can alter the fate of the galaxy. Victory depends not only on battlefield success, but also on the trust, loyalty, and unity built within your squad.CORE GAMEPLAY FEATURESTactical Turn-Based Combat Engage in strategic, cinematic battles where positioning, abilities, and squad composition determine success.Command Elite Operatives Recruit and deploy a diverse roster of operatives, including: • Scoundrels• Astromechs• Jedi• Custom-built characters Each brings unique tactical abilities to the battlefield.BASE MANAGEMENT & STRATEGY LAYER Between missions, manage your base of operations, expand your tactical options, and deploy informants across key locations in the galaxy. Use gathered intelligence to stay ahead of enemies and influence mission outcomes.SQUAD BOND SYSTEM Build relationships between squad members to unlock: • New combat synergies• Enhanced abilities• Improved battlefield coordination Stronger bonds directly impact mission success and survival.FULL CUSTOMIZATION SYSTEM Personalize your experience by: • Customizing Hawks’ combat specialization and appearance• Building a squad of fully customized Star Wars characters• Adjusting loadouts, abilities, and visual identity Every squad is unique to your playstyle.SETTING – CLONE WARS ERA The game is set in the twilight of the Clone Wars, featuring: • Iconic Star Wars locations• New galactic conflict zones• A gritty, cinematic wartime narrative• A collapsing Republic under pressure from rising threats',NULL,269.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
