('87f4fcea-0962-4056-b33c-873f3b4c2671','2026-07-09 10:46:54.881434','2026-07-09 10:46:54.881434',NULL,'Nemesis Now Harry Potter Slytherin Collectible Tankard 15.5cm 600ml Capacity','nn-harry-potter-slytherin-collectible-tankard-15-5cm-600ml-capacity','801269143213-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'6c37856e-f0e1-41cc-baf4-c86092a4757a',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Show your passion for the finest School of Witchcraft and Wizardry in the world with this officially licensed Slytherin collectable Tankard. Slytherin is one of the four houses at Hogwarts School of Witchcraft and Wizardry, whose members are characterised by their cunning, resourcefulness, leadership, and ambition. The emblematic animal of the house is a snake, which can be seen within the crest on the sides of this beautifully crafted piece, along with the house colours of green and silver. Cast in the finest resin before being expertly hand-painted, this collectable Tankard is the perfect addition to any wizarding collection and can be enjoyed by witches, wizards and Muggles alike.',NULL,205.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('87f5488a-6d0e-4929-8db1-d154f692c3b7','2026-07-09 10:41:16.356389','2026-07-09 10:41:16.356389',NULL,'Govee Gaming Light Strip G1 Light:  27-34 inch TV Monitor Backlight','govee-gaming-light-strip-g1-light-27-34-inch-tv-monitor-backlight','6974316994763-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'2f4818b1-ebde-4ac3-adb1-5c4f62d01e42',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescription Compatibility: 27-34 inch monitors and TVsLighting Type: RGBIC LEDPower Source: USB-powered (via TV/monitor or wall adapter)Control Options: Govee Home app, manual controlsConnectivity: BluetoothSpecial Features: Game-specific modes, music sync, multi-color displayStrip Length: Tailored for 27-34 inch displays, with easy-to-apply adhesive backingGovee Gaming Light Strip G1 (27-34 inch TV/Monitor Backlight)Enhance your gaming or viewing experience with the Govee Gaming Light Strip G1, designed for 27-34 inch TVs and monitors. This RGBIC backlighting solution brings your screen to life by syncing dynamic lighting effects with your content. Whether you\'re gaming, streaming, or watching movies, the Govee Light Strip offers an immersive experience with vibrant colors and real-time reactions to on-screen action. Key Features: Real-Time Screen Sync: The light strip syncs with your screen to mirror on-screen colors and enhance your visual experience.RGBIC Technology: Multicolor illumination with smooth transitions and stunning effects, showing different colors at once.Customizable Lighting: Use the Govee Home app to control colors, brightness, and effects for a personalized look.Game-Mode Lighting: Choose from gaming-specific modes to create the perfect atmosphere for FPS, RPGs, and other genres.Music Sync: The built-in microphone picks up audio from your device and synchronizes lighting with the music or game sounds.Easy Installation: Flexible adhesive light strips designed to wrap around the back of your TV or monitor for an effortless setup.',NULL,179.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,