('881c221b-4a27-45a3-bc51-fff79308d769','2026-07-09 11:12:13.835849','2026-07-09 11:12:13.835849',NULL,'Sand Land','sand-land','p-3391892030693-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescription Platform: PlayStation 5, Xbox Series X|S, PlayStation 4, PCGenre: Action-AdventureResolution: Up to 4K UHDFrame Rate: 60fpsGameplay Modes: Single-playerSand LandEmbark on an epic journey through a desolate world in Sand Land, based on the manga by Akira Toriyama. Join Beelzebub, the Prince of the Underworld, and his unlikely companions as they venture through a drought-stricken desert to uncover the secrets of a hidden water source. With a mix of exploration, combat, and Toriyama\'s signature art style brought to life in stunning visuals, Sand Land delivers a unique action-adventure experience. Key Features: Unique Storyline: Explore a drought-stricken world inspired by the original manga, blending humor and heart.Diverse Exploration: Traverse vast deserts, mysterious ruins, and enemy-filled regions in customizable vehicles.Dynamic Combat: Engage in thrilling battles with desert creatures and enemy factions using a mix of melee and ranged attacks.Vehicle Customization: Build and upgrade your sand tank to adapt to various terrains and combat scenarios.Stunning Visuals: Akira Toriyama’s iconic art style is brought to life with vibrant, modern graphics.Immersive World: Uncover secrets, solve environmental puzzles, and meet quirky characters in a richly detailed desert landscape.',NULL,99.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('881f9289-ebd3-4c9c-b559-395d7b94293f','2026-07-09 11:03:15.649218','2026-07-09 11:03:15.649218',NULL,'Pokemon Pokopia - Nintendo Switch 2','pokemon-pokopia-nintendo-switch-2','0045496313890-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Step into a vibrant new frontier with Pokémon™ Pokopia – Nintendo Switch™ 2 Edition. Designed from the ground up to utilize the advanced architecture of the Nintendo Switch 2, Pokémon Pokopia offers a seamless, expansive open-world experience where the bond between Trainer and Pokémon reaches new, cinematic heights. Next-Generation Visuals: Explore the lush landscapes of Pokopia in native 4K resolution when docked. Witness Pokémon in stunning detail with realistic fur, scales, and feathers, all brought to life with dynamic weather systems and enhanced lighting. Seamless Open World: Experience the region without limits. The Switch 2\'s ultra-fast processing power eliminates loading screens between towns and the wild, allowing for a truly fluid journey across diverse biomes. Advanced Battle Mechanics: Engage in tactical Pokémon battles featuring fluid animations and cinematic camera angles. The increased power of the Switch 2 allows for large-scale, real-time battle effects that make every move feel impactful. Living Ecosystems: Observe Pokémon behaving naturally in their habitats. Watch herds migrate, predators hunt, and nocturnal Pokémon emerge at night, all rendered with an increased draw distance that makes the world feel endless. New Regional Forms & Discoveries: Uncover the secrets of the Pokopia region, including never-before-seen Pokémon and unique regional variants that have adapted to the island\'s mystical energy. Integrated Online Play: Connect with Trainers worldwide in the enhanced Pokopia Hub. Trade, battle, and participate in massive Tera-style Raids with improved stability and faster matchmaking.',NULL,299.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0