('898611e9-87a7-461b-ae2f-de941dc25324','2026-07-09 11:11:33.217263','2026-07-09 11:11:33.217263',NULL,'Tekken 8 Standard Edition','tekken-8-standard-edition','p-3391892029963-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescriptionPlatform: PlayStation 5, Xbox Series X|S, and PCResolution: 4K UHD with HDR supportFrame Rate: 60fps for smooth and responsive combatAudio: 3D spatial audio support for immersive soundscapes during battlesTekken 8 Standard EditionTekken 8 Standard Edition is the latest addition to the iconic Tekken series, delivering next-gen fighting mechanics, breathtaking visuals, and intense one-on-one combat action. Featuring a roster of beloved characters and newcomers, Tekken 8 continues the story of the Mishima feud with more dynamic gameplay and enhanced graphics powered by Unreal Engine 5. This edition offers all core gameplay elements, story mode, and multiplayer modes, perfect for both competitive players and fans of the classic series. Key FeaturesNext-Gen Graphics: Built with Unreal Engine 5, Tekken 8 showcases highly detailed character models, fluid animations, and realistic environments, bringing the heat of battle to life.Dynamic Fighting Mechanics: Includes the new Heat System, a special gameplay mechanic that enhances characters’ unique abilities and powers during battle, adding new layers to the fighting experience.Expansive Roster: Features classic characters like Jin Kazama, Kazuya Mishima, and Paul Phoenix, along with new fighters, each with distinct fighting styles.Story Mode: Continuation of the Mishima saga with cinematic storytelling and immersive gameplay, allowing players to experience the next chapter in the legendary rivalry.Multiplayer Modes: Online ranked matches, tournaments, and casual lobbies offer an expansive multiplayer experience, with rollback netcode for smoother online play.',NULL,189.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
