('8d6e2669-1d12-46c9-b595-4c387efd998d','2026-07-09 11:08:53.699362','2026-07-09 11:08:53.699362',NULL,'SADES Cpower Gaming Headset','sades-cpower-gaming-headset','6956766908156-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'8f5c8927-be48-41c7-9c7a-c40f59f564c2',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','The SADES C-Power Gaming Headset is a multi-platform headset weighing in at only 200 grams, swivel-to-mute Mic for easy operation, and an adjustable headband with comfortable earmuffs for long gaming sessions. SWIVEL-TO-MUTE MICROPHONE Toggle mute on/off by simply flipping the microphone up and down vertically on the headset. 40MM DRIVERS FOR AUDIO PRECISION Powered by 40mm speakers, the stereo sound delivers the full audioscape of your favorite games. COMFORTABLE TO WEAR The C-Power’s 9-segment adjustable headband and oval PU leather earmuffs suits for all head sizes. SUPER LIGHTWEIGHT HEADSET AT 200 GRAMS C-Power is designed for less pressure on the head which allows for comfortable long gaming hours. MULTI PLATFORM HEADSET C-Power is designed for PS4 Pro & PS4 controllers with a 3.5mm jack and also compatible with Xbox One & Xbox One S, Nintendo Switch, and mobile & VR devices. The conversion cable with dual 3.5mm audio & mic jacks is for connecting to PC. Specification: SPEAKER Loudhailer diameter: 40mm Sensitivity: 98 ± 3 dB at 1 kHz Frequency response: 20~20,000 Hz Impedance: 32 Ω at 1 kHz Handling power capacity: 15 mW MICROPHONE Mic sensitivity: –46 ± 3 dB at 1 kHz Mic frequency response: 50–10kHz Mic impedance: ≤ 1.8 KΩ at 1 kHz Mic directivity: omnidirectional Cable length: 1.2 m/ 4.92 ft WEIGHT/ BOX SIZE Weight (Headset only): 200g/ 0.44 lb Weight (Headset & Package): 400g/ 0.88 lb Box Size: 18598210mm/ 7.283.868.27 in PACKAGE CONTENT SADES Headset User Manual Guarantee Card SADES Sticker CONNECTION Input Plug : 3.5mm Plug Cable Length : 1.2 m',NULL,139.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
