('8d746c96-7606-4256-944c-0413a48340e1','2026-07-09 11:01:49.447736','2026-07-09 11:01:49.447736',NULL,'Tony Hawk\'s Pro Skater 1 + 2 Collector\'s Edition - PS4','tony-hawk-s-pro-skater-1-2-collector-s-edition-ps4','5030917291463-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Drop into the most iconic skateboarding games ever made with Tony Hawk\'s Pro Skater 1 + 2 Collector\'s Edition for PS4. This remastered collection brings together the original Tony Hawk\'s Pro Skater and Tony Hawk\'s Pro Skater 2, faithfully rebuilt with stunning HD visuals while preserving the fast-paced gameplay, legendary soundtrack, iconic tricks, and unforgettable skate parks that made the franchise a global phenomenon. Skate as the legendary Tony Hawk and a roster of professional skateboarders, perform jaw-dropping combos, complete challenges, and master classic locations from the original games. Featuring enhanced graphics, updated controls, Create-A-Park, Create-A-Skater, local multiplayer, and online multiplayer modes, the game delivers the ultimate skateboarding experience for both new and returning players. The Collector\'s Edition is designed for dedicated fans and collectors, offering a premium version of one of the most celebrated skateboarding franchises in gaming history.',NULL,199.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
