('8de3ef4c-b742-4fc3-a9e4-5d0add67a1c3','2026-07-09 10:55:06.878812','2026-07-09 10:55:06.878812',NULL,'Pop! Animation: One Piece - Jewelry Bonney W/Chase','pop-animation-one-piece-jewelry-bonney-w-chase','889698905626-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'f98bbd67-0b4f-473a-9b36-8d4e6c4d60c2',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Bring one of the most intriguing members of the Worst Generation into your collection with the Funko Pop! Animation: One Piece – Jewelry Bonney Vinyl Figure. Inspired by the globally popular One Piece anime series, this officially licensed collectible showcases Jewelry Bonney in Funko\'s signature Pop! style. Known for her bold personality and unique abilities, Jewelry Bonney has become a fan-favorite character among One Piece enthusiasts. This detailed vinyl figure captures her distinctive appearance, making it an excellent addition to any anime or Funko display. Collectors also have the exciting opportunity to receive a rare Chase Variant. Chase figures are randomly inserted in limited quantities and feature an alternate design, making them highly desirable among Funko collectors.',NULL,75.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
