('8f11c8f6-12b2-452e-aedd-26b7d536849a','2026-07-09 11:11:17.353980','2026-07-09 11:11:17.353980',NULL,'ASTRO BOT - PS5','ps5-astrobot-uae','711719592181-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescriptionPlatform: PlayStation 5Resolution: Native 4K with HDR supportFrame Rate: 60fps for smooth gameplayAudio: 3D spatial audio powered by the PS5’s Tempest EngineController Support: Full integration with the DualSense controller for an unparalleled tactile experience ASTRO BOT (PS5) Astro Bot, the beloved mascot of PlayStation, returns on the PS5 in a brand-new adventure designed to take full advantage of the console’s next-gen hardware. This action-packed platformer delivers a whimsical and immersive experience with innovative gameplay, breathtaking visuals, and charming characters. Whether you\'re exploring vibrant worlds, solving creative puzzles, or engaging in thrilling platforming challenges, Astro Bot showcases the true potential of the PS5. Key FeaturesImmersive Platforming: Navigate imaginative worlds filled with unique challenges, collectibles, and surprises, with gameplay that blends action, exploration, and puzzles.DualSense Integration: Experience tactile feedback, adaptive triggers, and 3D audio that bring every action and environment to life. Feel every jump, step, and interaction like never before.Next-Gen Graphics: Stunning 4K visuals with HDR and a buttery-smooth 60fps ensure a vibrant and fluid experience.Innovative Gameplay: Utilize creative mechanics that take advantage of the PS5\'s features, such as motion controls, haptics, and microphone interaction.Charming Characters: Join Astro and his friends in a heartwarming adventure that appeals to players of all ages.Dynamic Levels: Each world offers distinct themes, obstacles, and boss battles, ensuring every stage feels fresh and exciting.',NULL,239.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
