('8f18039d-083d-4d97-8699-76f9c8537f82','2026-07-09 11:12:25.251394','2026-07-09 11:12:25.251394',NULL,'Atomic Heart: Ultimate Edition - PS5','atomic-heart-ultimate-edition-ps5','3512899969919-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','The Atomic Heart Ultimate Edition delivers the complete and definitive experience of the award-winning action RPG Atomic Heart, including the base game and all major expansions in one package. Step into a bold retro-futuristic vision of an alternate history where technological advancement has spiraled out of control. In Facility 3826, once a symbol of perfection and scientific achievement, machines and mutant creations have turned against humanity. As Major P-3, you are sent into this chaotic world to uncover the truth behind the catastrophe. Along the way, encounter unforgettable characters such as the robotic ballerina Twins, the mysterious Granny Zina, and the AI-powered repair system NORA. Harness experimental polymer abilities and a powerful arsenal of futuristic weapons to survive fast-paced, visceral combat against deadly mechanical enemies and bio-engineered threats. The Ultimate Edition expands the experience beyond the main storyline with four additional narrative DLC chapters, introducing new locations, enemies, and bosses. Travel through the shifting dangers of the Mendeleev Complex, escape the surreal world of Limbo, uncover secrets beneath the Neptune Research Center, and face the explosive finale in the Crystal Complex. These expansions set the stage for the future of the Atomic Heart universe, including The CUBE and Atomic Heart 2. Included in the Ultimate Edition • Full Atomic Heart base game• Atomic Pass (all major story expansions)• 4 additional story DLC chapters• Golden Age weapon skin pack• Labor & Science weapon skin pack• All 5 Gold weapon and glove skins• Digital Artbook Key Features • Complete edition with all story content and DLC expansions• Explosive first-person combat with advanced abilities and futuristic weapons• Explore a twisted retro-futuristic world of science and horror• Fight unique bosses and mutated mechanical enemies• Upgrade weapons, abilities, and equipment for deeper combat strategy• Includes exclusive skins and digital bonus content• Rich narrative expansion continuing beyond the main game',NULL,169.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('8f37b2b5-91db-4bfa-8652-dda2c7a9be00','2026-07-09 11:08:07.805076','2026-07-09 11:08:07.805076',NULL,'Baten Kaitos I & II HD Remaster - Nintendo Switch','baten-kaitos-i-ii-hd-remaster','3391892024944-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','A long time ago, there was a great conflict between the evil god and the people. After a fierce battle, the people managed to seal off the evil god, but what was left behind was a desolate land. The people thus chose to abandon the land and live in the sky. Such fairy tales were passed down as legends. At this time, people had wings called Wings of the Heart and lived a peaceful life. It was an era of long-lasting tranquility… But the collapse had quietly already begun. When a young man calls upon the Guardian Spirt, the story begins to unfold. A story set on a floating continent in the sky, where thoughts and prayers intersect. In the world of \"Baten Kaitos,\" equipment, weapon, magic, items etc… possess “Magna Essence” that can be sealed on cards and return to their original form when needed. Those cards are called \"Magnus” and are completely unique to these games. Each character has their own deck of “Magnus” cards which they can select to attack or heal. The attack power is determined by the attributes and the combination of the cards which are randomly dealt from the deck.',NULL,199.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
