('90b1a6e4-17f0-44b4-8324-c90dbbc77829','2026-07-09 11:06:23.951083','2026-07-09 11:06:23.951083',NULL,'Kirby Air Riders - Nintendo Switch 2','kirby-air-riders-nintendo-switch-2','045496313487-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Take to the skies and tracks of Dream Land in Kirby Air Riders, a high-speed blend of frantic racing and action-packed arena battles! This modern version of the Nintendo GameCube classic delivers accessible controls, deep multiplayer chaos, and all the charm of the Kirby universe. Key Features:Easy to Play, Hard to Master: Use the Boost Charge system to effortlessly glide, drift, and control your speed. Mastering the art of the Boost Charge is the key to victory in both races and battles. Pick Your Rider & Machine: Play as Kirby, Meta Knight, King Dedede, Magolor, and more! Choose from iconic machines like the Warp Star, Wheelie Bike, and Chariot, each offering unique stats and handling. Unleash Copy Abilities: Steal powers from your foes mid-race or battle to gain an immediate, powerful advantage—a signature Kirby twist to the competition. Chaotic City Trial Mode: This expanded mode is a free-for-all for up to 16 players online (or 8 locally). Zip around the massive city of Skyah collecting power-ups and machines, dodging unpredictable Field Events like meteor showers, before facing off in a random Stadium showdown. Classic Air Ride Racing: Compete in straightforward, high-speed races against up to six riders across various vibrant courses, using slipstreams and boosts to fly past rivals to the finish line. Get ready to boost, battle, and steal your way to victory in the ultimate, fast-paced vehicle action game on Nintendo Switch 2!',NULL,299.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('90b7ec42-e9b4-4c6b-bb0a-33c9ae773a2f','2026-07-09 11:16:46.275549','2026-07-09 11:16:46.275549',NULL,'Battle Chasers: Nightwar - PS4','ps4-battle-chasers-nightwar-r2','9006113009207-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Battle Chasers: Nightwar is an American made JPRG and dungeon-crawler, based on the best-selling Battle Chasers comic series by Joe Maduriera and inspired by JPRG greats such as Final Fantasy, Suikoden, Chrono Trigger, and Phantasy Star. It was developed by Airship Syndicate, funded through Kickstarter and published by THQ Nordic. The game features beautiful environments; a gorgeously animated strategic turn-based combat system; and hand-crafted dungeon rooms which are randomly arranged for a different experience each time. Players will battle enemies, find secrets, solve puzzles and explore the world.',NULL,29.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('90b7f2a8-2c04-47f2-ad1c-ad92b56a4446','2026-07-09 11:07:13.764637','2026-07-09 11:07:13.764637',NULL,'SW The Legend of Zelda: Breath of the Wild','sw-the-legend-of-zelda-brea-16667848336557','45496590420-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','DLC pack 2 cannot be purchased outside of the expansion pass. The Champion\'s Ballad. Following the guidance of an unseen voice, Link encounters a new test: the Divine Beast Tamer\'s Trial. Take hold of the One-Hit Obliterator to clear out monster encampments, discover new shrines, conquer a huge dungeon and more. Overcoming all these obstacles will earn you the power to call upon the Master Cycle Zero. Additionally, help the travelling bard Kass complete an unfinished song left behind by his mentor. Better still, Kass is also inspired to write some verses of his own, revealing scenes from the Champions\' and Princess Zelda\'s past that even Link never knew of. And what exactly could Kass\'s mentor\'s song be...? Nine hidden items for you to find. The following items, which pay tribute to The Legend of Zelda series, can now be found scattered across Hyrule: Island Lobster Shirt, Ravio\'s Hood, Zant\'s Helmet, Phantom Ganon Skull, Phantom Ganon Armor and Phantom Ganon Greaves. You can also find the Royal Guard Cap, Royal Guard Uniform and Royal Guard Boots, which were once worn by Hyrule\'s royal guards. Ancient Horse Gear. The Ancient Bridle, which increases the spurs available when riding the equipped horse, and the Ancient Saddle, which lets you summon the equipped horse wherever it is, are hidden in treasure chests somewhere in Hyrule, waiting to be found.',NULL,199.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
