('9403be2a-07f9-4ccf-8583-0c89622ab4e7','2026-07-09 11:01:53.092962','2026-07-09 11:01:53.092962',NULL,'XIGMATEK PRO Gaming PC - INTEL i9 14900K, ASUS RTX 5080 16GB, PNY 32GB DDR5 6000MHz, 2TB M.2 SSD, ASUS Z790-P PRIME','xigmatek-pro-gaming-pc-intel-i9-14900k-asus-rtx-5080-16gb-pny-32gb-ddr5-6000mhz-2tb-m-2-ssd-asus-z790-p-prime','TDM-PC14',NULL,'simple',NULL,'3155269b-8d2e-4303-ba21-b03ba2ef8437',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Ultimate Gaming PC | Intel i9-14900K | RTX 5080 (16GB) | 32GB DDR5 | 2TB SSD : Experience ultimate next-generation performance. This premium, fully assembled gaming desktop combines the massive processing power of the Intel i9-14900K with the groundbreaking ASUS TUF RTX 5080. Engineered for flawless 4K gaming, seamless streaming, and intensive content creation, it features a stunning panoramic dual-glass chassis and an advanced LCD liquid cooling system for a premium aesthetic and elite thermal performance.Technical SpecificationsProcessor – Intel Core i9-14900K At the heart of this system is the Intel Core i9-14900K, Intel\'s flagship 14th Generation desktop processor. Featuring a hybrid architecture with Performance-cores and Efficient-cores, it delivers exceptional gaming performance, smooth multitasking, and powerful productivity capabilities. Whether you\'re gaming, streaming, editing videos, or running demanding applications, the i9-14900K provides the processing power needed for enthusiast-level workloads.Graphics Card – ASUS TUF Gaming GeForce RTX 5080 OC 16GB GDDR7 Experience next-generation graphics performance with the ASUS TUF Gaming GeForce RTX 5080 OC Edition. Equipped with 16GB of ultra-fast GDDR7 memory, this graphics card is built for high-refresh-rate gaming, advanced ray tracing, AI-enhanced rendering, and immersive visual experiences. The TUF Gaming design features military-grade components, robust cooling, and factory overclocking for reliable performance under demanding gaming sessions.Motherboard – ASUS PRIME Z790-P WiFi The ASUS PRIME Z790-P WiFi motherboard provides a reliable foundation for this high-performance gaming system. Built for Intel LGA 1700 processors, it supports DDR5 memory, high-speed storage, advanced connectivity options, and integrated WiFi. Its premium power delivery and cooling design ensure stable operation for gaming, content creation, and everyday computing.Memory – PNY XLR8 Gaming 32GB DDR5 6000MHz The system is equipped with 32GB (2x16GB) of PNY XLR8 Gaming DDR5 memory running at 6000MHz, delivering exceptional responsiveness and multitasking performance. DDR5 technology provides increased bandwidth and improved efficiency, helping modern games and professional applications run smoothly while leaving plenty of headroom for streaming and content creation.Storage – TEAMGROUP MP33 PRO 2TB SSD Store your games, applications, and media library on the TEAMGROUP MP33 PRO 2TB SSD. Offering fast NVMe performance and generous storage capacity, this drive reduces loading times, accelerates system responsiveness, and provides ample room for large game installations and productivity software.CPU Cooling – ASUS TUF Gaming LC III 360 LCD ARGB Keeping the processor running at optimal temperatures is the ASUS TUF Gaming LC III 360 LCD ARGB All-In-One Liquid Cooler. Featuring a large 360mm radiator, efficient cooling performance, customizable ARGB lighting, and an integrated LCD display, it helps maintain system stability during demanding workloads while enhancing the overall aesthetics of the build.Power Supply – SilverStone Strider 850W The SilverStone Strider 850W Power Supply delivers dependable power to every component in the system. Designed for modern gaming hardware, it provides stable power delivery and sufficient capacity to support high-performance processors and graphics cards while maintaining reliable operation during intensive gaming and productivity sessions.Case – Xigmatek Vision Pro Black All components are housed inside the stylish Xigmatek Vision Pro Black chassis. Designed with a modern panoramic appearance, excellent airflow, and ample interior space, the case showcases the premium hardware while helping maintain efficient cooling performance. Its clean design makes it an excellent centerpiece for any gaming setup.',NULL,12999.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
