('94f22e63-aaec-4aed-a791-6af0a5149f75','2026-07-09 10:42:56.498197','2026-07-09 10:42:56.498197',NULL,'Seagate 1TB FireCuda Gaming External Hard Drive','seagate-gaming-firecuda-gaming-hard-drive-1tb','3660619041336-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'2f4818b1-ebde-4ac3-adb1-5c4f62d01e42',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Immerse Yourself in the Action FireCuda Gaming Hard Drive and the FireCuda Gaming Hub are ready to bring added depth to your battlestation. Watch the FireCuda Gaming Drives in action below. Big Capacity, Bold Design Plug in and light up with the FireCuda Gaming Hard Drive. Created with up to 5 TB of capacity and a sleek, bold design — this gaming hard drive can hold all your titles and compliment the look of your battlestation. And bring an extra layer of atmosphere to gaming sessions with customizable RGB LED lighting. Gaming in a New Light FireCuda gaming drives upgrade your whole gaming atmosphere with customizable RGB LED lighting and a sleek new design. One Battlestation, Customized Your Way Explore the full, customizable RGB color and pattern control that\'s at your fingertips—you can even sync up all your FireCuda RGB products with help from the free Seagate Toolkit software. Plus, the FireCuda Gaming Hub and FireCuda Gaming Hard Drive work with Razer Chroma™ RGB, so you can sync all your Chroma-enabled peripherals and dive deep into your gaming. Vault Built with big capacities, FireCuda Gaming Hard Drive (up to 5TB) and FireCuda Gaming Hub (up to 16TB) give you the space to build up your library of games, applications, and media without fear of limits. Go Gaming Go USB 3.2 bus-powered and a lightweight design gives the Gaming Hard Drive easy plug and play functionality—grab it and take it to take to a friend’s place.',NULL,289.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('94fd1e93-9215-4fe9-b54b-b95ffb1b8f8b','2026-07-09 10:54:14.915376','2026-07-09 10:54:14.915376',NULL,'Pop! Football: England - John Stones','pop-football-england-john-stones','889698944625-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'f98bbd67-0b4f-473a-9b36-8d4e6c4d60c2',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Celebrate defensive excellence with the Pop! Football: England – John Stones collectible figure. This Funko Pop! features John Stones representing England national football team in the iconic stylized vinyl design. A strong addition for football and Pop! Sports collectors.',NULL,75.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('951e7776-2d55-4d29-841d-031ed7a76a27','2026-07-09 11:07:59.008936','2026-07-09 11:07:59.008936',NULL,'Jujutsu Kaisen Cursed Clash','jujutsu-kaisen-cursed-clash','p-3391892025651-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescriptionPlatform: PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Xbox Series X|S, Nintendo Switch, and PCResolution: 1080p and 4K (platform-dependent)Frame Rate: 60fps for smooth, responsive combatAudio: Japanese and English voiceovers with immersive sound effects, music, and iconic soundtrack elements from the anime series Jujutsu Kaisen: Cursed Clash Jujutsu Kaisen: Cursed Clash is an action-packed, 2v2 fighting game based on the popular anime and manga series Jujutsu Kaisen. Dive into the world of Jujutsu Sorcery and cursed energy, where you can play as iconic characters like Yuji Itadori, Megumi Fushiguro, Nobara Kugisaki, and Satoru Gojo. The game combines fast-paced combat with immersive visuals and signature moves from the series, delivering an experience that fans and fighting game enthusiasts alike will enjoy. Key Features2v2 Combat: Engage in dynamic, team-based 2v2 battles with the ability to switch between characters during combat. Players can team up with friends or AI to create powerful synergy with unique combos and strategies.Authentic Jujutsu Techniques: Each character has unique Jujutsu techniques and special moves inspired directly by the anime and manga. These abilities include Yuji’s Divergent Fist, Nobara’s Straw Doll Technique, and Gojo’s powerful Cursed Techniques.Story Mode: Relive the Jujutsu Kaisen storyline, experiencing key battles and events from the anime. Players can progress through a series of missions that introduce them to characters, curses, and the challenges of Jujutsu Sorcery.Team Synergy: The game encourages players to pair characters for team synergy. Certain character combinations offer bonuses and unique interactions that make each battle strategic as well as action-packed.High-Quality Anime Graphics: The game features cel-shaded, anime-inspired graphics that bring the Jujutsu Kaisen universe to life, capturing the intensity and energy of the source material.Multiplayer Modes: Online multiplayer modes include ranked and casual matches, allowing players to test their skills against others around the world or practice combos and techniques in casual play.',NULL,219.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
