('95b136b8-919e-4abf-925e-494af21ff8a5','2026-07-09 11:02:54.506104','2026-07-09 11:02:54.506104',NULL,'Castlevania: Belmont\'s Curse Midnight Edition with Steelbook and Tarot Card (ZGames Exclusive)','castlevania-belmont-s-curse','p-4012927152164-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Physical early purchase items incentives Exclusive additional physical items on purchase of the Midnight Edition. Castlevania: Belmont’s Curse SteelBook® Exclusive new SteelBook® celebrating the release of Castlevania: Belmont’s Curse Midnight Edition.Tarot Card Premium printed tarot card of Rose Belmont, featuring exclusive art by illustrator and manga artist Katsuya Terada.Game Summary: Set 23 years after Castlevania III: Dracula\'s Curse, follow Rose Belmont\'s monster-hunting journey in an all new 2D Action-Exploration title from KONAMI, Evil Empire and Motion Twin.Description 1499, Paris, a city attacked by monstrous creatures suddenly emerge from the shadows.Armed with the legendary holy whip, the Vampire Killer, Rose and her father Trevor Belmont venture into the streets and the looming castle to hunt down the beasts.Can they save the city from the brink of destruction? Satisfying whip action The iconic whip of the series is now more important than ever!Crack your whip to move around freely like a trapeze artist!Master the whip mechanics and be creative to pounce on your prey like a wolf in fast-paced combat! A large selection of weapons and abilities The whip is not the only tool at your disposal. You will need to strategically plan your next move in combat and make full use of all the weapons and abilities to stand a chance! Environmental hazards that will make you grit your teeth, biomes are packed with secrets, traps and puzzles: it is not just about muscles, it\'s about brains too! A new art style Expanding further the series-classic gothic style, this unique colorful art style will let you discover the world of Castlevania like never before. Beloved elements of Castlevania make their return True to the roots of the series, you will encounter colorful characters and powerful foes, stumble upon many secret chambers, dig up numerous hidden items, and whip your way through challenging areas!',NULL,199.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
