('96a0a9dc-ef28-402d-821c-ef7d06501f13','2026-07-09 11:11:12.258050','2026-07-09 11:11:12.258050',NULL,'Killer Klowns from Outer Space: The Game','killer-klowns-from-outer-spa-17289944675801','p-811949038562-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescription Platform: PlayStation 5, PlayStation 4, Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One, PCGenre: Asymmetrical Multiplayer, Horror, ActionGameplay Modes:Online Multiplayer (3v7 format)Resolution: Up to 4K UHD (on supported platforms)Frame Rate: 60fpsKiller Klowns from Outer Space: The GameStep into the zany, terrifying world of cult-classic horror with Killer Klowns from Outer Space: The Game. This asymmetrical multiplayer experience pits players against each other in an epic showdown between invading alien Klowns and humans fighting for survival. Based on the 1988 movie, the game combines campy horror with strategic gameplay, offering a mix of over-the-top action, eerie humor, and nostalgic charm. Choose your side—Klown or human—and decide the fate of Crescent Cove! Key Features: Play as the Klowns: Take control of one of the iconic alien Klowns, each with unique powers, weapons, and abilities to trap and eliminate humans.Survive as a Human: Gather resources, rescue civilians, and outwit the Klowns to escape Crescent Cove alive.Dynamic Multiplayer: Engage in 3v7 matches where strategy and teamwork are key for both humans and Klowns.Iconic Locations: Explore detailed maps based on the film, including the amusement park and spaceship circus tent.Customization Options: Unlock cosmetics to personalize your characters.Faithful Adaptation: Captures the aesthetic, humor, and eerie vibe of the original film, with Easter eggs for fans to discover.',NULL,129.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
