('9789f40f-1b64-4e25-aec2-a7f2f84388fc','2026-07-09 11:18:23.920223','2026-07-09 11:18:23.920223',NULL,'FIFA 20 - XBOX One','xbx-one-fifa-20-nmc-ara','5035223123651-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Powered by Frostbite™, EA SPORTS™ FIFA 20 for PC brings two sides of The World’s Game to life - the prestige of the professional stage and an all-new, authentic street football experience in EA SPORTS VOLTA. FIFA 20 innovates across the game, FOOTBALL INTELLIGENCE unlocks an unprecedented platform for gameplay realism, FIFA Ultimate Team™ offers more ways to build your dream squad and EA SPORTS VOLTA returns the game to the street with an authentic form of small-sided football.',NULL,29.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('979eb1ff-6180-4ba7-ad7b-06b6bf1eeb53','2026-07-09 11:11:37.173878','2026-07-09 11:11:37.173878',NULL,'Evil Dead: The Game - PS5','ps5-evil-dead-the-game','5060760886189-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescriptionPlatform: PlayStation 5Genre: Action, Horror, MultiplayerGame Modes: Single-player, Online Co-op, PvP MultiplayerResolution: 4K UHD with HDR supportFrameRate: 60fps for smooth and responsive gameplayAudio: 3D Audio support for immersive soundscapes Evil Dead: The Game - PS5Step into the world of cult horror with Evil Dead: The Game, a thrilling co-op and PvP action experience inspired by the legendary Evil Dead franchise. Play as iconic characters like Ash Williams and others from the movies and TV series as you battle Deadites, close the breach between worlds, and survive the night. Team up with friends in co-op missions or face them in intense asymmetric multiplayer battles, where one player controls the Kandarian Demon to hunt down survivors. Featuring dynamic combat, gruesome visuals, and a dose of dark humor, this game is a must-play for horror fans. Key Features: Iconic Characters: Play as Ash, Kelly, Pablo, and more from the Evil Dead universe, each with unique abilities and weapons.Asymmetric Multiplayer: Work together as survivors or take control of the powerful Kandarian Demon to stalk and destroy your enemies.Authentic Experience: Fully voiced characters and settings inspired by Evil Dead films and series, including iconic locations like the Knowby Cabin.Brutal Combat: Wield chainsaws, boomsticks, and other weapons to decimate Deadites in visceral, over-the-top action.Solo and Co-op Modes: Play with or against others online or dive into AI-driven missions for a solo horror adventure.',NULL,169.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
