('9a098535-5c7e-40ef-8c0a-dd2a0595de98','2026-07-09 11:01:37.571381','2026-07-09 11:01:37.571381',NULL,'Magic: The Gathering – Marvel Super Heroes Play Booster Box (30 Packs)','magic-the-gathering-marvel-super-heroes-play-booster-box-30-packs','195166313597-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'3155269b-8d2e-4303-ba21-b03ba2ef8437',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Magic: The Gathering – Marvel Super Heroes Play Booster Box (30 Packs) Experience the worlds of Marvel through Magic: The Gathering with the Marvel Super Heroes Play Booster Box. Play Boosters are designed to offer an exciting experience for both Limited play and opening packs just for fun. Whether you\'re building your next deck, drafting with friends, or adding new cards to your collection, each pack delivers a mix of gameplay and collectability. The Marvel Super Heroes Play Booster Box contains 30 Play Booster packs, giving players and collectors plenty of opportunities to discover iconic cards inspired by Marvel\'s legendary heroes and characters. Box Contents • 30 Magic: The Gathering – Marvel Super Heroes Play Booster packs• Ideal for Draft, Sealed, and casual play• Great for collectors and Magic: The Gathering fans',NULL,870.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('9a13b6aa-abae-4b4b-9115-3108c9386269','2026-07-09 11:06:29.734424','2026-07-09 11:06:29.734424',NULL,'Lumo 2 Collector\'s Edition - Nintendo Switch (ZGames Exclusive)','lumo-2-collector-edition-nintendo-switch','5060997483571-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','The Lumo 2 Collector’s Edition comes with a nostalgic bundle of goodies: a cassette featuring the game’s original soundtrack, a classic slide puzzle, an A3-sized poster, and a collectible badge, all housed in a retro-inspired box. Press play and journey back to the golden age of British gaming from the ‘80s and ‘90s, brought to life through a heartfelt homage to that iconic era. Don your adventurer’s hat, ignite your magical staff, and dive into a richly detailed world filled with shifting environments and cleverly interconnected chambers. Each space is crafted as a challenging puzzle, brimming with hazards, precision-based jumps, and hidden surprises. Track down secrets, gather collectibles, and leap through dimensional portals that introduce unexpected genre twists to keep the experience fresh and thrilling.',NULL,249.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('9a239923-5ab7-420a-9d9b-127a34c655f9','2026-07-09 11:12:45.044647','2026-07-09 11:12:45.044647',NULL,'EA Sports WRC 23 - PS5','ea-sports-wrc-23','5030947125271-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescriptionPlatform: PlayStation 5Genre: Racing, SimulationGame Modes: Single-player, Online Multiplayer, Co-opResolution: 4K UHD with HDR supportFrame Rate: 60fps for smooth performanceAudio: 3D Audio support for a realistic, immersive experienceEA Sports WRC 23 - PS5EA Sports WRC 23 delivers an authentic, high-octane rally racing experience that pushes the limits of racing simulation. With official licenses from the FIA World Rally Championship, the game features all the teams, cars, and tracks from the 2023 season, including iconic locations and legendary rally cars. Developed with cutting-edge technology and enhanced for PlayStation 5, WRC 23 provides breathtaking graphics, realistic physics, and immersive gameplay that transports players directly into the heart of rally racing. Whether you’re tackling winding forest roads, gravel tracks, or snow-covered mountains, the game offers unparalleled realism, dynamic weather conditions, and a deep career mode that lets you rise through the ranks of the rally world. Key Features: Official WRC Content: Race with all official teams, drivers, and cars from the 2023 FIA World Rally Championship season.Realistic Physics and Driving Dynamics: Experience authentic rally car handling and responsive physics for a true-to-life driving experience.Immersive Environments: Stunning visuals with dynamic weather and day-night cycles that affect gameplay. Race through iconic tracks and locations around the world.Enhanced for PS5: Optimized for PlayStation 5, featuring improved graphics, faster load times, and smooth 60fps gameplay.Career Mode: Build your career from the ground up, managing your team, upgrading your car, and competing in multiple championships.Multiplayer and Online Modes: Compete in online races and events against other players, with leaderboards, weekly challenges, and custom tournaments.Dynamic Weather: Face unpredictable weather conditions that impact traction, visibility, and car handling on every stage.Next-Gen Features: Haptic feedback and adaptive trigger support on the DualSense controller provide a tactile, immersive racing experience.',NULL,139.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
