('9b67d3db-e590-486f-b1bb-bb2c6d696334','2026-07-09 10:56:33.339634','2026-07-09 10:56:33.339634',NULL,'Banpresto One Piece World Collectable - Special Monkey D. Luffy','banpresto-one-piece-world-collectable-special-monkey-d-luffy','4573102696526-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'f98bbd67-0b4f-473a-9b36-8d4e6c4d60c2',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Add a legendary pirate to your collection with the Banpresto One Piece World Collectable Figure – Special Monkey D. Luffy. Part of the popular World Collectable Figure (WCF) series, this figure showcases Luffy in a compact, stylized design while maintaining impressive detail and character accuracy. Known for its small size and high-quality craftsmanship, the WCF series is perfect for collectors who enjoy building themed displays. This special edition version of Monkey D. Luffy captures his iconic look and adventurous spirit, making it a must-have for fans of One Piece. With its collectible scale and detailed sculpt, this figure is ideal for display on desks, shelves, or alongside other WCF figures to complete your One Piece lineup.',NULL,159.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
