('9b81d43f-854b-41e9-99ba-753a530650ba','2026-07-09 11:06:47.680389','2026-07-09 11:06:47.680389',NULL,'Darkest Dungeon 2','darkest-dungeon-2','p-811949037978-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'8f5c8927-be48-41c7-9c7a-c40f59f564c2',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescriptionResolution: 1080p, 4K support (depending on platform)Frame Rate: Target 60fps for smooth combat experienceAudio: Full orchestral score with a dynamic audio system to enhance the grim atmosphereGame Type: Tactical RPG, Roguelike, Turn-based combatDarkest Dungeon 2 Darkest Dungeon 2 is the highly anticipated sequel to the critically acclaimed Darkest Dungeon, continuing the dark, gothic narrative and strategic turn-based combat that made the original game a cult favorite. Set in a new world where you lead a group of doomed heroes on a journey through a dark and dangerous landscape, Darkest Dungeon 2 features improved mechanics, a new art style, and a relentless psychological challenge. With an emphasis on risk, resource management, and the mental toll of the journey, Darkest Dungeon 2 offers a punishing yet rewarding experience for fans of tactical RPGs. Key FeaturesRoguelike Mechanics: Each journey is unique, with procedurally generated maps, events, and encounters, ensuring that no two runs are the same. The choices you make along the way will affect the outcome of the journey.Psychological Stress System: The game’s hallmark stress system returns, where your heroes’ mental stability plays a crucial role in their performance. Stress, fear, and despair can cripple even the strongest adventurers, and you must manage their sanity as much as their health.New Combat System: While maintaining the core turn-based strategy, Darkest Dungeon 2 introduces new combat mechanics, including upgraded abilities and more dynamic interactions between party members. Environmental factors also play a larger role in how battles unfold.Road to the End: Unlike the first game’s dungeon crawling, Darkest Dungeon 2 introduces a journey format where your group of adventurers must travel through dangerous lands, battling threats along the way. Along the road, you’ll make decisions, manage resources, and plan for each encounter, all while trying to keep your team alive.Hero Management: Recruit and develop a wide variety of heroes, each with distinct skills, strengths, and weaknesses. From the stalwart Crusader to the deadly Highwayman, each character brings unique tactical possibilities. You’ll need to balance your party composition, upgrade their skills, and deal with their personal struggles.Art and Presentation: The game features a striking 3D art style that retains the gothic, hand-drawn aesthetic that made the original game’s visuals iconic. The atmosphere is dark, haunting, and filled with despair, reinforcing the grim nature of your quest.Multiplayer Features: Darkest Dungeon 2 offers co-op multiplayer where players can team up, each controlling a member of the party in cooperative exploration and combat.',NULL,169.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
