('9c56e34b-ae85-498d-b569-6f580532cdf4','2026-07-09 11:08:32.816087','2026-07-09 11:08:32.816087',NULL,'Sony PlayStation 5 DualSense Wireless Controller - 30th Anniversary Special Edition','ps5-30th-anniv-spl-edt-duals-17285589933702','711719596677-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'8f5c8927-be48-41c7-9c7a-c40f59f564c2',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescriptionDesign: 30th Anniversary special edition in retro-inspired PlayStation grayButton Accents: Classic PS1 button colors (green, pink, blue, and red)Emblem: \"30th Anniversary\" engraved logo on the touchpadHaptic Feedback: Advanced haptic motors for immersive, responsive gameplayAdaptive Triggers: Adjustable trigger resistance to simulate in-game actionsBuilt-in Microphone and Speaker: Communicate effortlessly with teammatesTouchpad: Responsive, with a refined feel and textureBattery Life: Up to 10-12 hours of playtime on a single chargeCompatibility: PS5, PC (with limited feature support on PC)Special Edition Packaging: Unique collector’s box with 30th Anniversary brandingWireless Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.1 for fast, stable connectionsUSB-C Charging Port: Includes USB-C charging cableExtra FeaturesMotion Controls: Integrated gyroscope and accelerometer for motion-based gameplayEnhanced Comfort Grip: Redesigned textured grip for comfortable, extended gaming sessionsDual LEDs: LED lighting accents around the touchpad to indicate player status and system notificationsPS5 30th Anniversary Special Edition DualSense Controller Celebrating 30 years of PlayStation, this limited-edition DualSense controller is a stunning tribute to the gaming legacy that has defined generations. Styled with a unique blend of classic and contemporary design, it incorporates the iconic PlayStation gray color scheme from the original PS1 console, accentuated with vibrant PlayStation button colors. Featuring subtle, nostalgic details like the PlayStation logo and the \"30th Anniversary\" emblem, this controller brings both style and sentimentality to every gaming session. This DualSense retains the standard features that make it one of the most advanced controllers on the market, while adding an exclusive design that makes it a collector’s item for dedicated fans.',NULL,359.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
