('9fbaff0a-fc9b-4e82-a355-9a0ec3cbd253','2026-07-09 11:15:22.485078','2026-07-09 11:15:22.485078',NULL,'Mad Max - PS4','ps4-mad-max-16667840629523','5051892158992-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescriptionPlatform: PlayStation 4Genre: Action, Adventure, Open-WorldGame Modes: Single-playerResolution: 1080pFrame Rate: 30fpsAudio: Dolby Digital Mad Max - PS4Step into the chaotic, post-apocalyptic world of Mad Max for PS4, where survival is a brutal battle, and only the strongest will endure. Play as Max, a lone warrior with a haunted past, as you navigate the wasteland in search of redemption. Customize your vehicle, battle ruthless enemies, and engage in intense vehicular combat as you strive to survive in a world ravaged by violence and destruction. Key Features: Open-World Exploration: Roam the vast and dangerous wasteland, from barren deserts to hostile settlements, filled with hidden secrets and dangerous threats.Vehicular Combat: Take control of your customizable vehicle, the Magnum Opus, and engage in high-speed battles with marauding enemies.Dynamic Weather and Day/Night Cycle: Experience changing weather conditions and a shifting environment that adds to the challenge of survival.Intense Combat System: Engage in fast-paced hand-to-hand combat against enemies, using a variety of weapons, combos, and brutal takedowns.Customization: Upgrade Max\'s gear and vehicle, allowing for tailored combat strategies and a stronger chance of survival.Story-Driven Experience: Embark on a gripping narrative as Max, seeking revenge while confronting the horrors of the wasteland.Scavenging and Crafting: Gather resources from the environment to craft weapons, fuel, and vehicle upgrades, essential for staying alive in the harsh world.',NULL,89.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
