('9fee0447-32c0-411b-a1df-d5e1f3888273','2026-07-09 10:48:36.847522','2026-07-09 10:48:36.847522',NULL,'Funism Pokemon Vinyl Keychain - Morpeko','funism-pokemon-vinyl-keychain-morpeko','6971680455753-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'3155269b-8d2e-4303-ba21-b03ba2ef8437',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Bring home the uniquely expressive Morpeko with this Funism Pokémon Vinyl Keychain collectible. This officially licensed Pokémon accessory features Morpeko, known for its iconic dual personality: Full Belly Mode and Hangry Mode. Funism captures this transformation in a stylized vinyl keychain design, making it both playful and highly collectible. Made from durable PVC soft vinyl material, the keychain is lightweight yet sturdy, ideal for daily use on keys, backpacks, handbags, or zippers. The compact size ensures portability while still showcasing detailed character design and vibrant paintwork. Perfect for Pokémon fans who enjoy unique character designs, this Morpeko keychain blends functionality with collectible appeal.',NULL,19.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('a01ca5c2-0de9-4ff1-bbed-fc77ddd0b684','2026-07-09 10:47:11.066654','2026-07-09 10:47:11.066654',NULL,'MARVEL COMICS (SPIDER-MAN PANELS) COLOURED INNER MUG','marvel-comics-spider-man-panels-red','5050574273336-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'6c37856e-f0e1-41cc-baf4-c86092a4757a',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','A brand new Marvel Comics mug featuring Spider-Man. Comic style panels around the circumference showcasing Spider-Man in action. Fully licenced product. Presented in an attractive open fronted Marvel Comics gift box with matching artwork. Size approximately 8cm diameter x 10cm tall (3.25\"x4\").',NULL,45.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('a040265e-e0a6-4bc8-8df6-50d1bb7cf790','2026-07-09 11:16:57.654455','2026-07-09 11:16:57.654455',NULL,'Assassin\'s Creed Valhalla: Dawn of Ragnarök - PS4','ps4-assassins-creed-valhalla-dawn-of-ragnarok','3307216234500-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','In the most ambitious expansion in franchise history, Eivor must embrace their destiny as Odin, the Norse god of Battle and Wisdom. Unleash new divine powers as you embark on a desperate quest through a breathtaking world. Complete a legendary Viking saga and save your son in the face of the gods’ doom. Wield incredible, otherworldly powers. Absorb new abilities from those you’ve defeated and use them to slay all who stand in your way. Shape-shift into a raven for spectacular assassinations or resurrect your defeated foes to fight on your side. Transform your skin into magma to protect yourself, infuse your weapon with ice to unleash devastating strikes, and more. Faced with visions of a new threat, Eivor must embrace their destiny as Odin and enter the mythical dwarven realm of Svartalfheim, a beautiful but hostile world under invasion. From underground forges to soaring golden peaks, immerse yourself in a vast, perilous new world of Norse mythology as you embrace your fate as a Norse god. Face off against Jotnars, foes of ice from Jotunheim, and Muspels, new enemies of fire from Muspelheim. Battle a wide range of enemy archetypes, infiltrate their strongholds, and wield their own powers against them as you grow stronger. At the head of this army stands Surtr, an unkillable fire giant and the greatest enemy that Odin has ever faced. As Odin, embark on a desperate quest to rescue your son, Baldr, from imprisonment at the hands of an unspeakable foe. Use your wit and cunning to infiltrate hostile territory, gain dwarven allies, and take revenge on Baldr’s captors. Odin’s journey will force him to confront his own fate against the certain doom of Ragnarök.',NULL,169.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('a048e10f-ddc2-4e0f-95eb-874be150beb3','2026-07-09 10:52:13.296386','2026-07-09 10:52:13.296386',NULL,'Roblox Deluxe Playset Operation Beach Day Wave 11','roblox-deluxe-playset-operation-beach-day-wave-11','191726437543-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'ff242680-eaae-4c64-9b7f-22aef1f926df',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Relive your favorite Roblox adventures or create your own with this unique playset, featuring six iconic characters and loads of accessories. Mix and match parts to build your own unique Roblox character. Deck out your figures with the included accessories. Each package comes with a redeemable code to unlock an exclusive virtual item on Roblox. Collect all your favorite Roblox figures today!',NULL,349.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('a04e371e-537f-400e-8eaa-dff050b3be31','2026-07-09 11:17:06.225683','2026-07-09 11:17:06.225683',NULL,'Unknown 9 Awakening','unknown-9-awakening','p-3391892030846-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Unknown 9: AwakeningUnknown 9: Awakening invites players into a mysterious world filled with intrigue, ancient secrets, and supernatural powers. Step into the shoes of Haroona, a young woman with the ability to manipulate unseen dimensions, as she uncovers the hidden truths about her past and the enigmatic forces shaping her destiny. Set in a richly detailed, interconnected world, this story-driven action-adventure game blends exploration, puzzle-solving, and combat with a gripping narrative inspired by global mythology and science. Key Features: Master the Fold: Harness Haroona’s supernatural abilities to manipulate time, space, and perception in combat and puzzle-solving.Immersive Storytelling: Experience a compelling narrative that explores themes of identity, hidden knowledge, and human potential.Rich, Expansive World: Explore diverse environments inspired by ancient cultures, reimagined with a modern supernatural twist.Cinematic Visuals: Stunning next-gen graphics and atmospheric design bring the world and its mysteries to life.Engaging Gameplay: Balance fast-paced combat, environmental puzzles, and exploration to uncover the game’s deep lore.Global Mythology: Discover a story steeped in cultural myths and legends, offering a unique blend of the real and the mystical.',NULL,129.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
