('a08ecd1e-ec3c-4181-849c-3419d21f5dc2','2026-07-09 11:13:17.608048','2026-07-09 11:13:17.608048',NULL,'Stray - PS5','ps5-stray-16669714268987','811949035196-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescription Platform: PlayStation 5Genre: Adventure, Puzzle, PlatformerGameplay Modes: Single-playerResolution & Frame Rate:4K UHD at 30fps (Quality Mode)1080p at 60fps (Performance Mode)Audio: 3D Audio support, immersive sound design for a heightened environmental experienceEngine: Unreal Engine 4Stray - PS5Stray is a visually stunning and emotionally captivating adventure game for the PS5, set in a cyberpunk-inspired world where you play as a stray cat navigating through a decaying, futuristic city. With a mix of exploration, puzzle-solving, and stealth mechanics, you\'ll guide the cat through the dystopian environment, befriending a small robot companion named B-12 along the way. The game blends atmospheric storytelling with a unique feline perspective, offering a fresh and immersive experience. Explore neon-lit streets, climb walls, and solve mysteries in a city overrun by robots and dangerous creatures, all while uncovering the story of your own mysterious past. Key Features: Unique Feline Experience: Play as a stray cat with natural feline movements, such as jumping, climbing, and purring, giving you a fresh perspective on gameplay.Cyberpunk World: Navigate a beautifully detailed, futuristic city filled with neon lights, towering structures, and mysterious robotic inhabitants.Companion B-12: Team up with B-12, a small flying robot, to uncover secrets and interact with the environment. Solve puzzles and gather clues to progress through the story.Atmospheric Exploration: Discover hidden secrets, interact with quirky NPCs, and experience a rich narrative while exploring the dark corners of the city.Engaging Story: Uncover the mystery behind the cat’s journey, the downfall of human civilization, and the rise of robotic life forms in the city.Stunning Visuals: Leveraging PS5\'s hardware, Stray offers detailed environments, realistic lighting, and smooth animation to bring the world to life.Stealth and Combat: Avoid threats, use stealth to your advantage, and interact with enemies using agility.',NULL,169.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
