lexible and adhesive, making it easy to install on any flat surface or in corners to enhance your space.Sync with Music: Enjoy a truly immersive experience with the music sync feature, where the lights react to the beats and rhythm of your favorite music.Energy Efficient & Long-Lasting: Using high-quality LEDs, the strip is energy-efficient and designed for durability, ensuring a long lifespan and low power consumption.Vibrant & Dynamic Lighting: Perfect for bedrooms, living rooms, offices, gaming setups, or any space that needs a touch of vibrant and dynamic lighting.',NULL,189.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
