('a350de33-2ea8-492a-8c80-80f0eac4d078','2026-07-09 11:02:56.726635','2026-07-09 11:02:56.726635',NULL,'Reanimal Deluxe Edition','reanimal-deluxe-edition','D-9120131603435-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Reanimal From the twisted imagination of the creators behind Little Nightmares and Little Nightmares II comes an even darker descent into fear. Reanimal is a cinematic co-op horror adventure where you guide a brother and sister through a living nightmare in a desperate attempt to rescue their lost friends. Travel across a cursed island by boat and on foot, solving environmental challenges, avoiding grotesque creatures, and relying on cooperation and intelligence to survive. Every step forward uncovers fragments of a haunting secret that refuses to stay buried.Horror With Hope Beneath the dread and despair lies a fragile thread of optimism. The journey of the two orphans is driven by the search for redemption, safety, and reunion, creating a powerful emotional core within an intensely oppressive atmosphere.Across a Dark and Twisted World Venture through a beautifully disturbing landscape filled with strange architecture and hidden narratives. The main route is only part of the story — curious explorers will uncover mysterious locations, each revealing new layers of tragedy and meaning.A Dread-Filled Adventure Tarsier Studios brings its signature visual storytelling to life with unforgettable monster designs and vulnerable yet determined child protagonists. The horrors you face are deeply connected to echoes of the past, shaping both the enemies and the emotional weight of the experience.Share the Scare Terror is stronger together. The game is fully playable in single-player, local co-op, or online co-op. A shared, directed camera heightens claustrophobia, intensifies suspense, and keeps both players trapped in the same terrifying moment.Key Features• Minimalist narrative that invites interpretation • A new horror journey from the minds behind Little Nightmares • Striking creature design and deeply atmospheric environments • Play solo or with a partner in local and online cooperative modes • Exploration by land and sea across interconnected, story-rich areas',NULL,249.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
