('a3d40e47-35eb-422d-abd3-1a38f8d53867','2026-07-09 11:11:17.043384','2026-07-09 11:11:17.043384',NULL,'Madden NFL 23 - PS5','madden-nfl-23','5030934124317-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Specs Description Platform: PlayStation 5Genre: Sports, SimulationGame Modes: Single-player, Multiplayer, OnlineResolution: 4KFrame Rate: 60fpsAudio: Dolby Atmos, StereoMadden NFL 23 - PS5Madden NFL 23 brings the thrill of American football to the PS5 with stunning next-gen graphics, lifelike gameplay, and deeper mechanics. Experience the evolution of football as you step onto the field with enhanced player movements, realistic physics, and dynamic stadiums. Whether you\'re competing in franchise mode, playing online with friends, or taking part in exciting new challenges, Madden NFL 23 delivers the ultimate gridiron experience. Key Features: Next-Gen Gameplay: Powered by the capabilities of the PS5, the game features smoother animations, lifelike player movements, and improved AI for a more immersive football experience.Franchise Mode: Take control of your favorite NFL team, manage the roster, and lead them to the championship in the most in-depth and strategic franchise mode to date.Face of the Franchise: Build your player from the ground up and make key decisions that will shape your career as you rise through the NFL ranks.New Passing Mechanic: With the introduction of the \"FieldSENSE\" technology, passing has become more precise, allowing for greater control and accuracy.Dynamic Stadiums: Experience the excitement of every NFL stadium with improved crowd reactions, dynamic weather, and realistic atmosphere.Madden Ultimate Team (MUT): Create your dream team with player cards, earn rewards, and compete in online challenges against others in this popular game mode.Improved AI and Physics: A revamped physics engine brings more realism to tackles, collisions, and player interactions on the field.',NULL,279.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
