('a5934419-e527-4f8d-bac3-9ab363cdaaa1','2026-07-09 10:56:40.865312','2026-07-09 10:56:40.865312',NULL,'S.H. Figuarts Evangelion - Rei Ayanami','s-h-figuarts-evangelion-rei-ayanami','4573102687265-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'f98bbd67-0b4f-473a-9b36-8d4e6c4d60c2',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Add one of anime’s most iconic characters to your collection with the S.H. Figuarts Evangelion – Rei Ayanami Action Figure. Inspired by the legendary anime series Neon Genesis Evangelion, this premium figure captures Rei Ayanami in her recognizable plugsuit with exceptional sculpting and detailed paintwork. Produced by Bandai’s S.H. Figuarts line, the figure features multiple articulation points that allow collectors to recreate memorable scenes or create dynamic display poses. The high-quality craftsmanship and accurate character design make it a standout piece for anime enthusiasts and figure collectors. Perfect for display on shelves, desks, or collector showcases, this figure is a must-have for Evangelion fans and S.H. Figuarts collectors. Key Features • Official S.H. Figuarts Evangelion – Rei Ayanami action figure• Detailed sculpt inspired by Neon Genesis Evangelion• Multiple articulation points for dynamic posing• Premium craftsmanship from the S.H. Figuarts / Tamashii Nations line• Ideal for anime collections, desks, or display cabinets• Perfect collectible for Evangelion fans and figure collectors',NULL,299.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('a5a391af-9818-48ca-a59c-17fbcc53ae81','2026-07-09 10:49:37.739183','2026-07-09 10:49:37.739183',NULL,'AOKZOE A1 Pro AMD Ryzen 7 6800U 16GB 512GB 8-Inch Display - Quantum Blue','aokzoe-a1-pro-amd-ryze-n-680-16724189127685','6971808685239-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'9623f09d-c1bf-4180-b485-04dc44252cb2',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','AOKZOE A1 features an 8-inch Full-HD IPS Display with 1920 x 1200 resolution. The pixel density peaks at an impressive 283 PPI. AOKZOE did not go for the typical 7-inch screen or a larger 8.4-inch. The 8-inch screen is widely praised among insiders for the overall balance of weight, portability, and visual presentation. Featuring 8 Cores and 16 Threads - along with 4MB of L2 cache and 16MB of L3 cache - AMD Ryzen™? 7 6800U Processor guarantees the strongest gaming computing power. Its potential frequency is as high as 4.7GHz. A1 powers game with AMD Radeon 680M Graphics, featuring 12 CUs and 768 SPs. The AMD Radeon 680M Graphics boosts the computing power and bandwidth by 50% compared to Vega, all with double the cache and RB+. The frequency of the GPU can reach 2.4 GHz. Gaming is fun. Your gaming console should be too. The symmetric RGB Breathing Lights give a vibrant look that adds style and shine. The lights can be personalized by pressing key combinations, and gamers can open the light bar to switch between different light modes. There are 3 modes and 20 additional light effects, so you can turn game time into showtime! The design of details lies in other components as well. Equipped with a 3-axis gyroscope, AOKZOE A1 enables the players to tilt their console to the game. This provides direct control and better aiming, while also receiving in-game haptic responses. The comfortable, ergonomic arcs of the console body, along with the layout of the controllers, can prevent finger cramps caused by extended playtime. A1\'s vibration is sharper thanks to quicker response of the motor. Even the lightest consoles can get tiring to hold after enough time, and we are among the lightest out there. Thanks to the kickstand, however, you can rest your wrist and alleviate discomfort. Binge your shows on AOKZOE A1! Memory speed is as important as any other feature. Only with high frequency memory can the potential of AMD Radeon 680M Graphics be fully realized. Now enter LPDDR5-6400MHz. AOKZOE A1 features a built-in M.2280 PCIe3.0 solid-state drive, with a maximum support of 2TB of PCIe. This enables higher reading and writing speeds, negates anxious wait time, and allows for more local files. A1 also supports high speed TF 3.0 cards as a more cost-effective way to add hard drive capacity. Cooling is incredibly important for maintaining performance (and for avoiding burned palms!). To dissipate heat as fast as possible, we used PC grade high-speed fans and deliberately enlarged the air intake hole to reach 4.7 CFM air exchange rate. In addition, we put in place a pure aluminum cooling fin and a pure copper cooling pipe. Throw in the help of a smart temperature control system, and the overheating problem can be overlooked for good. Despite the impressive array of features mentioned, we know that it’s not enough. External accessories take their own precedence. That\'s why we embedded 2 USB 4.0 ports, 1 USB 3.0 ports and 1 headphone jack. To account for more use cases, there is a usb4.0 port provided for possible docking stations, at the bottom of the device. AOKZOE A1 CPU: AMD Ryzen 7 6800U processor GRAPHICS: AMD Radeon 680M Graphics RAM:LPDDR5(frequency 6400)16GB/32GB GYROSCOPE: Support LIGHTING: RGB LED Breathing Light DISPLAY:8inch RESOLUTION:1920*1200 IPS GAMUT:sRGB100% PIXEL DENSITY:283 DIMMING MODE: DC Dimming BRIGHTNESS:350 NIGHT-MODE: Support BATTERY:Standard version(48wh)/Pro version(65wh) PD CHARGER: Support FULL CHARGE TIME:1.5 Hours with 100W charger POWERBANK SUPPORT: Support SPEAKER:Dual stereo speakers VIBRATOR: Support SSD:PCI-E M.2 2280 TF CARD: Support WIFI: Wifi6 BLUETOOTH: BT 5.0 SIZE:285mm*125mm*24mm DOCKING/KEYBOARD: Support Docking Weight:Pro version:729g',NULL,3499.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
