('a5ad482a-588c-40ef-8f4b-792ceaf54b0b','2026-07-09 11:13:00.263668','2026-07-09 11:13:00.263668',NULL,'Saints Row: Day One Edition - PS5','saints-row-day-one-edition-16667842796072','4020628686819-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','As the future Boss, with Neenah, Kevin, and Eli by your side, you’ll form The Saints – and take on Los Panteros, The Idols, and Marshall as you build your empire across the streets of Santo Ileso and battle for control of the city. Ultimately Saints Row is the story of a start-up company, it’s just that the business The Saints are in happens to be crime. Experience the biggest and best Saints Row playground ever created; the unique sprawling world of Santo Ileso is the backdrop for a wild, larger than life sandbox of thrilling side hustles, criminal ventures and blockbuster missions, as you shoot, drive, and wingsuit your way to the top.',NULL,229.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('a5b23e01-ee5e-4ab1-bcc9-aeab78ab6eb9','2026-07-09 11:06:57.518039','2026-07-09 11:06:57.518039',NULL,'Pokémon: Let\'s Go Eevee - SW','switch-pokemon-lets-go-eevee-nmc','45496593971-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Take your Pok?mon™ journey to the Kanto region with your energetic partner, Pikachu, to become a top Pok?mon Trainer as you battle other trainers. Use a throwing motion to catch Pok?mon in the wild with either one Joy-Con™ controller or Pok? Ball™ Plus accessory, which will light up, vibrate, and make sounds to bring your adventure to life. Share your adventure with family or friends in 2-player action on one system using a second Joy-Con or Pok? Ball Plus (sold separately). You can even connect to the Pok?mon™ GO app using a compatible smartphone to bring over Pok?mon originally discovered in the Kanto region! Explore the diverse and vibrant region of Kanto! True-to-size wild Pok?mon roam around in the game, so catch them like a real Pok?mon Trainer by using motion, timing, and a well-placed Pok? Ball™. Go on a stroll with your favorite Pok?mon in your Pok? Ball Plus! Connect your game directly to Pok?mon GO* to receive Kanto region Pok?mon.',NULL,189.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
