('a5c3b370-c075-40c4-bb6c-fcd592b0ab80','2026-07-09 10:52:21.411313','2026-07-09 13:18:19.487725',NULL,'DC Universe Fig 9.5\" Asst.','dc-universe-fig-9-5-asst','778988463277-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'ff242680-eaae-4c64-9b7f-22aef1f926df',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Now the kids can always have their favorite characters by their side with this incredible Sunny figures! Produced in plastic, it represents in a fun way one of the most iconic characters from DC Comics. Make her part of the DC Comics universe and get ready for incredible battles! With Batman, Super Man, Joker from DC Comics DC line, hours of fun are guaranteed. You can play with them following their stories or collect them for as long as you like. One of the activities you can do with these types of figures is to collect them and store them in a special place. As you learn more and more, your collection will grow and become more varied.',NULL,59.00,44.74,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,1,1,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('a5c62155-d20b-4bc4-b70c-173f2453e4bf','2026-07-09 10:51:17.981606','2026-07-09 10:51:17.981606',NULL,'Minecraft Stormlander (F4416)','minecraft-stormlander','5010993948758-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'ff242680-eaae-4c64-9b7f-22aef1f926df',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','NERF MINECRAFT STORMLANDER HAMMER: This dart-firing Nerf Minecraft hammer takes its inspiration from the hammer in Minecraft: Dungeons DART-BLASTING HAMMER: Storm into action and hammer the competition with darts The dart-blasting Nerf Minecraft Stormlander hammer has a 3-dart capacity and launches 1 dart at a time LOAD, PRIME, FIRE: Load 3 darts into the front of the hammer, pull back the priming handle, and press the button to unleash 1 dart from this Minecraft-inspired hammer INCLUDES 3 NERF ELITE DARTS: Includes 3 Official Nerf Elite foam darts that are great for indoor and outdoor play and are tested and approved for performance and quality',NULL,219.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
