('a669be41-596f-42a0-8ffa-c0d2c30ffc37','2026-07-09 11:17:15.444381','2026-07-09 11:17:15.444381',NULL,'Assassin\'s Creed Valhalla: Ultimate Edition - Xbox XS','xbx-xs-assassins-creed-valhalla-ultimate-edition-pegi-arb','3307216167983-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','In Assassin\'s Creed: Valhalla, become Eivor, a legendary Viking raider on a quest for glory. Explore a dynamic and beautiful open world set against the brutal backdrop of Englandâ€™s Dark Ages. Raid your enemies, grow your settlement, and build your political power in the quest to earn a place among the gods in Valhalla. Assassin\'s Creed: Valhalla - Ultimate Edition includes the game, the Ultimate Pack and the Season Pass. *--*Playable as female or male, Eivor leads a clan of Norse people across the icy North Sea to flee Norwayâ€™s endless war and dwindling resources. If they hope to survive, theyâ€™ll have to build a new home in the hostile lands of England. There, youâ€™ll provide for yourself and your people by constructing, customizing, and upgrading your settlement with new buildings like barracks, blacksmiths, and tattoo parlors, all while recruiting new members to grow your clan.',NULL,309.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('a66e994d-82ea-41c3-a9af-cf34af7c7130','2026-07-09 10:41:10.461404','2026-07-09 10:41:10.461404',NULL,'Govee Smart AI Sync Box kit (H8604B12)','govee-smart-ai-sync-box-kit','6974316993391-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'2f4818b1-ebde-4ac3-adb1-5c4f62d01e42',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescription Resolution Support: Up to 4K @ 60Hz, HDR10+, and Dolby Vision passthrough.Control Options: Govee Home app, physical control box, and voice commands.Connectivity: HDMI, Wi-Fi, and Bluetooth enabled.Included Components: AI Sync Box, RGBIC LED light strip, mounting clips, power adapter, and HDMI cable.Lighting Modes: Movie, Game, Music Sync, and custom modes.Strip Length: Adjustable for TVs ranging from 55 to 85 inches.Power Supply: Input: 100-240V AC; Output: DC 12V.Govee Smart AI Sync Box KitElevate your home entertainment setup with the Govee Smart AI Sync Box Kit, designed to provide an immersive and intelligent lighting experience. With AI-powered features, the sync box analyzes on-screen content in real-time, creating stunning, dynamic lighting effects that enhance movies, games, and music. Perfect for TVs and gaming setups, this kit offers seamless integration and vibrant ambiance. Key Features: AI-Driven Visual Sync: Advanced AI algorithms analyze screen content to match lighting effects with precision.4K HDR10+ Support: Delivers stunning visuals and compatibility with modern high-resolution displays.Multi-Device Connection: Features HDMI inputs for easy integration with gaming consoles, streaming devices, and more.Voice Assistant Integration: Compatible with Alexa and Google Assistant for hands-free control.Smart App Control: Customize lighting effects, adjust brightness, and set schedules via the Govee Home app.Music Sync Mode: Built-in microphone dynamically adjusts lights to music, enhancing your audio-visual experience.Wide Compatibility: Works with TVs 55 inches and larger.',NULL,439.50,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
