('a6de1d0a-b415-40e3-a664-ac9dad46c171','2026-07-09 10:52:07.639808','2026-07-09 10:52:07.639808',NULL,'Original Rubik\'s Race','rubiks-race-classic-fast-paced-strategy-sequence-board-game','5060591710219-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'ff242680-eaae-4c64-9b7f-22aef1f926df',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','CLASSIC BOARD GAME: Rubik’s Race is a high-intensity two-player board game designed to get your brain and fingers racing at an extreme pace. A strategy racing game like no other SHIFT, SLIDE AND SOLVE: Shake the scrambler and race head-to-head against your opponent. Shift and slide the tiles to become the first racer to match the 3x3 centre of the scrambler’s Cube pattern A GAME OF ULTIMATE SKILL: It sounds easy enough, but the Rubik’s Race is a board game of skill, speed and dexterity. Be the first to drop the divider frame on your completed side of the board',NULL,79.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
