('aa870126-c344-4715-9d24-be696cb956d8','2026-07-09 10:41:13.285374','2026-07-09 10:41:13.285374',NULL,'Govee Envisual TV Backlight T2 (75-85 inch)','govee-tv-backlight-t2-75-85-inch','6974316993087-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'2f4818b1-ebde-4ac3-adb1-5c4f62d01e42',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescription Compatibility: Designed for 75-85 inch TVsLight Type: RGBIC LEDControl Options: Govee Home app, Voice control (Amazon Alexa, Google Assistant), Physical touch panelConnectivity: BluetoothPower Source: USB-powered (via TV USB port or power adapter)Sync Modes: Dynamic screen sync, Music syncLength of LED Strips: Custom length for 75-85 inch TV sizesColor Options: 16 million colors with dynamic RGBIC effectsSpecial Features: Smart control, easy installation with adhesive, dynamic light sync with TV screen, customizable lighting effectsGovee TV Backlight T2 (75-85 inch)The Govee TV Backlight T2 (75-85 inch) is an advanced backlighting solution designed to bring your home entertainment setup to life. This backlight system features Govee’s innovative RGBIC technology, allowing dynamic and customizable lighting that syncs seamlessly with the content on your screen. Perfect for large-screen TVs, this lighting kit transforms your viewing experience with vibrant colors and effects that react in real-time to your content, whether it\'s movies, games, or music. Key Features: RGBIC Technology: RGBIC (RGB with Independent Control) technology allows for different colors to be displayed on different segments of the LED strip simultaneously. This ensures a more immersive and fluid light experience that corresponds with the content on your screen.Enhanced Screen Sync: The backlight dynamically adjusts based on the content being shown, making movies, games, and music visually engaging by creating synchronized lighting effects that match the on-screen action.Wide Compatibility: Specifically designed for large-screen TVs, this kit is ideal for 75-85 inch TVs, making it a perfect fit for big-screen home theater setups.Multiple Scene Modes: The backlight features various preset scene modes, such as movie, gaming, and music modes, which can be switched for the ideal lighting atmosphere tailored to your activity.Smart Control: Control your lighting setup through the Govee Home app, voice commands (Amazon Alexa or Google Assistant), or directly via the touch panel on the device. Adjust brightness, colors, and effects according to your preference.Music Sync: Sync the lights to the rhythm of your music with the built-in microphone. The lights will react to the beat, adding an extra layer of excitement for parties or gaming sessions.Easy Installation: The Govee TV Backlight T2 features an easy-to-apply adhesive, allowing you to neatly attach the LED strips to the back of your TV without leaving any residue.USB Powered: The system is powered by a USB connection, meaning it can easily plug into your TV’s USB port or a standard power outlet.',NULL,299.40,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
