('aaa45919-bf98-4af4-a3bb-60b5746ed41e','2026-07-09 11:06:50.487218','2026-07-09 11:06:50.487218',NULL,'No More Heroes 3 - Nintendo Switch','no-more-heroes-3-16672147355870','45496595333-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescriptionPlatform: Nintendo SwitchGenre: Action, Hack-and-SlashGame Modes: Single-playerResolution: 720p (Handheld), 1080p (Docked)Frame Rate: 30fpsAudio: StereoController Features: Joy-Con motion controls, HD Rumble, Pro Controller supportNo More Heroes 3 - Nintendo SwitchNo More Heroes 3 brings back the over-the-top, action-packed mayhem with Travis Touchdown in the third installment of this cult-favorite series. Developed by Grasshopper Manufacture and directed by Goichi Suda (Suda51), the game blends hack-and-slash combat with quirky humor, unique characters, and a story full of chaos. Travis must battle through a variety of bizarre alien enemies, face off against powerful foes, and fight to protect Earth from a group of extraterrestrial invaders. The game delivers fast-paced action, creative boss fights, and a fresh sense of style on the Nintendo Switch. Key Features: Fast-Paced Combat: Take down waves of enemies using Travis\' signature beam katana and unlock new combat abilities throughout the game.Creative Boss Battles: Each boss fight is unique and requires different strategies, offering a variety of exciting and challenging battles.Open World Exploration: Traverse the city of Santa Destroy in Travis\' motorcycle, completing side missions and exploring new areas for hidden secrets.Quirky Humor and Storyline: True to the series, No More Heroes 3 delivers a wacky and unpredictable storyline with memorable characters and dialogue.Motion Controls and HD Rumble: Utilize the Nintendo Switch’s Joy-Con motion controls and HD Rumble features for an immersive experience during combat and interactions.Optimized for Nintendo Switch: Play anywhere on the go with the Nintendo Switch\'s portability and enjoy the game\'s vibrant art style and smooth performance.',NULL,179.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
