('aad03a3d-896e-494c-baf0-ef7d482d949b','2026-07-09 11:15:18.696653','2026-07-09 11:15:18.696653',NULL,'Marvel Guardians of the Galaxy: Digital Deluxe - PS4','ps4-marvels-guardians-of-the-galaxy-digital-deluxe-edition-nmc-arb','5021290091832-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescription Developer: Eidos-MontrealPublisher: Square EnixGenre: Action-AdventurePlatform: PlayStation 5Modes: Single-playerRating: PEGI 16Release Date: October 26, 2021 Marvel\'s Guardians of the Galaxy: Digital Deluxe - PS5 Marvel’s Guardians of the Galaxy: Digital Deluxe Edition offers a thrilling single-player action-adventure experience that lets you play as Star-Lord, the leader of the misfit team of heroes, the Guardians of the Galaxy. The game is filled with humor, epic battles, and a deeply engaging storyline. The Digital Deluxe Edition includes exclusive in-game content, allowing fans to further enhance their gameplay. Key Features: Play as Star-Lord: Take control of Peter Quill (Star-Lord) and lead the Guardians in an original story where your decisions matter and impact the team\'s journey.Team Up with Iconic Heroes: Alongside Star-Lord, you will fight alongside Groot, Rocket, Drax, and Gamora, each with their own unique abilities and personalities.Action-Packed Combat: Use Star-Lord’s dual blasters, unique gadgets, and team-based combat strategy to take down enemies in dynamic and fluid battles.Rich Storyline: Uncover an all-new storyline featuring the Guardians of the Galaxy and other Marvel characters. Your choices will influence the fate of the team and the universe.Incredible Visuals: Marvel’s Guardians of the Galaxy features stunning visuals, bringing the vibrant world of the Guardians to life with high-fidelity graphics and smooth performance on PS5.Digital Deluxe Edition Bonuses: Unique Costumes: The Digital Deluxe Edition includes exclusive alternate outfits for the Guardians, including the \"Throwback Guardians Outfit\" and \"Knights of the Galaxy\" outfits.Early Access to the game: Play the game ahead of the official release date.Bonus In-Game Content: Access additional music tracks, and other digital content to enhance your journey.',NULL,299.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('aadafd38-21af-4e55-8885-f5a3c929966c','2026-07-09 11:12:20.970960','2026-07-09 11:12:20.970960',NULL,'Cygni All Guns Blazing','cygni-all-guns-blazing','pr-4012927150375-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescription Platform: PlayStation 5, Xbox Series X|S, PCGenre: Shoot-\'Em-Up (SHMUP), ActionResolution: Up to 4K UHDFrame Rate: 60fps for fluid and responsive gameplayGameplay Modes:Single-player campaignArcade modCygni: All Guns Blazing Experience the future of shoot-\'em-up games with Cygni: All Guns Blazing, a visually stunning and action-packed space shooter. Combining classic arcade-style gameplay with breathtaking modern visuals, Cygni takes players on an adrenaline-fueled journey through an intergalactic battlefield. With waves of relentless enemies, explosive weaponry, and a dynamic soundtrack, this game redefines the shoot-\'em-up genre for a new generation. Key Features: Cinematic Visuals: Unparalleled graphics and lighting effects bring the sci-fi world to life, setting a new standard for the genre.Fast-Paced Combat: Engage in high-speed dogfights and battles against massive enemy fleets and powerful bosses.Dual Weapon Systems: Switch between air-to-air and air-to-ground weaponry to adapt to different combat scenarios.Power-Up System: Upgrade your ship with devastating weapons, shields, and abilities to overcome increasingly challenging enemies.Immersive Soundtrack: A dynamic score enhances the intensity of the action and deepens the game\'s atmospheric experience.Challenging Gameplay: Designed for both casual players and hardcore SHMUP enthusiasts, with multiple difficulty levels.',NULL,99.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
