('b06d844a-713a-4186-9ab4-304a100f3490','2026-07-09 10:51:34.007970','2026-07-09 10:51:34.007970',NULL,'WW FASHION DOLL 8\" DLX GIFT SET-HARRY','ww-fashion-doll-8-dlx-gift-set-harry','778988344194-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'ff242680-eaae-4c64-9b7f-22aef1f926df',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Recreate your favorite Harry Potter scenes with the Wizarding World Harry Potter Gift Set! With two different outfits and five accessories included, this deluxe 8-inch doll is perfect for storytelling play and is a must-have for Harry Potter fans. Cute facial details, his lightning bolt scar, round glasses and five points of articulation bring this beloved Harry Potter character to life. Harry is ready for endless spellbinding adventures! He comes wearing his blue “H” holiday sweater and pants, as seen in the Sorcerer’s Stone movie, or you can switch him into his blue plaid Diagon Alley shirt. Dress Harry in the Invisibility Cloak and follow the Marauder’s Map to explore Hogwarts and travel to Hogsmeade! Place the wand in his hand and pose your doll to pretend to cast spells. With a Hedwig figure and Nimbus 2000 broomstick accessory, play out finding Hedwig and the broomstick in Diagon Alley. This 8-inch Harry Potter doll will inspire your imagination through fun and exciting pretend play. Add all of the 8-inch dolls to your collection (toys each sold separately) and build out your own Wizarding World! Wizarding World Harry Potter toys are must-have gifts for kids who enjoy collectibles, wands, action figures, dolls, and doll accessories. They’re great as a birthday gift, Christmas gift or stocking stuffer. Relive the magic of Harry’s first year with the Wizarding World Harry Potter Gift Set!',NULL,169.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('b0712c70-4645-4080-b490-c84df8b33803','2026-07-09 10:58:16.038476','2026-07-09 10:58:16.038476',NULL,'POP MOVIES UNIVERSAL MONSTER X CARE BEARS CHEER BEAR BRIDE OF FRANKENSTEIN','pop-movies-care-bears-x-universal-monsters-cheer-bear-as-bride-of-frankenstein','889698815376-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'f98bbd67-0b4f-473a-9b36-8d4e6c4d60c2',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Add something delightful and spookily sweet to your Funko collection with the Funko Pop! Movies: Care Bears x Universal Monsters – Cheer Bear as Bride of Frankenstein vinyl figure. This imaginative crossover brings together the joyful world of Care Bears and the classic horror charm of Universal Monsters in one collectible that’s perfect for fans of both franchises. In this playful mash‑up, Cheer Bear takes on the iconic look of the Bride of Frankenstein, complete with dramatic white‑streaked hair and stitched costume details that contrast charmingly with her signature pink fur and rainbow belly badge. The figure’s expressive design and themed styling make it a standout piece for display shelves, desks, or themed cabinets. Approximate Size: This collectible stands at about 4.8 inches tall, giving it a presence that fits nicely with other Funko Pop! figures while making an impression on its own. Packaged in a full‑colour window display box featuring dual Care Bears and Universal Monsters artwork, this figure is a fun and unique addition to any collection. Whether you’re celebrating spooky season, nostalgia from childhood cartoons, or just love creative character crossovers, this Funko Pop! brings personality, contrast, and charm to your lineup. Key Highlights: • Official Funko Pop! Movies collectible — Cheer Bear as Bride of Frankenstein from the Care Bears x Universal Monsters series. • Detailed vinyl figure with stylized mash‑up design. • Approximate size: ~4.8 inches tall, ideal for display. • Comes in themed window box with dual‑franchise artwork. • Great for collectors, horror‑inspired displays, and fans of whimsical crossovers in the UAE. Elevate your Funko Pop! collection with this unique and delightful crossover figure — blending nostalgic charm and monster‑movie magic in one memorable collectible.',NULL,75.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('b0830b44-54cc-44be-8e17-6ab446051e10','2026-07-09 11:07:23.995467','2026-07-09 11:07:23.995467',NULL,'Pokémon Legends: Arceus - SW','sw-pokemon-legends-arceus-r2','45496596583-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','The Pokémon Legends: Arceus game honors past Pokémon games’ core gameplay while infusing new action and RPG elements. You’ll need to catch, survey, and research wild Pokémon in a long-gone era of the Sinnoh region to create and complete the region’s first Pokédex. To catch Pokémon in the Pokémon Legends: Arceus game, you can observe them to learn their behavior, then carefully sneak up, aim your Poké Ball, and let fly! You can also have your ally Pokémon battle wild Pokémon that you hope to catch. Just throw the Poké Ball holding your ally Pokémon near a wild Pokémon, and you’ll seamlessly enter battle and command your Pokémon by choosing from moves it knows. You’ll be brought to the Sinnoh region, the setting for the Pokémon Diamond and Pokémon Pearl games. But this story unfolds in a long-gone era, before ideas such as being a Pokémon Trainer or having a Pokémon League even existed. All around, you’ll find Pokémon living wild in harsh environments that make for a Sinnoh unlike the region you may remember from the days of the Pokémon Diamond and Pokémon Pearl games. The Poké Balls of old were apparently built a little differently from the ones we know so well. They were made mostly of wood, and steam puffed from their tops when Pokémon were caught.? As you start off on your adventure to create the region’s first Pokédex, you’ll be able to choose Rowlet, Cyndaquil, or Oshawott as a partner. These three Pokémon arrived with a Pokémon Professor, who encountered them on research excursions to various regions.?',NULL,199.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('b0844734-71ff-4c82-b286-3484cf2eab98','2026-07-09 11:14:26.563977','2026-07-09 11:14:26.563977',NULL,'Sword Art Online: Alicization Lycoris - PS4','ps4-sword-art-online-alicization-lycoris-pegi','3391892008661-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Following the events of the SWORD ART ONLINE Alicization anime series, SWORD ART ONLINE Alicization Lycoris finds Kirito in a mysterious but familiar virtual world, “Underworld,” where A.I.s behave like humans. As players take control of Kirito, they will relive heart-pounding scenes from the series through intense combat. Players will also encounter fan favorite characters including Eugeo, Alice, Administrator, and many more. A wide world awaits Kirito and his friends in this exciting adaptation to the SWORD ART ONLINE Alicization series.',NULL,129.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
