ghtweight build and adjustable straps ensure comfort during extended sessions, while a larger battery offers hours of uninterrupted play.Massive Content Library: Access an expansive library of games, applications, and experiences, including popular titles and exclusive releases.Social and Multiplayer: Connect with friends, join virtual communities, or explore multiplayer games in a shared immersive environment.',NULL,0.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
