('b70e15a1-c001-4b67-acb2-82d1047e3833','2026-07-09 11:18:58.583189','2026-07-09 11:18:58.583189',NULL,'Marvel vs. Capcom Fighting Collection: Arcade Classics','mvc-fighting-collection-arcade-classics','p-5055060904787-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescriptionPlatform: PlayStation 5, Xbox Series X|S, PC, Nintendo SwitchResolution: Up to 4K with support for classic 4:3 and widescreen 16:9 aspect ratiosPerformance: 60fps for smooth gameplayAudio: Remastered soundtracks and voiceovers from the original arcade versionsController Features: Full support for fight sticks and customizable button mapping Marvel vs. Capcom Fighting Collection: Arcade Classics Marvel vs. Capcom Fighting Collection: Arcade Classics unites iconic heroes and villains from the Marvel and Capcom universes in an electrifying compilation of legendary arcade fighters. Featuring classic titles with enhanced features, this collection is perfect for both nostalgic fans and new challengers looking to experience the roots of fast-paced crossover fighting action. Relive the glory of arcade battles with stunning visuals, balanced gameplay, and online multiplayer functionality. Included TitlesMarvel vs. Capcom: Clash of Super HeroesMarvel Super Heroes vs. Street FighterX-Men vs. Street FighterMarvel Super HeroesX-Men: Children of the AtomCapcom Fighting EvolutionDarkstalkers: The Night Warriors (Special Marvel-themed stages and characters included)Super Puzzle Fighter II Turbo Key FeaturesRemastered Visuals: Improved graphics with arcade-perfect detail and optional visual filters for a customizable experience.Online Multiplayer: Compete against players worldwide with rollback netcode for smooth online matches in ranked and casual modes.Training Mode: Hone your skills with training options to master combos, special moves, and defensive tactics.Gallery Mode: Unlock and explore concept art, music, and historical content from the Marvel and Capcom archives.Customizable Settings: Adjust difficulty, controls, and game speed to tailor your experience.Local Versus Play: Battle friends at home in classic couch co-op style.Balanced Gameplay: Updates to game mechanics ensure smoother and more competitive battles without losing the original arcade feel.',NULL,199.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
