('b8291d42-bd62-47d1-b3ad-107cc14bf4c8','2026-07-09 11:02:17.333254','2026-07-09 11:02:17.333254',NULL,'Asus GT302 Gaming PC - INTEL i7 12700KF, 4070 Ti X3 OC 12GB, 32GB 6000MT/s DDR5, 2TB M.2 SSD, ASUS Prime Z790-P, 240MM ARGB LIQUID COOLER','asus-gt302-gaming-pc-intel-i7-12700kf-4070-ti-x3-oc-12gb-32gb-6000mt-s-ddr5-1tb-m-2-ssd-asus-prime-z790-p-240mm-argb-liquid-cooler','ZCC-PC2',NULL,'simple',NULL,'3155269b-8d2e-4303-ba21-b03ba2ef8437',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','The ZGames White Performance Gaming PC combines the Intel Core i7-12700KF processor, GeForce RTX 4070 Ti graphics card, 32GB of high-speed DDR5 memory, and a spacious 2TB SSD to create a powerful gaming and productivity platform. Designed with premium ASUS components and a striking white-themed aesthetic, this system is ideal for modern gaming, content creation, streaming, multitasking, and everyday computing.Technical SpecificationsProcessor – Intel Core i7-12700KF At the core of this gaming system is the Intel Core i7-12700KF, a high-performance 12th Generation desktop processor built for gaming enthusiasts, content creators, and power users. Featuring Intel\'s advanced hybrid architecture with Performance-cores and Efficient-cores, the processor delivers excellent gaming responsiveness, smooth multitasking, and powerful productivity performance. As a KF-series processor, it is designed to be paired with a dedicated graphics card for display output.Graphics Card – Inno3D GeForce RTX 4070 Ti X3 OC White 12GB Experience exceptional gaming performance with the Inno3D GeForce RTX 4070 Ti X3 OC White 12GB graphics card. Featuring a factory-overclocked design and an efficient triple-fan cooling solution, this GPU is built to handle modern AAA games, high-resolution gaming, ray-traced environments, and demanding graphical workloads. The striking white finish perfectly complements the overall aesthetic of the build.Motherboard – ASUS Prime Z790-P DDR5 The system is built around the ASUS Prime Z790-P ATX motherboard, providing a reliable and feature-rich platform for Intel LGA 1700 processors. Designed to support DDR5 memory, high-speed storage devices, and modern connectivity options, it offers the stability and expandability needed for gaming, streaming, and productivity applications.Memory – Kingston FURY Beast RGB 32GB DDR5 6000MT/s Multitasking and gaming performance are enhanced by 32GB of Kingston FURY Beast RGB DDR5 memory, configured as a dual-channel kit operating at 6000MT/s. The high-speed DDR5 platform provides increased bandwidth for modern applications, while customizable RGB lighting adds a premium visual touch to the system.Storage – TEAMGROUP MP33 PRO 2TB SSD Store your games, applications, and media library on the TEAMGROUP MP33 PRO 2TB SSD. Offering fast NVMe storage performance and generous capacity, the drive helps reduce loading times, improve system responsiveness, and provide ample space for large game libraries and creative projects.CPU Cooling – DeepCool LE240 ARGB White The processor is cooled by the DeepCool LE240 ARGB All-In-One Liquid Cooler. Featuring a 240mm radiator and ARGB lighting, the cooler helps maintain stable operating temperatures during gaming and demanding workloads while contributing to the clean white-themed appearance of the system.Power Supply – ASUS Prime 750W Gold Power Supply Powering the entire build is the ASUS Prime 750W Gold Power Supply, delivering dependable and efficient power for high-performance gaming hardware. Designed for modern gaming systems, it provides the reliability required for demanding workloads and long gaming sessions.Case – ASUS TUF Gaming GT302 ARGB White All components are housed inside the ASUS TUF Gaming GT302 ARGB White Mid-Tower Case. Featuring a premium white finish, excellent airflow design, tempered glass side panel, and integrated ARGB lighting, the case provides both visual appeal and effective cooling performance while showcasing the internal hardware.',NULL,8399.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
