('b856a7ff-861b-4f5d-b189-683ae75b2268','2026-07-09 11:01:23.771840','2026-07-09 11:01:23.771840',NULL,'Dune: Awakening Day 1 Edition - PS5','dune-awakening-day-1-edition-ps5','3391892045345-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Dune: Awakening Day 1 Edition - PS5DUNE: AWAKENING – EARLY PURCHASE DLC For a limited time only, purchase the physical Edition of Dune: Awakening and receive for free the exclusive Terrarium of Muad’Dib that you can place in your base, and the sunset dye, a unique global color swatch as downloadable content. WELCOME TO DUNE: AWAKENING Dune: Awakening is an immersive open-world survival game that combines adventure, RPG elements, exploration, crafting, and cinematic storytelling. Set on the legendary desert planet of Arrakis, players must survive harsh conditions, build their own path, and uncover an epic story while playing alone or alongside friends. Explore, gather resources, craft equipment, and rise from a survivor struggling against the dangers of the desert into a powerful force within the world of Dune. But always remember: the sandworm awaits.EXPLORE A VAST, WORLD OPEN DUNE Discover a massive and dynamic version of Arrakis, from endless desert landscapes and dangerous sand dunes to hidden Fremen caves and the impressive streets of Arrakeen. Traverse the planet using advanced tools, climb massive rock formations with the Shigawire hook, and travel across the dangerous deserts with an ornithopter crafted by your own hands. Survive powerful sandstorms that move across the landscape, adapt to the challenges of the desert environment, and take in the breathtaking beauty of Arrakis as the sun sets over the sands.UNRAVEL AN EPIC, CINEMATIC DUNE STORY Step into the universe of Dune and experience one of science fiction’s most iconic worlds like never before. Choose your allegiance between the Atreides and the Harkonnen, rise through their ranks, and discover unique storylines shaped by your decisions. Encounter familiar characters such as Duke Leto and Feyd-Rautha, investigate the mysterious disappearance of the Fremen, and uncover the secrets surrounding your own origins. Experience a cinematic Dune adventure built around a fascinating question: what if Paul Atreides was never born?BECOME A MASTER OF COMBAT AND SURVIVAL Surviving Arrakis requires skill, preparation, and adaptation. Manage the extreme desert climate, search for shade, collect valuable resources, and extract water from your enemies to survive in one of the universe’s most unforgiving environments. Master the teachings of the Schools of the Imperium and unlock powerful abilities, weapons, and tools. Choose your combat style by becoming a Trooper with unmatched firepower, using the Bene Gesserit voice to influence enemies, setting strategic traps as a Mentat, or mastering the deadly combat techniques of the Swordmaster.BUILD YOUR STRONGHOLD, CRAFT YOUR ORNITHOPTER Create your own base of operations on Arrakis and establish your presence in the desert. Build everything from small survival outposts to massive strongholds using Atreides, Harkonnen, and other available architectural styles. Customize your base with decorations that reflect your personality, install powerful crafting equipment and spice refineries, and expand your influence across the planet. Craft essential survival tools, advanced equipment, and vehicles including ground vehicles and ornithopters to help you explore and conquer Arrakis.PLAY ALONE, WITH FRIENDS, OR WITH OTHERS IN A LARGER WORLD Experience Arrakis your way by playing solo, teaming up with friends, or entering a larger shared world filled with hundreds of other players. Take part in the politics and conflicts of Arrakis while building your own legacy. Create your own server, rent a server through a third-party provider, or play through official servers. A complete single-player mode arrives on September 22, 2026, along with additional improvements and new features. Survive the desert, build your power, and shape your destiny in Dune: Awakening.',NULL,199.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
