('b9d5c7ab-ba10-4f1f-af8b-850736c495d2','2026-07-09 10:43:01.982225','2026-07-09 10:43:01.982225',NULL,'Samsung T7 1TB Portable SSD','samsung-portable-ssd-t7-touc-16668836052394','8806090195297-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'2f4818b1-ebde-4ac3-adb1-5c4f62d01e42',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Data BackupBeautifully light, small and handy: With the Portable SSD T7 you can be safe on number one. Even large files are transferred impressively fast and well protected for a long time. Whether for work or pleasure, the T7 offers you reliable performance for daily use.Super-fast data transferWith the T7 you can transfer huge amounts of data within seconds with USB 3.2 of the 2. Generation. Thanks to the built-in PCIe® NVMe™ technology, sequential transfer speeds of up to 1,050 MB/s read and up to 1,000 MB/s write are possible. The T7 is thus almost twice as fast as the predecessor model T5.1Robust protection against data lossThe T7 is a so-called solid-state drive (SSD) drive and has no moving parts inside. Thanks to its robust metal casing, your data can survive a fall from a height of up to two meters without any damage.3 In addition, the access can be protected with a password based on AES 256-bit hardware encryption. A plus in security, which is also covered by the Samsung 3-year manufacturer\'s warranty.4Automatically protected against overheatingYou hardly have any problems with high working temperatures. The T7 relies entirely on Dynamic Thermal Guard technology for temperature management. This ensures that the T7 does not become uncomfortably hot and maintains its optimum operating temperature even under high stress.4Nice small and everywhere with youWeighs almost nothing and fits in every bag: The T7 convinces with a stable light-metal casing. It is made of a piece of aluminum and is only about the size of a credit card. With its spring weight of 58 g, the T7 fits comfortably in the hand and can accompany you everywhere. Fits your lifestyle Explore the wide selection and decide which T7 fits you best. Choose your favorite color: Timeless Titan Gray, classic Indigo Blue or distinctive metallic Red – and combine with the storage capacity you need for your purposes: GB, 1TB or 2TB.6Can be connected almost everywhere You want to access your data whenever and wherever you want? No problem. The T7 is compatible with many devices, e.g. with different PCs, Macs, game consoles and AndroidTM devices.7 Also very convenient: Two USB cables are included in the delivery (type C-on-C as well as type C-on-A).8Simple: Manage your password and updates The Portable SSD T7 comes with PC and Mac management software that helps you set up your password and keep you updated.9 You can also install the associated Mobile app for Android TM smartphones and tablets.15',NULL,499.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('b9f0d784-2cef-41e9-b76c-0c5a4ab8e905','2026-07-09 10:49:27.088595','2026-07-09 10:49:27.088595',NULL,'Valve Steam Deck OLED Handheld Gaming Console - 512GB','valve-steam-deck-oled-512gb','814585022278-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'9623f09d-c1bf-4180-b485-04dc44252cb2',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescription Display: 7.1-inch OLED, 1280x800 resolution, 60Hz refresh rateProcessor: AMD APU (Zen 2 CPU, RDNA 2 GPU)RAM: 16GB LPDDR5Storage Options: 256GB/512GB/1TB NVMe SSD (expandable via microSD)Audio: Stereo speakers, 3.5mm headphone jack, and Bluetooth 5.0 audio supportConnectivity: Wi-Fi 6, Bluetooth 5.0, USB-CBattery Life: 4-8 hours depending on usageWeight: Approx. 668g Valve Steam Deck OLED Handheld Gaming Console The Valve Steam Deck OLED revolutionizes portable gaming with its stunning OLED display, improved performance, and enhanced battery life. Designed for gamers who demand both power and portability, this upgraded version of the Steam Deck delivers rich visuals, immersive gameplay, and seamless access to your entire Steam library. Whether at home or on the go, the Steam Deck OLED offers a premium handheld gaming experience. Key FeaturesOLED Display: A vibrant 7.1-inch OLED screen delivers deeper blacks, richer colors, and enhanced contrast for immersive gaming.Improved Performance: Powered by a custom AMD APU optimized for gaming, ensuring smooth gameplay on modern titles.Enhanced Battery Life: Longer playtime per charge, thanks to improved power efficiency and the OLED screen’s reduced energy consumption.Full Steam Library: Access your complete Steam library and play AAA, indie, and classic games directly on the device.Customizable Controls: Dual trackpads, thumbsticks, and reprogrammable buttons for precise input and adaptability to any game.Expandable Storage: Choose from multiple storage options (256GB/512GB/1TB SSD) with microSD card support for extra space.Docking Capability: Connect to a TV or monitor via the optional Steam Deck Dock for a full gaming setup.Versatile OS: Runs SteamOS for a console-like interface but also supports desktop mode for PC functionality.',NULL,3749.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('ba03b4dc-6b3c-4198-8e8a-3e3a1d0d4061','2026-07-09 11:02:10.407737','2026-07-09 11:02:10.407737',NULL,'Destroy All Humans! 2 - Reprobed Nintendo Switch 2','destroy-all-humans-2-reprobed-nintendo-switch-2','9120131605002-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Destroy All Humans! 2 – Reprobed Destroy All Humans! 2 – Reprobed is a sci-fi action-adventure game published by THQ Nordic. This sequel continues the alien invasion storyline, placing players in control of an extraterrestrial invader tasked with causing chaos on Earth using advanced alien technology, weapons, and abilities. The game expands on the original experience with larger environments, enhanced gameplay systems, and continued satirical storytelling inspired by classic sci-fi themes.Key Official Features • Play as an alien invader with advanced technology• Open-area sci-fi action gameplay• Use weapons, vehicles, and psychic abilities• Mission-based structure with exploration elements• Humorous sci-fi parody storyline• Expanded sequel gameplay experience',NULL,169.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
