('bbe57f05-703c-413c-9922-9aa74c7e3674','2026-07-09 11:01:45.274674','2026-07-09 11:01:45.274674',NULL,'Rayman Legends Retold Launch Edition','rayman-legends-retold-launch-edition','p-3307216313403-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Product DescriptionScreenshotsRayman Legends Retold Launch Edition delivers the ultimate way to experience Ubisoft\'s beloved platforming adventure. Reimagined with enhanced visuals, new content, fully voiced cinematics, and expanded gameplay features, this special Launch Edition is perfect for both longtime fans and newcomers. Embark on an unforgettable journey through magical worlds packed with action, exploration, secrets, and cooperative fun. Available as a pre-order for PlayStation 5 and Nintendo Switch 2, the Launch Edition also includes exclusive bonus content available at launch.PURE PLATFORMING JOY Leap, glide, and punch your way through worlds bursting with charm and delightful surprises. Craving a change of pace? Dive into unforgettable musical stages, where every move must sync with the beat for a rhythm-powered thrill.NEW AND IMPROVED GAMEPLAY Immerse yourself in a world brimming with life, reimagined with stunning visuals. A rich selection of iconic levels returns alongside a mysterious sixth realm and 4 new musical stages. Saddle up for epic dragon rides and test your skills in the Cave of Trials.A FRESH TAKE ON AN EPIC TALE Join Rayman and his friends on their most ambitious adventure yet, facing a new foe stirring trouble from the underworld. Voiced cinematics and an expanded soundtrack by Christophe Héral and Grant Kirkhope bring the journey to life, blending original themes with new compositions.4 PLAYERS, LEGENDARY FUN Play the entire adventure in up to 4-player couch co-op, racing for Lums or knocking each other off to claim every last Teensy. Kung Foot also returns with improved controls, power-ups, and customizable rules for hours of frantic competition.',NULL,199.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('bbecd5b0-2336-4d10-ab16-7ca639012663','2026-07-09 11:07:26.278645','2026-07-09 11:07:26.278645',NULL,'Odd Ballers - SW','sw-odd-baller','3307216238669-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Bend your knees and thrust your hips - it\'s time for an intense dose of hard-hitting dodgeball action! OddBallers is a hilariously charming and totally bonkers multiplayer party game where each round is a new, absurd type of dodgeball. Gather your best enemies and prepare to shave sheep with lawnmowers, tussle with tractors, slam stinky toilets -- and yes, throw dodgeballs -- to decide who\'s the greatest player of them all! Dodge, block, and grab whatever you can to throw at the face of your enemies. From last-one standing games to team-based battles to running for your life wearing a rooster costume or knocking opponents out with fresh fish -- OddBallers goes there. Customise your character from head to toe, with hundreds of hilarious outfits and haircuts. And tailor each mini-game to your taste! Play with up to 6 players, online or locally. Download code only - This product does not contain a cartridge. Internet connection required, Ubisoft account and Nintendo account required to redeem the code. Digital download. For ages 7 years and over. Nintendo switch compatible. Nintendo switch OLED compatible.',NULL,79.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
