('bd0c05db-b8f4-4029-922c-e117cd02e2e5','2026-07-09 10:41:30.215794','2026-07-09 10:41:30.215794',NULL,'Paladone Deadpool Logo Light V2','paladone-deadpool-logo-light-v2','5055964726539-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'2f4818b1-ebde-4ac3-adb1-5c4f62d01e42',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Light up your space with Deadpool, your favourite wise-cracking, mutant ‘super’ hero. This light can be set up as a free standing or wall mounted decoration. Originally featured in Marvel Comics in the 90s, Deadpool has mutant abilities of quick physical healing & super strength. He’s become a fan favourite with his recent films. Use this nightlight as a desk lamp on the nightstand by your bed. It’s a perfect way to illuminate your man cave, bedroom, baby nursery, toddler’s playroom, or themed home theatre. This quality collectible is a unique addition to any fan\'s set. Give this cool collector\'s merchandise to mums, dads, fans, grads, kids, guys, and gals who love pop culture fun! For those in the fandom looking for novelty items and all things geek, crazy, and unique, Paladone is your best source for top-selling toys, mugs, collectibles, and novelties.',NULL,139.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('bd1c9853-30d4-4759-a376-3807ef2f506e','2026-07-09 11:07:42.592103','2026-07-09 11:07:42.592103',NULL,'Donkey Kong Country: Tropical Freeze - SW','donkey-kong-country-tropica-16667842797355','45496421731-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Donkey Kong, Diddy Kong, Dixie Kong and Cranky Kong return for the franchise’s debut on Nintendo Switch. This title includes all the fun and challenge of the original game, plus a new beginner-friendly mode that lets players enjoy this critically acclaimed adventure as groovy surfing simian Funky Kong. Funky Kong can double jump, hover, perform infinite rolls and even perform infinite underwater corkscrews. Thanks to his sturdy surfboard, even spikes can’t slow him down. The game launches for Nintendo Switch on May 4.',NULL,209.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
