('be533b7c-66be-43b0-90bc-6542f0dafb6d','2026-07-09 11:07:36.032445','2026-07-09 11:07:36.032445',NULL,'Detective Pikachu Returns - Nintendo Switch','sw-etective-pikachu-returns','4902370551747-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Back on the Case Detective Pikachu Returns is coming soon, exclusively to Nintendo Switch! Welcome to Ryme City A place where humans and Pokémon live side-by-side. In this bustling burg lives a gruff, tough-talking (but surprisingly lovable) Pikachu who loves coffee and calls himself a great detective. Two Heads Are Better than One This Pikachu works together with his partner, a young man named Tim Goodman, to solve a series of mysterious incidents that are occurring within the city. Start the Investigation We hope you look forward to the mystery-filled adventures of Tim and his chatty Pikachu pal – a sleuthing team that only the world of Pokémon can deliver! Detective Pikachu Returns has just been announced at Nintendo Direct 2023. Can\'t wait for Detective Pikachu Returns?',NULL,189.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('be5754b9-2e92-4099-b35d-b5dc2bf1ea7a','2026-07-09 11:08:03.965656','2026-07-09 11:08:03.965656',NULL,'EA SPORTS FC 25','ea-sports-fc-25-17218327086835','p-5035225125370-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescriptionGraphics: Frostbite Engine delivers 4K resolution at 60fps with HDR support, ensuring detailed visuals and realistic lighting.DualSense Features (PS5): Haptic feedback, adaptive triggers, and controller sounds respond to in-game moments like goals, tackles, and crowd noise.Audio: Enhanced 3D audio for a fully immersive stadium experience, with overhauled crowd dynamics and custom chants.Online Modes: Improved server stability for smoother online play across Ultimate Team, Pro Clubs, and Volta modes.EA SPORTS FC 25 EA SPORTS FC 25 marks the latest installment in the EA Sports FC series, building on its reimagined, fan-focused approach to football gaming. Known as the successor to the popular FIFA franchise, EA SPORTS FC continues its tradition of delivering realistic, immersive gameplay while incorporating new mechanics, modes, and updated visuals powered by the Frostbite engine. With a focus on community, customization, and a deeper level of realism, FC 25 promises the most comprehensive football experience yet. Game FeaturesUltimate Team Evolution: FC 25 takes Ultimate Team to the next level with customizable player progression, allowing gamers to build and evolve their teams with enhanced chemistry options, new skill modifiers, and dynamic player attributes based on real-world performance.Expanded Career Mode: The Career Mode now includes a more immersive Manager Career with deeper tactical control, realistic press conferences, and training modules. Player Career Mode allows greater influence over off-pitch decisions, contract negotiations, and skill specialization.Realistic Gameplay with HyperMotion V: The latest HyperMotion V technology combines real-world motion capture and advanced AI to create realistic, fluid animations for player movement and on-field interactions, enhancing responsiveness and realism.Cross-Platform Play: Now supporting cross-play across more modes, players on PlayStation, Xbox, and PC can compete and connect with friends and rivals regardless of their platform.New Leagues and Stadiums: EA SPORTS FC 25 includes newly licensed leagues and stadiums, expanding the global representation of teams. This edition introduces additional South American and African leagues, as well as new stadiums for a more authentic experience.Community Clubs: Create and customize a community club with friends, participate in weekly challenges, and climb the ranks together with unique club branding, kits, and stadium customization options.Improved Matchday Experience: Enhanced crowd animations, updated commentary, and more realistic weather effects immerse players in each match, making for an engaging and atmospheric gameplay experience.',NULL,99.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
