('bf04684d-2c25-4654-9651-fba704f42ff0','2026-07-09 11:16:20.340045','2026-07-09 11:16:20.340045',NULL,'Far Cry 6 - PS4','ps4-far-cry-6-pegi-ara','3307216170778-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescription Platform: PlayStation 4Genre: First-Person Shooter / Open-WorldPublisher: UbisoftRelease Date: October 7, 2021ESRB Rating: M for MatureMultiplayer: Online multiplayer available (co-op mode) Far Cry 6 - PS4 Far Cry 6 is an action-packed, first-person shooter set in a fictional Caribbean island called Yara. Developed by Ubisoft Toronto and published by Ubisoft, it follows the story of Dani Rojas, a guerilla fighter caught in the middle of a revolution to overthrow the ruthless dictator Anton Castillo, portrayed by Giancarlo Esposito. The game features a dynamic open world filled with action, exploration, and strategic combat, offering a rich experience for players who enjoy immersive environments and intense firefights.Key Features:Open-World Gameplay: Explore a huge, dynamic world full of diverse environments such as lush jungles, slums, military outposts, and beautiful coastlines.Story-Driven Campaign: Experience a compelling narrative featuring Dani Rojas as you fight to bring down the dictatorship led by Anton Castillo.Revolutionary Combat: Engage in explosive combat using a mix of traditional and makeshift weapons, vehicles, and guerrilla warfare tactics.Customization: Customize your weapons, outfits, and vehicles to fit your playstyle, from making your own unique arsenal to adapting to different combat scenarios.Co-Op Mode: Team up with a friend and take on missions in a cooperative multiplayer mode to make your fight for freedom even more thrilling.Vibrant Characters: Meet a variety of colorful characters that aid you in your revolution, each with their own motivations and stories.',NULL,109.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
