('c1035c2d-347c-4b26-9607-7b56817473bc','2026-07-09 10:50:23.367081','2026-07-09 10:50:23.367081',NULL,'LEGO Jeep  Wrangler Rubicon SUV V29 (42227)','lego-jeep-wrangler-rubicon-suv-v29-42227','5702018065532-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'3155269b-8d2e-4303-ba21-b03ba2ef8437',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Ignite your passion for hands‑on building and off‑road adventure with the LEGO Technic Jeep Wrangler Rubicon SUV (42227) — a detailed and dynamic building set designed to inspire creativity and engineering curiosity. This official Technic kit brings the rugged personality of the iconic Jeep Wrangler Rubicon to life with realistic features and playful accessories that make every build a rewarding experience. Featuring 723 pieces, this set introduces young builders aged 10 years and up to core engineering concepts through authentic functions like steering, working suspension and a realistic V6 engine. Each component works together to recreate how a real 4x4 vehicle moves and handles, offering a satisfying and educational play experience. One of the standout touches of this Technic model is the inclusion of fun lifestyle details: a LEGO‑scale rubber duck for the Jeep “ducking” fan tradition and a removable surfboard accessory that sparks imaginative storylines, whether for display or play. The set’s opening hood with support rod lets builders explore the engine bay, while the advanced LEGO Builder app offers smart digital tools to preview, rotate and track progress in 3D. Key Highlights: • Authentic LEGO Technic SUV model — Jeep Wrangler Rubicon design with realistic detailing. • Approx. 723 pieces that teach real‑world mechanics and STEM concepts. • Functional steering, suspension and V6 engine for interactive play. • Includes rubber duck and surfboard accessories for playful customization. • Ideal gift for builders ages 10+, car enthusiasts and STEM learners. Perfect for display on shelves or as a hands‑on weekend project, this LEGO Technic 42227 Jeep Wrangler Rubicon SUV delivers both an engaging build experience and a striking finished model — a great addition to any LEGO collection in the UAE.',NULL,299.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
