('c1130a8d-eddb-4c34-bdd4-fd2db7ee410e','2026-07-09 10:56:34.492039','2026-07-09 10:56:34.492039',NULL,'Pop! Animation: My Hero Academia - Armored All Might (Metallic) (ZGames Exclusive)','pop-animation-my-hero-academia-armored-all-might-metallic-zgames-exclusive','889698916448-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'f98bbd67-0b4f-473a-9b36-8d4e6c4d60c2',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Power up your collection with the Funko Pop! Animation: My Hero Academia – Armored All Might (Metallic) (ZGames Exclusive). This limited edition figure showcases All Might in his powerful armored form, enhanced with a striking metallic finish that highlights every detail of his heroic design. Inspired by My Hero Academia, this exclusive collectible captures the Symbol of Peace in a battle-ready stance, making it a standout piece for any anime fan or Funko collector. The metallic coating adds a premium touch, giving the figure a unique shine that sets it apart from standard releases. As a ZGames Exclusive, this figure is a must-have for collectors seeking rare and special edition items. Perfect for display, gifting, or completing your My Hero Academia lineup, this Armored All Might Pop! brings heroic energy to any collection.',NULL,89.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('c12027b6-824e-4d29-be4f-63b8187d97a1','2026-07-09 11:06:34.971298','2026-07-09 11:06:34.971298',NULL,'EA SPORTS FC 26 - Standard Edition','ea-sports-fc-26-standard-edition','p-5030943125329-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','EA SPORTS FC™ 26The Club is Yours in EA SPORTS FC™ 26. Play your way with an overhauled gameplay experience powered by community feedback, Manager Live Challenges that bring fresh storylines to the new season, and Archetypes inspired by greats of the game.OVERHAULED GAMEPLAY, POWERED BY COMMUNITY FEEDBACKPlay your way in EA SPORTS FC™ 26 with more responsive dribbling, smarter AI positioning, and sharper, more explosive movement — all based on community feedback. Goalkeepers now react more naturally with improved positioning, animations are more lifelike, and new Playstyles and Player Roles give you more ways to shape how your team plays.PLAY YOUR WAY WITH TWO DISTINCT GAMEPLAY PRESETSFC 26 introduces two new gameplay presets, each built for a different way to play. Competitive is tuned for head-to-head action in Ultimate Team and Clubs, with faster passing, smarter keeper rebounds, and more direct control, while Authentic brings a true-to-football feel to modes like Career, featuring more positionally-responsible defenders, realistic corner success rates, lifelike goalmouth scrambles, and more.CRAFT AND DEVELOP YOUR PERFECT PLAYER WITH ARCHETYPESBrand-new Archetypes, inspired by greats of the game, introduce new classes to Clubs and Player Career to bring more individuality to your player customisation and progression. Select a base Archetype and develop your abilities throughout the season by earning Archetype XP, upgrading attributes, and unlocking Archetype Perks for a truly distinct feel on the pitch.DISCOVER MORE WAYS TO COMPETE IN FOOTBALL ULTIMATE TEAMCompete in new ways across Football Ultimate Team™ with Tournaments and Live Events, as well as a refreshed Rivals and Champs experience. Tournaments will test your skills with up to four rounds of knockout football, while Live Events add more variety with themed competitions and content all season long. New Bounties allow you to earn additional rewards or accelerate your weekly progress. Additionally, EA SPORTS FC™ 26 launches Challengers - a new second-tier weekend competition designed for players in lower Divisions.TAKE ON NEW CHALLENGES IN MANAGER AND PLAYER CAREERExperience Manager Career like never before with all-new Manager Live Challenges throughout the new season. Take on a variety of real-world scenarios and alternative storylines—ranging from a few minutes of play to multiple seasons—and earn rewards including Season Points, Vanity, and ICONs and Heroes to use in modern-day clubs. Additionally, for the first time ever, movement in the Manager Market sees team tactics transform over time as new managers take the helm, changing the dynamics of every new season.TEAM UP ALL SEASON LONG IN CLUBSTeam up with big additions to Clubs in EA SPORTS FC™ 26. Experience more variety throughout the season when playing solo or with Clubmates in dynamic Live Events, featuring new challenges with varying entry requirements, modified Rush gameplay, and alternate rules, creating fresh opportunities to earn rewards all year round. Plus, for the first time ever, EA SPORTS FC™ 26 allows you to affiliate with up to 3 clubs at a time and become the last line of defence in Clubs Rush with the introduction of a revamped Be-A-Goalkeeper system.EXPERIENCE UNRIVALLED AUTHENTICITYExperience unrivalled authenticity in EA SPORTS FC™ 26, featuring 20,000+ players across 750+ clubs and national teams in over 120 stadiums and 35+ leagues. EA SPORTS FC™ 26 is the only place you can play the iconic UEFA Champions League, UEFA Europa League, UEFA Europa Conference League, CONMEBOL Libertadores, Premier League, Bundesliga, and LALIGA EA SPORTS in the same game, alongside the Frauen-Bundesliga, Liga F, Barclays FA Women’s Super League, D1 Arkema, National Women\'s Soccer League, and the UEFA Women\'s Champions League.',NULL,129.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
