asual gaming alike.Bluetooth Wireless Connectivity Connect easily to smartphones, tablets, and other Bluetooth-enabled devices, making it simple to switch between gaming, calls, and entertainment.Up to 24-Hour Battery Life Game longer with up to 24 hours of wireless battery life on a single charge, perfect for long gaming sessions and daily use.Powered by Logitech G HUB Customize your audio and microphone settings using Logitech G HUB software to fine-tune your gaming experience exactly the way you like it.Clean, Stylish Gaming Headset Design A modern, minimal design that looks great in any setup, available in Black and White color options to match your gaming style.',NULL,343.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
