('c3626ee7-a3e4-406a-b0fe-3a61a8570ae6','2026-07-09 11:16:13.135324','2026-07-09 11:16:13.135324',NULL,'FIFA 21 Ultimate Edition - PS4','ps4-fifa-21-ultimate-edition-pegi-arb','5030930124243-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescription Platform: PlayStation 4 (includes free upgrade to PS5 version)Genre: Sports, SimulationGame Modes: Single-player, Multiplayer, Online Co-opResolution: Up to 1080p on PS4, 4K on PS5 upgradeFrame Rate: 60fpsFIFA 21 Ultimate Edition - PS4FIFA 21 Ultimate Edition delivers the most immersive football experience yet, combining cutting-edge gameplay features, revamped career modes, and enhanced visuals. Powered by the Frostbite Engine, FIFA 21 lets you experience the intensity of the pitch, both online and offline, while bringing new levels of authenticity to the world’s most popular sport. The Ultimate Edition includes a host of exclusive content, including FUT packs, player bonuses, and limited-time in-game items to give you a head start in FIFA Ultimate Team. Play the game your way, whether it\'s managing your dream team, competing in VOLTA Football, or rising through the ranks in career mode. Key Features: Gameplay Enhancements: Improved player responsiveness, dribbling, and collision mechanics for fluid, lifelike football.FIFA Ultimate Team (FUT): Build your dream squad and dominate online or offline. Access exclusive content with Ultimate Edition bonuses.Career Mode: Take control of every aspect of your team’s journey with new depth in training, transfers, and match simulation.VOLTA Football: Enjoy street football in unique locations worldwide, with customizable characters and game modes.Licenses & Realism: Official leagues, teams, and stadiums, with authentic player likenesses and broadcast-quality presentation. Ultimate Edition Bonus Content: 3 Days Early AccessUp to 24 Rare Gold Packs for FIFA Ultimate TeamCover Star Loan Item for 5 FUT MatchesFUT Ambassador Loan Player PickSpecial Edition FUT Kits and Stadium Items',NULL,139.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('c36feb97-a33d-4bdf-9fe2-e3391e8af010','2026-07-09 11:01:50.816484','2026-07-09 11:01:50.816484',NULL,'XIGMATEK Gaming PC -  Intel Core i9-12900KF, RTX 4070 Ti X3 OC, 32GB DDR4, 1TB M.2 SSD Storage, ASUS TUF GAMING Z790-PLUS, 1050W Power supply','xigmatek-gaming-pc-intel-core-i9-12900kf-rtx-4070-ti-x3-oc-32gb-ddr4-1tb-m-2-ssd-storage-asus-tuf-gaming-z790-plus-1050w-power-supply','IBN-PC8',NULL,'simple',NULL,'3155269b-8d2e-4303-ba21-b03ba2ef8437',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Designed for gamers, streamers, and creators who demand premium performance, this ZGames White Edition Gaming PC combines the Intel Core i9-12900KF and Inno3D GeForce RTX 4070 Ti X3 OC White with 32GB of RGB memory and a fast PCIe Gen4 NVMe SSD. The result is a powerful and visually striking gaming system capable of handling demanding games, content creation workflows, multitasking, and everyday productivity with ease.Technical SpecificationsProcessor – Intel Core i9-12900KF Powering this high-performance gaming system is the Intel Core i9-12900KF, a flagship Intel desktop processor designed for enthusiasts, gamers, and content creators. Featuring Intel\'s hybrid architecture with Performance-cores and Efficient-cores, the i9-12900KF delivers exceptional processing power for demanding games, multitasking, streaming, video editing, and productivity workloads. As a KF-series processor, it is intended for use with a dedicated graphics card.Graphics Card – Inno3D GeForce RTX 4070 Ti X3 OC White 12GB Experience premium gaming performance with the Inno3D GeForce RTX 4070 Ti X3 OC White 12GB graphics card. Featuring a factory-overclocked design, triple-fan cooling solution, and stylish white finish, this GPU is built to handle modern AAA games, high-resolution gaming, ray-traced visuals, and advanced graphics technologies while maintaining efficient thermal performance.Motherboard – ASUS TUF GAMING Z790-PLUS WIFI D4 The system is built on the ASUS TUF GAMING Z790-PLUS WIFI D4 motherboard, engineered for reliability, stability, and long-term durability. Supporting Intel LGA 1700 processors and DDR4 memory, it offers integrated Wi-Fi connectivity, robust power delivery, comprehensive cooling features, and modern expansion options for gaming and productivity applications.Memory – TEAMGROUP T-FORCE DELTA RGB White 32GB (2×16GB) DDR4 3200MHz Equipped with 32GB of TEAMGROUP T-FORCE DELTA RGB DDR4 memory, configured as 2×16GB modules running at 3200MHz, this system provides smooth multitasking, responsive application performance, and ample memory capacity for modern gaming, streaming, and creative workloads. The white heat spreaders and RGB lighting perfectly complement the system\'s white-themed design.Storage – Lexar NQ780 1TB PCIe Gen4 NVMe SSD Store your operating system, games, and applications on the Lexar NQ780 1TB NVMe SSD. Utilizing a PCIe Gen4 interface, this drive delivers fast boot times, rapid application launches, and responsive game loading while providing ample storage capacity for everyday computing and gaming needs.CPU Cooling – DeepCool LE360 V2 360mm ARGB Liquid Cooler White Keeping the processor running at optimal temperatures is the DeepCool LE360 V2 360mm ARGB All-In-One Liquid Cooler. Featuring a large 360mm radiator and ARGB lighting, it provides efficient thermal management for high-performance processors while enhancing the overall aesthetics of the build with synchronized lighting effects and a clean white finish.Power Supply – GameMax GX-1050 PRO White The GameMax GX-1050 PRO White Power Supply delivers dependable power for this high-performance gaming configuration. Designed to support demanding gaming hardware, it provides the capacity required for enthusiast-grade components while complementing the white-themed appearance of the system.Case – Xigmatek Vision Arctic ARGB White All components are housed inside the stunning Xigmatek Vision Arctic ARGB Mid-Tower Gaming Case. Featuring a panoramic tempered glass design, integrated ARGB lighting, and a premium white finish, the case showcases the internal hardware beautifully while promoting effective airflow and a clean modern gaming aesthetic.',NULL,8299.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
