('c62a6864-4aa0-497f-868f-8b6379400b3c','2026-07-09 11:13:31.238943','2026-07-09 13:18:19.487725',NULL,'Tekken 8 Ultimate Edition','tekken-8-ultimate-edition','p-3391892029079-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescriptionPlatform: PlayStation 5, Xbox Series X|S, and PCResolution: 4K UHD with HDR supportFrame Rate: 60fps for smooth and responsive combatAudio: 3D spatial audio support for immersive soundscapes during battlesTekken 8 Ultimate Edition Tekken 8 Ultimate Edition is the definitive version for fans of the legendary fighting game series, offering a range of exclusive content and bonus items in addition to the core game. This edition provides premium digital content, character customization items, and special in-game bonuses that enhance both the competitive and visual aspects of the Tekken 8 experience. With access to the Season Pass and exclusive digital extras, the Ultimate Edition is perfect for dedicated players who want the full Tekken package. Ultimate Edition ContentsFull Game: Tekken 8 with all core gameplay, story mode, multiplayer modes, and new combat mechanics.Season Pass: Access to additional DLC characters, stages, and features as they are released, ensuring an expanded roster and fresh content.Character Skin Pack: Exclusive skins for fan-favorite characters, providing unique customization options unavailable in other editions.Avatar Customization Pack: A set of special customization items for player avatars, including unique outfits, emotes, and accessories.Tekken Soundtrack Collection: A digital collection of iconic tracks from the Tekken series, including remastered classics and new music from Tekken 8.Key FeaturesEnhanced Visuals with Unreal Engine 5: Next-gen graphics, lifelike environments, and smooth character animations for an immersive fighting experience.New Heat System: A fresh gameplay mechanic that allows characters to unlock powerful moves and abilities, adding new depth to competitive matches.Expanded Character Roster: Classic characters and newcomers with unique fighting styles, enhanced through Tekken 8’s advanced animation and detail.Cinematic Story Mode: Continues the epic Mishima feud with high-stakes storytelling and intense battles.Multiplayer and Tournament Modes: Ranked matches, tournaments, and casual lobbies with rollback netcode for seamless online play.',NULL,439.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,1,1,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
