('c7798209-38a0-4872-a64e-8853d0c779f4','2026-07-09 11:06:50.973968','2026-07-09 11:06:50.973968',NULL,'Getsufumaden undying moon Standard - Nintendo Switch','nintendo-switch-getsufumaden-16826869662041','4012927086230-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescriptionPlatform: Nintendo SwitchGenre: Action, Roguelike, Hack-and-SlashGame Modes: Single-playerResolution: 720p (Handheld), 1080p (Docked)Frame Rate: 30fpsAudio: StereoController Features: Joy-Con and Pro Controller supportGetsufumaden: Undying Moon - Standard Edition - Nintendo SwitchGetsufumaden: Undying Moon is a visually stunning action game set in a beautifully dark, side-scrolling world inspired by traditional Japanese art. Developed by Konami, this title draws from the rich lore and mythology of Japan to offer a challenging and atmospheric adventure. Players take on the role of the protagonist, Getsu Fuma, a skilled warrior who must journey through a hellish world filled with demons and supernatural creatures. With its blend of fast-paced combat, roguelike mechanics, and unique art style, Getsufumaden: Undying Moon delivers a thrilling experience for fans of action and dark fantasy. Key Features: Stunning Art Style: Experience the game\'s unique visual style, which blends traditional Japanese artwork with modern animation techniques, creating an eerie, atmospheric world.Challenging Combat: Engage in brutal and fluid combat against a variety of demonic enemies using a variety of weapons and abilities.Roguelike Elements: Explore procedurally generated levels, where death is a part of the journey. Each run offers different challenges and rewards.Character Upgrades: Collect various items and upgrades that enhance your abilities and weapons, allowing for deeper customization and strategy.Dynamic Boss Fights: Encounter massive, multi-phase bosses that require quick reflexes and tactical thinking to defeat.Epic Storyline: Unravel the mysteries of the world, delve into Japanese folklore, and experience a world at the mercy of dark forces.',NULL,169.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
