('ca4e7faf-f68d-4387-8bb7-e271d2a5fe5c','2026-07-09 11:02:38.318827','2026-07-09 11:02:38.318827',NULL,'Havit GK61 Recording Live Microphone - Black','havit-gk61-recording-live-microphone-black','6939119067557-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'3155269b-8d2e-4303-ba21-b03ba2ef8437',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Elevate your streaming, recording, and gaming audio with the Havit GK61 Recording Live Microphone. Featuring a cardioid pickup pattern that focuses on your voice while reducing background noise, this USB microphone delivers clear, professional‑grade sound for streaming, podcasting, voice chats, and content creation. With RGB lighting effects, responsive touch controls, and high‑resolution 192 kHz/24‑bit sampling, the GK61 blends performance and aesthetics for modern setups. Its plug‑and‑play USB‑C connection makes it simple to use on PCs and laptops without additional drivers. Perfect for streamers, gamers, voice actors, and creators, this microphone offers rich, clear audio capture while adding vibrant RGB flair to your desk or recording space. Technical Specifications Microphone Performance • Pickup Pattern: Cardioid (focuses on front‑facing audio) • Sample Rate / Bit Depth: 192 kHz / 24‑bit high‑resolution audio capture • Frequency Response: 100 Hz – 18 kHz• Sensitivity: ‑33 ± 2 dB• Sound Pressure Level: 110 dB• Signal‑to‑Noise Ratio (Mic Core): > 68 dB• Signal‑to‑Noise Ratio (Line Board): ≥ 96 dB• Output Impedance: < 2.2 kΩ Connectivity & Controls • Connection Interface: USB‑A to USB‑C data cable (1.8 m) • Plug‑and‑Play: Yes, no extra drivers required • On‑Device Controls: • Touch‑activated mute • Long‑press noise reduction function Additional Features • RGB Lighting: Dynamic lighting effects for gaming and streaming setups • Real‑Time Monitoring: 3.5 mm headphone port for mic monitoring (supported on some listings) Power • Working Voltage: 5 V • Working Current: ≤ 100 mA Physical • Dimensions: 95 × 95 × 213 mm• Weight: 294 g• Color: Black (with RGB lighting) Key Features • Cardioid Pickup Pattern — captures clear front‑facing audio, reducing ambient noise for speech, streaming, and podcasts. • High‑Resolution 192 kHz/24‑bit Audio — professional‑grade recording quality. • RGB lighting with dynamic effects to enhance your gaming/streaming setup. • Touch‑activated mute and noise‑reduction controls for on‑the‑fly audio management. • Plug‑and‑play USB‑C connectivity for easy setup and compatibility. • 3.5 mm headphone monitoring support for real‑time audio feedback (on some models).',NULL,89.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
