('cce352ca-2497-4163-9bff-985f123802cf','2026-07-09 10:43:19.281256','2026-07-09 10:43:19.281256',NULL,'Divoom Pixoo Pixel Photo Frame','divoom-pixoo-pixel-photo-frame','6958444602516-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'2f4818b1-ebde-4ac3-adb1-5c4f62d01e42',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Meet Pixoo - The Divoom Pixoo Pixel Display is a fun and useful piece of technology. You can use the Pixoo as a smart wall clock, able to display the weather and temperature, use it as a lamp or music visualizer, but far and away the most fun is using it display Pixel Art. Create Pixel Art - This led display sign is an excellent way to exercise creativity. In the Discovery tab you are given the option of designing you own image, animation and scrolling text message - all offering a large variety of options. Spice up your Room - There are many artists\' pixel paintings available on the app. The breadth of different motifs is really great and a real eye-catching decor in every room, every gaming lounge or just on the bedside table! Most Wished Gift - It is a led decor to have on your desk, and the multitude of animations and other art available to put on its limitless. It even comes in a beautiful packing box, and that would make a great Christmas/birthday gift for someone who loves pixel art, into video games or a Nerd. More Practical Features - It is not only the sign board for shops, hotels, coffee and bar to advertise and sales promotion, but also a great pixel art decor for an gaming room or office. Support to get quick notifications from Twitter, Facebook and Instagram, check the led screen of weather, thermometers and noise meter.',NULL,215.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('ccf5f90c-82f9-44dc-96b7-cb8245ebb10c','2026-07-09 11:11:17.350877','2026-07-09 11:11:17.350877',NULL,'Oxide: Room 104 - PS5','oxide-room-104-16667842791681','5060522098942-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescription Platform: PlayStation 5Genre: Psychological Horror, PuzzleGame Modes: Single-playerResolution: Up to 4KFrame Rate: Targeted 60fpsAudio: 3D Audio support for immersive sound designController Features: Haptic feedback and adaptive triggers for a more immersive horror experienceOxide: Room 104 - PS5Oxide: Room 104 is a psychological horror game set in a mysterious motel room. Players are trapped in Room 104 and must unravel the eerie secrets of the environment while facing dark forces that haunt the room. With immersive storytelling, eerie visuals, and tense gameplay, Oxide: Room 104 challenges players to solve puzzles and survive the night. Get ready for a chilling experience as you explore the strange and unsettling world of Room 104 on the PS5. Key Features: Psychological Horror: Experience a deep, unsettling narrative that unfolds as you uncover the secrets of Room 104.Immersive Atmosphere: Stunning graphics and sound design take full advantage of PS5\'s capabilities for a truly eerie experience.Intriguing Puzzles: Solve a variety of puzzles and challenges to unlock more of the room’s mysteries.Gripping Storytelling: Engage with a captivating and suspenseful story that keeps you on the edge of your seat.Survival Elements: Encounter dark forces and overcome terrifying situations to escape the room.Optimized for PS5: Enjoy faster load times, immersive haptic feedback, and 3D audio for a truly terrifying experience.',NULL,119.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('ccfd3d86-3ca9-4af1-b5c0-02519f6f4b4d','2026-07-09 11:16:43.077554','2026-07-09 11:16:43.077554',NULL,'Blaze and the Monster Machines: Axle City Racers - PS4','ps4-blaze-and-the-monster-ma-16667840621932','5060528035415-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','On your marks, get ready to race with Blaze and his monster machine friends! From Axle City’s colourful streets to the awesome Monster Dome stunt track, the world of Blaze is yours to explore! So buckle your seatbelts and take control of Blaze, Pickle, Darington, Zeg, Starla, Stripes… and even cheating Crusher! It’s time to race at blazing speed and go for the championship or compete with up to 4 players in couch split-screen mode! The fun keeps on rolling. You can boost, drift, jump and pull off stunts around amazing tracks like Race to Eagle Rock, Stuntmania, and more! Power-up with the Wrench to activate your character’s unique skill and outsmart the competition. Customise Blaze and his friends in the garage. And with STEM education features, plus accessible control options like Auto-Drive Helper, younger players will have a blast discovering as they race for glory!',NULL,169.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('ccfd62bb-a24b-45f7-80fc-4e549a93fef4','2026-07-09 11:13:58.774274','2026-07-09 11:13:58.774274',NULL,'PS4 Wolfenstein Youngblood Deluxe Edition','ps4-wolfenstein-youngblood-deluxe-edition-pegi-eng','5055856425083-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Wolfenstein: Youngblood is a brand-new co-op adventure from award-winning studio MachineGames, developers of the critically-acclaimed Wolfenstein II: The New Colossus, in partnership with Arkane Studios Lyon. The Deluxe Edition includes the Buddy Pass, allowing you and a friend to play the entire game together, even if they don\'t own the game themselves. This edition also features the Cyborg Skin Pack, which includes: - Cyborg player skin - Titanium alloy skins for all weapons - Titanium alloy hatchet - Titanium alloy knife - Armor-boosting pep signal You play as one of BJ Blazkowicz\'s twin daughters and undertake a do-or-die mission to find their missing father in 1980s Paris. Wield an arsenal of new weapons, gadgets, and power armor abilities in a fight to kick Nazis out of the city of lights. Paris 1980. Nineteen years after the events of Wolfenstein II: The New Colossus, BJ has disappeared after a mission into Nazi-occupied Paris. Now, after years of training and guidance from their battle-hardened father, BJ\'s twin daughters Jess and Soph are forced into action. Team up with a new cast of freedom fighters and brave the unsettling sights and sounds of twisted, alternate reality 1980s Paris.',NULL,79.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('cd021511-bd2b-4ed1-9711-bedec747ae21','2026-07-09 10:41:13.298011','2026-07-09 10:41:13.298011',NULL,'Govee RGBIC LED Neon Rope Lights for Desks','govee-rgbic-led-neon-rope-lights-for-desks','6974316993605-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'2f4818b1-ebde-4ac3-adb1-5c4f62d01e42',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescription Length: Customizable length options (typically 2-5 meters)Lighting Type: RGBIC LED Neon Rope LightPower Source: USB-powered (via wall adapter or power bank)Control Options: Govee Home app, voice control (Amazon Alexa/Google Assistant)Connectivity: BluetoothColor Options: Customizable RGB colors with color effectsSpecial Features: Music sync, flexible neon tubing, easy installation, smart controlsGovee RGBIC LED Neon Rope Lights for DesksThe Govee RGBIC LED Neon Rope Lights for Desks is a stylish and vibrant lighting solution designed to add a touch of creativity and personality to your workspace or desk setup. Featuring the advanced RGBIC technology, these neon-style rope lights offer multiple colors and dynamic effects that can be customized to your liking, creating a unique atmosphere for gaming, working, or relaxing. With easy installation and smart control features, this product is perfect for enhancing your desk space with vibrant and flexible lighting, while adding a modern touch to any room. Key Features: RGBIC Technology: RGBIC technology allows individual control of different colors in the same light strip, creating stunning multicolored effects that flow seamlessly.Perfect for Desk Setup: Specifically designed to line your desk, computer monitors, or even your gaming setup, providing a visually appealing and functional lighting accent.Customizable Effects: Choose from multiple lighting effects, adjust brightness, and change colors via the Govee Home app, or use preset scenes for quick customization.Voice Control: Works with Alexa and Google Assistant, allowing you to control the lights using voice commands for hands-free convenience.Music Sync: Built-in music sync feature that lets the lights react to your music or voice, creating a dynamic light show that matches the rhythm.Easy Installation: The rope light is flexible and comes with mounting accessories, making it easy to install on any surface or shape to fit your desk setup.Durable and Energy-efficient: Low energy consumption, long-lasting LED technology ensures a safe and cost-effective lighting solution for your desk.Wide Compatibility: Can be used with desktops, laptops, and monitors, or around other furniture for creative effects and accent lighting.',NULL,279.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
