('ce39c692-d10f-4156-9c2c-896515d0b1b9','2026-07-09 11:03:05.756380','2026-07-09 11:03:05.756380',NULL,'Super Mario Bros. Wonder - Nintendo Switch 2 Edition + Meetup in Bellabel Park - Nintendo Switch 2','super-mario-bros-wonder-nintendo-switch-2-edition-meetup-in-bellabel-park-nintendo-switch-2','0045496313999-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Experience a bold evolution of Nintendo’s acclaimed side‑scrolling platformer with Super Mario Bros.™ Wonder – Nintendo Switch™ 2 Edition + Meetup in Bellabel Park, an expanded edition built specifically for the Nintendo Switch™ 2 system. This enhanced version takes the beloved Super Mario Bros.™ Wonder adventure further with new gameplay mechanics, additional playable characters, and a vibrant multiplayer hub in Bellabel Park. In the Nintendo Switch 2 Edition, players can explore the Flower Kingdom across classic and new levels, tackling challenges solo or cooperatively. This edition introduces Rosalina and Co‑Star Luma as playable characters, expanding the roster of heroes available for platforming action. The game also introduces exciting power‑ups such as the Super Flower Pot, which lets characters transform and interact with the world in fresh, imaginative ways. A centerpiece of this edition is Bellabel Park, a dynamic in‑game social hub designed for multiplayer fun. Here you can team up with friends or family for a range of co‑op and competitive attractions, including mini‑games, Toad Brigade Training Camp challenges, and other interactive experiences. Whether you’re playing together on the same system or joining other players via online or local wireless modes, Bellabel Park enriches the Wonder experience with new ways to engage beyond the traditional platforming stages. The Nintendo Switch 2 Edition also delivers technical enhancements, taking advantage of the system’s capabilities with smoother performance, faster load times, and updated visuals. Support for GameShare allows one copy of the game to be shared locally with other players’ systems, expanding accessibility and cooperative play. Key Features: • Fully expanded Nintendo Switch 2 Edition of Super Mario Bros.™ Wonder. • Adds Rosalina and Co‑Star Luma as playable characters. • New multiplayer hub with Bellabel Park attractions, mini‑games, and training challenges. • Enhanced gameplay mechanics and fresh power‑ups like the Super Flower Pot. • Supports local and online multiplayer with GameShare functionality. • Optimized for speed, smoothness, and responsiveness on Nintendo Switch 2. • Estimated file size ~9 GB and supports various play modes including TV, Handheld, and Tabletop. Whether you’re revisiting the Flower Kingdom or discovering Wonder for the first time on Nintendo Switch 2, this edition delivers fresh content, deeper multiplayer engagement, and enhanced performance that elevates the classic Super Mario formula.',NULL,299.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
