('d11dc032-267f-4a82-a4e6-f02d83479575','2026-07-09 10:58:04.840875','2026-07-09 10:58:04.840875',NULL,'Pop! Movies: Harry Potter S20 - Harry Potter','pop-movies-harry-potter-s20-harry-potter','889698902724-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'f98bbd67-0b4f-473a-9b36-8d4e6c4d60c2',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Step into the magic of Hogwarts™ with the Funko Pop! Movies: Harry Potter – Harry Potter vinyl figure, an officially licensed collectible that celebrates one of the most beloved heroes in cinematic history. This Pop! figure depicts Harry Potter™ wielding the Resurrection Stone™, capturing a powerful moment from Harry Potter and the Deathly Hallows: Part 2 in classic Funko stylized form. Crafted from high-quality vinyl with detailed sculpting and vibrant paint, this figure stands at approximately 4 inches (about 10.2 cm) tall — a perfect size for display on shelves, desks, or as part of a themed Wizarding World collection. It’s ideal for both new fans and seasoned collectors looking to expand their Harry Potter lineup. Whether you’re commemorating the journey of the Boy Who Lived or curating a complete pop culture showcase, this Harry Potter figure brings charm, nostalgia, and collectible appeal to any space. With its timeless design and faithful attention to character details, it’s a standout addition for fans in the UAE and beyond. Key Highlights: • Official Funko Pop! Movies collectible — Harry Potter: Harry Potter • Features Harry holding the Resurrection Stone™ for a dramatic touch • High-quality vinyl figure with detailed sculpt and vibrant paint • Approximate size: ~4 inches (10.2 cm) tall • Perfect for fans of the Harry Potter films, Wizarding World collectors, and Pop! enthusiasts in the UAE Expand your collection with this iconic Harry Potter Funko Pop! and celebrate the magic, bravery, and legend of the world’s most famous wizard.',NULL,75.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
