('d20e1698-0647-4538-a655-53bb91dedbce','2026-07-09 11:11:27.784704','2026-07-09 11:11:27.784704',NULL,'Just Dance 2022 - PS5','ps5-just-dance-22-r2-pegi-arb-std','3307216211129-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescription Platform: PS5Genre: Dance, Music, PartyRelease Date: November 4, 2021Rating: E for EveryoneJust Dance 2022 - PS5 Just Dance 2022 brings the fun of dancing to your living room with a collection of the latest hits and timeless classics. This rhythm-based game allows players to follow dance routines to popular songs from various genres, including pop, hip-hop, and more. With the PlayStation 5\'s enhanced performance, Just Dance 2022 delivers fluid animations, vibrant visuals, and an even more immersive experience. The game supports solo and multiplayer modes, allowing you to dance with friends or challenge others in dance battles. With the addition of new features like the improved Sweat Mode, Just Dance 2022 offers a fun and energetic way to stay active. Key Features: New Songs: Dance to 40 new tracks, including hits like \"Believer\" by Imagine Dragons, \"Save Your Tears\" by The Weeknd, and more.All-New Modes: Experience a variety of modes including \"Kids Mode\" for younger players and \"Quickplay\" for easy access to random songs.Sweat Mode: Track your calories burned with the new Sweat Mode feature, making dancing even more enjoyable as part of a fitness routine.Multiplayer Support: Play with friends and family in multiplayer mode for up to 6 players simultaneously.Stunning Graphics: Enjoy the colorful visuals and energetic dance choreography in stunning 4K resolution on the PS5.',NULL,169.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('d21b01b2-4b87-4903-bb13-2516ec0afb36','2026-07-09 10:46:49.295591','2026-07-09 10:46:49.295591',NULL,'Nemesis Now Mortal Kombat Tankard 15.5cm 600ml Capacity','nn-mortal-kombat-tankard-15-5cm-600ml-capacity','801269149345-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'6c37856e-f0e1-41cc-baf4-c86092a4757a',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Officially Licensed Mortal Kombat Tankard 15.5cm From the best-selling fighting game series Mortal Kombat comes Nemesis Now\'s Mortal Kombat Tankard. Featuring the franchise\'s ionic “Elder God” dragon logo. Seemingly suspending the logo in place are the chains associated with Scorpion\'s Kunai. The series title “Mortal Kombat” is embossed around the rim of the tankard. Beneath, blood drips down onto the logo. Trapped below are the skulls of former tournament combatants. The handle is formed from the emergence of the Elder God as it moves through a billow of flame and smoke. Cast in the highest quality resin, this Mortal Kombat Tankard Is the perfect addition to any store that specialises in gaming and pop-culture collectibles.',NULL,279.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
