('d36a7bd4-42cc-40a4-92fc-fd9170775331','2026-07-09 10:57:09.156453','2026-07-09 10:57:09.156453',NULL,'Pop! Basketball: NBA Chicago Bulls - Michael Jordan (3 Times in a Row)','pop-basketball-nba-chicago-bulls-michael-jordan-3-times-in-a-row','889698905381-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'f98bbd67-0b4f-473a-9b36-8d4e6c4d60c2',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Celebrate the legendary career of the basketball icon with the Pop! Basketball: NBA Chicago Bulls – Michael Jordan (3 Times in a Row) figure. This Funko Pop! collectible honors Michael Jordan’s historic achievement of winning three consecutive NBA championships, capturing his dynamic presence and iconic Chicago Bulls uniform. Part of the Pop! Basketball series, this figure features Funko’s signature stylized design, perfect for display on shelves, desks, or sports collections. Ideal for NBA fans, collectors, and admirers of MJ’s unforgettable legacy. Key Features: • Official Funko Pop! Basketball collectible • Character: Michael Jordan • Commemorates 3 consecutive NBA championships • From the NBA Chicago Bulls • Stylized Funko Pop! design • Perfect for display and collection • Ideal for basketball fans and collectors Honor the legacy of Michael Jordan with this iconic Pop! figure.',NULL,75.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('d36ba7f8-ba4b-40a1-aefe-e2254ed6ac58','2026-07-09 11:16:51.937668','2026-07-09 11:16:51.937668',NULL,'Arcadegeddon - PS4','ps4-arcadegeddon-16667840618288','5060760887810-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Rise up and play with up to three friends in this ever-evolving cooperative multiplayer shooter. Explore multiple biomes, mini games, find hidden chests, and defeat numerous enemies and bosses. Gilly, the owner of a local arcade, is trying to save his business from a faceless mega corporation. To do so he takes all the top arcade games and connects them all to make a super game. Unfortunately, the mega corporation, Fun Fun Co. hacks the game and injects a virus. You and your friends need to save the game and the last hometown arcade. Fun Fun Co. owned enemies and the Data Demons/glitches that have occurred due to Fun Fun Co. tampering are taking over Gilly\'s game. FFC enemies are prototypes to their real world weaponry and this is their test site. Gilly needs you in the fight!',NULL,129.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
