('d6b16dde-b9b1-4047-85b8-bdccd9d4993b','2026-07-09 11:03:08.058454','2026-07-09 11:03:08.058454',NULL,'Sony PlayStation 5 DualSense Wireless Controller – Alpine Green','playstation-5-dualsense-wireless-controller-alpine-green','711719020035-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'8f5c8927-be48-41c7-9c7a-c40f59f564c2',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Introducing the Sony PS5 DualSense Wireless Controller – Alpine Green — the official PlayStation 5 controller that takes your gaming experience to the next level. Designed for immersive gameplay and flawless control, the DualSense controller blends cutting‑edge technology with ergonomic comfort, now in a striking Alpine Green finish. Built for the PlayStation 5 console, the DualSense controller features adaptive triggers that dynamically adjust resistance during gameplay, making actions like braking, pulling back a bowstring, or firing weapons feel more realistic. Haptic feedback provides nuanced vibrations that simulate in‑game motions and impacts, bringing environments and battles to life in your hands. These advanced sensory technologies help create a deeper, more tactile connection to your games. The controller also includes a built‑in microphone and headset jack, allowing seamless voice chat with friends without needing an external headset. An updated ergonomic design offers improved comfort for long sessions, while the USB‑C port ensures fast and reliable charging. Whether you’re exploring rich single‑player worlds or competing online, the Alpine Green DualSense controller delivers precision, comfort, and style — perfect for both casual and hardcore gamers.Key Features: • Designed exclusively for PlayStation 5 • Immersive haptic feedback and adaptive trigger technology for lifelike gaming sensations • Built‑in microphone and 3.5 mm headset jack for easy communication • Ergonomic design for extended comfort during long gaming sessions • USB‑C charging for quick and reliable power',NULL,359.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,