('d725e8f2-f1bf-4083-ad54-b0f192208593','2026-07-09 11:02:04.777018','2026-07-09 11:02:04.777018',NULL,'ASUS TUF Gaming GeForce RTX 4070 Ti SUPER O16G 16GB GDDR6X Graphics Card (AE)','asus-tuf-gaming-geforce-rtx-4070-ti-super-o16g-16gb-gddr6x-graphics-card-ae','4711387437834-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'3155269b-8d2e-4303-ba21-b03ba2ef8437',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','The ASUS TUF Gaming GeForce RTX 4070 Ti SUPER O16G GAMING (AE) is a high-end graphics card designed for durability, stability, and sustained gaming performance. Built on NVIDIA’s Ada Lovelace architecture, it delivers advanced ray tracing, AI acceleration, and efficient power usage. Equipped with 16GB GDDR6X memory, this GPU is optimized for high-refresh 1440p gaming and smooth 4K performance. The TUF Gaming series emphasizes long-term reliability with reinforced components and a robust cooling system designed for extended workloads. Key Features • NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 Ti SUPER GPU• 16GB GDDR6X high-speed memory• TUF Gaming military-grade durability design• Advanced triple-fan cooling system• Ray tracing and DLSS AI support• Optimized for 1440p and 4K gaming• Stable long-session performance',NULL,3879.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
