('db80b579-bfb5-483f-b812-9b961eb61792','2026-07-09 10:55:25.785465','2026-07-09 10:55:25.785465',NULL,'BLOKEES Transformers Galaxy Version Blind Box Figure - Assorted 1','blokees-transformers-galaxy-version-blind-box-figure-assorted-1','858050008893-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'f98bbd67-0b4f-473a-9b36-8d4e6c4d60c2',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','The Blokees Transformers Galaxy Version Blind Box Model Kit is a buildable collectible inspired by the iconic Transformers universe, designed for fans who enjoy hands-on assembly and surprise character reveals. Each blind box contains one randomly packed buildable figure, featuring snap-fit construction that requires no glue or paint. Once assembled, the model becomes a highly detailed, articulated Transformers character with accessories and display capability. Manufactured with durable materials and designed for collectors aged 10+, this series combines the excitement of mystery blind-box collecting with the satisfaction of model building.',NULL,39.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
