('dcc563c1-9642-4c2a-90d8-4b4e6f058607','2026-07-09 11:06:49.288283','2026-07-09 11:06:49.288283',NULL,'Disney Epic Mickey Rebrushed','disney-epic-mickey-r2-pegi-172709490550','p-9120131601288-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'8f5c8927-be48-41c7-9c7a-c40f59f564c2',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescription Platform: PlayStation 5, Xbox Series X|S, Nintendo Switch, PCGenre: Action-Adventure, PlatformerResolution: Up to 4K UHDFrame Rate: Up to 60fpsGameplay Modes: Single-player campaignDisney Epic Mickey: RebrushedRediscover the magic of Disney Epic Mickey in Rebrushed, a stunning remaster of the beloved action-adventure game. Step into the shoes of Mickey Mouse as he journeys through the Wasteland, a dark and twisted world inhabited by forgotten Disney characters. With a magical paintbrush in hand, players can choose to create or erase their path, influencing the fate of the Wasteland and its quirky inhabitants. Enhanced with updated visuals, improved gameplay mechanics, and additional content, Rebrushed invites both new and returning players to experience this enchanting tale. Key Features: Enhanced Graphics: Experience the Wasteland in stunning high-definition with remastered visuals and textures.Dynamic Paintbrush Mechanics: Use Mickey’s magical paint and thinner to shape the environment and solve puzzles.Moral Choices: Your decisions impact the story and the world, offering multiple paths and endings.Expanded Content: Includes new areas to explore, additional missions, and fresh interactions with iconic Disney characters.Improved Controls: Optimized for modern platforms with refined camera and gameplay mechanics.Iconic Soundtrack: Enjoy the re-orchestrated soundtrack that brings the world of Epic Mickey to life.',NULL,229.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
