ctor gates and PlayStation Link™ wireless adapter, keeping essential accessories organized and easily accessible. PlayStation Link™ Wireless Features When connected to a PlayStation 5 console, PlayStation Link technology unlocks additional functionality: • Connect a compatible PlayStation Link audio device and the FlexStrike fight stick simultaneously using a single PlayStation Link adapter.• Connect up to two FlexStrike wireless fight sticks through a single PlayStation Link adapter for local multiplayer battles.• Continue using a DualSense® wireless controller while FlexStrike is connected.• Wake your PS5® console by pressing the PS button on the FlexStrike fight stick once paired.• Designed by PlayStation®• Experience premium craftsmanship, exceptional build quality, and seamless customization options with the first wireless fight stick developed by PlayStation®. Key Features • Official PlayStation® FlexStrike™ Wireless Fight Stick• Compatible with PlayStation® 5 and PC• PlayStation Link™ wireless connectivity• USB Type-C wired connectivity• Ultra-low latency response• Custom-designed digital stick• Mechanical switch buttons• Durable ergonomic design• Built-in rechargeable battery• Up to 40 hours of wireless gameplay• Interchangeable square, circular, and octagonal restrictor gates• Internal storage compartment• Supports simultaneous PlayStation Link audio device connectivity on PS5• Supports up to two FlexStrike fight sticks through one PlayStation Link adapter on PS5• DualSense® controller can remain connected while using FlexStrike• PS5® console wake functionality• Includes carrying case for storage and transport Box Contents • PlayStation FlexStrike™ Wireless Fight Stick• PlayStation Link™ USB Adapter• Square Restrictor Gate• Circular Restrictor Gate• Octagonal Restrictor Gate• Carrying Case• Documentation',NULL,829.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
