('e29db2e2-a0e4-4e0e-8d87-04eda6335be9','2026-07-09 10:57:04.822548','2026-07-09 10:57:04.822548',NULL,'Pop! Rocks: BTS - RM (Wildflower)','pop-rocks-bts-rm-wildflower','889698863469-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'f98bbd67-0b4f-473a-9b36-8d4e6c4d60c2',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Celebrate the BTS leader with the Funko Pop! Rocks BTS RM (Wildflower) Vinyl Figure. Inspired by RM’s soulful solo track “Wildflower,” this collectible showcases RM in Funko’s signature stylized design, capturing his unique charisma and style. Ideal for BTS fans, ARMY collectors, and Funko enthusiasts, this figure is a must-have for anyone completing a BTS Funko collection. Inspired by RM’s “Wildflower” Era RM’s solo track “Wildflower” is a fan favorite, and this Funko Pop! figure pays homage to that iconic solo release. It’s perfect for display with other BTS Pop! Rocks figures, completing your K-Pop collectible lineup.',NULL,75.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
