('e4ad1343-2ae3-48fd-9422-b7fe5c5259b7','2026-07-09 11:13:50.092265','2026-07-09 11:13:50.092265',NULL,'The LEGO Movie 2 Video Game - PS4','lego-movie-2-16672147343996','5051892220262-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescription Platform: PlayStation 4Genre: Action, Adventure, PuzzleGame Modes: Single-player, Multiplayer (Co-op)Resolution: 1080pFrame Rate: 30fpsAudio: Dolby DigitalThe LEGO Movie 2 Video Game - PS4The LEGO Movie 2 Video Game for PS4 invites players into the vibrant and dynamic world of the LEGO universe, inspired by the hit movie The LEGO Movie 2: The Second Part. Join Emmet, Lucy, Batman, and all your favorite LEGO characters as they embark on a new adventure to save the world from the Duplo invaders. With cooperative gameplay, puzzle-solving, and exploration, it’s an action-packed journey where creativity and teamwork are essential to success. Key Features: Play as Iconic LEGO Characters: Take control of Emmet, Lucy, Batman, and other beloved characters from The LEGO Movie 2 and the LEGO universe.Build and Explore: Use your building skills to create structures, vehicles, and tools that help you solve puzzles and progress through the game’s various levels.Cooperative Gameplay: Team up with friends or AI-controlled characters to solve challenges and fight off enemies in an expansive LEGO world.Vibrant LEGO World: Travel across various colorful and diverse environments, from the bustling Apocalypseburg to the far-reaching lands of the Systar System.Character Abilities: Each character has unique abilities, allowing for varied gameplay experiences and puzzle solutions.Fun Combat: Engage in combat with the Duplo invaders, using creative attacks and LEGO-powered abilities to overcome obstacles.Humor and Story: Enjoy the movie’s witty humor and storyline, complete with fun cutscenes and memorable moments that stay true to the LEGO Movie’s charm.Build, Destroy, and Create: The game allows you to build your own creations, destroy enemies, and craft tools necessary to overcome challenges.',NULL,89.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
