('e72e383f-e63a-4e8c-8c4f-8e4a82780530','2026-07-09 11:12:45.042239','2026-07-09 11:12:45.042239',NULL,'Need For Speed Unbound - PS5','need-for-speed-unbound','5030948125089-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescription Platform: PlayStation 5Genre: Racing, ActionGame Modes: Single-player, Multiplayer (Online)Resolution: 4KFrame Rate: 60fpsAudio: Dolby Atmos, StereoController Features: DualSense support with adaptive triggers and haptic feedback for an immersive driving experience.Need for Speed Unbound - PS5Need for Speed Unbound brings the high-speed thrills and adrenaline-fueled racing action to the next generation with cutting-edge visuals, intense street racing, and a deep customization system. Set in a vibrant, urban open-world environment, this installment of the iconic Need for Speed franchise introduces an immersive, fast-paced experience where players race to become the ultimate street racer. The game features an exciting mix of police chases, illegal racing, and vehicle modification, all while incorporating bold new art styles and smooth, fluid gameplay on the PS5. Key Features: Next-Gen Visuals: Enjoy stunning graphics with detailed environments, dynamic lighting, and smooth 4K visuals (up to 60fps) for a truly immersive racing experience on the PS5.Customization: Modify and personalize your vehicles with an extensive range of parts, skins, and tuning options, allowing you to create the perfect ride to match your racing style.Open World: Explore a vast, open-world city filled with hidden shortcuts, dangerous races, and a variety of challenges as you build your reputation and climb the street racing ranks.Police Pursuits: Outrun aggressive police forces in intense chases, using your wits and driving skills to evade capture while racing to the finish line.Street Racing Culture: Dive into the world of underground racing with unique characters, bold visual styles, and an energetic soundtrack that brings the streets to life.Multiplayer Modes: Compete against friends or other players in exciting online races and challenges, with both casual and competitive modes available for endless replayability.',NULL,169.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
