('e7eb3d94-e3fd-481a-9932-443341a74f04','2026-07-09 11:13:31.809087','2026-07-09 11:13:31.809087',NULL,'Star Wars Jedi: Survivor','star-wars-jedi-survivor','pr-5035224125081-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','STAR WARS Jedi: Survivor is a science-fiction action video game developed by Respawn Entertainment and released by Electronic Arts in 2023. It is a direct continuation of the adventures of Cal Kestis, known from Star Wars Jedi: Fallen Order, revealing his heroic battle against the growing Empire forces. This time, with some new gameplay mechanics that make the story even more addictive. Story Five years have passed since the previous thrilling events, and now Cal is one of the last Jedi in the galaxy. Armed with the essential Jedi Order knowledge, the man is determined to end the cruel Empire regime and gather as many allies as possible. Will he be able to survive and revive once lost hope? Gameplay STAR WARS Jedi: Survivor is a stunning action RPG set in the legendary Star Wars universe, ten years after the heartbreaking events of the Revenge of the Sith movie. Playing as Cal Kestis, you will learn about the current situation to embark on an epic crusade against the mighty Empire forces. And by completing quests, you\'ll discover the details of a captivating plot developing in a classic Star Wars setting. Prepare for a dynamic and spectacular combat system focusing primarily on lightsaber battles. Character progression means better combat skills, perfect for creating deadly combos. And by combining them with the Force, you can become unbeatable in the fight against the most powerful opponents. But Star Wars is more than a heroic fight against the menacing Empire. One of the most vital cores of this saga is exploration. And in this game, you will discover many familiar planets and completely new locations with even more secrets, friendly characters, quests, and enemies. Where you can pet and ride various mounts to travel faster than ever! STAR WARS Jedi: Survivor is the ultimate essence of the best in video games from this iconic universe, so get ready for a lot of single-player fun in your favorite war-torn world. This content was copied from https://www.g2a.com/fr/star-wars-jedi-survivor-pc-origin-key-global-i10000337546013. It is protected by copyright, all rights reserved. If you want to use it, you are obligated to leave the link to the original source.',NULL,279.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
