('e95baf8e-3361-4b71-84f7-cc1216440668','2026-07-09 11:11:24.384374','2026-07-09 11:11:24.384374',NULL,'Assassin\'s Creed Shadows Special Edition - PS5','ps5-assassins-creed-shadows-special-mcy','3307216292982-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescription Platform: PlayStation 5Resolution: 4K with HDR supportPerformance: 60fps with ray-tracing enabledAudio: 3D spatial audio for immersive soundscapesController Features: DualSense haptic feedback and adaptive triggers for a tactile gaming experienceAssassin\'s Creed: Shadows Special Edition – PS5 The Special Edition of Assassin\'s Creed: Shadows for PlayStation 5 delivers the complete base game along with exclusive bonus content to enhance your journey through a shadowy and mysterious historical era. Step into the boots of an elite assassin, uncover secrets, and shape your legacy with additional in-game items and unique content available only in this edition. Special Edition IncludesBase Game: Full version of Assassin\'s Creed: Shadows, optimized for next-gen consoles.Exclusive Digital Content:\"Shadow Warden\" Armor Set: A stylish and functional outfit designed for ultimate stealth.Unique Weapon Skin: \"Eclipse Blade\" adds flair and function to your arsenal.Exclusive Mission – \"Veil of Darkness\": A special side mission that dives deeper into the lore of the Brotherhood. Key FeaturesImmersive World: Explore a richly detailed historical setting with dynamic environments, hidden secrets, and iconic landmarks.Enhanced Gameplay: Enjoy refined stealth mechanics, seamless parkour, and fluid combat systems that elevate the classic Assassin’s Creed experience.Next-Gen Visuals: Experience stunning 4K resolution, ray-traced lighting, and smooth 60fps gameplay.Rich Customization: Upgrade your assassin’s weapons, gear, and abilities to suit your preferred playstyle.Narrative-Driven Adventure: Embark on a compelling story that ties into the larger Assassin\'s Cree