('ec94339e-0fd8-4eed-acaf-87c7cd7ff2dc','2026-07-09 11:12:17.960134','2026-07-09 11:12:17.960134',NULL,'Dragon Ball Xenoverse 2','dragon-ball-xenoverse-2','p-3391892031119-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescriptioPlatform: PlayStation 5, PlayStation 4, Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch, PCGenre: Action RPG, FightingResolution: Up to 4K UHD (platform-dependent)Frame Rate: 60fps (platform-dependent)Gameplay Modes:Single-player campaignOnline multiplayer (PvP and Co-op)Local multiplayerDragon Ball Xenoverse 2Revisit the epic battles and timeless storylines of the Dragon Ball universe with Dragon Ball Xenoverse 2. This action-packed RPG-fighting game allows players to create their own custom character and dive into an expansive world where time itself is under threat. Featuring enhanced graphics, larger hubs, improved customization, and dynamic battles, Xenoverse 2 offers the ultimate Dragon Ball gaming experience. Key Features: Time Patrol Adventures: Rewrite Dragon Ball history and protect the timeline from threats.Custom Characters: Create and customize your own fighter with numerous races, appearances, and skills.Massive Hub World: Explore Conton City, an expansive online hub that supports up to 300 players.Iconic Battles: Relive legendary moments from Dragon Ball Z, Super, and beyond, with thrilling battles and cinematic cutscenes.Dynamic Combat: Engage in explosive, high-speed fights with ki blasts, melee combos, and transformations.Post-Launch Content: Access a wealth of downloadable content, including new characters, missions, and stages.Multiplayer Modes: Battle against players worldwide or team up for challenging co-op missions and raids.',NULL,119.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
