('ecfae8f1-4308-45c7-9e70-56500a651e6b','2026-07-09 10:50:23.603246','2026-07-09 10:50:23.603246',NULL,'LEGO Batman vs. Superman Batmobile V29 (76331)','lego-batman-vs-superman-batmobile-v29-76331','5702018063149-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'3155269b-8d2e-4303-ba21-b03ba2ef8437',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Experience high‑octane superhero action from the DC Universe with the LEGO: Batman vs. Superman Batmobile (76331) — an officially licensed building set that brings one of the most iconic vehicles from Batman v Superman™ to life brick by brick. Designed for both play and display, this collectible Batmobile model combines creative building fun with dramatic superhero flair. This set includes 220 pieces that recreate the sleek Batmobile with authentic details such as an opening cockpit, front‑mounted non‑functioning shooter, and distinctive headlight features rendered via graphic stickers. The vehicle measures approximately 18 cm (7 in) long once assembled, making it a standout piece for shelves or play zones alike. A highlight of this set is the armored Batman minifigure complete with a fabric cape, ready to take the driver’s seat and inspire imaginative superhero storytelling. The interior of the Batmobile also houses a commemorative golden coin that adds a touch of collectible appeal. Building this set is an engaging experience for creators aged 9 years and up — and with support from the LEGO Builder app, you can take advantage of interactive digital tools to rotate, zoom, and track your progress as you assemble the model. When the adventure winds down, display your Batmobile proudly as a highlight of any LEGO DC Super Heroes collection. Key Highlights: • Official LEGO DC Super Heroes building set — Batman v Superman Batmobile (76331) • 220 pieces for creative building and display appeal • Includes armored Batman minifigure with fabric cape • Functional opening cockpit and front‑mounted styling details • Measures ~18 cm (7 in) long once built • Perfect gift for LEGO builders and Batman fans in the UAE Add this dynamic Batmobile model to your collection and celebrate the spirit of superhero innovation and imagination.',NULL,149.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
