icks Navigate seamlessly with 2 full-size analog sticks featuring capacitive touch technology. Enjoy precise control and responsiveness for an enhanced gaming encounter. Haptics Elevate your gaming experience with HD haptics, adding a tactile dimension to every interaction. Feel the intensity of in-game actions through nuanced and realistic feedback. Trackpads Discover versatility with 2 32.5mm square trackpads offering haptic feedback. Achieve configurable click strength with pressure-sensitive controls, providing a tailored touch experience. Gyro Immerse yourself further with a 6-Axis IMU, allowing intuitive motion controls for an added layer of gaming realism. Portable Gaming Excellence Elevate your gaming experience anywhere with the Steam Deck OLED\'s compact and lightweight design. It\'s ergonomic controls and comfortable grip ensure extended gaming sessions on the go. SteamOS 3.0 A Seamless PC Gaming Experience Navigate your gaming world with ease using SteamOS 3.0, a custom operating system tailored for the Steam Deck OLED. SteamOS 3.0 provides a familiar and intuitive interface, allowing you to effortlessly access your games, customize settings, and connect with fellow gamers. Sensors Enhance your device\'s awareness with advanced sensors: Light Benefit from dual ambient light sensors (ALS) for optimal screen adjustments. Connectivity Stay seamlessly connected with cutting-edge connectivity options: Bluetooth Utilize Bluetooth 5.3 for controller, accessory, and audio support, enhanced by a dedicated Bluetooth antenna. Wi-Fi Experience high-speed connectivity with Tri-band Wi-Fi 6E radio, supporting 2.4GHz, 5GHz, and 6GHz bands with 2 x 2 MIMO. Audio Immerse yourself in a captivating audio experience: Channels Enjoy stereo audio with embedded DSP for an immersive listening experience. Microphones Enhance communication with a dual-microphone array. Headphone/Mic Jack Connect effortlessly with a 3.5mm stereo headphone/headset jack. Digital Audio Access multichannel audio via DisplayPort over USB-C, standard USB-C, or Bluetooth 5.3. Power Ensure sustained performance with reliable power features: Input Power up with a PD3.0 Type C power supply, featuring a 45W output and a 2.5m cable. Battery Game for extended periods with a 50Whr battery, providing 3-12 hours of gameplay. Expansion Expand your possibilities with convenient expansion options: microSD Boost storage capacity with UHS-I support for SD, SDXC, and SDHC. External Connectivity Connect controllers and displays effortlessly with DisplayPort over Type C, supporting up to 8K @60Hz or 4K @120Hz, and USB3 gen 2. Size and Weight Experience portability without compromise: Size Compact design at 298mm x 117mm x 49mm. Weight Travel light with an approximate weight of 640 grams. Software Optimize your gaming experience with robust software features: Operating System Navigate seamlessly with SteamOS 3, based on Arch. Desktop Enjoy a user-friendly interface with KDE Plasma.',NULL,4199.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
