('ee9428a3-f460-4e6a-903c-7aaf45aa247b','2026-07-09 11:12:40.080391','2026-07-09 11:12:40.080391',NULL,'Elden Ring - PS5','elden-ring-16667842792209','3391892017380-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescription Platform: PlayStation 5Genre: Action-RPGGame Modes: Single-player, Online Co-op, PvPResolution: 4K UHD with HDR supportFrame Rate: 60fps for smooth performanceAudio: 3D Audio support for an immersive experience in the dark and ominous world Elden Ring - PS5Step into the stunning and perilous world of Elden Ring, a critically acclaimed action-RPG from the creators of Dark Souls and Bloodborne. In a shattered world known as the Lands Between, you play as the Tarnished, a hero with a mysterious past, tasked with seeking the Elden Ring and becoming the Elden Lord. Explore vast, interconnected environments, battle terrifying foes, and uncover hidden secrets in this open-world masterpiece. With deep lore, challenging combat, and a beautifully atmospheric world, Elden Ring delivers a game-changing experience that combines the best elements of FromSoftware\'s acclaimed titles with the expansive freedom of an open world. Key Features: Open-World Exploration: Traverse vast landscapes, from mystical forests and desolate plains to deadly dungeons, all with seamless transitions between environments.Challenging Combat: Engage in strategic, brutal combat that demands precision and mastery, using an arsenal of weapons, spells, and abilities.Stunning Visuals: Experience the hauntingly beautiful world of the Lands Between with breathtaking graphics, rich landscapes, and atmospheric design.Deep Lore and Story: Uncover the mysterious past of the Elden Ring and the powerful beings that rule the Lands Between. The story is told through environmental storytelling and encounters with memorable characters.Multiplayer: Engage in co-op or PvP modes, summoning allies to assist in difficult battles or challenging other players in intense PvP duels.Customization: Build your character and combat style with countless options for weapons, armor, and magic.',NULL,239.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
