('efef739d-05d5-4f4b-924e-1db05704bd80','2026-07-09 11:15:54.157864','2026-07-09 11:15:54.157864',NULL,'Hitman 3 - PS4','ps4-hitman-3-pegi-eng','5021290089556-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Agent 47 returns as a ruthless professional for the most important contracts of his entire career in HITMAN 3, the dramatic conclusion to the World of Assassination trilogy.Agent 47 returns as a ruthless professional in Hitman 3. He is supported by his Agency handler, Diana Burnwood and his long-lost friend, Lucas Grey. Together, their mission is to hunt down the partners of Providence - an organisation that 47 and Grey promised to destroy. These are the most important contracts of Agent 47\'s entire career and when the dust settles, the world he inhabits will never be the same again.',NULL,149.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('eff71891-4ce8-4e62-8347-c1f167aeaa99','2026-07-09 10:52:30.364570','2026-07-09 10:52:30.364570',NULL,'Among Us Official 16-Inch Super Soft Squishy Plush - Pink','among-us-official-16-inch-super-soft-squishy-plush-pink','4895217509233-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'ff242680-eaae-4c64-9b7f-22aef1f926df',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','AMONG US PLUSH TOY – Official branded toys of the hit online multiplayer game Among Us. These 16-inch plushies make great gaming allies, to show fellow Crewmates your dedication to the game. PREMIUM STRETCH QUALITY – made from super-soft, squeezy, stretchy and durable soft Velboa fabric. GAMING COLLECTIBLE – Collect 4 colourful designs - Cyan, Orange, Pink, and Purple (sold separately) GIFT FOR AMONG US FANS – Character replicas of popular social deduction game Among Us. The perfect gift for gaming fans, kids, girls, and boys. OFFICIAL LICENSED PRODUCT – Official merchandise of Among Us, by InnerSloth.',NULL,99.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
