('f102f7fb-2e00-4726-9507-ade7e4899c67','2026-07-09 10:49:25.875539','2026-07-09 10:49:25.875539',NULL,'ASUS ROG Xbox Ally X Handheld Gaming Console 1TB - Black (RC73XA-NH011W)','asus-rog-xbox-ally-x-handheld-gaming-console-1tb-black-rc73xa-nh011w','4711636157346-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'3155269b-8d2e-4303-ba21-b03ba2ef8437',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','ASUS ROG Xbox Ally X Gaming Handheld The ASUS ROG Xbox Ally X is a next-generation handheld gaming system powered by the AMD Ryzen™ AI Z2 Extreme processor with integrated AMD Radeon™ graphics. Designed for high-performance portable gaming, it combines a 7-inch Full HD 120Hz touchscreen display with advanced cooling, ergonomic controls, and Windows 11 compatibility. Built for AAA gaming and cloud gaming experiences, the ROG Xbox Ally X delivers desktop-class gaming performance in a portable handheld form factor. SPECS Model : ROG Xbox Ally X (2025) RC73XA Gaming Handheld PC (RC73XA-NH011W) Operating System : Windows 11 Home Processor : • CPU: AMD Ryzen™ AI Z2 Extreme Processor 2.0GHz (24MB Cache, up to 5.0GHz, 8 cores, 16 Threads); AMD XDNA™ NPU up to 50TOPS • GPU: AMD Radeon™ Graphics Display: • 7-inch• FHD (1920 x 1080) 16:9• IPS-level• Anti-glare and low-reflection(AGLR) display• sRGB:100%• Adobe:75.35%• Gorilla® Glass Victus™• Gorilla® Glass DXC• Touch Screen (10-point multi-touch)• Refresh Rate:120Hz• Brightness:500 nits• AMD FreeSync™ Premium (Variable Refresh Rate) Memory: • 24GB LPDDR5X on board• Support dual channel memory Storage: • 1TB PCIe® 4.0 NVMe™ M.2 SSD (2280)• The actual speed of the systems vary by CPU specifications. I/O Ports: • 1x 3.5mm Combo Audio Jack• 1x USB 3.2 Gen 2 Type-C support DisplayPort™ / power delivery• 1x Type C support USB 4 (Thunderbolt™ 4 compliance, DisplayPort™ 1.4 with Freesync support, Power Delivery 3.0)• 1x UHS-II microSD card reader (supports SD, SDXC and SDHC) Control and Input: • View button• Menu button• L & R Hall Effect analog triggers• L & R bumpers• D-pad• Command Center button• Armoury Crate button• A B X Y buttons• 2 x assignable grip buttons• Thumbsticks: 2 x full-size analog sticks• Haptics: HD haptics• Gyro:6-Axis IMU Audio: • Smart Amp Technology• Hi-Res certification (for headphone)• Dolby Atmos• AI noise-canceling technology• Built-in array microphone• 2-speaker system with Smart Amplifier Technology Network and Communication: Wi-Fi 6E(802.11ax) (Triple band) 2*2 + Bluetooth® 5.2 (*Bluetooth® version may change with OS version different.) Battery: 80WHrs, 4S1P, 4-cell Li-ion Power Supply: TYPE-C, 65W AC Adapter, Output: 20V DC, 3.25A, 65W, Input: 100~240V AC 50/60Hz universal AURA SYNC: Yes Weight: 715 g (1.58 lbs) Dimensions (W x D x H): 29.0 x 12.1 x 2.75 ~ 5.09 cm (11.42\" x 4.76\" x 1.08\" ~ 2.00\") Xbox Game Pass: Xbox Game Pass Premium_3 months (*Terms and exclusions apply. Offer only available in eligible markets for Xbox Game Pass Premium. Eligible markets are determined at activation. Game catalog varies by region, device, and time. Security:• Microsoft Pluton security processor• Built-in Fingerprint Sensor Play Without Limits The ROG Xbox Ally X is built for gaming and ready for your games, anytime and anywhere you play. Play all your games at full power Experience the latest PC titles and games included with Game Pass fueled by the power of Windows in the ROG Xbox Ally XAccess your Xbox anywhere With Xbox Remote Play, stream games installed on your Xbox console — including Game Pass titles — straight to your ROG Xbox Ally X.Stream from the cloud Stream games directly from the cloud with Xbox Cloud Gaming (Beta) — no long installations, just instant play. (Requires Game Pass membership)Plug in. Power up. Connect the ROG XG Mobile to unleash up to RTX 5090 Laptop GPU performance with more ports for expansion. Transform your Xbox Ally X into a desktop-class powerhouse.Xbox Full Screen Experience A good handheld is ready at a moment’s notice. As soon as you power on the ROG Xbox Ally X, you can jump right into your favorite Xbox and PC games.All Access. One Xbox button. Quickly access the Game Bar with the dedicated Xbox button to see system stats, capture gameplay, or chat with friends. Plus enter the Command Center for quick settings and deep customization.Handheld compatibility The handheld compatibility program helps you understand when a game will work on your ROG Xbox Ally X and ROG Xbox Ally. Easily identify which games are handheld optimized. Don’t worry about tweaking settings. Just launch your game and play anywhere. Games that are mostly compatible mean minor adjustments might be required on your supported handheld. When a game has a “Should play great” Windows Performance Fit badge, it means that game will play, look, and feel great on your device.Less Charging. More Boss Fights. Portability means everything for a handheld, which is why we’ve equipped the ROG Xbox Ally X with a massive 80Wh battery. And it’s not just about battery size. The new Ryzen AI Z2 Extreme delivers greater efficiency and performance across the board: playing in Silent Mode will feel like the previous generation\'s Performance Mode, while giving you more playtime. up to 2X battery lifeInspired by Xbox controls Comfortable. Familiar. The ROG Xbox Ally is designed to feel natural, just like your favorite Xbox controller. Dedicated textured grips allow for a more secure hold — the perfect fit for comfortable long sessions at home or on the go.See it. Hear it. Feel it. The Xbox Ally X features a bright 7” 1080p touchscreen with a 120Hz refresh rate and FreeSync™ Premium for ultra-smooth gameplay — even outdoors. Protected by Gorilla Glass and powered by dual Smart Amp speakers, it’s built to look great and sound even better.Feel the Incredible ImmersionSee it. Hear it. Feel it. We’ve added a vibration motor into both triggers of the ROG Xbox Ally X, offering a huge upgrade to immersion. With independent trigger vibration, anything from racing a supercar to destroying hordes of zombies will feel incredibly visceral. The Xbox Ally X features a bright 7” 1080p touchscreen with a 120Hz refresh rate and FreeSync™ Premium for ultra-smooth gameplay — even outdoors. Protected by Gorilla Glass and powered by dual Smart Amp speakers, it’s built to look great and sound even better.NEXT-GEN PERFORMANCE The Power to Play, Built for the Future Powered by the AMD Ryzen™ AI Z2 Extreme, the ROG Xbox Ally X delivers next-gen graphics and ultra-smooth gameplay with AFMF. As the first AI-powered handheld, its built-in NPU is ready for the future of gaming.3 months of Xbox Game Pass Included Play 200+ games on ROG Xbox Ally X.*All Under Control',NULL,4199.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
