('f1984c5b-7787-4d07-9b85-1d24a1f0264e','2026-07-09 11:06:48.476747','2026-07-09 11:06:48.476747',NULL,'Final Fantasy I-VI Anniversary Edition','final-fantasy-i-vi-anniversa-17269098057540','p-5021290098923-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescriptionResolution: Optimized for HD displays with support for modern screen resolutions.Frame Rate: Enhanced animations and fluid frame rates for smoother gameplay.Audio: Remastered audio options with orchestral and original soundtracks available.Platforms: Available on PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch, PC (Steam), and mobile platforms. Final Fantasy I-VI Anniversary Edition The Final Fantasy I-VI Anniversary Edition is a collector\'s dream, celebrating the rich legacy of the first six titles in the legendary Final Fantasy series. This edition brings all six games together with enhanced visuals, modernized soundtracks, and exclusive anniversary-themed extras, making it a must-have for both longtime fans and newcomers. Each game has been carefully updated to maintain the charm and nostalgia of the originals while adding quality-of-life improvements that bring them up to today’s gaming standards. Anniversary Edition ContentsFinal Fantasy I-VI Games: Includes Final Fantasy I, II, III, IV, V, and VI with pixel-perfect remasters, featuring updated visuals, refined soundtracks, and optimized gameplay to enhance the classic experience.Collector’s Box: A premium box with original artwork commemorating the series\' iconic moments and characters, with embossed details and anniversary branding.Pixel Remaster Art Book: A full-color art book featuring artwork, sketches, and pixel sprites from each game, showcasing the evolution of the Final Fantasy style across all six titles.Exclusive Soundtrack Collection: A CD or digital download featuring remastered versions of some of the series\' most beloved musical pieces, including Nobuo Uematsu’s iconic themes and melodies from each game.Character Pixel Figurines: Includes pixelated figurines of iconic characters like Warrior of Light, Terra, Bartz, and Cecil in their original, classic pixel-art style.Anniversary Commemorative Poster Set: Six high-quality posters, one for each title, featuring key art that celebrates iconic moments from each game’s storyline.Game FeaturesEnhanced Graphics & Visuals: Pixel-perfect remasters maintain the charm of the original pixel art while refining backgrounds, animations, and UI for a modern look and feel.Modernized Soundtrack: A fully remastered soundtrack featuring newly arranged versions of the original compositions, with the option to switch back to the classic soundtracks.Quality-of-Life Improvements: Includes updated UI, auto-save features, faster character movement, and other gameplay tweaks that make these classics more accessible than ever.New Bestiary, Gallery, and Music Player: Added content that allows players to dive deeper into each game’s lore, art, and music, perfect for fans who want to explore beyond the main storyline.Original Storylines and Gameplay: All six titles retain their unique battle systems, characters, and plots, staying faithful to the stories that shaped Final Fantasy history.',NULL,249.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
