('f3146ab3-380b-4ad2-8f14-ebd0f991d630','2026-07-09 11:18:34.458325','2026-07-09 11:18:34.458325',NULL,'Battlefield 2042 - Xbox One','xbx-one-battlefield-2042-pegi-arb','5035228124882-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescriptionPlatform: Xbox OneGenre: First-Person ShooterPublisher: Electronic ArtsDeveloper: DICERelease Date: November 19, 2021ESRB Rating: T for Teen (violence, strong language)Storage: Approximately 50-60 GB (subject to updates and DLC)Multiplayer: Online only; no single-player campaign Battlefield 2042 - Xbox OneSet in a world on the brink of chaos, Battlefield 2042 focuses entirely on multiplayer gameplay. Classic modes like Conquest and Breakthrough return, alongside new experiences such as Hazard Zone and Battlefield Portal. While optimized for Xbox One, the game retains its core features and offers intense battles with up to 64 players per match. Key Features:Epic Multiplayer Modes: Enjoy massive 64-player matches in Conquest and Breakthrough, designed for strategic and action-packed combat.Dynamic Environments: Battle across large maps with destructible environments and extreme weather events like tornadoes and sandstorms.Specialists System: Choose from unique Specialists, each equipped with specific abilities and gadgets to suit your tactical approach.Battlefield Portal: Create and play custom game modes featuring content from past Battlefield titles like Battlefield 1942, Bad Company 2, and Battlefield 3.Hazard Zone: A high-stakes squad-based survival mode, where teamwork and strategy are key to retrieving valuable data drives.',NULL,139.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
