('f41cf619-130a-4d86-a8f5-c8ba5660f1f4','2026-07-09 11:02:54.144447','2026-07-09 11:02:54.144447',NULL,'Directive 8020 Deluxe Edition','directive-8020-deluxe-edition','p-3391892037395-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Directive 8020 Deluxe Edition is the enhanced version of the upcoming sci‑fi survival horror adventure from Supermassive Games, launching on May 12, 2026 for PlayStation 5 and Xbox Series X|S. In this chilling tale set aboard the colony ship Cassiopeia, Earth’s last hope becomes humanity’s greatest nightmare when a crash landing on the exoplanet Tau Ceti f reveals a shape‑shifting alien threat that can perfectly mimic its prey. Pre‑orders for the Deluxe Edition are now live, giving early adopters access to a suite of exclusive bonuses and content as they fight to survive and make critical decisions that affect the fate of the crew and possibly all of humanity. The Deluxe Edition includes additional digital content not available in the standard edition. Players gain access to: • The Dark Pictures Outfit Pack — Play as iconic crew members wearing outfits from past Dark Pictures titles. • Bonus Mission: The Dark Pictures Heirlooms Retrieval — A secret mission to collect relics that unlock chilling lore connections across the Dark Pictures universe. • Cinematic Filter Pack — Three visual filters (60’s black‑and‑white, 70’s film grain, 80’s VHS) to customize the game’s aesthetic. • Digital Artbook — Explore concept art and behind‑the‑scenes visuals from the development of Directive 8020. • Exclusive Soundtrack — Original score and selected tracks designed to heighten the horror atmosphere. With intense survival gameplay, meaningful narrative choices, and co‑op options for up to five players, Directive 8020 Deluxe Edition offers both replay value and exclusive bonus experiences for fans of cinematic horror.',NULL,209.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
