('f442e90c-2bff-4124-9aa9-ac7402b032e3','2026-07-09 10:50:17.979437','2026-07-09 13:18:03.773259',NULL,'Sakami One Piece Monkey D. Luffy Plush 25cm','sakami-one-piece-monkey-d-luffy-plush-25cm','8809592541708-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'3155269b-8d2e-4303-ba21-b03ba2ef8437',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Bring the energetic captain of the Straw Hat Pirates to life with the Sakami One Piece – Monkey D. Luffy Plush 25cm. This soft and durable plush captures Luffy’s iconic straw hat, outfit, and cheerful expression, making it a must-have for fans of the One Piece anime series. Crafted from high-quality materials, the 25cm plush is perfect for cuddling, display, or gifting. Its vibrant design ensures it stands out in any anime collection. Ideal for One Piece fans, anime collectors, and plush enthusiasts, this plush combines comfort, quality, and collectible appeal. Key Features • Official Sakami One Piece – Monkey D. Luffy Plush 25cm• Soft, high-quality materials for durability and comfort• Features Luffy’s signature straw hat and outfit• Perfect for display, cuddling, or gifting• Great collectible for One Piece fans and anime enthusiasts• Sized at 25cm, ideal for shelves, desks, or play',NULL,85.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
