('f4847416-04b2-4773-8edb-56285adcaf4d','2026-07-09 11:01:37.620041','2026-07-09 11:01:37.620041',NULL,'Hello Kitty Party Land Day 1 Edition','hello-kitty-party-land-day-1-edition','s-3391892044799-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Hello Kitty Party Land Day 1 EditionDescriptionScreenshotsTogether With Heart! Join the party in Hello Kitty Party Land Day 1 Edition and team up with your favourite Sanrio characters in a fun-filled adventure packed with exciting mini-games and memorable moments. Step into the colourful world of Sanrio and play together with family and friends as you explore Party Land, meet beloved characters, and enjoy a variety of entertaining activities.Immerse Yourself in the Sanrio Universe Meet more than 145 beloved Sanrio characters and collect their stickers as you journey through Party Land. Choose from 16 playable Sanrio characters and team up with your favourite companions, or create your own avatar and join the fun your way.Partner Up and Enjoy Exciting Mini-Games Jump into 45+ mini-games and enjoy multiplayer fun both offline and online. Take on Board Game Mode and keep the party going with quick mini-games while waiting for your next turn.Customize Your Avatar Create a character that\'s uniquely yours with a wide range of customization options. Personalize everything from hairstyles to outfits, and unlock even more items as you progress through the game.Game Features • Explore the colourful world of Sanrio with over 145 beloved characters• Play as one of 16 playable Sanrio characters or create your own avatar• Enjoy 45+ mini-games with friends online or offline• Experience Board Game Mode and additional quick mini-games• Customize your avatar with a variety of hairstyles, outfits, and unlockable items• Collect character stickers throughout your adventure',NULL,189.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('f496f9a6-31d6-4008-9847-c6d76329ed6b','2026-07-09 11:06:45.692648','2026-07-09 11:06:45.692648',NULL,'Suikoden I&II HD Remaster: Day 1','suikoden-i-ii-hd-remaster-day-1','p-4012927151204-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','The Suikoden SeriesThe Suikoden Series began its journey in 1995 and quickly gained popularity as KONAMI\'s original RPG series, releasing a total of 11 titles including spin-offs. Each installment of the game featured new locations and unique characters, thoughtfully woven together storylines, and more than 108 charming allies to tell a wartime story full of grandeur.The hero, whose father is one of the empire\'s five generals, gathers his 108 Stars of Destiny to fight against the oppressive rule of the Empire. The first title of the now acclaimed Suikoden series.Childhood friends, tossed about by a great whirlpool of destiny. Where will the paths they choose lead them to...? Set three years after the first game, this sequel moved many fans and became an iconic title in the series.Basic System[Battle]A turn-based command system is employed in battles, with a battle formation made up of front and back members. S range characters are unable to attack from the back, M range characters can attack from the back, but are unable to hit backline enemy members, while L range characters can attack any enemy.[108 Stars and The Home Base]The hero will acquire a castle at one point in the story, to act as a home base. All characters that are not included in the party will reside here. Some characters even have special roles within the home base, such as opening up shop. Travel around the world to recruit allies and enhance the home base.[War]A war event, a special type of battle, will pop up from time to time. Suikoden 1: When the number of troops reach zero, the side with soldiers remaining wins. Choose a unit to attack with, and the results will differ according to its type and advantages/disadvantages. Suikoden 2: Utilize an army battle system similar to a turn-based RPG. Victory is determined based by battle conditions or by defeating the entire opposing army.[Duel]A duel is a special type of battle that consists of a fight between two characters. Choose to either attack, defend, or use a special attack and the damage will be calculated according to the advantage/disadvantages of both character\'s actions. Listen well and choose wisely to get the upper hand.',NULL,229.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
