('f5098484-b92f-4226-b697-1b84d8822b8d','2026-07-09 10:55:47.564588','2026-07-09 10:55:47.564588',NULL,'BLOKEES Transformers Classic Elita-1','blokees-transformers-classic-elita-1','858050008589-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'f98bbd67-0b4f-473a-9b36-8d4e6c4d60c2',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','BLOKEES Transformers Classic Elita-1 is a buildable collectible figure based on the Transformers character Elita-1. Designed in a block-style construction format, this model kit is part of the Transformers Classic series and allows users to assemble a detailed display figure. It is ideal for Transformers fans, collectors, and hobbyists who enjoy model-building toys. Once assembled, it becomes a display-ready collectible suitable for shelves, desks, or showcases.',NULL,99.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('f50a501b-a7af-4857-a879-38afddc73be9','2026-07-09 11:11:37.250102','2026-07-09 11:11:37.250102',NULL,'Far Cry 6 - PS5','ps5-far-cry-6-pegi-ara','3307216186175-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Welcome to Yara, a tropical paradise frozen in time. Far Cry 6 thrusts players into a modern-day guerrilla revolution. As dictator of Yara, Anton Castillo is intent on restoring his nation back to its former glory by any means, with his son, Diego, following in his bloody footsteps. Become a guerrilla fighter and liberate Yara. As Dani Rojas (playable as a female or male character), you will help stoke the fires of revolution through guerrilla warfare across the island of Yara, from verdant jungles to the urban streets of the capital city, Esperanza. You’ll use a powerful array of weapons and vehicles, and build a network of allies to fight alongside you, including Fangs for Hire like Chorizo, the dangerously distracting wiener dog. As President Castillo prepares his son Diego, played by Anthony Gonzalez (“Coco”), to succeed him, you will do all you can to ensure his plans don’t come to fruition.',NULL,199.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('f518b232-f209-43c3-9325-31eb6dc0c877','2026-07-09 11:01:47.678078','2026-07-09 11:01:47.678078',NULL,'Elden Ring Nightreign Collector’s Edition - PC','elden-ring-nightreign-collector-s-edition-pc','3391892034790-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'3155269b-8d2e-4303-ba21-b03ba2ef8437',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Elden Ring Nightreign Collector’s Edition is a standalone action RPG experience set within the Elden Ring universe, published by Bandai Namco Entertainment. Designed as a cooperative-focused adventure, the game allows players to team up in groups of up to three to face dynamic nighttime challenges in a shifting world environment. Each session presents changing conditions, enemies, and progression paths, requiring coordination and strategy to overcome escalating threats. Players take control of uniquely skilled heroes, each featuring distinct abilities that can combine to create powerful team synergies. The gameplay structure emphasizes cooperative survival, environmental pressure, and boss encounters at the end of each cycle. Collector’s Edition Includes: • Elden Ring Nightreign base game (PC – Steam code)• DLC content (as included in Collector’s Edition distribution)• Steelbook case• 25 cm character statue• Hardcover artbook (approx. 40 pages)• 8 collectible character cards• Digital soundtrack',NULL,699.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
