('f5af751e-9cd2-4527-a39d-b2a4869bf307','2026-07-09 10:58:12.710368','2026-07-09 10:58:12.710368',NULL,'Pop! Tv: The Wire - McNulty','pop-tv-the-wire-james-jimmy-mcnulty','889698657624-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'f98bbd67-0b4f-473a-9b36-8d4e6c4d60c2',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Bring the iconic detective from Baltimore’s streets into your collection with the Funko Pop! TV: The Wire – James “Jimmy” McNulty vinyl figure. Officially licensed by Funko, this collectible captures the sharp-witted, rebellious detective with his signature expression and classic attire from the critically acclaimed TV series The Wire. Standing approximately 3.75 inches tall, this figure is made from high-quality vinyl with Funko’s signature stylized design. The detailed sculpting brings McNulty’s determined personality to life, making it a standout piece for display on shelves, desks, or among other TV Pop! collectibles. Ideal for fans of The Wire, television memorabilia collectors, or Funko Pop! enthusiasts, this McNulty figure adds both nostalgia and character to your collection. It’s perfect for showcasing the drama and intrigue of Baltimore’s crime world right in your home. Key Highlights: • Official Funko Pop! TV collectible — James “Jimmy” McNulty. • Detailed vinyl figure with stylized design capturing McNulty’s personality. • Approximate size: ~3.75 inches tall, perfect for display with other Pop! figures. • Ideal for The Wire fans, TV series collectors, and Funko Pop enthusiasts in the UAE. • Great for gifting or expanding a Pop! TV collection.',NULL,75.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('f5b051ec-9f13-4d3d-bd2f-4a8da186de13','2026-07-09 10:41:03.886161','2026-07-09 10:41:03.886161',NULL,'CHARMANDER PLUSH BACKPACK 36 cm','charmander-plush-backpack-36','8426842051215-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'cfac33db-f672-41dc-8d02-baaac0891814',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','The Pokémon 3D Backpack Plush is your new backpack to take with you everywhere. In addition, you can also use the bag as a hug. The shoulder straps can be detached, so they don\'t get in the way when you cuddle with your favorite Pokémon character. It\'s no longer \'catch them all\', but \'collect them all\'. Which bag do you choose? Will it be Pikachu, Charmander or Squirtle? Dimension item: 38 x 31 x 16 cm Suitable for: From 3 years',NULL,139.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
