('f62152ce-3ac5-4e1b-8c4a-40be1fb9e310','2026-07-09 11:03:17.506121','2026-07-09 11:03:17.506121',NULL,'Nintendo Switch 2 Console with Mario Kart World Game Cartridge [UAE Version]','nintendo-switch-2-console-with-mario-kart-world-game-cartridge-uae-version','45496337279-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'a98d2277-6776-45b2-b725-b5c4dfb53a56',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Nintendo Switch 2 Console + Mario Kart World Game Cartridge [UAE Version] The Ultimate Hybrid Console Experience, Ready to Race in 4K! The Nintendo Switch 2 is the monumental successor to the original, and this bundle gives you the best start possible with the defining new title: Mario Kart World. This is the authentic UAE Version and includes the game as a physical cartridge. Console Highlights: Next-Generation Performance The Nintendo Switch 2 is a massive leap forward, offering significant upgrades in every mode: Nintendo Switch 2: Key UpgradesHere are the most important features and what they mean for the gamer: New High-Performance Display: Enjoy games on a larger 7.9-inch screen with a sharp 1080p resolution. The screen supports 120Hz refresh rates and Variable Refresh Rate (VRR) for incredibly smooth motion and gaming on the go. Next-Gen Console Experience: Play on your big screen with up to 4K resolution at 60fps (when docked) or smooth 120fps gameplay at 1080p/1440p resolutions on compatible TVs. Massive Storage Boost: The console comes with 256GB of fast internal UFS storage—a huge upgrade from the original model—giving you ample space for game downloads right out of the box. Storage is expandable up to 2TB via the new microSD Express slot. Revolutionary Joy-Con 2: The new controllers attach magnetically and feature enhanced precision, HD Rumble 2, and a new C Button that enables the built-in GameChat feature for easy voice and video communication. Dedicated UAE Version: The console is the official UAE Specification, guaranteeing the correct power adapter, regional coding, and local warranty support for peace of mind. Mario Kart World: Open-World ChaosYour bundle includes the Mario Kart World game on a physical cartridge, ready to play instantly. This is the biggest, most ambitious entry in the series: Open-World Racing: Drive seamlessly across a massive, interconnected map featuring diverse environments like cities, volcanos, and vast waters. 24-Player Races: Experience the exhilarating chaos of racing with up to 24 players in online competitions. New Modes: Try the intense Knockout Tour elimination mode or explore the massive world with missions in Free Roam mode. Next-Gen Graphics: Graphics and track details are enhanced to leverage the Switch 2\'s power, making it the most visually stunning Mario Kart ever. What’s Included in Your UAE Bundle Nintendo Switch 2 Console (256GB, UAE Version) Mario Kart World (Full Game Cartridge) Joy-Con 2 (L) & Joy-Con 2 (R) (typically Light Blue/Light Red or Black) Nintendo Switch 2 Dock (4K Ready) Joy-Con 2 Grip and Straps (x2) AC Adapter and Ultra High-Speed HDMI™ Cable',NULL,2099.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('f6224927-52a3-46c0-b9f6-f2e74bd5c9f1','2026-07-09 11:09:25.016457','2026-07-09 11:09:25.016457',NULL,'OIVO PS5 Controller Silicon Case','otvo-ps5-controller-silicon-case','6972861546147-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'8f5c8927-be48-41c7-9c7a-c40f59f564c2',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','COMPATIBILITY: For PlayStation 5 Controller GRIP: Intense gamers know that one slip can be devastating. Get a grip on your PS5 controller with this form-fit rubber skin. The soft silicone gel feels satisfying in your hands and also offers protection. PROTECTION: This rubber skin is a great solution to keep your controller protected from scuffs and drops. The flexible material provides both shock absorption and impact protection. STYLE: The rubber skins are available in different colors so you can personalize and protect your controller in style! Buy multiple colors and differentiate your controllers for quick and easy identification. FUNCTIONALITY: Your controller remains fully functional in the rubber skin. You have direct access to all buttons and ports. COLOR: This offer is for the BLACK color. *This offer is the protective case. The PS5 Controller is not included.',NULL,39.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
