('f78ab7e0-b5c8-4712-b940-564cda551065','2026-07-09 10:57:50.246389','2026-07-09 10:57:50.246389',NULL,'Pop! Animation: The War of the Rohirrim - Wulf','pop-animation-the-war-of-the-rohirrim-wulf','889698802482-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'f98bbd67-0b4f-473a-9b36-8d4e6c4d60c2',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Step into the epic world of The War of the Rohirrim with this Funko Pop! Wulf figure. Featuring the legendary warrior in iconic pose, this stylized vinyl collectible captures the strength and spirit of Rohan’s hero, making it a standout addition to your Middle-earth display. Perfect for Lord of the Rings fans, collectors, and Funko enthusiasts seeking unique cinematic figures. Key Features • Official Funko Pop! Movies collectible • Features Wulf from The War of the Rohirrim in battle-ready pose • High-quality vinyl figure with detailed sculpting • Ideal for Lord of the Rings and Funko collectors • Display-ready collectible for shelves or themed displays',NULL,75.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('f78c6df5-978b-41cd-a156-a8df1077142b','2026-07-09 11:07:21.641735','2026-07-09 11:07:21.641735',NULL,'SW Pokemon Scarlet','sw-pokemon-scarlet','45496598211-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Catch, battle, and train Pokémon in the Paldea Region, a vast land filled with lakes, towering peaks, wastelands, small towns, and sprawling cities. Choose either Sprigatito, Fuecoco, or Quaxly, to be your first partner Pokémon before setting off on your journey through Paldea. Embark on an independent study called the Treasure Hunt to gain new experiences, meet new people, and find your very own treasure.',NULL,189.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('f798ffb8-91fa-4829-8a94-0e630851df19','2026-07-09 11:14:05.324782','2026-07-09 11:14:05.324782',NULL,'PS4 Warhammer End Times - Vermintide','ps4-warhammer-end-times-vermintide-r2','9006113009085-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Vermintide is a co-operative action first person shooter and melee combat adventure set in the End Times of the iconic Warhammer Fantasy universe. Vermintide takes place in and around Ubersreik, a city overrun by Skaven. You will assume the role of one of five heroes, each featuring different play-styles, abilities, gear and personality. Working cooperatively, you must use their individual attributes to survive an apocalyptic invasion from the hordes of relentless rat-men, known as the Skaven. Battles will take place across a range of environments stretching from the top of the Magnus Tower to the bowels of the Under Empire. The time of mortals is ending, and the reign of Chaos draws ever closer. The Dark Gods are at last united in a singular purpose, losing their madness across the world as never before. In the Empire of Sigmar, Karl Franz\'s gaze is focused on the incursion of the savage northmen, but it is not the only threat. As the Chaos moon Morrslieb waxes full, shrill voices echo through tunnels gnawed far beneath the Empire\'s cities, and a Skaven host swarms towards the surface. It emerges first in the city of Ubersreik, a screeching mass that consumes all before it. Soon Ubersreik is a charnel-town, drowning beneath the malevolent shadow of the Horned Rat. Yet even in the darkest times, there are always champions to light the way. As Ubersreik cowers, five heroes, united by capricious fate, carry the fight to the rat-men. It remains to be seen whether they have the strength to survive, let alone work together long enough to thwart the invaders. One truth, however, is beyond all doubt: should these five fall, then Ubersreik will fall with them.',NULL,39.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('f7a7c617-3788-4194-ac32-00415df06264','2026-07-09 10:40:55.609598','2026-07-09 10:40:55.609598',NULL,'POKEMON SQUIRTLE BACKPACK (MC-112-PK)','squirtle-plush-backpack-33','8426842051192-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'cfac33db-f672-41dc-8d02-baaac0891814',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','The Pokémon 3D Backpack Plush is your new backpack to take with you everywhere. In addition, you can also use the bag as a hug. The shoulder straps can be detached, so they don\'t get in the way when you cuddle with your favorite Pokémon character. It\'s no longer \'catch them all\', but \'collect them all\'. Which bag do you choose? Will it be Pikachu, Charmander or Squirtle? Dimension item: 38 x 31 x 16 cm Suitable for: From 3 years',NULL,139.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('f7a99b26-6bbe-4641-9017-a617956fa7d4','2026-07-09 11:12:59.724008','2026-07-09 11:12:59.724008',NULL,'Warhammer 40,000: Space Marine 2 Gold Edition','warhammer-40000-space-marine-2-gold-edition','p-3512899967793-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescriptionGraphics: Same 4K resolution with HDR at 60fps, delivering stunning visuals in every Gold Edition mode.DualSense Features: Full support for haptic feedback and adaptive triggers, with exclusive effects for Gold Edition weapons and armor variations.3D Audio: Enhanced audio for realistic, immersive soundscapes that capture the scale of Space Marine 2’s battles.Warhammer 40,000: Space Marine 2 Gold Edition The Warhammer 40,000: Space Marine 2 Gold Edition for PS5 is the ultimate bundle for fans who want an all-inclusive experience in the grimdark universe of Warhammer 40K. This exclusive edition offers a wealth of additional in-game content, collectible items, and early access privileges, giving players a head start and a unique flair as they face the deadly Tyranid swarms. With premium extras like Ultramarine-inspired skins, a collectible figurine, and expanded digital content, the Gold Edition is the definitive choice for those looking to embody the true spirit of a Space Marine. Gold Edition ContentsFull Game: Access to Warhammer 40,000: Space Marine 2 on PS5, taking you into the heart of brutal, large-scale battles.Exclusive Ultramarine Armor Skins: Unique cosmetic skins for Lieutenant Titus, allowing you to personalize his armor with iconic Ultramarine designs that honor the legacy of the Chapter.Season Pass: Includes access to all planned expansions, DLCs, and bonus missions, promising new stories, weapons, and skins to expand the universe.Digital Art Book: A beautiful digital collection of concept art, design details, and behind-the-scenes artwork that captures the game’s dark, gothic atmosphere.Official Digital Soundtrack: A complete collection of Space Marine 2’s soundtrack, including bonus tracks created exclusively for the Gold Edition.Collector’s Figurine: A high-quality figurine of Lieutenant Titus in his Ultramarine power armor, standing in a powerful battle stance (included with physical editions only).Exclusive Weapon Pack: Unique weapon skins inspired by legendary Warhammer 40K relics, adding a personal touch to your arsenal.Exclusive Features and In-Game PerksEarly Access: Start the battle 48 hours before the standard release, giving you a head start in single-player and co-op missions.Gold Edition Emblems: Special in-game emblems for co-op and multiplayer modes, showing off your dedication to the Imperium and your Gold Edition status.Co-Op Customization Options: Extra customization items exclusive to co-op mode, such as additional banners, armor decals, and color schemes.Priority Beta Access: Early access to any beta testing phases or pre-release demos, offering a first look at upcoming expansions or content.',NULL,369.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
