('fa151524-2d35-4cc2-87cf-541b02f9dd5e','2026-07-09 10:50:18.767321','2026-07-09 10:50:18.767321',NULL,'Barrado Plush: One Piece - Sanji','barrado-plush-one-piece-sanji','8436591581444-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'3155269b-8d2e-4303-ba21-b03ba2ef8437',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Bring the suave chef of the Straw Hat Pirates to life with the Barrado Plush One Piece – Sanji. This high-quality plush features Sanji in his signature black suit and blond hair, capturing the charm and style of the beloved character from the One Piece anime. Made from soft and durable materials, it’s perfect for display, cuddling, or gifting. The detailed design and vibrant colors make it a must-have collectible for anime fans. Ideal for One Piece enthusiasts, anime collectors, and plush lovers, this plush adds a stylish and adorable touch to any collection. Key Features • Official Barrado Plush One Piece – Sanji• Soft, high-quality materials for durability and comfort• Features Sanji’s signature outfit and blond hair• Ideal for display, cuddling, or gifting• Perfect collectible for One Piece fans and anime enthusiasts• Great addition to any anime or plush collection',NULL,99.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
