('fb29405f-692b-49a5-a23a-8f69e70e79a4','2026-07-09 11:01:46.437115','2026-07-09 11:01:46.437115',NULL,'Tekken 8 Collector’s Edition - PC','tekken-8-collector-s-edition-pc','3391892028560-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'3155269b-8d2e-4303-ba21-b03ba2ef8437',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Tekken 8 Collector’s Edition (PC) is a premium release of the latest entry in Bandai Namco Entertainment’s long-running fighting game franchise. Built for competitive and cinematic fighting gameplay, Tekken 8 continues the saga of the Mishima and Kazama families with high-intensity battles and modern visual fidelity. Developed using Unreal Engine, Tekken 8 delivers enhanced character models, dynamic environments, and fluid combat animations. The game introduces new offensive mechanics while preserving the deep combo-based system the series is known for. The Collector’s Edition is designed for fans of the franchise and includes the base game along with exclusive bonus content depending on regional release. Collector’s Edition Includes: • Full Tekken 8 PC game (digital or physical depending on retailer)• Collector’s Edition bonus content (varies by region and edition)• Official Bandai Namco collector packaging• Additional digital content (if included in specific edition release)',NULL,699.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('fb2c3af9-4a46-4984-ad32-81945f761ce9','2026-07-09 11:13:16.085668','2026-07-09 11:13:16.085668',NULL,'Ghostwire: Tokyo - PS5','ghostwire-tokyo-16475048711333','711719797999-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescriptionPlatform: PlayStation 5Genre: Action-AdventurePublisher: Bethesda SoftworksDeveloper: Tango GameworksModes: Single-playerRelease Date: March 25, 2022Ghostwire: Tokyo - PS5Step into a hauntingly beautiful rendition of Tokyo, where a supernatural force has caused the city\'s population to vanish. In Ghostwire: Tokyo, players take on the role of Akito, a lone survivor who must wield powerful elemental abilities to uncover the truth behind the mysterious disappearance and save the city. Face off against terrifying spirits and navigate through eerie urban landscapes teeming with Japanese folklore-inspired creatures. Key Features Stunning Open-World Tokyo: Explore an intricately detailed, deserted Tokyo filled with iconic landmarks and supernatural occurrences.Supernatural Abilities: Harness the power of elemental forces such as fire, water, and wind to combat spirits and solve mysteries.Japanese Folklore: Encounter unique and terrifying Yokai, inspired by traditional Japanese myths and urban legends.Immersive Combat: Use a combination of ranged attacks, melee moves, and spiritual abilities in fast-paced, tactical battles.Intriguing Storyline: Unravel the mystery behind the disappearance of Tokyo’s citizens and uncover the dark secrets of the supernatural realm.DualSense Features: Experience haptic feedback and adaptive triggers for a fully immersive PS5 gameplay experience.',NULL,28.50,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
