('fec8f589-5697-4ed5-a913-947bebf1304e','2026-07-09 11:12:40.220826','2026-07-09 11:12:40.220826',NULL,'Deliver At All Costs','deliver-at-all-costs','p-4012927151280-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'66db686d-8b86-49e6-a2db-37d9b7330045',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescription Platform: PlayStation 5, Xbox Series X|S, PCGenre: Action, Adventure, SimulationModes:Single-player CampaignOnline Co-op MultiplayerGraphics:4K HDR visuals with ray tracing (on supported devices)Realistic terrain and physics-based interactionsFrame Rate: Up to 60fps for smooth gameplayAudio: Dolby Atmos support for an immersive sound experienceDeliver At All CostsIn Deliver At All Costs, you step into the boots of a relentless courier in a dystopian world teetering on the edge of chaos. This gripping action-simulation game combines high-stakes deliveries with strategic planning and heart-pounding encounters. Armed with customizable equipment and vehicles, you’ll traverse unforgiving landscapes, evade threats, and make moral decisions that could shape the fate of the people relying on you. With its dynamic environments, an emotionally charged story, and cooperative multiplayer options, Deliver At All Costs offers an immersive experience where every mission tests your endurance, skill, and commitment to get the job done.Key Features: Expansive Open World: Explore a vast and unpredictable landscape with diverse biomes, dynamic weather, and environmental hazards.Challenging Deliveries: Complete high-risk missions under tight deadlines while managing limited resources and avoiding enemies.Customizable Gear: Upgrade your vehicles, tools, and equipment to suit your delivery style and overcome specific challenges.Tactical Planning: Strategize routes, balance payloads, and make split-second decisions in high-pressure scenarios.Engaging Storyline: Uncover the secrets of a fractured society and forge connections with a cast of compelling characters.Co-op Mode: Team up with other players to tackle cooperative delivery missions and share resources in real-time.High Replay Value: Procedurally generated challenges, hidden secrets, and multiple endings ensure no two playthroughs are the same.',NULL,129.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
