('ff5cc293-3186-4d59-8370-d626ba3b7246','2026-07-09 10:51:21.691726','2026-07-09 10:51:21.691726',NULL,'Lightsaber Forge - Obi Wan','lightsaber-forge-obi-wan','5010994145057-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'ff242680-eaae-4c64-9b7f-22aef1f926df',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','STAR WARS-INSPIRED DESIGN & DECO: With Star Wars Lightsaber Forge Lightsabers, kids ages 4 and up can imagine epic pretend battles in the Star Wars Galaxy CREATE THEIR OWN: The Lightsaber Forge Obi-Wan Kenobi Lightsaber toy is comprised of four parts -- the blade, cap, cover, and core -- allowing kids to assemble their Lightsaber for imaginary duels CUSTOMIZABLE LIGHTSABER: Pieces are compatible across the Lightsaber Forge line, so kids can mix and match. Just one additional Lightsaber Forge Lightsaber unlocks 16 total combinations! (Each sold separately. Subject to availability.) MASTER 1000s OF COMBINATIONS: Create amazing combinations with pieces from the Lightsaber Forge line and imagine becoming a true Jedi or Sith. (Total combinations includes all Lightsaber Forge products. Each sold separately. Subject to availability.) ELECTRONIC LIGHTSABER WITH SOUND FX: This electronic toy for boys and girls features a light-up blade and exciting sounds inspired by the Star Wars entertainment',NULL,209.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('ffb300f6-aa64-4ab6-bf5b-32a4f2e88703','2026-07-09 10:53:29.202176','2026-07-09 10:53:29.202176',NULL,'Switch Hori Split Pad Pro (Lucario & Pickachu)','switch-hori-split-pad-pro-lucario-and-pickachu','810050911504-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'a98d2277-6776-45b2-b725-b5c4dfb53a56',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Enjoy the full-size controller experience in handheld mode with the HORI Split Pad Pro (Lucario & Pikachu)! Featuring full-size analog sticks, a precision D-pad, and large shoulder buttons, designed for comfort and accuracy, even during marathon gaming sessions. Advanced features include assignable rear triggers, turbo functionality, and more. Perfect for a wide range of genres available on the Nintendo Switch. Enjoy a new gaming experience with the Split Pad Pro! (Not a wireless controller - only for handheld mode. Does not include motion controls, HD rumble, NFC, or IR Camera.) Officially Licensed by Nintendo & Pokémon.',NULL,199.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('ffcff7e2-dfb4-4f74-b0ab-a8cab00484b1','2026-07-09 11:03:32.886300','2026-07-09 11:03:32.886300',NULL,'Stan Bucks','stan-bucks','stan-bucks-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'8f5c8927-be48-41c7-9c7a-c40f59f564c2',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Stan Bucks Custom PS5 Console Skin (Disc Version Only)',NULL,199.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('ffd5bb61-cf37-4b7b-980c-a5e3aa0ada6e','2026-07-09 10:53:22.108601','2026-07-09 10:53:22.108601',NULL,'Switch V-Grip FR-TEC','switch-v-grip','8436563090790-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'a98d2277-6776-45b2-b725-b5c4dfb53a56',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','V-Grip for Nintendo Switch is a support for Joy-Con that improves the ergonomics of the laptop in addition to having LED indicators of the battery level of the controls. Ergonomic support that facilitates the gameplay and prevents discomfort in the wrists after hours of play.',NULL,19.50,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('ffdd3101-625b-4d66-8986-c0f537ddafd3','2026-07-09 11:09:06.053648','2026-07-09 11:09:06.053648',NULL,'Oculus Quest 2 VR Headset 256GB - CA','oculus-quest-2-256gb-all-in-one-vr-headset-ca','815820022466-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'e6badb04-c2b1-49f3-a8b4-5dc89e1814e6',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','SpecsDescriptionDisplay: Fast-switch LCD, 1832 x 1920 resolution per eyeProcessor: Qualcomm Snapdragon XR2RAM: 6GBStorage: 256GBAudio: Built-in speakers with 3D positional audio and 3.5mm headphone jackTracking: Inside-out 6DoF (six degrees of freedom) tracking with no external sensors requiredBattery Life: 2-3 hours (headset) depending on usageWeight: Approximately 503g Oculus Quest 2 256GB All-in-One VR Headset The Oculus Quest 2 256GB All-in-One VR Headset delivers an unparalleled virtual reality experience with its expansive storage, powerful performance, and easy-to-use design. With 256GB of storage, you can explore vast VR worlds, enjoy immersive games, and stream your favorite media without worry. This standalone headset requires no PC or console, making it the ultimate solution for both beginners and VR enthusiasts. Key Features256GB Storage: Ample space to store a wide range of games, apps, and media, ensuring you never run out of room for your VR adventures.Powerful Performance: Powered by a Qualcomm Snapdragon XR2 processor and 6GB RAM for fast, seamless gameplay and high-quality visuals.High-Resolution Display: Crisp 1832 x 1920 pixels per eye for sharp visuals and a more immersive experience.All-in-One Design: No PC or console required; everything you need for VR is built into the headset.Easy Setup: Wireless connectivity and intuitive setup make jumping into VR simple and fast.Comfortable Fit: Adjustable straps and lightweight construction ensure extended comfort during long play sessions.Touch Controllers: Precise, ergonomic controllers offer natural and intuitive interaction with VR worlds.Expansive VR Library: Access a wide range of titles from Oculus Store, covering games, fitness, entertainment, and social apps.PC VR Compatibility: Connect to a gaming PC with Oculus Link for high-end VR experiences via compatible USB-C cable (sold separately).',NULL,1999.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('fff5604b-e84e-4b5d-9208-07f9743d6d6e','2026-07-09 10:42:14.111127','2026-07-09 10:42:14.111127',NULL,'PNY XLR8 Gaming MicroSD Card - 512GB','pny-electronics-sd-microsd-xc-card-512gb','751492662657-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'2f4818b1-ebde-4ac3-adb1-5c4f62d01e42',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','Memory card microSD Description XLR8 PNY XLR8 Gaming Class 10 U3 V30 microSD flash memory is the ultimate gaming solution: it\'s ideal for mobile devices and for gaming on smartphones, tablets and Nintendo XLR8 gaming microSD cards are Class 10, U3 with V30 Reading speed 100 Writing speed 90 Flash memory capacity 512 Memory standard UHS-I Adapter No USB reader No Storage class A2',NULL,189.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL),
('fffa4a7a-d6ce-4074-877d-7ff2cfe02cbd','2026-07-09 10:51:44.313447','2026-07-09 10:51:44.313447',NULL,'Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: 12” Original Classic Donatello Giant Figure by Playmates Toys','teenage-mutant-ninja-turtles-12-original-classic-donatello-giant-figure-by-playmates-toys','43377833970-ae',NULL,'simple',NULL,'ff242680-eaae-4c64-9b7f-22aef1f926df',NULL,NULL,'n_a','global','n_a','GIANT SIZE: Donatello figure is an impressive 12” high AUTHENTIC: Figure is authentically sculpted and decorated to match the original release of the Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles in 1989 ACCESSORIES: Donatello comes with his signature bo staff POSEABLE: Figure is articulated in the arms, legs, and head RETRO PACKAGING: Donatello comes in packaging with classic 1980’s graphics, for the ultimate retro design',NULL,149.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,0,NULL);
